	 (230,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 05:39:41','20260202T053941','Amazon''s $75 Million Melania Trump Documentary Beats Forecasts To Become Box Office Surprise: ''Not Involved,'' Says President','https://www.benzinga.com/news/entertainment/26/02/50290331/amazons-75-million-melania-trump-documentary-beats-forecasts-to-become-box-office-surprise-not-involved-says-president','Amazon MGM Studios'' documentary "Melania" significantly surpassed box office expectations, earning about $7 million in its opening weekend against forecasts of $2 million to $5 million. Despite its theatrical success, driven largely by Republican-leaning markets, the film faces scrutiny over its $75 million production and marketing cost, with Melania Trump reportedly receiving at least $28 million. Critics view the film as a promotional vehicle, yet Amazon defends its investment by anticipating strong long-term value from its eventual release on Prime Video.','https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/02/02/East-Rutherford--Nj-nov-13-Donald-Trump-.jpeg?quality=85&auto=webp&width=850','Benzinga','General','Benzinga','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.808262"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.716631"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.626901"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.636692"}]',0.063411,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.204703"}, {"ticker": "WBD", "relevance_score": "0.618480", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.106590"}]','{"url": "https://www.benzinga.com/news/entertainment/26/02/50290331/amazons-75-million-melania-trump-documentary-beats-forecasts-to-become-box-office-surprise-not-involved-says-president", "title": "Amazon''s $75 Million Melania Trump Documentary Beats Forecasts To Become Box Office Surprise: ''Not Involved,'' Says President", "source": "Benzinga", "topic