	 (234,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 00:58:25','20260202T005825','The Artificial Intelligence (AI) Winner Hiding in Plain Sight for 2026','https://finviz.com/news/294864/the-artificial-intelligence-ai-winner-hiding-in-plain-sight-for-2026','Marvell Technology (NASDAQ: MRVL) is presented as an overlooked AI infrastructure company poised for significant growth in 2026 and beyond. This is driven by its strong position in the custom AI processor market, particularly with hyperscalers like Amazon and Microsoft, and its attractive valuation compared to its high earnings growth potential. The article highlights Marvell''s role in supplying application-specific integrated circuits (ASICs) for AI data centers, a market expected to grow substantially.','https://g.foolcdn.com/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fg.foolcdn.com%2Feditorial%2Fimages%2F852224%2Fartificial-intelligence-written-on-a-processor.jpg&w=700','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.937373"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.805660"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.734831"}]',0.310064,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "MRVL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.495906"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.719310", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.317265"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.617843", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.268190"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.604635", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.270217"}, {"ticker": "AVGO", "relevance_score": "0.649786", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.231941"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/294864/the-artificial-intelligence-ai-winner-hiding-in-plain-sight-for-2026", "title": "The Artificial Intelligence (AI) Winner Hiding in Plain Sigh