	 (235,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 00:54:26','20260202T005426','GlobalFoundries stock price slides 5% into weekend as chip sector sours','https://ts2.tech/en/globalfoundries-stock-price-slides-5-into-weekend-as-chip-sector-sours/','GlobalFoundries (GFS) shares dropped 5% to $42.20, mirroring a broader decline in the chip sector, which saw the PHLX Semiconductor Sector index fall by almost 4%. Investors are anticipating GlobalFoundries'' earnings report on February 11th, along with the U.S. jobs report and other corporate earnings, as new geopolitical announcements create uncertainty in the market. The company will release its fourth-quarter and full-year 2025 results on February 11, with analysts focusing on utilization and capital spending plans.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/globalfoundries-stock-price-slides-5-into-weekend-as-chip-sector-sours-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.908789"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.922992"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.635169"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.848725"}]',-0.145563,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "GFS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.234452"}, {"ticker": "AMD", "relevance_score": "0.614067", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.103159"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.624040", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.147644"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.622011", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.101353"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.603670", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.104795"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/globalfoundries-stock-price-slides-5-into-weekend-as-chip-sector-sours/", "title": "GlobalFoundries stock price slides 5% into 