	 (250,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-01 10:03:22','20260201T100322','Celestica, Inc. $CLS Stake Lowered by Independent Advisor Alliance','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-celestica-inc-cls-stake-lowered-by-independent-advisor-alliance-2026-02-01/','Independent Advisor Alliance reduced its stake in Celestica, Inc. (NYSE:CLS) by 10.6% in the third quarter of 2025, holding 32,162 shares valued at approximately $7.92 million. Despite this, Wall Street analysts largely maintain a "Moderate Buy" rating for CLS, with a consensus price target of $345.41, higher than its current trading price of around $281. Celestica recently raised its FY2026 revenue guidance to about $17 billion and EPS targets due to strong AI-related demand, although an accelerated capital expenditure plan of $1 billion caused a temporary share sell-off and investor concern.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/celestica-inc-logo-1200x675.png?v=20220503104731','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.902062"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.826235"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.728391"}]',0.208227,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "CLS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.084664"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.563655", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.231830"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.561747", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.216355"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.591423", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.205485"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-celestica-inc-cls-stake-lowered-by-independent-advisor-alliance-2026-02-01/", "title": "Celestica, Inc. $CLS Stake Lowered by Independent Advisor Alliance", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earn