	 (251,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-01 08:42:45','20260201T084245','Summa Corp. Buys 9,827 Shares of NVIDIA Corporation $NVDA','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-summa-corp-buys-9827-shares-of-nvidia-corporation-nvda-2026-02-01/','Summa Corp. increased its stake in NVIDIA Corporation by 1.6%, purchasing an additional 9,827 shares, making NVIDIA its largest holding at 50.4% of its portfolio. Despite significant insider selling over the past 90 days, analysts remain largely bullish on NVIDIA with an average target price of $263.98, driven by positive catalysts like China''s conditional approval for chip sales and potential investment in OpenAI. The article also details other institutional investor activity, recent insider transactions, analyst rating changes, and key news impacting NVIDIA''s stock.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/nvidia-co-logo-1200x675.jpg?v=20221020142916','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.919034"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.818387"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.819640"}]',0.105798,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.262624"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.603299", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.136034"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.612159", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.132238"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-summa-corp-buys-9827-shares-of-nvidia-corporation-nvda-2026-02-01/", "title": "Summa Corp. Buys 9,827 Shares of NVIDIA Corporation $NVDA", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.919034"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.818387"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.819640"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Summa Corp. increa