	 (252,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-01 08:30:00','20260201T083000','Broadcom Inc. (AVGO) Strengthens AI and Semiconductor Leadership with Analyst Upgrades and Market Share Gains','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/broadcom-inc-avgo-strengthens-ai-and-semiconductor-leadership-with-analyst-upgrades-and-market-share-gains-1686650/','Broadcom Inc. (AVGO) is solidifying its leadership in the AI and semiconductor sectors, backed by recent analyst upgrades and projected market share growth. Counterpoint Research anticipates Broadcom''s AI server compute ASIC market share to reach 60% by 2027, driven by surging demand from hyperscalers like Google and AWS. JPMorgan, Wells Fargo, and Goldman Sachs have all highlighted Broadcom''s strong positioning due to its diversified portfolio and benefits from increasing AI infrastructure spending.','https://imonkey-blog.imgix.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Broadcom-Corporation.jpg?auto=format&fit=clip&expires=1801440000&width=320&height=250','Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.908435"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.840180"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.619417"}]',0.356127,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "AVGO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.429448"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.704495", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.328429"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.640020", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.260553"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.601327", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.343542"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.625984", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.374382"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/broadcom-inc-avgo-strengthens-ai-and-semiconductor-le