	 (255,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-01 07:30:56','20260201T073056','Oracle may lay off up to 30,000 employees, and one of the Big reasons is the company''s ''commitment'' to Sam Altman''s OpenAI for…','https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/technology/tech-news/oracle-may-lay-off-up-to-30000-employees-and-one-of-the-big-reasons-is-the-companys-commitment-to-sam-altmans-openai-for/articleshow/127835680.cms','Oracle is considering laying off between 20,000 and 30,000 employees to secure $8 to $10 billion in cash flow. This drastic measure is attributed to the substantial financial drain caused by its purported $300 billion partnership with OpenAI, which includes significant capital spending on AI data centers and 3 million GPUs. The company faces over $100 billion in debt, declining stock value, and reluctance from US banks to finance its AI projects, leading Oracle to seek upfront customer payments and consider selling its Cerner unit.','https://static.toiimg.com/thumb/msid-127835680,imgsize-18640,width-400,resizemode-4/127835680.jpg','Times of India','General','Times of India','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932146"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.809282"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.743270"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.602923"}]',-0.083667,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "ORCL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.805016"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.608798", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.311370"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.623586", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.312358"}]','{"url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/technology/tech-news/oracle-may-lay-off-up-to-30000-employees-and-one-of-the-big-reasons-is-the-companys-commitment-to-sam-altmans-ope