	 (256,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-01 06:44:36','20260201T064436','Short Interest in ProShares UltraPro QQQ (NASDAQ:TQQQ) Rises By 48.4%','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/short-interest-in-proshares-ultrapro-qqq-nasdaqtqqq-rises-by-484-2026-02-01/','Short interest in ProShares UltraPro QQQ (NASDAQ: TQQQ) surged by 48.4% in January, reaching 19,120,104 shares, which represents about 3.4% of its outstanding stock. Despite this increase in short interest, several institutional investors significantly raised their holdings in QQQQ during the fourth quarter of the prior year, including Howard Capital Management Inc. and IMC Chicago LLC. ProShares UltraPro QQQ is a 3x leveraged ETF tracking the NASDAQ-100 Index and recently increased its quarterly dividend to $0.0855 per share.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/proshares-ultrapro-qqq-logo-1200x675.png?v=20210709134806','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.934572"}]',0.085987,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TQQQ", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.184898"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.622335", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.110807"}, {"ticker": "AAPL", "relevance_score": "0.623329", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.119595"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.637405", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.104834"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.618841", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.107527"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/short-interest-in-proshares-ultrapro-qqq-nasdaqtqqq-rises-by-484-2026-02-01/", "title": "Short Interest in ProShares UltraPro QQQ (NASDAQ:TQQQ) Rises By 48.4%", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.934572"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"]