	 (257,'alpha_vantage','BBWI','BBWI','2026-02-01 13:30:57','20260201T133057','Access Investment Management LLC Takes Position in Bath & Body Works, Inc. $BBWI','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-access-investment-management-llc-takes-position-in-bath-body-works-inc-bbwi-2026-02-01/','Access Investment Management LLC has acquired a new stake of 136,105 shares in Bath & Body Works (NYSE:BBWI) valued at approximately $3.51 million. This comes amidst multiple securities class action lawsuits alleging material misstatements, which have increased the company''s litigation risk and short-term volatility. Analysts currently have a consensus "Hold" rating for BBWI with a target price of $23.53, while the stock trades near $21.79 and offers a dividend yield of about 3.7%.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/bath--body-works-inc-logo-1200x675.jpg?v=20210805052207','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.941556"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.815144"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.742611"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.627329"}]',-0.133181,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "BBWI", "relevance_score": "0.980883", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.145004"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-access-investment-management-llc-takes-position-in-bath-body-works-inc-bbwi-2026-02-01/", "title": "Access Investment Management LLC Takes Position in Bath & Body Works, Inc. $BBWI", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.941556"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.815144"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.742611"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.627329"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Access Investment Management LLC has acquired a new stake of 136,105 shares in Bath & Body Works (NYSE:BBWI) valued at approximately $3.51 million. Th