	 (270,'alpha_vantage','CL','CL','2026-02-01 19:38:40','20260201T193840','Colgate Palmolive (CL) One Off US$1.0b Charge Tests Premium P/E Narrative','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/household/nyse-cl/colgate-palmolive/news/colgate-palmolive-cl-one-off-us10b-charge-tests-premium-pe-n','Colgate-Palmolive (CL) reported a challenging Q4 FY2025 with a US$0.05 EPS loss and a US$37 million net income loss, influenced by a one-off US$1.0 billion charge. Despite a dip in net margin to 10.5% from 14.4%, the company''s five-year annual EPS growth stands at 3.2%, and analysts project 11.4% yearly earnings growth, treating the large charge as non-recurring. The stock''s premium P/E of 34.1x is debated against its lowered margins and high debt, though a DCF fair value suggests significant upside.',NULL,'Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.807722"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.637069"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.711405"}]',-0.09164,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "CL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.156827"}, {"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "0.641330", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.025063"}, {"ticker": "KMB", "relevance_score": "0.641533", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.037468"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/household/nyse-cl/colgate-palmolive/news/colgate-palmolive-cl-one-off-us10b-charge-tests-premium-pe-n", "title": "Colgate Palmolive (CL) One Off US$1.0b Charge Tests Premium P/E Narrative", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.807722"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.637069"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0