	 (275,'alpha_vantage','CL','CL','2026-02-01 15:01:34','20260201T150134','TriNet stock jumps on Friday — what TNET investors are watching ahead of Feb. 12 earnings','https://ts2.tech/en/trinet-stock-jumps-on-friday-what-tnet-investors-are-watching-ahead-of-feb-12-earnings/','TriNet shares jumped 4.7% on Friday, closing at $61.24, ahead of its fourth-quarter and full-year 2025 earnings release scheduled for Feb. 12. Investors are closely watching client hiring trends, retention rates, and employee benefit expenses, as well as upcoming labor-market data and a rival''s earnings report. The stock''s recent gain carries risks given the time remaining until earnings and the potential for shifts in market sentiment due to broader economic indicators and geopolitical events.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/trinet-stock-jumps-on-friday-what-tnet-investors-are-watching-ahead-of-feb-12-earnings-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.948856"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.829521"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.722159"}]',0.190485,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "TNET", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.297737"}, {"ticker": "CL", "relevance_score": "0.579113", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.139009"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/trinet-stock-jumps-on-friday-what-tnet-investors-are-watching-ahead-of-feb-12-earnings/", "title": "TriNet stock jumps on Friday — what TNET investors are watching ahead of Feb. 12 earnings", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.948856"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.829521"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.722159"}], "authors": ["Shan Ahmed Khan"], "summary": "TriNet shares jumped 4.7% on Friday, closing at $61.24, ahead of its fourth-quarter and full