	 (276,'alpha_vantage','CL','CL','2026-02-01 14:00:50','20260201T140050','Colgate-Palmolive (CL) stock price jumps nearly 6% after outlook — what to watch before Monday','https://ts2.tech/en/colgate-palmolive-cl-stock-price-jumps-nearly-6-after-outlook-what-to-watch-before-monday/','Colgate-Palmolive (CL) stock jumped nearly 6% after reporting strong quarterly profits and an upbeat sales forecast for 2026, ending Friday at $90.29. The company''s fourth-quarter net sales were $5.23 billion, with a Q4 loss due to an impairment charge, but pricing boosted sales. Goldman Sachs raised its price target to $94, and investors are now looking forward to the company''s presentation at the Consumer Analyst Group of New York conference on February 20.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/colgate-palmolive-cl-stock-price-jumps-nearly-6-after-outlook-what-to-watch-before-monday-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.908389"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.801354"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.618837"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.735000"}]',0.212849,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "CL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.332774"}, {"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "0.614146", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.128806"}, {"ticker": "KMB", "relevance_score": "0.644180", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.149994"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/colgate-palmolive-cl-stock-price-jumps-nearly-6-after-outlook-what-to-watch-before-monday/", "title": "Colgate-Palmolive (CL) stock price jumps nearly 6% after outlook — what to watch before Monday", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.908389"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.801354"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "