	 (294,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-01 19:02:01','20260201T190201','Costco issues recall notice for bakery item due to undeclared allergen','https://www.foxbusiness.com/economy/costco-issues-recall-notice-bakery-item-due-undeclared-allergen','Costco has issued a recall notice for its "Mini Beignets filled with Caramel" because they were inadvertently packaged with "Mini Beignets filled with Chocolate Hazelnut," containing undeclared tree nuts (hazelnuts/filberts). The recall affects purchases made between January 16-30 in 22 states. This announcement follows a class-action lawsuit against Costco alleging false advertising regarding preservatives in its Kirkland Signature Seasoned Rotisserie Chicken.','https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2024/04/931/523/costco.jpg?ve=1&tl=1','Fox Business','General','Fox Business','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.936069"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.602803"}]',-0.437276,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.419733"}]','{"url": "https://www.foxbusiness.com/economy/costco-issues-recall-notice-bakery-item-due-undeclared-allergen", "title": "Costco issues recall notice for bakery item due to undeclared allergen", "source": "Fox Business", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.936069"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.602803"}], "authors": ["Anders Hagstrom"], "summary": "Costco has issued a recall notice for its \\"Mini Beignets filled with Caramel\\" because they were inadvertently packaged with \\"Mini Beignets filled with Chocolate Hazelnut,\\" containing undeclared tree nuts (hazelnuts/filberts). The recall affects purchases made between January 16-30 in 22 states. This announcement follows a class-action lawsuit against Costco alleging false advertising regarding preservatives in its Kirkland Signature Seasoned Rotisserie Chicken.", "banner_image": "https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2024/04/931/523/costco.jpg?ve=1&tl=1", "source_domain": "Fox Business", "time_published": "20260201T190201", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.419733"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "overall_sentiment_score": -0.437276}','2026-02-02 06:40:13',NULL),
	 (295,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-01 16:31:11','20260201T163111','Meet Walmart''s new CEO, John Furner: Once an hourly worker, he''ll helm the top company in the Fortune 500','https://fortune.com/article/who-is-walmarts-new-ceo-john-furner-fortune-500-doug-mcmillon-retail/','John Furner, who began his career at Walmart as an hourly employee, has taken over as the CEO of Walmart, succeeding Doug McMillon. Furner''s leadership is noted for significantly increasing store manager pay to improve morale and retention, as well as strengthening the company''s supply chain and e-commerce during the COVID-19 pandemic. His management philosophy, influenced by his humble beginnings and a strong work ethic, emphasizes problem-solving and employee investment.','https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/GettyImages-2241267839-e1763144137109.jpg?format=webp&w=1440&q=100','Fortune','General','Fortune','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.926707"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.708038"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.608068"}]',0.382155,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.510893"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.631702", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.205356"}]','{"url": "https://fortune.com/article/who-is-walmarts-new-ceo-john-furner-fortune-500-doug-mcmillon-retail/", "title": "Meet Walmart''s new CEO, John Furner: Once an hourly worker, he''ll helm the top company in the Fortune 500", "source": "Fortune", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.926707"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.708038"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.608068"}], "authors": ["Marco Quiroz-Gutierrez"], "summary": "John Furner, who began his career at Walmart as an hourly employee, has taken over as the CEO of Walmart, succeeding Doug McMil