	 (297,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-01 15:30:05','20260201T153005','AbbVie stock rises into weekend as Feb. 4 earnings loom — what traders watch next','https://ts2.tech/en/abbvie-stock-rises-into-weekend-as-feb-4-earnings-loom-what-traders-watch-next/','AbbVie shares rose 1.2% to $223.01 on Friday, ahead of the company''s Q4 earnings report on February 4th. Investors will be closely watching the sales trends for Skyrizi and Rinvoq, as well as commentary on the Botox-driven aesthetics segment, particularly as newer immunology drugs need to offset declines in legacy products. The broader market faces uncertainty over interest rates and political developments, making AbbVie''s guidance crucial.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/abbvie-stock-rises-into-weekend-as-feb-4-earnings-loom-what-traders-watch-next-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.931807"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.801697"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.746301"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.605996"}]',0.062331,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "ABBV", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.204117"}, {"ticker": "JNJ", "relevance_score": "0.632076", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.010106"}, {"ticker": "AMGN", "relevance_score": "0.612193", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.127637"}, {"ticker": "PFE", "relevance_score": "0.634528", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.123088"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.605605", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.131773"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/abbvie-stock-rises-into-weekend-as-feb-4-earnings-loom-what-traders-watch-next/", "title": "AbbVie stock rises into weekend as Feb. 4 earnings loom — what traders watch next", "sourc