	 (300,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-01 22:34:41','20260201T223441','A Look At Labcorp Holdings (LH) Valuation After Receivables Facility Extension And Added Accordion Feature','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/healthcare/nyse-lh/labcorp-holdings/news/a-look-at-labcorp-holdings-lh-valuation-after-receivables-fa','Labcorp Holdings (LH) recently extended its receivables facility to January 26, 2029, and added a $125 million accordion feature, providing financial flexibility. Despite a steady year-to-date share price return of 7.9% and a 9.9% one-year total shareholder return, the stock trades at a 52.7% discount to one intrinsic estimate, suggesting potential undervaluation. The most popular narrative suggests a fair value of $300.06 per share, driven by anticipated growth from innovative tests in various medical fields.',NULL,'Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.842573"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.934899"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.748352"}]',0.191783,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "LH", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.300718"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.645952", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.128636"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.625660", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.128235"}, {"ticker": "DGX", "relevance_score": "0.627298", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.123159"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/healthcare/nyse-lh/labcorp-holdings/news/a-look-at-labcorp-holdings-lh-valuation-after-receivables-fa", "title": "A Look At Labcorp Holdings (LH) Valuation After Receivables Facility Extension And Added Accordion Feature", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.842573"}, {"topic": "financial_mark