	 (304,'alpha_vantage','DECK','DECK','2026-02-01 14:06:34','20260201T140634','New HOKA Speedgoat 7 challenges trail runners to climb 7,000 ft','https://www.stocktitan.net/news/DECK/the-g-o-a-t-returns-hoka-unveils-the-new-speedgoat-clpf94ir39nq.html','HOKA, a division of Deckers Brands, has launched the Speedgoat 7, the latest iteration of its popular trail running shoe, priced at $165. Designed for challenging terrains, the Speedgoat 7 features upgraded traction with a Vibram® Megagrip outsole, enhanced cushioning from a super-critical foamed EVA midsole, and an integrated gaiter attachment. To celebrate the launch, HOKA is hosting the Speedgoat 7 Vert Challenge, inviting trail runners to gain 7,000 feet of vertical elevation between April 9 and May 9, 2026, with prizes including HOKA footwear, apparel, and entry into a UTMB World Series Race.','https://mms.businesswire.com/media/20260201862456/en/2707603/4/HOKA_S26_Speedgoat7_Hoka_Speedgoat_DSC00246_357_9970_gravel_%281%29.jpg','Stock Titan','General','Stock Titan','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.836290"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.700249"}]',0.284643,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "DECK", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.289014"}]','{"url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/news/DECK/the-g-o-a-t-returns-hoka-unveils-the-new-speedgoat-clpf94ir39nq.html", "title": "New HOKA Speedgoat 7 challenges trail runners to climb 7,000 ft", "source": "Stock Titan", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.836290"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.700249"}], "authors": [], "summary": "HOKA, a division of Deckers Brands, has launched the Speedgoat 7, the latest iteration of its popular trail running shoe, priced at $165. Designed for challenging terrains, the Speedgoat 7 features upgraded traction with a Vibram® Megagrip outsole, enhanced cushioning from a super-critical foamed EVA midsole,