	 (318,'alpha_vantage','HD','HD','2026-02-02 05:04:27','20260202T050427','P&G bets big on retail integration as CPGs question incrementality','https://digiday.com/marketing/pg-bets-big-on-retail-integration-as-cpgs-question-incrementality/','As U.S. growth decelerates, major brands like Procter & Gamble and Diageo are significantly increasing their investment in retail media, despite ongoing questions about its incremental growth. P&G is prioritizing retail media with a focus on data and AI to navigate a fragmented media landscape and integrate brand building with retailer strategies. This shift reflects a broader industry trend where retail media spending is rapidly increasing, moving budgets away from traditional channels and towards platforms like Amazon and Walmart, although concerns about inconsistent metrics and true incrementality persist.','https://digiday.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/02/rmn-creators-digiday.jpg?w=719&h=419&crop=1','Digiday','General','Digiday','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.929952"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.801834"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.730868"}]',0.192178,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.423810"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.723842", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.148493"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.641308", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.144726"}, {"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "0.631169", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.110149"}, {"ticker": "HD", "relevance_score": "0.623084", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.127011"}]','{"url": "https://digiday.com/marketing/pg-bets-big-on-retail-integration-as-cpgs-question-incrementality/", "title": "P&G bets big on retail integration as CPGs question increm