	 (332,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-01 17:09:17','20260201T170917','I Predicted That Coca-Cola Would Be a Better Buffett Stock Than Domino''s to Buy in 2025. Here''s What Happened.','https://finviz.com/news/294784/i-predicted-that-coca-cola-would-be-a-better-buffett-stock-than-dominos-to-buy-in-2025-heres-what-happened','The author predicted that Coca-Cola would outperform Domino''s in 2025 among Buffett stocks, and this proved correct due to Coca-Cola''s stability and ability to manage tariffs. While both companies showed mid-single-digit sales growth, Coca-Cola''s localized production and dividend king status provided an edge. Looking to 2026, the author suggests Domino''s might have a slight advantage due to its recent flat performance and current valuation, making it a tough call between the two.','https://g.foolcdn.com/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fg.foolcdn.com%2Feditorial%2Fimages%2F853335%2Fdominos-delivery-person.jpg&w=700','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.909782"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.817013"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.709782"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.621824"}]',0.211711,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "DPZ", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.104592"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.958895", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.258572"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/294784/i-predicted-that-coca-cola-would-be-a-better-buffett-stock-than-dominos-to-buy-in-2025-heres-what-happened", "title": "I Predicted That Coca-Cola Would Be a Better Buffett Stock Than Domino''s to Buy in 2025. Here''s What Happened.", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.909782"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.817013"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.709782"}, {"topic": "r