	 (333,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-01 16:54:28','20260201T165428','Coca-Cola stock price hits a fresh 52-week high — what KO investors watch before Feb. 10 earnings','https://ts2.tech/en/coca-cola-stock-price-hits-a-fresh-52-week-high-what-ko-investors-watch-before-feb-10-earnings/','Coca-Cola''s stock (KO) recently hit a 52-week high, closing at $74.81, fueled by investor interest in defensive consumer staples amidst market uncertainty. Investors are now keenly focused on the upcoming Q4 and full-year 2025 earnings report on February 10, particularly looking at pricing, sales volumes, input costs, and currency shifts. The company''s presentation at the Consumer Analyst Group of New York conference on February 17 is also anticipated to provide further guidance.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/coca-cola-stock-price-hits-a-fresh-52-week-high-what-ko-investors-watch-before-feb-10-earnings-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.949189"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.925117"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.732610"}]',0.248431,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.987505", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.311342"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.702619", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.222545"}, {"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "0.620764", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.116594"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/coca-cola-stock-price-hits-a-fresh-52-week-high-what-ko-investors-watch-before-feb-10-earnings/", "title": "Coca-Cola stock price hits a fresh 52-week high — what KO investors watch before Feb. 10 earnings", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.949189"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.925117"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relev