	 (342,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-01 15:44:32','20260201T154432','Say goodbye to Kroger''s ''walk-in'' sister stores as chain pulls out of state with mass closures taking place in weeks','https://www.the-sun.com/money/15873189/kroger-the-little-clinic-closure-pharmacy-georgia/','Kroger has announced that all 18 of its "The Little Clinic" walk-in locations across Georgia will be closing down on April 4. The Little Clinic is a subsidiary offering medical services like check-ups, vaccinations, and minor issue treatments. A spokesperson confirmed the closures without providing specific reasons, but invited patients to continue using Kroger''s in-store pharmacies.','https://www.the-sun.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/02/newspress-collage-bijakceys-1769960130815.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&1769942149','www.the-sun.com','General','www.the-sun.com','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.929995"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.711291"}]',-0.283234,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.264899"}]','{"url": "https://www.the-sun.com/money/15873189/kroger-the-little-clinic-closure-pharmacy-georgia/", "title": "Say goodbye to Kroger''s ''walk-in'' sister stores as chain pulls out of state with mass closures taking place in weeks", "source": "www.the-sun.com", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.929995"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.711291"}], "authors": ["Emma Crabtree"], "summary": "Kroger has announced that all 18 of its \\"The Little Clinic\\" walk-in locations across Georgia will be closing down on April 4. The Little Clinic is a subsidiary offering medical services like check-ups, vaccinations, and minor issue treatments. A spokesperson confirmed the closures without providing specific reasons, but invited patients to continue using Kroger''s in-store pharmacies.", "banner_image": 