	 (388,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-01 16:20:19','20260201T162019','Target unveils an expert-driven beauty assortment post Ulta Beauty partnership','https://insideretail.asia/2026/02/01/target-unveils-an-expert-driven-beauty-assortment-post-ulta-beauty-partnership/','Target is expanding its beauty category offerings with over 3,000 new SKUs and a refreshed store design, following the concluded partnership with Ulta Beauty. Experts view this move as a strategic opportunity for Target to establish its own unique identity in the competitive beauty market, moving beyond the challenges faced in its previous collaboration. The new strategy focuses on practical authority and intuitive shopping experiences rather than just curation or exclusivity.','https://insideretail.asia/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/target-shopping-cart.jpg','Inside Retail Asia','General','Inside Retail Asia','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.938462"}]',0.031905,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.269760"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.272059"}]','{"url": "https://insideretail.asia/2026/02/01/target-unveils-an-expert-driven-beauty-assortment-post-ulta-beauty-partnership/", "title": "Target unveils an expert-driven beauty assortment post Ulta Beauty partnership", "source": "Inside Retail Asia", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.938462"}], "authors": ["Nicole Kirichanskaya"], "summary": "Target is expanding its beauty category offerings with over 3,000 new SKUs and a refreshed store design, following the concluded partnership with Ulta Beauty. Experts view this move as a strategic opportunity for Target to establish its own unique identity in the competitive beauty market, moving beyond the challenges faced in its previous collaboration. The new strategy foc