	 (394,'alpha_vantage','TJX','TJX','2026-02-01 09:23:48','20260201T092348','Mediolanum International Funds Ltd Raises Stock Holdings in The TJX Companies, Inc. $TJX','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-mediolanum-international-funds-ltd-raises-stock-holdings-in-the-tjx-companies-inc-tjx-2026-02-01/','Mediolanum International Funds Ltd increased its stake in The TJX Companies, Inc. by 5.0% in Q3, now holding 562,131 shares valued at $80.68 million. This makes TJX its 16th largest position, representing approximately 0.05% of TJX''s stock. The TJX Companies reported strong Q3 earnings, beating analyst estimates, and announced a quarterly dividend of $0.425 per share.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/the-tjx-companies-inc-logo-1200x675.png?v=20240102162711','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.916126"}]',0.44619,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "TJX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.446387"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-mediolanum-international-funds-ltd-raises-stock-holdings-in-the-tjx-companies-inc-tjx-2026-02-01/", "title": "Mediolanum International Funds Ltd Raises Stock Holdings in The TJX Companies, Inc. $TJX", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.916126"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Mediolanum International Funds Ltd increased its stake in The TJX Companies, Inc. by 5.0% in Q3, now holding 562,131 shares valued at $80.68 million. This makes TJX its 16th largest position, representing approximately 0.05% of TJX''s stock. The TJX Companies reported strong Q3 earnings, beating analyst estimates, and announced a quarterly dividend of $0.425 per share.", "banner_image": "https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/the-tjx-companies-inc-logo-1200x675.png?v=2