	 (395,'alpha_vantage','TSCO','TSCO','2026-02-02 02:27:35','20260202T022735','Hot Shot’s Secret® Announces Major Expansion in Tractor Supply Company® Nationwide','https://www.lansingstatejournal.com/press-release/story/978949/hot-shots-secret-announces-major-expansion-in-tractor-supply-company-nationwide/','Hot Shot’s Secret®, a fast-growing lubricant brand, is significantly expanding its product offerings nationwide at Tractor Supply Company. This expansion introduces five new products, including DEF Defender, LX4 Lubricity Extreme, Gasoline Extreme, Diesel Winter Rescue, and EDT+ Winter Defense, in addition to larger sizes of existing popular treatments. The partnership leverages Tractor Supply''s extensive retail presence to reach DIY customers who depend on high-performance equipment.','https://www.lansingstatejournal.com/gciaf/prod/p?a=pageview&p=PLSJ-TEALIUM-COBRAND&m=web&k=f14ebdd6-0569-4c64-af73-99937bc06379&s=noscript&','Lansing State Journal','General','Lansing State Journal','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.908477"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.721874"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.617434"}]',0.832266,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "TSCO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.815837"}]','{"url": "https://www.lansingstatejournal.com/press-release/story/978949/hot-shots-secret-announces-major-expansion-in-tractor-supply-company-nationwide/", "title": "Hot Shot’s Secret® Announces Major Expansion in Tractor Supply Company® Nationwide", "source": "Lansing State Journal", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.908477"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.721874"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.617434"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Hot Shot’s Secret®, a fast-growing lubricant brand, is significantly expanding its product offerings nationwide at Tractor Supply Company. This exp