	 (400,'alpha_vantage','TSCO','TSCO','2026-02-01 08:39:58','20260201T083958','Keybank National Association OH Has $26.88 Million Stake in Tractor Supply Company $TSCO','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-keybank-national-association-oh-has-2688-million-stake-in-tractor-supply-company-tsco-2026-02-01/','Keybank National Association OH recently disclosed a $26.88 million stake in Tractor Supply Company (TSCO), despite reducing its position by 6.9% in the third quarter. Other institutional investors like Buckhead Capital Management LLC and Congress Asset Management Co. significantly increased their holdings. The article also notes recent analyst price target cuts following Tractor Supply''s Q4 earnings miss and lower-than-expected FY2026 guidance, alongside some positive sentiment regarding capital returns and store expansion.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/tractor-supply-co-logo-1200x675.gif','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.941790"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.823943"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.718638"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.633575"}]',-0.253916,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "TSCO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.219989"}, {"ticker": "JPM", "relevance_score": "0.627205", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.347656"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-keybank-national-association-oh-has-2688-million-stake-in-tractor-supply-company-tsco-2026-02-01/", "title": "Keybank National Association OH Has $26.88 Million Stake in Tractor Supply Company $TSCO", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.941790"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.823943"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.718638"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevanc