	 (415,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 13:26:23','20260203T132623','Gen Digital Inc. $GEN Position Increased by National Pension Service','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-gen-digital-inc-gen-position-increased-by-national-pension-service-2026-02-03/','National Pension Service increased its stake in Gen Digital Inc. (NASDAQ:GEN) by 26.1% in the third quarter, now owning 822,756 shares valued at $23.36 million. This move is part of a broader trend where institutional investors, including Amundi, Arrowstreet Capital, and Vanguard Group, have significantly increased their positions in the cybersecurity company, collectively owning about 81.38% of the stock. Gen Digital also reported strong Q3 earnings, beating estimates with $0.62 EPS and $1.22 billion in revenue, and provided optimistic FY 2026 guidance.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/gen-digital-logo-1200x675.png?v=20230316142124','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.946564"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.819030"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.701371"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.604220"}]',0.103546,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "GEN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.336240"}, {"ticker": "AMP", "relevance_score": "0.626864", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.344104"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.624252", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.133986"}, {"ticker": "CRM", "relevance_score": "0.627263", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.104967"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.600865", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.140257"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-gen-digital-inc-gen-position-increased-by-national-pension-service-2026-02-03/", "tit