	 (416,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 13:15:00','20260203T131500','Amazon Sets New Prime Delivery Speed Record in 2025 With Over 13 Billion Items Arriving the Same or Next Day Around the World','https://investingnews.com/amazon-sets-new-prime-delivery-speed-record-in-2025-with-over-13-billion-items-arriving-the-same-or-next-day-around-the-world/','Amazon announced it delivered over 13 billion items globally with same or next-day speed in 2025, setting a new record for the third consecutive year. U.S. Prime members received over 8 billion items this quickly, saving an average of $550 on delivery and 64 trips to a physical store. This achievement is attributed to significant investments in rural delivery networks, expansion of perishable grocery and prescription delivery, and the use of AI to optimize inventory placement.','https://investingnews.com/media-library/image.jpg?id=46921662&width=980&quality=70','Investing News Network','General','Investing News Network','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.914210"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.812828"}]',0.345885,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.454918"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.616421", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.281346"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.578802", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.210514"}]','{"url": "https://investingnews.com/amazon-sets-new-prime-delivery-speed-record-in-2025-with-over-13-billion-items-arriving-the-same-or-next-day-around-the-world/", "title": "Amazon Sets New Prime Delivery Speed Record in 2025 With Over 13 Billion Items Arriving the Same or Next Day Around the World", "source": "Investing News Network", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.914210"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.812828"