	 (420,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 12:35:08','20260203T123508','UBS Maintains Buy on Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) Feb 02, 2026','https://meyka.com/blog/ubs-maintains-buy-on-amazoncom-inc-amzn-feb-02-2026-0302/','UBS reaffirmed its Buy rating for Amazon (AMZN) on February 2, 2026, citing strong cloud demand and ongoing AI investments, as summarized by StreetInsider. The firm did not issue a new price target, implying a confirmation of its prior conviction rather than an upgrade or downgrade. The market reaction was modest, with investors focusing on AWS growth, AI adoption, and margin trends.',NULL,'Meyka','General','Meyka','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.947811"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.841031"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.706612"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.646636"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.607706"}]',0.448565,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.447340"}]','{"url": "https://meyka.com/blog/ubs-maintains-buy-on-amazoncom-inc-amzn-feb-02-2026-0302/", "title": "UBS Maintains Buy on Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) Feb 02, 2026", "source": "Meyka", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.947811"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.841031"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.706612"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.646636"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.607706"}], "authors": ["Danny Kontos"], "summary": "UBS reaffirmed its Buy rating for Amazon (AMZN) on February 2, 2026, citing strong cloud demand and ongoing AI investments, as summarized by StreetInsider. The firm did not issue a new price target, implying a confirmation of its prior conviction rather than an upgrade or downgrade. The market reaction was modest, with investors focusing on AWS growth, AI adoption, and margin trends.