	 (426,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 10:37:56','20260203T103756','Earnings call transcript: Celestica Q4 2025 EPS beats but stock slides','https://www.investing.com/news/transcripts/earnings-call-transcript-celestica-q4-2025-eps-beats-but-stock-slides-93CH-4481021','Celestica Inc. (CLS) reported Q4 2025 EPS of $2.56 and revenue of $4.95 billion, exceeding analyst forecasts of $2.42 and $4.82 billion respectively. Despite the strong performance, the stock declined 10.7% in after-hours trading, closing at $403.89. The company also raised its 2026 revenue outlook to $17 billion, anticipating significant growth driven by demand in communications and AI/ML compute markets, and announced substantial capital investments to expand manufacturing capacity.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/world_news_2_69x52._800x533_L_1419494365.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.901614"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.848647"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.720771"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.616864"}]',0.275815,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "CLS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.184703"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.740600", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.451455"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.733147", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.481857"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.616937", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.312127"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.596238", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.341120"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/transcripts/earnings-call-transcript-celestica-q4-2025-eps-beats-but-stock-slides-93CH-4481021", "title": "Earnings call transcript: Cele