	 (432,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 06:28:59','20260203T062859','Should Winmark’s (WINA) S&P Index Additions and Dividend Hike Require Action From Investors?','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/retail/nasdaq-wina/winmark/news/should-winmarks-wina-sp-index-additions-and-dividend-hike-re','Winmark Corporation''s recent inclusion in multiple S&P indices and its approved quarterly dividend of US$0.96 per share enhance the company''s visibility and liquidity, particularly for institutional and income-focused investors. While these developments strengthen Winmark''s investment narrative by attracting new shareholders, they do not mitigate underlying risks like high leverage and a dividend not fully covered by free cash flow. Investors should consider these financial challenges and the stock''s valuation, which is currently above some fair value estimates, despite the increased market presence.',NULL,'Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932358"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.949929"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.806986"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.744343"}]',0.100313,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "WINA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.294210"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.633593", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.024223"}, {"ticker": "META", "relevance_score": "0.609311", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.005373"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/retail/nasdaq-wina/winmark/news/should-winmarks-wina-sp-index-additions-and-dividend-hike-re", "title": "Should Winmark’s (WINA) S&P Index Additions and Dividend Hike Require Action From Investors?", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932358"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score