	 (442,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 00:48:01','20260203T004801','The Bull Case For Bio-Techne (TECH) Could Change Following New Synthetic Organoid ECM And Neuro Biomarker Tools','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nasdaq-tech/bio-techne/news/the-bull-case-for-bio-techne-tech-could-change-following-new','Bio-Techne has launched new Cultrex Synthetic Hydrogel for 3D stem cell and organoid research and ultra-sensitive Simple Plex assays for neurodegenerative biomarker detection. While these innovations reinforce Bio-Techne''s position in high-value research areas, they may not immediately alter the company''s near-term outlook of modest revenue growth and compressed profit margins. The article suggests that execution on these product launches will be crucial for influencing investor perception, especially given the company''s current valuation.',NULL,'Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.900037"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.701089"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.649759"}]',0.103898,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TECH", "relevance_score": "0.957735", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.104373"}, {"ticker": "DHR", "relevance_score": "0.642974", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.000282"}, {"ticker": "TMO", "relevance_score": "0.604046", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.048059"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.590817", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.141951"}, {"ticker": "TSLA", "relevance_score": "0.588649", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.125611"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nasdaq-tech/bio-techne/news/the-bull-case-for-bio-techne-tech-could-change-following-new", "title": "The Bull Case For Bio-Techne (TECH) Could Change Followi