	 (443,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 00:32:29','20260203T003229','Dow joins a growing list of companies announcing layoffs','https://www.1012industryreport.com/workforce/dow-joins-a-growing-list-of-companies-announcing-layoffs/','Dow is planning to cut approximately 4,500 jobs, citing an increased emphasis on artificial intelligence and automation. This move is expected to incur $600 million to $800 million in severance costs as part of a broader plan to simplify operations. Shares of Dow Inc. fell 2% following the announcement, joining other major companies like Amazon and UPS in recent large-scale layoffs.','https://www.1012industryreport.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/oil-and-gas-worker-696x460.jpg.webp','10/12 Industry Report','General','10/12 Industry Report','[{"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.823438"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.836128"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.630954"}]',-0.184401,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "DOW", "relevance_score": "0.323305", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.014360"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.637097", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.337971"}]','{"url": "https://www.1012industryreport.com/workforce/dow-joins-a-growing-list-of-companies-announcing-layoffs/", "title": "Dow joins a growing list of companies announcing layoffs", "source": "10/12 Industry Report", "topics": [{"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.823438"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.836128"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.630954"}], "authors": ["10/12 Industry Report Staff"], "summary": "Dow is planning to cut approximately 4,500 jobs, citing an increased emphasis on artificial intelligence and automation. This move is expected to incur $600 million to $800 million in severance costs as part of a broader plan to simplify operations. Shares of Dow Inc.