	 (445,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 00:00:00','20260203T000000','Alphabet GOOG stock closes higher after-hours as Waymo lands $16B round and earnings loom','https://ts2.tech/en/alphabet-goog-stock-closes-higher-after-hours-as-waymo-lands-16b-round-and-earnings-loom/','Alphabet''s (GOOG) Class C shares rose 1.9% after Waymo, its self-driving car unit, announced a $16 billion funding round valuing it at $126 billion. This news comes just before Alphabet''s earnings report, where investors will be looking for how new AI features will impact revenue and costs. Analysts like Jefferies have raised price targets for Alphabet, but the stock remains sensitive to future advertising or cloud outlooks and autonomous driving developments.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/alphabet-goog-stock-closes-higher-after-hours-as-waymo-lands-16b-round-and-earnings-loom-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.927732"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.830915"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.607523"}]',0.198243,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.946468", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.349462"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.897885", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.330481"}, {"ticker": "TSLA", "relevance_score": "0.647063", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.134904"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.641254", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.323228"}, {"ticker": "AVGO", "relevance_score": "0.641738", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.014992"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/alphabet-goog-stock-closes-higher-after-hours-as-waymo-lands-16b-round-and-earnings-loom/", "title": "Alphabet 