	 (450,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 23:51:47','20260202T235147','Amazon’s AI Shift With OpenAI Talks And Layoffs Meets Undervaluation Concerns','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/retail/nasdaq-amzn/amazoncom/news/amazons-ai-shift-with-openai-talks-and-layoffs-meets-underva','Amazon is reportedly in preliminary discussions to invest up to $50 billion in OpenAI, alongside announcing layoffs of over 16,000 corporate employees as part of a strategic shift towards an AI-powered organization. This move highlights Amazon''s focus on integrating AI across its diverse operations including e-commerce, cloud computing (AWS), and advertising, while also addressing concerns about its current stock undervaluation. Investors are advised to monitor how this significant AI spending and workforce adjustment will impact the company''s margins and earnings trajectory.','https://images.simplywall.st/company/d0665877-9ec5-4568-8a29-e8fff77df072/chart/quote-price','Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.803650"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.711384"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.639782"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.749513"}]',0.292484,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.270837"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/retail/nasdaq-amzn/amazoncom/news/amazons-ai-shift-with-openai-talks-and-layoffs-meets-underva", "title": "Amazon’s AI Shift With OpenAI Talks And Layoffs Meets Undervaluation Concerns", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.803650"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.711384"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.639782"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.749513"}], "authors": ["Simply Wall St", "Bailey Pemberton"], "summary": "Amazon