	 (451,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 23:17:47','20260202T231747','Amazon stock (AMZN) climbs after-hours as earnings loom and fresh filing hits tape','https://ts2.tech/en/amazon-stock-amzn-climbs-after-hours-as-earnings-loom-and-fresh-filing-hits-tape/','Amazon''s stock (AMZN) rose 1.5% in after-hours trading as investors anticipate its upcoming quarterly earnings report, which will offer insights into cloud demand and AI costs. The company''s results are a key indicator for corporate IT budgets and consumer spending. Investors are also monitoring Amazon''s capital spending, recent job cuts, and an extension request for its satellite broadband project.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/amazon-stock-amzn-climbs-after-hours-as-earnings-loom-and-fresh-filing-hits-tape-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.936020"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.814716"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.715679"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.647844"}]',0.131467,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.268499"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.620845", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.332898"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.555466", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.203349"}, {"ticker": "AVGO", "relevance_score": "0.579530", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.023908"}, {"ticker": "ORCL", "relevance_score": "0.562600", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.238910"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/amazon-stock-amzn-climbs-after-hours-as-earnings-loom-and-fresh-filing-hits-tape/", "title": "Amazon stock (AMZN) climbs after-hours as earnings loom and fresh filing hits tape", "source": "TechS