	 (452,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 22:27:44','20260202T222744','Earnings call transcript: Synchrony Financial’s Q4 2025 results show steady EPS but revenue miss','https://m.investing.com/news/transcripts/earnings-call-transcript-synchrony-financials-q4-2025-results-show-steady-eps-but-revenue-miss-93CH-4480263?ampMode=1','Synchrony Financial (SYF) announced its Q4 2025 earnings, where it met EPS expectations at $2.04 per diluted share but missed revenue forecasts, reporting $3.79 billion against an expected $3.84 billion. Following the announcement, the stock dropped by 5.28% in pre-market trading due to investor concerns over the revenue miss. The company provided a 2026 EPS guidance of $9.10 to $9.50, projecting mid-single-digit loan receivable growth and continued net interest income expansion, supported by new product strategies and partnerships like with Bob''s Discount Furniture and Polaris, and investments in technology.',NULL,'Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.845762"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.637183"}]',0.197379,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "SYF", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.291478"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.721951", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.236245"}, {"ticker": "LOW", "relevance_score": "0.620023", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.105881"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.579802", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.113784"}]','{"url": "https://m.investing.com/news/transcripts/earnings-call-transcript-synchrony-financials-q4-2025-results-show-steady-eps-but-revenue-miss-93CH-4480263?ampMode=1", "title": "Earnings call transcript: Synchrony Financial’s Q4 2025 results show steady EPS but revenue miss