	 (455,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 21:59:24','20260202T215924','Rio Tinto (RIO) 6-K details voting rights and new collaborations','https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/RIO/6-k-rio-tinto-plc-current-report-foreign-issuer-f3009de69a60.html','Rio Tinto plc filed a 6-K report detailing its share capital and voting rights as of December 31, 2025, confirming 1,254,292,412 voting rights after excluding treasury shares. The filing also summarized various January 2026 announcements, including collaborations with Amazon Web Services and BHP, and a joint acquisition with Chalco in the low-carbon aluminium sector. This report provides crucial information for shareholders to assess disclosure thresholds under UK transparency rules and highlights the company''s dual-listed structure.','https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0000863064/000086306426000008/image_02.jpg','Stock Titan','General','Stock Titan','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.948950"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.821536"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.745557"}]',0.195445,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "RIO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.102384"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.642545", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.210433"}]','{"url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/RIO/6-k-rio-tinto-plc-current-report-foreign-issuer-f3009de69a60.html", "title": "Rio Tinto (RIO) 6-K details voting rights and new collaborations", "source": "Stock Titan", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.948950"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.821536"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.745557"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Rio Tinto plc filed a 6-K report detailing its share capital and voting rights as of December 31, 2025, confirming 1,254,292,412 voting rights after 