	 (460,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 20:32:46','20260202T203246','Jim Cramer on Rio Tinto: "I Just Think It''s a Great Hedge Against All the Chaos That We See in the World"','https://finviz.com/news/296092/jim-cramer-on-rio-tinto-i-just-think-its-a-great-hedge-against-all-the-chaos-that-we-see-in-the-world','Jim Cramer expressed his long-standing approval of Rio Tinto, viewing it as a valuable hedge against global instability. While Cramer suggests owning the stock, Cullen Capital Management recently sold their position due to concerns about potential iron ore oversupply and declining demand from China, despite acknowledging Rio Tinto''s long-term growth potential. They instead favor AI stocks for better upside and less risk.','https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/03190215/pexels-alesiakozik-6770610.jpg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.948338"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.847620"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.720044"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.621711"}]',0.114087,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "RIO", "relevance_score": "0.999659", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.132015"}, {"ticker": "GS", "relevance_score": "0.614316", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.132404"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.564639", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.067395"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/296092/jim-cramer-on-rio-tinto-i-just-think-its-a-great-hedge-against-all-the-chaos-that-we-see-in-the-world", "title": "Jim Cramer on Rio Tinto: \\"I Just Think It''s a Great Hedge Against All the Chaos That We See in the World\\"", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.948338"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.847620"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.7200