	 (466,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 19:26:32','20260202T192632','Amazon Stock Is Cheap Heading Into Q4 Earnings (NASDAQ:AMZN)','https://seekingalpha.com/article/4865014-amazon-stock-is-cheap-heading-into-q4-earnings','Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) stock is consolidating and appears undervalued ahead of its Q4 2025 earnings report. Despite recent underperformance, the author believes AMZN offers a favorable risk-reward profile due to its discount compared to peers, ongoing margin improvements, and steady AWS growth. A potential OpenAI investment is noted as a risk if not strategically aligned with AWS.','https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1452541809/image_1452541809.jpg?io=getty-c-w630','Seeking Alpha','General','Seeking Alpha','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.910641"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.810837"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.744363"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.627293"}]',0.437782,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.446677"}]','{"url": "https://seekingalpha.com/article/4865014-amazon-stock-is-cheap-heading-into-q4-earnings", "title": "Amazon Stock Is Cheap Heading Into Q4 Earnings (NASDAQ:AMZN)", "source": "Seeking Alpha", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.910641"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.810837"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.744363"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.627293"}], "authors": ["The Techie"], "summary": "Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) stock is consolidating and appears undervalued ahead of its Q4 2025 earnings report. Despite recent underperformance, the author believes AMZN offers a favorable risk-reward profile due to its discount compared to peers, ongoing margin improvements, and steady AWS growth. A potential OpenAI investment is noted as a risk if not strate