	 (469,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 17:36:52','20260202T173652','Is your Alexa different? Recent upgrade brings new voices, features','https://www.usatoday.com/story/tech/2026/02/02/amazon-alexa-plus-upgrades-new-voices-features/88418423007/','Amazon Prime subscribers are receiving automatic upgrades to Alexa+, the latest generation of the virtual assistant, which introduces new voices and enhanced conversational capabilities. This upgrade, part of a free Early Access trial, includes features like free-flowing conversations, booking services, smart home control, and personalized news. Users can opt out of Alexa+ Early Access if they prefer the original Alexa voice and features.',NULL,'USA Today','General','USA Today','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.905332"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.636437"}]',0.290361,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.327710"}, {"ticker": "UBER", "relevance_score": "0.643865", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.217984"}]','{"url": "https://www.usatoday.com/story/tech/2026/02/02/amazon-alexa-plus-upgrades-new-voices-features/88418423007/", "title": "Is your Alexa different? Recent upgrade brings new voices, features", "source": "USA Today", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.905332"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.636437"}], "authors": ["Kate Perez"], "summary": "Amazon Prime subscribers are receiving automatic upgrades to Alexa+, the latest generation of the virtual assistant, which introduces new voices and enhanced conversational capabilities. This upgrade, part of a free Early Access trial, includes features like free-flowing conversations, booking services, smart home control, and personalized news. Users can opt out of Alexa+ Early Access if they prefer the original Alexa voice and features.", "b