	 (472,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 16:28:54','20260202T162854','How Novo Nordisk’s new Wegovy pill is transforming the weight-loss drug market','https://sherwood.news/business/how-novo-nordisks-new-wegovy-pill-is-transforming-the-weight-loss-drug/','Novo Nordisk''s new Wegovy pill is rapidly reshaping the obesity drug market, drawing in new patients and accelerating a shift towards cash-pay obesity care, according to telehealth executives and early prescription data. The pill''s lower cost for starting doses compared to injectables and its ease of use for some patients are contributing to its strong demand, particularly among first-time GLP-1 users. This launch is also affecting the economics of compounded drugs and highlights a growing consumer-driven approach in the weight-loss medication industry, with drugmakers increasingly partnering with telehealth companies.','https://sherwoodnews.imgix.net/mwphzyq69oso/en-US/assets/files/2256614226_photo-illustration-of-the-new-wegovy-semaglutide-tablets-on-a-white-background-its-a.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&cs=srgb&fit=max&w=3840','Sherwood News','General','Sherwood News','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.949275"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.742723"}]',0.211189,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "NVO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.454758"}, {"ticker": "LLY", "relevance_score": "0.703381", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.342545"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.636085", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.106424"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.644478", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.135983"}, {"ticker": "PFE", "relevance_score": "0.557327", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.106883"}]','{"url": "https://sherwood.news/business/how-novo-nordisks-new-