	 (475,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 15:57:16','20260202T155716','Morgan Stanley survey shows electronics spending intentions are worsening','https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/morgan-stanley-survey-shows-electronics-spending-intentions-are-worsening-4479444','A recent Morgan Stanley AlphaWise Consumer Survey indicates a notable decline in U.S. consumer intentions to spend on electronics, including PCs, despite an overall improvement in economic sentiment and household finances. Both one-month and six-month spending intentions for consumer electronics have worsened, particularly among lower and higher-income households. The report suggests that moderation in electronics spending could be a headwind for the sector in the coming months, with tariffs having minimal impact on purchasing decisions.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/moved_LYNXMPEL410N8_L.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.930009"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.711037"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.834972"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.638988"}]',-0.12935,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "MS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.001650"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.625980", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.185795"}, {"ticker": "AAPL", "relevance_score": "0.633690", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.162262"}, {"ticker": "BBY", "relevance_score": "0.619561", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.191072"}, {"ticker": "DELL", "relevance_score": "0.619093", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.150945"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/morgan-stanley-survey-shows-electronics-spending-intentions-are-wors