	 (480,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 14:27:00','20260202T142700','Home Depot cuts 800 jobs','https://www.ciodive.com/news/home-depot-cuts-jobs-tech-organization/811031/','Home Depot has laid off approximately 800 employees, primarily in its technology organization at its Atlanta support center, and is mandating a full return to office for corporate staff. This restructuring aims to simplify corporate operations and improve agility, following a third quarter where the company missed profit expectations and cut its full-year guidance. The job cuts are part of a broader trend of layoffs in the retail industry, which has seen a significant increase in job eliminations over the past year.','https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/GAYHHpzdQUR2kqIDrHJM67EYqYauOf64fthE5RJ5I9w/g:ce/rs:fill:1200:675:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9HZXR0eUltYWdlcy0xNDE1MjMxNjM1LmpwZw==.webp','CIO Dive','General','CIO Dive','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.905717"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.813972"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.739907"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.643833"}]',-0.338402,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "HD", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.341735"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.613124", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.313840"}]','{"url": "https://www.ciodive.com/news/home-depot-cuts-jobs-tech-organization/811031/", "title": "Home Depot cuts 800 jobs", "source": "CIO Dive", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.905717"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.813972"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.739907"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.643833"}], "authors": ["Caroline Jansen"], "summary": "Home Depot has laid off approximately 800 employees, primarily in its technology organization at its Atlant