	 (482,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-02 14:14:59','20260202T141459','Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) is in Talks to Invest Up to $50 billion in OpenAI, Source Reports','https://finviz.com/news/295451/amazoncom-inc-amzn-is-in-talks-to-invest-up-to-50-billion-in-openai-source-reports','Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) is reportedly in preliminary talks to invest up to $50 billion in OpenAI, potentially becoming the largest contributor to OpenAI''s fundraising round. This comes as OpenAI seeks up to $100 billion in capital at an $830 billion valuation, preparing for a potential $1 trillion IPO. Separately, Amazon recently announced significant corporate layoffs, totaling 16,000 positions, aimed at increasing efficiency.','https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/19152853/AMZN-insidermonkey-1695151731080.jpg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.922007"}, {"topic": "ipo", "relevance_score": "0.810005"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.716300"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.613872"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.611380"}]',0.023534,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.107802"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.602486", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.130029"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/295451/amazoncom-inc-amzn-is-in-talks-to-invest-up-to-50-billion-in-openai-source-reports", "title": "Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) is in Talks to Invest Up to $50 billion in OpenAI, Source Reports", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.922007"}, {"topic": "ipo", "relevance_score": "0.810005"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.716300"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.613872"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.611380"}], "authors": ["F