	 (486,'alpha_vantage','BBWI','BBWI','2026-02-02 21:27:55','20260202T212755','Shareholder Rights Law Firm Robbins LLP Urges BBWI Investors to Contact the Firm About Leading the Class Action Against Bath & Body Works, Inc.','https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/02/02/3230637/0/en/Shareholder-Rights-Law-Firm-Robbins-LLP-Urges-BBWI-Investors-to-Contact-the-Firm-About-Leading-the-Class-Action-Against-Bath-Body-Works-Inc.html','Robbins LLP, a shareholder rights law firm, is urging investors of Bath & Body Works, Inc. (BBWI) to contact them regarding a class action lawsuit. The lawsuit alleges that Bath & Body Works misled investors regarding its business strategy, specifically that its focus on "adjacencies, collaborations and promotions" failed to grow its customer base and obscured weak financial results. This led to disappointing Q3 2025 financial results and a significant drop in stock price.','https://ml.globenewswire.com/media/Yzc1N2FhZjItNjAyZS00MGVmLWEwZTYtZTY3NzNiMTExZDM5LTEwMjI3MzctMjAyNi0wMi0wMi1lbg==/tiny/Robbins-LLP.png','GlobeNewswire','General','GlobeNewswire','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.931732"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.817725"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.748262"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.643039"}]',-0.804431,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "BBWI", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.845125"}]','{"url": "https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/02/02/3230637/0/en/Shareholder-Rights-Law-Firm-Robbins-LLP-Urges-BBWI-Investors-to-Contact-the-Firm-About-Leading-the-Class-Action-Against-Bath-Body-Works-Inc.html", "title": "Shareholder Rights Law Firm Robbins LLP Urges BBWI Investors to Contact the Firm About Leading the Class Action Against Bath & Body Works, Inc.", "source": "GlobeNewswire", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.931732"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_scor