	 (487,'alpha_vantage','BBY','BBY','2026-02-03 00:48:46','20260203T004846','McDonald''s Corporation (MCD): A Bull Case Theory','https://finviz.com/news/296382/mcdonalds-corporation-mcd-a-bull-case-theory','This article summarizes a bullish thesis on McDonald''s Corporation (MCD), highlighting its strong franchise model, digital ecosystem, and unit expansion plans as key drivers for profitable, recurring revenue streams. Despite potential risks like traffic quality and valuation, the company is seen as a high-quality, defensive compounder with a strong track record of shareholder returns, including consistent dividend increases and share buybacks. The analysis suggests optimal entry points for investors below $300, with further accumulation below $285.','https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/26164436/mcdonalds-450433_1280.jpg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.843422"}]',0.127537,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "MCD", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.457501"}, {"ticker": "BBY", "relevance_score": "0.596635", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.140781"}, {"ticker": "NFLX", "relevance_score": "0.572895", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.182230"}, {"ticker": "PLTR", "relevance_score": "0.590233", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.278182"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/296382/mcdonalds-corporation-mcd-a-bull-case-theory", "title": "McDonald''s Corporation (MCD): A Bull Case Theory", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.843422"}], "authors": ["Ricardo Pillai"], "summary": "This article summarizes a bullish thesis on McDonald''s Corporation (MCD), highlighting its strong franchise model, digital ecosystem, and unit expansion plans as key drivers for profitable, recurring revenue streams. Desp