	 (494,'alpha_vantage','BBY','BBY','2026-02-02 14:23:03','20260202T142303','Best Buy faces challenging FY26 as tough comps, housing slump cloud sales outlook - analyst (BBY:NYSE)','https://seekingalpha.com/news/4545362-best-buy-faces-challenging-fy26-as-tough-comps-housing-slump-cloud-sales-outlook---analyst','J.P. Morgan analyst Christopher Horvers downgraded Best Buy (BBY) due to a challenging outlook for FY26. While the company may see a sales bump from tax refunds and hardware updates, these gains are unlikely to offset tough comparisons to 2025 and an anticipated sluggish housing market. The analyst highlighted concerns over rising PC memory costs, optimistic sales guidance for computing, mobile, and gaming, and ongoing consumer uncertainty impacting profitability and sales growth.','https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2197536092/image_2197536092.jpg?io=getty-c-w630','Seeking Alpha','General','Seeking Alpha','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.914759"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.838867"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.726984"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.613568"}]',-0.41268,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "BBY", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.415861"}]','{"url": "https://seekingalpha.com/news/4545362-best-buy-faces-challenging-fy26-as-tough-comps-housing-slump-cloud-sales-outlook---analyst", "title": "Best Buy faces challenging FY26 as tough comps, housing slump cloud sales outlook - analyst (BBY:NYSE)", "source": "Seeking Alpha", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.914759"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.838867"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.726984"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.613568"}], "authors": ["Amy Thielen"], "summary": "J.P. Morgan analyst Christopher Horvers downgraded Best Buy (BBY) due to a challenging 