	 (495,'alpha_vantage','BIRK','BIRK','2026-02-02 14:57:52','20260202T145752','AGF Management Ltd. Purchases 51,110 Shares of Birkenstock Holding PLC $BIRK','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-agf-management-ltd-purchases-51110-shares-of-birkenstock-holding-plc-birk-2026-02-02/','AGF Management Ltd. increased its stake in Birkenstock Holding PLC (NYSE:BIRK) by 51,110 shares, bringing its total holdings to 2,089,320 shares valued at approximately $94.54 million. The footwear company recently reported strong quarterly earnings, beating expectations with an EPS of $0.60 and revenue of $617.7 million, and provided positive FY2026 guidance. Analysts maintain a "Moderate Buy" rating for BIRK, with a consensus price target of $60.18.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/birkenstock-holding-limited-logo-1200x675.png?v=20231025071239','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.902840"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.829391"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.730051"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.607000"}]',0.217075,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "BIRK", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.453269"}, {"ticker": "GS", "relevance_score": "0.699229", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.297125"}, {"ticker": "KHC", "relevance_score": "0.568837", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.130944"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.594252", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.146836"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-agf-management-ltd-purchases-51110-shares-of-birkenstock-holding-plc-birk-2026-02-02/", "title": "AGF Management Ltd. Purchases 51,110 Shares of Birkenstock Holding PLC $BIRK", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.902840"}, {"topic": "fin