	 (497,'alpha_vantage','CFR','CFR','2026-02-02 19:58:12','20260202T195812','Cullen/Frost Bankers (NYSE:CFR) Stock Price Expected to Rise, Citigroup Analyst Says','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/cullenfrost-bankers-nysecfr-stock-price-expected-to-rise-citigroup-analyst-says-2026-02-02/','Citigroup raised its price target for Cullen/Frost Bankers (NYSE:CFR) to $125, although it maintained a "sell" rating due to a potential 10.27% downside. Despite this, other analysts have higher price targets, and the bank recently surpassed quarterly expectations with strong EPS and revenue figures. Institutional investors are increasing their holdings in CFR, with Goldman Sachs Group Inc. notably raising its stake by over 61%.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/cullen-frost-logo-1200x675.jpg','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.930302"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.843113"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.804008"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.638628"}]',0.220913,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "CFR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.285107"}, {"ticker": "C", "relevance_score": "0.616936", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.130590"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/cullenfrost-bankers-nysecfr-stock-price-expected-to-rise-citigroup-analyst-says-2026-02-02/", "title": "Cullen/Frost Bankers (NYSE:CFR) Stock Price Expected to Rise, Citigroup Analyst Says", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.930302"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.843113"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.804008"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.638628"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Citigroup raised its price target for Cullen/Frost Bankers (NYSE:CFR) to $125, although it maintai