	 (500,'alpha_vantage','CFR','CFR','2026-02-02 16:58:12','20260202T165812','Frost Bank parent adds Shields, Rummel as directors; Avery retiring from board','https://www.expressnews.com/business/article/cullen-frost-marsha-shields-mccombs-rummel-board-21328979.php','Cullen/Frost Bankers Inc., the parent company of Frost Bank, has appointed Marsha Shields and Jeff Rummel to its board of directors. Shields is the CEO and managing partner of McCombs Enterprises, while Rummel is a former managing partner at Ernst & Young LLP in San Antonio. Physician Chris Avery, a board member since 2015, plans to retire in April.','https://cdn-channels-pixel.ex.co/events/0012000001fxZm9AAE?integrationType=DEFAULT&template=design%2Farticle%2Fplatypus_two_column.tpl','San Antonio Express-News','General','San Antonio Express-News','[{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.827520"}]',0.179414,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "CFR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.343014"}, {"ticker": "T", "relevance_score": "0.638945", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.044988"}, {"ticker": "VLO", "relevance_score": "0.631229", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.216977"}]','{"url": "https://www.expressnews.com/business/article/cullen-frost-marsha-shields-mccombs-rummel-board-21328979.php", "title": "Frost Bank parent adds Shields, Rummel as directors; Avery retiring from board", "source": "San Antonio Express-News", "topics": [{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.827520"}], "authors": ["Patrick Danner"], "summary": "Cullen/Frost Bankers Inc., the parent company of Frost Bank, has appointed Marsha Shields and Jeff Rummel to its board of directors. Shields is the CEO and managing partner of McCombs Enterprises, while Rummel is a former managing partner