	 (530,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-02 19:57:13','20260202T195713','The AI trend can give dividend aristocrats a boost, Raymond James says','https://www.cnbc.com/2026/02/02/the-ai-trend-can-give-dividend-aristocrats-a-boost-raymond-james-says.html','Dividend aristocrats, companies with a history of increasing dividends for at least 25 consecutive years, have recently underperformed the broader market, according to Raymond James. However, the investment firm believes this trend is poised to stabilize or reverse, partly due to the benefits of artificial intelligence broadening beyond big tech to other industries. As AI drives cost savings and productivity, dividend-paying companies with strong track records are expected to appeal to investors looking for growth and consistent returns.','https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108151925-1748530619592-gettyimages-1164042474-img_0869001.jpeg?v=1769710393&w=600&h=300&vtcrop=y','CNBC','General','CNBC','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.904125"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.744602"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.606975"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.615804"}]',0.238121,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "RJF", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.339791"}, {"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "0.630949", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.221850"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.645007", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.235322"}]','{"url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/02/02/the-ai-trend-can-give-dividend-aristocrats-a-boost-raymond-james-says.html", "title": "The AI trend can give dividend aristocrats a boost, Raymond James says", "source": "CNBC", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.904125"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.744602"}, {"topic": "tech