	 (547,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-03 12:26:41','20260203T122641','Jim Cramer on McKesson: “When This Company Reports, Its Stock Usually Flies”','https://uk.finance.yahoo.com/news/jim-cramer-mckesson-company-reports-122411662.html','Jim Cramer highlighted McKesson (NYSE: MCK) as a company whose stock tends to "fly" when it reports earnings, despite a general sentiment against drug middlemen. He noted that the stock has a strong track record, being a "perpetual resident on the new high list." Even with a recent top-line miss, McKesson delivered an significant earnings beat and a strong forecast, leading to a 22% stock gain since his earlier comments in May 2025.','https://media.zenfs.com/en/insidermonkey.com/f6497930c7732eef3c7d79847d97e1aa','Yahoo Finance UK','General','Yahoo Finance UK','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.931617"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.830356"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.944288"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.631547"}]',0.219231,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "MCK", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.457185"}, {"ticker": "HUM", "relevance_score": "0.748354", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.129195"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.733193", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.131002"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.706363", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.124026"}, {"ticker": "CAH", "relevance_score": "0.628210", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.263630"}]','{"url": "https://uk.finance.yahoo.com/news/jim-cramer-mckesson-company-reports-122411662.html", "title": "Jim Cramer on McKesson: “When This Company Reports, Its Stock Usually Flies”", "source": "Yahoo Finance UK", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.931617"}, {"topic": "fin