	 (548,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-03 10:19:37','20260203T101937','Bernstein Reiterates Outperform on UnitedHealth (UNH) Amid Medicare Advantage Volatility','https://finviz.com/news/296855/bernstein-reiterates-outperform-on-unitedhealth-unh-amid-medicare-advantage-volatility','Bernstein SocGen Group reiterated its Outperform rating and a $405 price target for UnitedHealth Group (UNH) on January 30, despite recent stock volatility stemming from Medicare Advantage rate announcements. Analyst Lance Wilkes identified five critical market questions related to these rates, including their impact on MA margins and UnitedHealth''s EPS. This reiteration comes after TD Cowen reduced its price target for UNH, although it simultaneously upgraded its EPS projections for the company.','https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/30012749/shutterstock_309245576.jpg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.931918"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.849138"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.741405"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.624794"}]',-0.147623,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.057003"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.645868", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.227787"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/296855/bernstein-reiterates-outperform-on-unitedhealth-unh-amid-medicare-advantage-volatility", "title": "Bernstein Reiterates Outperform on UnitedHealth (UNH) Amid Medicare Advantage Volatility", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.931918"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.849138"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.741405"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.624794"}], "authors": ["Sheryar Siddiq"], "summary": "Bernstein SocGen Group