	 (551,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-03 07:55:00','20260203T075500','CVS Health''s (CVS) Path Forward: Policy Challenges, Analyst Views, and Dividend Stability','https://finviz.com/news/297087/cvs-healths-cvs-path-forward-policy-challenges-analyst-views-and-dividend-stability','CVS Health (CVS) is facing policy challenges after the Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services (CMS) proposed new policies for 2027 with a lower-than-expected net rate and changes to risk score calculations. This led BofA Securities to cut its price target to $95 from $100, though maintaining a Buy rating. Despite these challenges and mixed analyst views, CVS''s Board of Directors approved a quarterly dividend of $0.665 per share, reflecting stability.','https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/18095039/Healthcare-biology-microscope-lab-laboratory-piqsels.com-id-fvbjr.jpg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.947453"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.820547"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.733514"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.618876"}]',-0.120443,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.117392"}, {"ticker": "CMI", "relevance_score": "0.636817", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.127370"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.631891", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.136408"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/297087/cvs-healths-cvs-path-forward-policy-challenges-analyst-views-and-dividend-stability", "title": "CVS Health''s (CVS) Path Forward: Policy Challenges, Analyst Views, and Dividend Stability", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.947453"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.820547"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.733514"}, {"topi