	 (554,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-02 15:57:23','20260202T155723','Morgan Stanley downgrades Humana on Medicare Advantage risks By Investing.com','https://in.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/morgan-stanley-downgrades-humana-on-medicare-advantage-risks-5216265','Morgan Stanley has downgraded Humana to Underweight from Equal-weight, citing policy risks and Humana''s 2026 Medicare Advantage bid strategy, which could impede margin recovery and pressure earnings through 2027. The bank cut its price target to $174 from $262, noting Humana''s disproportionate exposure to a weaker-than-expected Medicare Advantage Advance Rate Notice and its strategy of expanding prescription drug offerings while competitors are cutting benefits. This approach, combined with potential higher enrollment and weaker profitability, complicates Humana''s planned recovery, leading Morgan Stanley to prefer peers like UnitedHealth Group, CVS Health, and Cigna.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/Humana_800x533_L_1645537779.jpg','Investing.com India','General','Investing.com India','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.909262"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.842875"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.726908"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.629902"}]',0.069969,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "MS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.146832"}, {"ticker": "HUM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.423681"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.609475", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.235164"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.642579", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.203993"}, {"ticker": "CI", "relevance_score": "0.648024", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.206904"}]','{"url": "ht