	 (555,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-02 15:52:16','20260202T155216','Morgan Stanley downgrades Humana on Medicare Advantage risks','https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/morgan-stanley-downgrades-humana-on-medicare-advantage-risks-4479382','Morgan Stanley downgraded Humana from Equal-weight to Underweight, citing policy risks and the company''s 2026 Medicare Advantage bid strategy which could negatively impact its margin turnaround and earnings through 2027. The bank cut its price target to $174 from $262, suggesting that peers like UnitedHealth Group, CVS Health, and Cigna offer more compelling positioning amidst broader managed care disruptions. Humana is considered disproportionately exposed to Medicare Advantage policy changes, especially after a weaker-than-expected Advance Rate Notice indicated roughly flat benchmark reimbursement rates for 2027.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/Humana_800x533_L_1645537779.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.938682"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.804470"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.703776"}]',0.057549,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "HUM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.469695"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.602239", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.249600"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.634507", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.228011"}, {"ticker": "CI", "relevance_score": "0.604009", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.242296"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/morgan-stanley-downgrades-humana-on-medicare-advantage-risks-4479382", "title": "Morgan Stanley downgrades Humana on Medicare Advantage risks", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "life_sciences", "rele