	 (568,'alpha_vantage','DECK','DECK','2026-02-02 13:48:32','20260202T134832','McDonald’s discounts, meal bundles lift traffic, says BTIG as it upgrades stock','https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/mcdonalds-discounts-meal-bundles-lift-traffic-says-btig-as-it-upgrades-stock-4478885','BTIG has upgraded McDonald''s stock to Buy from Neutral, citing that the company''s revamped value strategy, including increased discounts and meal bundles, is successfully driving consistent traffic growth. This strategy is expected to lead to a stronger sales and earnings recovery, despite a temporary setback in January due to severe winter weather. New product launches like the potential national rollout of CosMc’s beverage platform and the introduction of the "Big Arch" burger are also anticipated to fuel significant earnings growth.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/LYNXMPEB4F000_L.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.925672"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.847013"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.740129"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.602772"}]',0.36529,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "MCD", "relevance_score": "0.957035", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.637944"}, {"ticker": "DECK", "relevance_score": "0.667694", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.703484"}, {"ticker": "AAPL", "relevance_score": "0.602479", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.236334"}, {"ticker": "TSLA", "relevance_score": "0.620220", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.306912"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.672017", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.217008"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/mcdonalds-discounts-meal-bundles-lift-traffic-says-btig-as-it-upgrades-stock-4