	 (569,'alpha_vantage','DG','DG','2026-02-03 13:00:03','20260203T130003','Here’s What Hit Baxter (BAX) in Q4','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/heres-what-hit-baxter-bax-in-q4-1687760/','Pzena Focused Value Strategy''s Q4 2025 commentary reveals Baxter International Inc. (BAX) was a leading detractor in their portfolio. The stock''s underperformance was attributed to disappointing Q3 results, a dividend cut, and continued pressure from delayed IV fluid volume normalization and an extended Novum pump ship-hold. While hedge fund interest in BAX increased, Pzena suggests that AI stocks offer greater potential for higher and quicker returns.','https://imonkey-blog.imgix.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/21152500/BAX-insidermonkey-1695324298660-768x430.jpg?auto=format&fit=clip&expires=1801612800&width=480&height=269','Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.930414"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.810260"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.707274"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.620680"}]',-0.104839,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "BAX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.393522"}, {"ticker": "DG", "relevance_score": "0.645216", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.110085"}, {"ticker": "SWKS", "relevance_score": "0.618150", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.140332"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/heres-what-hit-baxter-bax-in-q4-1687760/", "title": "Here’s What Hit Baxter (BAX) in Q4", "source": "Insider Monkey", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.930414"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.810260"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.707274"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.620680"}], "authors": ["Soumya Eswaran"], "summary": "Pzena Focused Value Strategy''s Q4 2025 commentary