	 (576,'alpha_vantage','TSCO','DG','2026-02-02 17:57:59','20260202T175759','Here are the retailers with the most store openings and closures planned for 2026','https://www.cnbc.com/2026/02/02/store-openings-and-closures-2026-dollar-general-aldi-gamestop.html','U.S. retailers are projected to see fewer store closures and more store openings in 2026 compared to 2025, driven largely by value-focused retailers like Dollar General and Aldi. While department stores and legacy retailers continue to reduce their footprints, demand for retail space is increasing, potentially leading to new strip mall developments if construction costs stabilize. GameStop, Francesca''s, and Walgreens are expected to lead in closures, while the overall retail landscape reflects evolving consumer preferences and economic factors.',NULL,'CNBC','General','CNBC','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.903194"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.811391"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.714786"}]',0.091729,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "DG", "relevance_score": "0.971567", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.320823"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.724282", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.148819"}, {"ticker": "WBA", "relevance_score": "0.669506", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.235652"}, {"ticker": "TSCO", "relevance_score": "0.600877", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.261671"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.593417", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.144767"}]','{"url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/02/02/store-openings-and-closures-2026-dollar-general-aldi-gamestop.html", "title": "Here are the retailers with the most store openings and closures planned for 2026", "source": "CNBC", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.903194"}, {"t