	 (580,'alpha_vantage','KO','DG','2026-02-02 15:23:02','20260202T152302','Dollar General Launches One-Day Deals','https://www.newsweek.com/dollar-general-launches-one-day-deals-11452778','Dollar General has launched a "7 Days of Savings" event across its 20,000 stores, offering a new, limited-time deal each day from February 1st to 7th. This initiative also coincides with the expansion of its "myDG Delivery" service to 17,000 stores, including same-day and one-hour delivery options. The deals, which include items like laundry detergent, storage totes, and snacks, are designed to help customers stock up on essentials and prepare for the Super Bowl.','https://assets.newsweek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Copy-of-32-image-2026-02-02T144407.326.png?w=1600&quality=80&webp=1','Newsweek','General','Newsweek','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.943474"}]',0.228238,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "DG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.314389"}, {"ticker": "DASH", "relevance_score": "0.740219", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.205779"}, {"ticker": "UBER", "relevance_score": "0.610687", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.206249"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.595299", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.181621"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.554724", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.201824"}]','{"url": "https://www.newsweek.com/dollar-general-launches-one-day-deals-11452778", "title": "Dollar General Launches One-Day Deals", "source": "Newsweek", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.943474"}], "authors": ["Amanda Greenwood"], "summary": "Dollar General has launched a \\"7 Days of Savings\\" event across its 20,000 stores, offering a new, limited-time deal each day from February 1s