	 (590,'alpha_vantage','DLTR','DLTR','2026-02-02 19:56:47','20260202T195647','Manager accused of not helping mom who was found dead inside Dollar Tree freezer, lawsuit says','https://www.kswo.com/2026/02/02/manager-accused-not-helping-mom-who-was-found-dead-inside-dollar-tree-freezer-lawsuit-says/','The family of Helen Massiell Garay Sanchez, a mother found dead in a Dollar Tree freezer, has filed a lawsuit alleging that the store manager failed to help locate her despite being informed she was missing. The suit claims Sanchez became trapped in the freezer and that Dollar Tree was negligent. The family is seeking over $50 million in damages.','https://gray-kswo-prod.gtv-cdn.com/resizer/v2/GM7GNB6CNND6JL2EJWRYIWTUFY.jpg?auth=f58197aab86a5884e10e214ded321ceebe3240014c9b45607d6b77675134741d&width=980&height=551&smart=true','KSWO 7News','General','KSWO 7News','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.807387"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.612821"}]',-0.830948,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "DLTR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.847298"}]','{"url": "https://www.kswo.com/2026/02/02/manager-accused-not-helping-mom-who-was-found-dead-inside-dollar-tree-freezer-lawsuit-says/", "title": "Manager accused of not helping mom who was found dead inside Dollar Tree freezer, lawsuit says", "source": "KSWO 7News", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.807387"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.612821"}], "authors": ["Akim Powell"], "summary": "The family of Helen Massiell Garay Sanchez, a mother found dead in a Dollar Tree freezer, has filed a lawsuit alleging that the store manager failed to help locate her despite being informed she was missing. The suit claims Sanchez became trapped in the freezer and that Dollar Tree was negligent. The family is seeking over $50 million in damages.", "banner_image": "https://gray-kswo-prod.gtv-cdn.com/resizer/v2/GM7GNB6CNND6JL2E