	 (597,'alpha_vantage','EBAY','EBAY','2026-02-03 05:58:20','20260203T055820','CarParts.com announces Evan Fischer as exclusive brand on eBay','https://www.aftermarketmatters.com/collision-repair/collision-product-news/carparts-com-announces-evan-fischer-as-exclusive-brand-on-ebay/','CarParts.com has announced that its proprietary brand, Evan Fischer, will now be sold exclusively on eBay, making it the sole third-party marketplace for the brand. This partnership aims to provide customers with fast, reliable, and affordable access to automotive parts. The Evan Fischer lineup includes essential replacement parts like brake components, steering and suspension parts, lighting, mirrors, and common wear items such as filters, belts, and wipers.','https://www.aftermarketmatters.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/evan-fischer-auto-parts-2.jpg','Aftermarket Matters','General','Aftermarket Matters','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.805675"}]',0.366,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "PRTS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.418618"}, {"ticker": "EBAY", "relevance_score": "0.900677", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.315608"}]','{"url": "https://www.aftermarketmatters.com/collision-repair/collision-product-news/carparts-com-announces-evan-fischer-as-exclusive-brand-on-ebay/", "title": "CarParts.com announces Evan Fischer as exclusive brand on eBay", "source": "Aftermarket Matters", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.805675"}], "authors": ["Wire Reports"], "summary": "CarParts.com has announced that its proprietary brand, Evan Fischer, will now be sold exclusively on eBay, making it the sole third-party marketplace for the brand. This partnership aims to provide customers with fast, reliable, and affordable access to automotive parts. The Evan Fischer lineup includes essential replacement parts like brake components, steering and suspension part