	 (598,'alpha_vantage','EBAY','EBAY','2026-02-02 14:03:17','20260202T140317','eBay Brings Football’s Biggest Game to Life with Real-Time Shopping, Epic Collectibles, Fashion Finds, and Star Athletes','https://www.ebayinc.com/stories/news/ebay-brings-footballs-biggest-game-to-life-with-real-time-shopping-epic-collectibles-fashion-finds-and-star-athletes/','eBay is hosting a full weekend of live shopping experiences in the Bay Area to celebrate football''s biggest game. This includes an immersive "eBay End Zone" pop-up in San Francisco featuring star athletes, rare collectibles, and pre-loved fashion, as well as a community watch party in San Jose. The events leverage eBay Live to offer real-time shopping, unique inventory, and opportunities for fans to buy exclusive items and bid on game tickets.','https://static.ebayinc.com/static/assets/Uploads/Stories/Articles/_resampled/FillWzgwMCw0NTBd/eBay-SB-KV-01.30-16x9-V1-1.jpg?fs=df76797b79310022','eBay Inc.','General','eBay Inc.','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.837994"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.635338"}]',0.409377,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "EBAY", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.432063"}]','{"url": "https://www.ebayinc.com/stories/news/ebay-brings-footballs-biggest-game-to-life-with-real-time-shopping-epic-collectibles-fashion-finds-and-star-athletes/", "title": "eBay Brings Football’s Biggest Game to Life with Real-Time Shopping, Epic Collectibles, Fashion Finds, and Star Athletes", "source": "eBay Inc.", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.837994"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.635338"}], "authors": [], "summary": "eBay is hosting a full weekend of live shopping experiences in the Bay Area to celebrate football''s biggest game. This includes an immersive \\"eBay End Zone\\" pop-up in San Francisco featuring star athletes, rare collectibles, and pre-loved fashion, as well as a community watch party in San Jose. The events leverage eBay Live to offer real-time shopping, unique inventory, and opportunities for fans to buy exclusive items and bid on game tickets.", "banner_image": "https://static.ebayinc.com/static/assets/Uploads/Stories/Articles/_resampled/FillWzgwMCw0NTBd/eBay-SB-KV-01.30-16x9-V1-1.jpg?fs=df76797b79310022", "source_domain": "eBay Inc.", "time_published": "20260202T140317", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "EBAY", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.432063"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.409377}','2026-02-03 13:44:43',NULL),
	 (599,'alpha_vantage','EL','EL','2026-02-02 16:58:34','20260202T165834','Newell Brands Q4 Earnings Around the Corner: What Awaits the Stock?','https://www.tradingview.com/news/zacks:408af906a094b:0-newell-brands-q4-earnings-around-the-corner-what-awaits-the-stock/','Newell Brands (NWL) is anticipated to report a year-over-year decline in revenues for its fourth-quarter 2025 results, with an expected figure of $1.89 billion, down 3.3% from the prior year. Despite top-line challenges exacerbated by macroeconomic factors, the company forecasts a 12.5% increase in bottom-line earnings per share to 18 cents, driven by simplification and productivity initiatives. The Zacks Model indicates Newell Brands currently has an Earnings ESP of -1.89% and a Zacks Rank #3, suggesting it may not conclusively beat earnings estimates this quarter, though it presents an attractive valuation.',NULL,'TradingView','General','TradingView','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.927357"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.749322"}]',0.277646,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "NWL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.143518"}, {"ticker": "HSY", "relevance_score": "0.624486", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.336340"}, {"ticker": "EL", "relevance_score": "0.608956", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.303598"}]','{"url": "https://www.tradingview.com/news/zacks:408af906a094b:0-newell-brands-q4-earnings-around-the-corner-what-awaits-the-stock/", "title": "Newell Brands Q4 Earnings Around the Corner: What Awaits the Stock?", "source": "TradingView", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.927357"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.749322"}], "authors": ["Zacks Investment Research"], "summary": "Newell Brands (NWL) is anticipated to report a year-over-year decline in revenues for its fourth-quarter 202