	 (602,'alpha_vantage','FIVE','FIVE','2026-02-02 15:19:00','20260202T151900','4 changes hitting all 1,800 Five Below stores in 2026','https://www.the-sun.com/money/15880100/five-below-stores-changes-new-products-store-openings/','Five Below is implementing four significant changes across its 1,800 stores in 2026, impacting shoppers. These changes include the introduction of higher-priced items beyond the traditional $5 limit, thousands of new product arrivals, a new cash payment policy encouraging exact change or card use due to a penny shortage, and the opening of numerous new stores across the U.S.','https://www.the-sun.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/02/NINTCHDBPICT001046407744.jpg?quality=90&strip=all','The Sun','General','The Sun','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.902301"}]',0.192604,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "FIVE", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.349920"}, {"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "0.625575", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.144049"}, {"ticker": "TJX", "relevance_score": "0.647307", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.142190"}]','{"url": "https://www.the-sun.com/money/15880100/five-below-stores-changes-new-products-store-openings/", "title": "4 changes hitting all 1,800 Five Below stores in 2026", "source": "The Sun", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.902301"}], "authors": ["Fiona McLoughlin"], "summary": "Five Below is implementing four significant changes across its 1,800 stores in 2026, impacting shoppers. These changes include the introduction of higher-priced items beyond the traditional $5 limit, thousands of new product arrivals, a new cash payment policy encouraging exact change or card use due to a penny shortage, and the opening of numerous new stores across the U.S.", "banner_image": "https://www.the-sun.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/02/NI