	 (614,'alpha_vantage','HD','HD','2026-02-02 16:27:19','20260202T162719','Law firm investigating Home Depot after 800 Georgia layoffs announced','https://finance.yahoo.com/news/law-firm-investigating-home-depot-161246899.html','A law firm in Atlanta, Strauss Borrelli PLLC, is investigating Home Depot and pursuing a class-action lawsuit following the company''s announcement of layoffs impacting nearly 800 workers in Georgia. The firm believes Home Depot may have violated the WARN Act by not providing sufficient severance and benefits, though Home Depot''s WARN Act notice was filed 62 days before the effective layoff date, seemingly meeting the 60-day requirement. Channel 2 Action News has reached out to Home Depot for comment.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/CLpbFyUmUtQ9JDMeKaSwpA--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTExNjtoPTQ4/https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2023-05/35390dc0-f043-11ed-bc32-02b4c9ef2cf0','Yahoo Finance','General','Yahoo Finance','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.826061"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.733298"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.628094"}]',-0.301714,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "HD", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.305797"}]','{"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/law-firm-investigating-home-depot-161246899.html", "title": "Law firm investigating Home Depot after 800 Georgia layoffs announced", "source": "Yahoo Finance", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.826061"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.733298"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.628094"}], "authors": ["WSBTV.com News Staff"], "summary": "A law firm in Atlanta, Strauss Borrelli PLLC, is investigating Home Depot and pursuing a class-action lawsuit following the company''s announcement of layoffs impacting nearly 800 workers in Georgia. The firm believes Home Depot may have violated the WAR