	 (647,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-03 01:27:08','20260203T012708','The Coca-Cola Company Is Discontinuing a Decades-Old Product Line','https://sg.style.yahoo.com/coca-cola-company-discontinuing-decades-010000070.html','The Coca-Cola Company is discontinuing its Minute Maid frozen juice concentrate line, along with Fruitopia fruit punch and Five Alive juice blend, in both the U.S. and Canada, citing a lack of customer interest. This decision marks the end of a product line that originated in 1945 and was acquired by Coca-Cola in the 1960s. Consumers have expressed disappointment, with many sharing their favorite uses for the concentrates.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/6jKBKjZN8bXB6FP9XPibRQ--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTEyNDI7aD05MzI7Y2Y9d2VicA--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/all_recipes_969/04b68b04436cb8a710199d5370866215','Yahoo Lifestyle Singapore','General','Yahoo Lifestyle Singapore','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.835429"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.625738"}]',-0.188252,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.215999"}]','{"url": "https://sg.style.yahoo.com/coca-cola-company-discontinuing-decades-010000070.html", "title": "The Coca-Cola Company Is Discontinuing a Decades-Old Product Line", "source": "Yahoo Lifestyle Singapore", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.835429"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.625738"}], "authors": ["Samantha Dillard"], "summary": "The Coca-Cola Company is discontinuing its Minute Maid frozen juice concentrate line, along with Fruitopia fruit punch and Five Alive juice blend, in both the U.S. and Canada, citing a lack of customer interest. This decision marks the end of a product line that originated in 1945 and was acquired by Coca-Cola in the 1960s. Consumers have expressed disappointment, with many sharing their favorite uses for the concentrat