	 (651,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-02 20:57:43','20260202T205743','Coca-Cola Expands Its Cherry Portfolio with the Launch of Coca-Cola Cherry Float and the Nationwide Release of Diet Coke Cherry','https://www.coca-colacompany.com/media-center/coca-cola-cherry-float-and-diet-coke-cherry-launch-nationwide.html','Coca-Cola is significantly expanding its cherry-flavored beverage lineup by introducing Coca-Cola Cherry Float and re-releasing Diet Coke Cherry nationwide. These new offerings join the existing cherry-flavored drinks, providing consumers with more choices in response to growing demand for nostalgic flavors. The products, including full sugar and zero sugar options with updated packaging, will begin rolling out to retailers in the U.S. and Canada in February 2026.','https://www.coca-colacompany.com/content/dam/company/us/en/media-center/00_thumbnails/Pick-Your-Cherry-Favorite-(HERO-Image)-resize.png','The Coca-Cola Company','General','The Coca-Cola Company','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.816777"}]',0.429694,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.418565"}]','{"url": "https://www.coca-colacompany.com/media-center/coca-cola-cherry-float-and-diet-coke-cherry-launch-nationwide.html", "title": "Coca-Cola Expands Its Cherry Portfolio with the Launch of Coca-Cola Cherry Float and the Nationwide Release of Diet Coke Cherry", "source": "The Coca-Cola Company", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.816777"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Coca-Cola is significantly expanding its cherry-flavored beverage lineup by introducing Coca-Cola Cherry Float and re-releasing Diet Coke Cherry nationwide. These new offerings join the existing cherry-flavored drinks, providing consumers with more choices in response to growing demand for nostalgic flavors. The products, including full sugar and zero sugar options with updated packaging, will begin 