	 (652,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-02 20:39:00','20260202T203900','PepsiCo, Inc. (PEP): A Bull Case Theory','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/pepsico-inc-pep-a-bull-case-theory-6-1667695/','This article summarizes a bullish thesis on PepsiCo (PEP) by Eric García, despite recent challenges where the company missed organic revenue growth expectations and experienced declining volumes. The thesis acknowledges PepsiCo''s reliance on price increases and ongoing margin pressures but points to international market growth and activist involvement from Elliott Management as potential catalysts for structural reform. While PEP''s stock has depreciated since an earlier bullish report, its strong brand portfolio, dividend reliability, and defensive income-oriented nature still support a long-term bull case.','https://imonkey-blog.imgix.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/shutterstock_249084658.jpg?auto=format&fit=clip&expires=1801612800&width=480&height=279','Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.939925"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.831290"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.710745"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.611337"}]',0.026072,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.097940"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.618726", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.107877"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/pepsico-inc-pep-a-bull-case-theory-6-1667695/", "title": "PepsiCo, Inc. (PEP): A Bull Case Theory", "source": "Insider Monkey", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.939925"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.831290"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.710745"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.611337"}], "authors": ["Ricardo Pillai"], "summary": "This ar