	 (657,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-02 15:53:00','20260202T155300','Coca-Cola stock price climbs late as staples lead; Feb 10 earnings in focus','https://ts2.tech/en/coca-cola-stock-price-climbs-late-as-staples-lead-feb-10-earnings-in-focus/','Coca-Cola shares rose by approximately 1% in late trading, outperforming the broader market as consumer staples led gains. Investors are closely watching Coca-Cola''s upcoming fourth-quarter and full-year 2025 earnings report on February 10, followed by its CAGNY presentation on February 17. Key concerns include the impact of price hikes on demand, the balance between pricing and volume growth, and the effect of currency fluctuations on international profits.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/coca-cola-stock-price-climbs-late-as-staples-lead-feb-10-earnings-in-focus-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.948367"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.816418"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.714557"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.624536"}]',0.165791,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.292983"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.707565", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.130065"}, {"ticker": "CMG", "relevance_score": "0.605823", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.143571"}, {"ticker": "JNJ", "relevance_score": "0.560062", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.224734"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/coca-cola-stock-price-climbs-late-as-staples-lead-feb-10-earnings-in-focus/", "title": "Coca-Cola stock price climbs late as staples lead; Feb 10 earnings in focus", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.948367"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance