	 (665,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-02 15:57:17','20260202T155717','Southport HS student-created popcorn Cardinal Crunch hits Kroger shelves','https://www.wishtv.com/news/education/southport-high-cardinal-crunch/','Southport High School students, in collaboration with Kroger, have created a unique popcorn flavor called Cardinal Crunch. This initiative, part of a marketing class, allowed students to gain real-world experience in product development, branding, and sales. The popcorn, featuring caramel and churro flavors, is now available at a Kroger store in Southport, contributing to Indiana being Kroger''s top-selling popcorn division in its four-state area.','https://www.wishtv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/02/taste-test-1.jpg','WISH-TV','General','WISH-TV','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.910712"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.605311"}]',0.440142,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.441654"}]','{"url": "https://www.wishtv.com/news/education/southport-high-cardinal-crunch/", "title": "Southport HS student-created popcorn Cardinal Crunch hits Kroger shelves", "source": "WISH-TV", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.910712"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.605311"}], "authors": ["Hanna Mordoh"], "summary": "Southport High School students, in collaboration with Kroger, have created a unique popcorn flavor called Cardinal Crunch. This initiative, part of a marketing class, allowed students to gain real-world experience in product development, branding, and sales. The popcorn, featuring caramel and churro flavors, is now available at a Kroger store in Southport, contributing to Indiana being Kroger''s top-selling popcorn division in its four-state area.", "banner_image": "https://www.wishtv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/02/taste-test-1.jpg", "source_domain": "WISH-TV", "time_published": "20260202T15571