	 (667,'alpha_vantage','WMT','KR','2026-02-02 15:28:49','20260202T152849','Kroger, Hy-Vee and UNFI make better-for-you private-label plays in 2026','https://www.foodnavigator-usa.com/Article/2026/02/02/kroger-hy-vee-unfi-fuel-better-for-you-private-label-boom-in-2026/','Kroger, Hy-Vee, and UNFI are significantly investing in better-for-you private-label brands to meet consumer demand for health-conscious and functional products. Store brands are experiencing rapid growth, nearly tripling the dollar sales growth of national brands, with a focus on high-protein, clean-label, and plant-based options. This trend is driven by changing consumer priorities that value health, quality, and sustainability alongside price.','https://www.foodnavigator-usa.com/resizer/v2/GN4SN6KJYREHZDLTPFAFMK4GXE.jpg?auth=dd995e7369e8f7a139b39135adb136106fc63c2ea1b4248825875ac6cc655446&smart=true','FoodNavigator-USA.com','General','FoodNavigator-USA.com','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.718285"}]',0.293702,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "UNFI", "relevance_score": "0.976226", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.325057"}, {"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "0.925119", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.307406"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.636147", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.294298"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.555510", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.277888"}]','{"url": "https://www.foodnavigator-usa.com/Article/2026/02/02/kroger-hy-vee-unfi-fuel-better-for-you-private-label-boom-in-2026/", "title": "Kroger, Hy-Vee and UNFI make better-for-you private-label plays in 2026", "source": "FoodNavigator-USA.com", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.718285"