	 (671,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-02 14:57:23','20260202T145723','Kroger Stock Outlook: Is Wall Street Bullish or Bearish?','https://markets.financialcontent.com/stocks/article/barchart-2026-2-2-kroger-stock-outlook-is-wall-street-bullish-or-bearish','Kroger (KR) has underperformed the broader market and the retail ETF over the past year, despite expanding its Simple Truth Protein portfolio. While the company''s adjusted Q3 EPS surpassed estimates, revenue missed expectations. Analysts currently rate KR a "Moderate Buy," with a consensus price target indicating a potential 19% upside.','https://barchart-news-media-prod.aws.barchart.com/SANDP/51d0f2a37079010bef9bd3224365901c/ikvzxitvhd0krydv.png','FinancialContent','General','FinancialContent','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.918060"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.814666"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.726278"}]',0.177211,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.218705"}, {"ticker": "MS", "relevance_score": "0.604587", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.103555"}]','{"url": "https://markets.financialcontent.com/stocks/article/barchart-2026-2-2-kroger-stock-outlook-is-wall-street-bullish-or-bearish", "title": "Kroger Stock Outlook: Is Wall Street Bullish or Bearish?", "source": "FinancialContent", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.918060"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.814666"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.726278"}], "authors": ["Barchart.com"], "summary": "Kroger (KR) has underperformed the broader market and the retail ETF over the past year, despite expanding its Simple Truth Protein portfolio. While the company''s adjusted Q3 EPS surpassed estimates, revenue missed expectations. Analysts currently rate KR a \\"Moderate Buy,\\" with a consensus price