	 (703,'alpha_vantage','PEP','PEP','2026-02-03 11:27:52','20260203T112752','PEPSICO INC SEC 10-K Report','https://www.tradingview.com/news/tradingview:e5c5bc34c4105:0-pepsico-inc-sec-10-k-report/','PepsiCo Inc. has released its annual Form 10-K report, detailing its financial performance, business operations, and strategic initiatives. The report highlights a 2% net revenue increase to $93,925 million but an 11% decrease in operating profit and a 14% decrease in net income, attributed to higher costs and impairment charges. PepsiCo is focusing on strategic growth, including technology investments, portfolio diversification towards health and wellness, and expanding international markets, while facing challenges from market fluctuations and regulatory changes.',NULL,'TradingView','General','TradingView','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.904647"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.837473"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.743153"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.613046"}]',-0.180839,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.180644"}]','{"url": "https://www.tradingview.com/news/tradingview:e5c5bc34c4105:0-pepsico-inc-sec-10-k-report/", "title": "PEPSICO INC SEC 10-K Report", "source": "TradingView", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.904647"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.837473"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.743153"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.613046"}], "authors": [], "summary": "PepsiCo Inc. has released its annual Form 10-K report, detailing its financial performance, business operations, and strategic initiatives. The report highlights a 2% net revenue increase to $93,925 million but an 11% decrease in operating profit and a 14% decrease in net income, attributed to higher costs and impairment charges. PepsiCo is focusing on