	 (708,'alpha_vantage','PG','PEP','2026-02-03 11:08:00','20260203T110800','PepsiCo tops quarterly revenue estimates on resilient demand for sodas','https://www.reuters.com/sustainability/sustainable-finance-reporting/pepsico-tops-quarterly-revenue-estimates-resilient-demand-sodas-2026-02-03/','PepsiCo exceeded fourth-quarter revenue expectations, driven by strong demand for its sodas internationally and low-sugar beverages in the U.S. The company is overhauling its U.S. portfolio, planning price cuts of up to 15% on some snack products due to consumer complaints about high costs, and reducing its product offerings by about 20% this year. Despite a 1% fall in North American food business volumes, PepsiCo maintained its annual core earnings per share growth target.','https://www.reuters.com/resizer/v2/SDVICRNBXZOD7KESU57EBQVZ4U.jpg?auth=6869dd81d8424656a09b5959c159d345e0c6cba7b0c56c385c82cc1327983e07&width=1920&quality=80','Reuters','General','Reuters','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.927992"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.818991"}]',0.187558,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.342156"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.714562", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.102469"}, {"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "0.627437", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.119940"}]','{"url": "https://www.reuters.com/sustainability/sustainable-finance-reporting/pepsico-tops-quarterly-revenue-estimates-resilient-demand-sodas-2026-02-03/", "title": "PepsiCo tops quarterly revenue estimates on resilient demand for sodas", "source": "Reuters", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.927992"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.818991"}], "authors": ["Reuters"], "summary": "PepsiCo exceeded fourth-quarter revenue expectations, driven by strong demand 