	 (709,'alpha_vantage','PEP','PEP','2026-02-03 11:03:12','20260203T110312','Exclusive | PepsiCo to Cut Prices for Doritos and Other Snacks','https://www.wsj.com/business/retail/pepsico-to-cut-prices-for-doritos-and-other-snacks-96a7f353?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqcec5zTvTEREB7ahsUX3Pq_wtD5Z2ejIGWs4zSXb87RAw6DqHbA2B67&gaa_ts=6981de9d&gaa_sig=4d7E-E_BSJxlZzEYHadeKzFk5CmNGo6xnfyKA-o46HAkYpeMwX5CaePt4YhIUYvEsVyihiwyvX2csbCxa5MODQ%3D%3D','PepsiCo is planning to cut prices by up to 15% on popular snack brands like Lay''s potato chips and Flamin'' Hot Cheetos. This decision comes after numerous consumer complaints regarding high prices, as the company aims to offer "more value" following years of increased costs in snack aisles.','https://images.wsj.net/im-67443309?width=700&height=541','The Wall Street Journal','General','The Wall Street Journal','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.841446"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.716584"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.622155"}]',0.1228,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.128584"}]','{"url": "https://www.wsj.com/business/retail/pepsico-to-cut-prices-for-doritos-and-other-snacks-96a7f353?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqcec5zTvTEREB7ahsUX3Pq_wtD5Z2ejIGWs4zSXb87RAw6DqHbA2B67&gaa_ts=6981de9d&gaa_sig=4d7E-E_BSJxlZzEYHadeKzFk5CmNGo6xnfyKA-o46HAkYpeMwX5CaePt4YhIUYvEsVyihiwyvX2csbCxa5MODQ%3D%3D", "title": "Exclusive | PepsiCo to Cut Prices for Doritos and Other Snacks", "source": "The Wall Street Journal", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.841446"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.716584"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.622155"}], "authors": ["Laura Cooper and Jesse Newman"], "summary": "PepsiCo is planning to cut prices by up to 15% on popular snack brands like Lay''s potato chips and Flamin'' Hot Cheetos. This decision comes after nu