	 (728,'alpha_vantage','PEP','PEP','2026-02-02 15:27:23','20260202T152723','Pepsi exec: Mentorship, development pave supply chain career paths','https://www.supplychaindive.com/news/pepsico-darcy-arata-inclusivity-mentorship-women-supply-chain/806837/','Darcy Arata, SVP of Field Supply Chain at PepsiCo, highlights the increasing importance of mentorship, employee development, and resource groups in fostering inclusivity and diversity within the supply chain industry. Arata, who started her career at PepsiCo in 2001, emphasizes that leaders play a critical role in removing barriers and supporting employees. She advises aspiring professionals to embrace risks for greater learning and growth.','https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/YX4CbyvvVAlWffyErRFu-cc-Ckv6B21HpozGxyHpLB4/g:ce/rs:fill:1200:675:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9wZXBzaWZsZWV0LmpwZw==.webp','Supply Chain Dive','General','Supply Chain Dive','[{"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.944014"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.602096"}]',0.316279,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.347964"}]','{"url": "https://www.supplychaindive.com/news/pepsico-darcy-arata-inclusivity-mentorship-women-supply-chain/806837/", "title": "Pepsi exec: Mentorship, development pave supply chain career paths", "source": "Supply Chain Dive", "topics": [{"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.944014"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.602096"}], "authors": ["Kelly Stroh"], "summary": "Darcy Arata, SVP of Field Supply Chain at PepsiCo, highlights the increasing importance of mentorship, employee development, and resource groups in fostering inclusivity and diversity within the supply chain industry. Arata, who started her career at PepsiCo in 2001, emphasizes that leaders play a critical role in removing barriers and supporting employees. She advises aspiring professio