	 (729,'alpha_vantage','PEP','PEP','2026-02-02 15:27:15','20260202T152715','JPMorgan Raises Celsius Holdings Inc (CELH) Price Target, Sees Earnings Upside From PepsiCo Partnership and Alani Nu Growth','https://finance.yahoo.com/news/jpmorgan-raises-celsius-holdings-inc-145955992.html','JPMorgan has increased its price target for Celsius Holdings Inc (CELH) to $77 from $68, maintaining an Overweight rating due to expected earnings upside from its PepsiCo partnership and the growth of Alani Nu. The firm anticipates strong performance for Celsius in 2026, driven by its expanded role with PepsiCo and Alani Nu''s increasing distribution after its 2025 acquisition. Celsius Holdings reported a significant 173% year-over-year revenue increase in Q3 2025, reaching $725 million, underscoring its growing market position and strategic alliances.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/ApnU9BScRTsIJMi7WvNNpg--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTY1Mw--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/insidermonkey.com/c66c3030ae85c53497f87adabfc79a5b','Yahoo Finance','General','Yahoo Finance','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.909240"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.817433"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.711763"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.636999"}]',0.328572,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.815126", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.301474"}]','{"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/jpmorgan-raises-celsius-holdings-inc-145955992.html", "title": "JPMorgan Raises Celsius Holdings Inc (CELH) Price Target, Sees Earnings Upside From PepsiCo Partnership and Alani Nu Growth", "source": "Yahoo Finance", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.909240"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.817433"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.711763"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.636999