	 (732,'alpha_vantage','PEP','PEP','2026-02-02 14:58:53','20260202T145853','JPMorgan Raises Celsius Holdings Inc (CELH) Price Target, Sees Earnings Upside From PepsiCo Partnership and Alani Nu Growth','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/jpmorgan-raises-celsius-holdings-inc-celh-price-target-sees-earnings-upside-from-pepsico-partnership-and-alani-nu-growth-1686405/?amp=1','JPMorgan increased its price target for Celsius Holdings (CELH) to $77 from $68, maintaining an Overweight rating, citing potential upside from its expanded PepsiCo partnership and the growing momentum of Alani Nu. Celsius Holdings reported strong Q3 2025 consolidated revenue of approximately $725 million, a 173% year-over-year increase, reinforced by its role as PepsiCo''s U.S. Strategic Energy Drink Captain and the integration of Alani Nu into PepsiCo''s distribution network. The company, known for its healthier energy drinks, is headquartered in Boca Raton, Florida, and continues to expand its market presence.',NULL,'Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.942740"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.819429"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.713024"}]',0.421095,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "CELH", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.487671"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.803505", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.303564"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/jpmorgan-raises-celsius-holdings-inc-celh-price-target-sees-earnings-upside-from-pepsico-partnership-and-alani-nu-growth-1686405/?amp=1", "title": "JPMorgan Raises Celsius Holdings Inc (CELH) Price Target, Sees Earnings Upside From PepsiCo Partnership and Alani Nu Growth", "source": "Insider Monkey", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.942740"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.819429"}, {"topic": "reta