	 (751,'alpha_vantage','PG','PG','2026-02-02 16:36:32','20260202T163632','Inside P&G’s new ‘Champions Clubhouse’ for 3,500 Winter Games athletes','https://www.stocktitan.net/news/PG/p-g-brands-to-serve-more-olympic-and-paralympic-winter-games-jrtub5ppe9rl.html','Procter & Gamble has opened its "Champions Clubhouse" in the Milano Olympic Village for the Milano Cortina 2026 Winter Games, offering personalized services and products from brands like Gillette, Head & Shoulders, and Tampax to approximately 3,500 athletes. Athletes will also receive a Welcome Kit with various P&G products. The initiative aims to support athletes'' comfort and confidence while promoting access and inclusion in Para sport in Italy through collaborations and educational programs.','https://mms.businesswire.com/media/20260202542748/en/2708596/4/PHOTO_1_REPLACEMENT_4901_GeHL44ia_20260202042155.jpg','Stock Titan','General','Stock Titan','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.832983"}]',0.40672,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.441154"}]','{"url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/news/PG/p-g-brands-to-serve-more-olympic-and-paralympic-winter-games-jrtub5ppe9rl.html", "title": "Inside P&G’s new ‘Champions Clubhouse’ for 3,500 Winter Games athletes", "source": "Stock Titan", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.832983"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Procter & Gamble has opened its \\"Champions Clubhouse\\" in the Milano Olympic Village for the Milano Cortina 2026 Winter Games, offering personalized services and products from brands like Gillette, Head & Shoulders, and Tampax to approximately 3,500 athletes. Athletes will also receive a Welcome Kit with various P&G products. The initiative aims to support athletes'' comfort and confidence while promoting access and inclusion in Para sport in Italy through collaborations and educational programs.", "banner_image": "https://mm