	 (759,'alpha_vantage','SFM','SFM','2026-02-03 01:59:12','20260203T015912','Sprouts Farmers Market plans new stores in Smithtown and Levittown','https://greaterlongisland.com/sprouts-smithtown-levittown-stores-centereach/','Sprouts Farmers Market is planning to open two new grocery stores on Long Island in Smithtown later this year and Levittown in 2027. This expansion follows the recent opening of their first New York state location in Centereach. The Smithtown store will take over the former Fresh Market location, while the Levittown store will occupy a 25,593-square-foot space in the Levittown Shopping Center.','https://greaterlongisland.com/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect,metadata=none/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/12526-26-1.jpg','Greater Long Island','General','Greater Long Island','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.940456"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.744015"}]',0.504301,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "SFM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.525853"}]','{"url": "https://greaterlongisland.com/sprouts-smithtown-levittown-stores-centereach/", "title": "Sprouts Farmers Market plans new stores in Smithtown and Levittown", "source": "Greater Long Island", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.940456"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.744015"}], "authors": ["Brian Harmon"], "summary": "Sprouts Farmers Market is planning to open two new grocery stores on Long Island in Smithtown later this year and Levittown in 2027. This expansion follows the recent opening of their first New York state location in Centereach. The Smithtown store will take over the former Fresh Market location, while the Levittown store will occupy a 25,593-square-foot space in the Levittown Shopping Center.", "banner_image": "https://greaterlongisland.com/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect,metadata=none/wp-content/uploads/2026/01