	 (761,'alpha_vantage','SFM','SFM','2026-02-02 16:58:34','20260202T165834','Sprouts Farmers Market stock hits 52-week low at $69.27','https://www.investing.com/news/company-news/sprouts-farmers-market-stock-hits-52week-low-at-6927-93CH-4479479','Sprouts Farmers Market (SFM) stock has reached a new 52-week low of $69.27, marking a challenging year with significant declines. Despite the price drop, InvestingPro data indicates the company maintains a P/E ratio of 13.5 and remains profitable, suggesting it may be undervalued. Investors are awaiting the company''s upcoming earnings report on February 19th for further insights into its performance and future prospects.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/world_news_2_69x52._800x533_L_1419494365.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.914843"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.824238"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.740993"}]',-0.263184,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "SFM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.277271"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/company-news/sprouts-farmers-market-stock-hits-52week-low-at-6927-93CH-4479479", "title": "Sprouts Farmers Market stock hits 52-week low at $69.27", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.914843"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.824238"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.740993"}], "authors": ["Investing.com"], "summary": "Sprouts Farmers Market (SFM) stock has reached a new 52-week low of $69.27, marking a challenging year with significant declines. Despite the price drop, InvestingPro data indicates the company maintains a P/E ratio of 13.5 and remains profitable, suggesting it may be undervalued. Investors are awaiting the company''s upcoming earnings report on February 19th for further insights into its performa