	 (776,'alpha_vantage','WMT','TGT','2026-02-02 21:27:45','20260202T212745','New CEO Fiddelke Plots Target’s Design-Forward Renaissance','https://www.homepagenews.com/retail-articles/new-ceo-fiddelke-plots-targets-design-forward-renaissance/','Target''s new CEO, Michael Fiddelke, is initiating a design-forward renaissance for the company, focusing on larger-format stores, differentiated product assortments, and enhanced technology to improve efficiency and customer experience. This strategy aims to drive sustainable and profitable growth, addressing challenges like declining sales in discretionary categories and increasing competition. Fiddelke emphasizes the importance of design leadership in merchandising, elevating the shopping experience both in-store and digitally, and leveraging AI tools to forecast trends and personalize customer interactions.',NULL,'HomePage News','General','HomePage News','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.909288"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.816350"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.704630"}]',0.107151,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.971481", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.279946"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.646070", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.097742"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.553051", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.060218"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.587657", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.099697"}]','{"url": "https://www.homepagenews.com/retail-articles/new-ceo-fiddelke-plots-targets-design-forward-renaissance/", "title": "New CEO Fiddelke Plots Target’s Design-Forward Renaissance", "source": "HomePage News", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.909288"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.816350"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score"