	 (777,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-02 21:27:37','20260202T212737','Bellingham activists protest local Target, demanding end of ICE cooperation','https://www.bellinghamherald.com/news/local/article314547268.html','Over 50 community members in Bellingham protested outside a local Target, demanding the corporation cease its cooperation with U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE). Activists from the Bellingham Troublemakers group accused Target of allowing ICE agents to use its stores for raids and called on the company to publicly condemn ICE practices and protect its employees and customers. This protest follows a similar demonstration against Hilton Hotels regarding their housing of ICE agents.',NULL,'Bellingham Herald','General','Bellingham Herald','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.806425"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.624745"}]',-0.311953,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.325964"}]','{"url": "https://www.bellinghamherald.com/news/local/article314547268.html", "title": "Bellingham activists protest local Target, demanding end of ICE cooperation", "source": "Bellingham Herald", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.806425"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.624745"}], "authors": ["Rachel Showalter"], "summary": "Over 50 community members in Bellingham protested outside a local Target, demanding the corporation cease its cooperation with U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE). Activists from the Bellingham Troublemakers group accused Target of allowing ICE agents to use its stores for raids and called on the company to publicly condemn ICE practices and protect its employees and customers. This protest follows a similar demonstration against Hilton Hotels regarding their housing of ICE agents.", "banner_image": null, "source_domain": "Bellingham Herald", "time_published": "20260202T212737", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.325964"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "overall_sentiment_score": -0.311953}','2026-02-03 13:45:56',NULL),
	 (778,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-02 20:27:14','20260202T202714','Target just made a big change this weekend. Here’s what to know','https://www.fastcompany.com/91485274/target-just-made-a-big-change-this-weekend-heres-what-to-know-new-ceo-michael-fiddelke','Target has appointed Michael Fiddelke as its new CEO, effective Sunday, amidst declining sales and other challenges. Fiddelke, previously COO and CFO, plans to focus on bringing together design, style, and value, improving store and digital experiences, accelerating technology for personalization, and strengthening the team. This leadership change comes as Target faces an uphill battle to boost its performance and customer perception.','https://images.fastcompany.com/image/upload/f_webp,c_fit,w_1920,q_auto/wp-cms-2/2026/02/p-1-91485274-target-change.jpg','Fast Company','General','Fast Company','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.941635"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.917151"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.746722"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.642311"}]',0.123825,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.106940"}]','{"url": "https://www.fastcompany.com/91485274/target-just-made-a-big-change-this-weekend-heres-what-to-know-new-ceo-michael-fiddelke", "title": "Target just made a big change this weekend. Here’s what to know", "source": "Fast Company", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.941635"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.917151"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.746722"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.642311"}], "authors": ["Jennifer Mattson"], "summary": "Target has appointed Michael Fiddelke as its new CEO, effective Sunday, amidst declining sales and other challenges. Fiddelke, previously COO and CFO, plans to focus on bringing together design, style, and value, improving store and digital experiences, accelerating technology for personalization, and strengthening the team. This leadership change comes as Target faces an uphill battle to boost its performance and customer perception.", "banner_image": "https://images.fastcompany.com/image/upload/f_webp,c_fit,w_1920,q_auto/wp-cms-2/2026/02/p-1-91485274-target-change.jpg", "source_domain": "Fast Company", "time_published": "20260202T202714", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.106940"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.123825}','2026-02-03 13:45:56',NULL),
	 (779,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-02 19:28:00','20260202T192800','Target Corporation (TGT): A Bull Case Theory','https://finviz.com/news/296364/target-corporation-tgt-a-bull-case-theory','This article summarizes a bullish thesis on Target Corporation (TGT) by David J. Waldron, emphasizing its stable dividend profile and consistent owners'' earnings, making it attractive for reliable yields and steady capital gains. Despite underperforming the S&P 500 in revenue growth and having a "none" moat rating from Morningstar, Target maintains relevance through its customer base, operational footprint, dividend payments, and share repurchase programs. The company''s stock has appreciated since a previous bullish coverage in May 2025, and while it shows potential, some AI stocks are suggested to offer greater upside.','https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/supermarket-507295_1280.jpg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.910843"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.807626"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.738282"}]',0.258018,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.444462"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.620135", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.113566"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/296364/target-corporation-tgt-a-bull-case-theory", "title": "Target Corporation (TGT): A Bull Case Theory", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.910843"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.807626"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.738282"}], "authors": ["Ricardo Pillai"], "summary": "This article summarizes a bullish thesis on Target Corporation (TGT) by David J. Waldron, emphasizing its stable dividend profile and consistent owners'' earnings, making it attractive