	 (782,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-02 18:00:33','20260202T180033','Target’s new CEO outlines four priorities as he takes reins','https://chainstoreage.com/targets-new-ceo-outlines-four-priorities-he-takes-reins','Michael Fiddelke has taken over as CEO of Target Corp., outlining four key priorities for the company''s future. These priorities include enhancing merchandising with unique design and value, elevating the guest experience in stores and online, accelerating technology to improve operations and personalization, and strengthening the team and communities. Fiddelke''s appointment follows a two-decade career at Target, where he previously served as COO.','https://assets1.chainstoreage.com/images/v/max_width_1440/2026-02/michael-fiddelke_target_2022_1-1.png','Chain Store Age','General','Chain Store Age','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}]',0.423204,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.395601"}]','{"url": "https://chainstoreage.com/targets-new-ceo-outlines-four-priorities-he-takes-reins", "title": "Target’s new CEO outlines four priorities as he takes reins", "source": "Chain Store Age", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}], "authors": ["Marianne Wilson"], "summary": "Michael Fiddelke has taken over as CEO of Target Corp., outlining four key priorities for the company''s future. These priorities include enhancing merchandising with unique design and value, elevating the guest experience in stores and online, accelerating technology to improve operations and personalization, and strengthening the team and communities. Fiddelke''s appointment follows a two-decade career at Target, where he previously served as COO.", "banner_image": "https://assets1.chainstoreage.com/images/v/max_width_1440/2026-02/michael-fiddelke_target_2022_1-1.png", "source_domain": "Chain Store Age", "time_published": "20260202T18003