	 (783,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-02 16:17:35','20260202T161735','Target, Walmart usher in new CEOs','https://www.retaildive.com/news/target-walmart-new-ceos-start-michael-fiddelke-john-furner/811082/','Walmart and Target, two major U.S. retailers, have appointed new CEOs. Michael Fiddelke has taken over at Target, outlining priorities such as regaining merchandising authority and improving customer experience, while John Furner has succeeded Doug McMillon at Walmart, committing to continuity. Both former CEOs, Brian Cornell and Doug McMillon, will remain involved with their respective companies in advisory or board roles.','https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/h2-NP4xXwHJJfAfhPf5QccsOW7_f8rjY23dxEX6owY8/g:ce/rs:fill:1200:675:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9JTUdfMDc4MC5qcGc=.webp','Retail Dive','General','Retail Dive','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.905727"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.742698"}]',0.094486,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.122524"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.988138", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.087923"}]','{"url": "https://www.retaildive.com/news/target-walmart-new-ceos-start-michael-fiddelke-john-furner/811082/", "title": "Target, Walmart usher in new CEOs", "source": "Retail Dive", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.905727"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.742698"}], "authors": ["Dani James"], "summary": "Walmart and Target, two major U.S. retailers, have appointed new CEOs. Michael Fiddelke has taken over at Target, outlining priorities such as regaining merchandising authority and improving customer experience, while John Furner has succeeded Doug McMillon at Walmart, committing to continuity. Both former CEOs, Brian Cornell and Doug McMillon, will remain involved with their respective companies in advisory or bo