	 (785,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-02 16:14:29','20260202T161429','Target''s new CEO takes over amid slumping sales, unrest in Minneapolis','https://www.foxbusiness.com/lifestyle/targets-new-ceo-takes-over-amid-slumping-sales-unrest-minneapolis','Michael Fiddelke has taken over as Target''s new CEO, inheriting the challenging task of reversing a prolonged period of declining sales and addressing ongoing unrest in Minneapolis, the company''s home city. Fiddelke''s initial priorities include enhancing merchandising, improving digital capabilities and store experiences, and leveraging technology to boost growth and personalize customer interactions. The changing of leadership occurs as Target continues to report sales declines and faces local tensions from protests related to federal immigration operations in Minneapolis.','https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/08/931/523/michael-fiddelke-target-2.jpg?ve=1&tl=1','Fox Business','General','Fox Business','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.841572"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.617690"}]',0.010748,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.328066", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.026125"}]','{"url": "https://www.foxbusiness.com/lifestyle/targets-new-ceo-takes-over-amid-slumping-sales-unrest-minneapolis", "title": "Target''s new CEO takes over amid slumping sales, unrest in Minneapolis", "source": "Fox Business", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.841572"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.617690"}], "authors": ["Daniella Genovese"], "summary": "Michael Fiddelke has taken over as Target''s new CEO, inheriting the challenging task of reversing a prolonged period of declining sales and addressing ongoing unrest in Minneapolis, the company''s 