	 (791,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-02 14:17:57','20260202T141757','Crippled Target Promotes Someone Who Helped Break It','https://247wallst.com/investing/2026/02/02/crippled-target-promotes-someone-who-helped-break-it/','Target Corp. has promoted its chief operating officer, Michael Fiddelke, to chief executive, despite the company''s poor financial performance over the past five years, during which its stock dropped 44%. This decision is criticized given that Fiddelke was part of the leadership team under former CEO Brian Cornell, whose tenure saw significant decline while rivals like Walmart thrived. Analysts express skepticism about Target''s future prospects, noting their lack of a sustainable competitive advantage and expectations for continued struggles.','https://247wallst.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/imageForEntry38-zFm.jpg','24/7 Wall St.','General','24/7 Wall St.','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.900690"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.948153"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.818651"}]',0.033052,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.348222", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.025163"}]','{"url": "https://247wallst.com/investing/2026/02/02/crippled-target-promotes-someone-who-helped-break-it/", "title": "Crippled Target Promotes Someone Who Helped Break It", "source": "24/7 Wall St.", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.900690"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.948153"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.818651"}], "authors": ["Douglas A. McIntyre"], "summary": "Target Corp. has promoted its chief operating officer, Michael Fiddelke, to chief executive, despite the company''s poor financial performance over the past five years, during which its stock dropped 44%. This decision is criticized given that Fiddelke was part of the leadership team under former CEO Brian Cornell, whose tenure saw