	 (792,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-02 14:10:00','20260202T141000','New Target settlement available to those who applied for a job in Washington state','https://www.claimdepot.com/settlements/target-epoa-settlement','Target has agreed to a $2.2 million settlement for a class action lawsuit stemming from its failure to include required pay and benefits information in job postings for positions in Washington state. Job seekers who applied for a Target position in Washington between January 1, 2023, and July 26, 2025, where the posting lacked wage scale, salary range, or benefits details, may be eligible for an estimated payout of $1,711.93. The deadline to file a claim is March 31, 2026.','https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642f23e5f54b794300ac12a6/6980f6acfe2503ccfeae0733_FlOR9SlMegQjJdYzK9ZbSPmZjc2nmi6-wMfGoy0YWMQ.webp','Claim Depot','General','Claim Depot','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.929439"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.820226"}]',-0.241931,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.217653"}]','{"url": "https://www.claimdepot.com/settlements/target-epoa-settlement", "title": "New Target settlement available to those who applied for a job in Washington state", "source": "Claim Depot", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.929439"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.820226"}], "authors": ["Danielle Toth"], "summary": "Target has agreed to a $2.2 million settlement for a class action lawsuit stemming from its failure to include required pay and benefits information in job postings for positions in Washington state. Job seekers who applied for a Target position in Washington between January 1, 2023, and July 26, 2025, where the posting lacked wage scale, salary range, or benefits details, may be eligible for an estimated payout of $1,711.93. The deadline to file a claim is March 31, 20