	 (848,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-02 21:28:06','20260202T212806','Options Corner: Walmart Calls Are Surprisingly Cheap Despite Robust Performance','https://www.benzinga.com/markets/options/26/02/50316112/walmart-wmt-stock-call-options-contrarian-discount','Walmart (WMT) stock has shown robust performance, gaining 11% year-to-date and outperforming both the S&P 500 and Nasdaq Composite over the past year due to its focus on groceries and healthcare. Despite its strong upward trend, call options for WMT are surprisingly cheap on a volatility basis, suggesting an opportunity for upside. An aggressive but rational options strategy could involve a bull call spread expiring on February 20, 2026, targeting a price range between $124.50 and $125.30 before its earnings report.','https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/07/24/article-header-background-image.png?quality=85&auto=webp&width=1300','Benzinga','General','Benzinga','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.949370"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.882806"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.796077"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.635648"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.598780"}]',0.418716,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.430451"}]','{"url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/options/26/02/50316112/walmart-wmt-stock-call-options-contrarian-discount", "title": "Options Corner: Walmart Calls Are Surprisingly Cheap Despite Robust Performance", "source": "Benzinga", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.949370"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.882806"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.796077"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.635648"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.598780"}], "authors": ["Josh Enomoto"], "summary": "Walmart (WMT) stock has shown robust performance, gaining 11% year-to-date and outperforming both the S&P 500 and Nasdaq Composite over the past year due to its focus on groceries and healthcare. Despite its strong upward trend, call options for WMT are surprisingly cheap on a volatility basis, suggesting an opportunity for upside. An aggressive but rational options strategy could involve a bull call spread expiring on February 20, 2026, targeting a price range between $124.50 and $125.30 before its earnings report.", "banner_image": "https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/07/24/article-header-background-image.png?quality=85&auto=webp&width=1300", "source_domain": "Benzinga", "time_published": "20260202T212806", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.430451"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.418716}','2026-02-03 13:46:19',NULL),
	 (857,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-02 16:28:06','20260202T162806','Who is John Furner, Walmart’s new CEO?','https://www.foxbusiness.com/business-leaders/who-john-furner-walmarts-new-ceo','John Furner has been promoted to CEO of Walmart Inc., taking over from Doug McMillon. Furner, who previously led Walmart U.S. and Sam''s Club, started as a summer intern in Mexico and rose through various international roles. Known for his collaborative leadership and focus on employee development, Furner emphasizes listening to advice and understanding one''s weaknesses as key to his success, drawing lessons from both his business career and personal experiences.','https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/854081161001/401211b9-efc9-4d61-9f03-1504e4d60dc2/4ae1a811-fd77-423d-8ff7-7a0267d0a44c/1280x720/match/image.jpg','Fox Business','General','Fox Business','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.921156"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.746188"}]',0.428613,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.431702"}]','{"url": "https://www.foxbusiness.com/business-leaders/who-john-furner-walmarts-new-ceo", "title": "Who is John Furner, Walmart’s new CEO?", "source": "Fox Business", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.921156"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.746188"}], "authors": ["Daniella Genovese"], "summary": "John Furner has been promoted to CEO of Walmart Inc., taking over from Doug McMillon. Furner, who previously led Walmart U.S. and Sam''s Club, started as a summer intern in Mexico and rose through various international roles. Known for his collaborative leadership and focus on employee development, Furner emphasizes listening to advice and understanding one''s weaknesses as key to his success, drawing lessons from both his business career and personal experiences.", "banner_image": "https://cf-images.us-east-1.pro