	 (871,'alpha_vantage','ZKIN','ZKIN','2026-02-02 22:27:46','20260202T222746','ZK International Delays Annual 20-F Filing','https://www.tipranks.com/news/company-announcements/zk-international-delays-annual-20-f-filing','ZK International (ZKIN) has announced a delay in filing its annual Form 20-F for the fiscal year ended September 30, 2025, due to additional time needed to finalize consolidated financial statements and audit procedures. The company expects to file within the 15-day SEC grace period and does not anticipate significant year-over-year earnings changes. TipRanks'' AI Analyst, Spark, rates ZKIN as Neutral due to weak financial performance despite some positive short-term technical trends.','https://blog.tipranks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/shutterstock_2186329533-1-750x406.jpg','TipRanks','General','TipRanks','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.946354"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.721486"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.645098"}]',-0.265122,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "ZKIN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.299774"}]','{"url": "https://www.tipranks.com/news/company-announcements/zk-international-delays-annual-20-f-filing", "title": "ZK International Delays Annual 20-F Filing", "source": "TipRanks", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.946354"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.721486"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.645098"}], "authors": ["TipRanks Auto-Generated Newsdesk"], "summary": "ZK International (ZKIN) has announced a delay in filing its annual Form 20-F for the fiscal year ended September 30, 2025, due to additional time needed to finalize consolidated financial statements and audit procedures. The company expects to file within the 15-day SEC grace period and does not anticipate significant year-over-year earnings changes. TipRanks'' AI Analyst, Spark, rates ZKIN as Neutral