	 (872,'alpha_vantage','MDLZ','MDLZ','2026-02-03 18:58:04','20260203T185804','PepsiCo cuts Doritos prices by as much as 15% ahead of Super Bowl to boost demand','https://www.latimes.com/business/story/2026-02-03/pepsico-cuts-doritos-prices-by-as-much-as-15-ahead-of-super-bowl-to-boost-demand','PepsiCo is lowering prices on key brands like Lay''s and Doritos by up to 15% ahead of the Super Bowl to stimulate demand and make products more affordable. This move comes as the company aims to boost sales in North America, facing pressure from consumers feeling the strain of past price hikes and from investor Elliott Management to revamp its product lineup. In addition to price cuts, PepsiCo plans to reduce its product portfolio, streamline operations, and introduce healthier options to attract more consumers.','https://ca-times.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/90cb5cf/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1334+0+0/resize/1200x800!/quality/75/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcalifornia-times-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3c%2F81%2F6a1b1403b66334ed91964d975d8a%2F1x-1.jpg','Los Angeles Times','General','Los Angeles Times','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.945860"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.812550"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.645145"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.634837"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.643427"}]',0.056225,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.982734", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.323014"}, {"ticker": "GIS", "relevance_score": "0.561754", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.113070"}, {"ticker": "CMG", "relevance_score": "0.599351", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.199801"}, {"ticker": "MDLZ", "relevance_score": "0.555799", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.068337"}]','{"url": "https://www.latimes.com/business/story/2026-0