	 (873,'alpha_vantage','MDLZ','MDLZ','2026-02-03 15:02:40','20260203T150240','Hershey''s Easter push: fruity gummies, Butterbeer Kisses, bigger Reese''s','https://www.stocktitan.net/news/HSY/the-hershey-company-rolls-out-an-egg-cellent-easter-collection-fans-o48dx2fx3em7.html','The Hershey Company announced its 2026 Easter collection, featuring new Jolly Rancher Gummies Fruity Mix and expanded sizes for popular Cadbury, Reese''s, and Hershey''s Kisses items. Key additions include Reese''s Peanut Butter Mini Eggs Unwrapped in King Size and Hershey''s Kisses Harry Potter Butterbeer Flavor in a shareable bag. This launch aims to capitalize on Easter as a significant sales period, building on Hershey''s strategy of seasonal innovations and brand-building promotions.','https://mma.prnewswire.com/media/2873773/Fruit_snacks_bag.jpg','Stock Titan','General','Stock Titan','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.947137"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.724782"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.642817"}]',0.151979,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "HSY", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.228246"}, {"ticker": "MDLZ", "relevance_score": "0.646711", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.134231"}]','{"url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/news/HSY/the-hershey-company-rolls-out-an-egg-cellent-easter-collection-fans-o48dx2fx3em7.html", "title": "Hershey''s Easter push: fruity gummies, Butterbeer Kisses, bigger Reese''s", "source": "Stock Titan", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.947137"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.724782"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.642817"}], "authors": [], "summary": "The Hershey Company announced its 2026 Easter collection, featuring new Jolly Rancher Gummies Fruity Mix and expanded sizes for popular Cadbury, Reese''s, and Hershey''s Kisses items. Key additions include R