	 (876,'alpha_vantage','AEO','AEO','2026-02-03 22:28:33','20260203T222833','Stord, an Atlanta company, takes on D-FW American Eagle facility in bid to preserve jobs','https://www.dallasnews.com/business/retail/2026/02/03/atlanta-company-takes-on-american-eagle-facility-in-d-fw-preserving-jobs/','Stord, an Atlanta-based logistics and software company, has acquired American Eagle Outfitters'' Dallas fulfillment center, formerly operated by Quiet Logistics. This acquisition saves approximately 150 jobs that were at risk after American Eagle decided to shutter its Quiet Logistics business. Stord will also become the preferred fulfillment provider for former Quiet customers, expanding its global network.','https://dmn-dallas-news-prod.cdn.arcpublishing.com/resizer/v2/LLOWXEV3JVHSBLAX2JPC6IWMLI.jpg?auth=760f872d4c35c7502dadc0c0a5f0bfb38a0653b2fefe52e04dc0cdcbaf2d52dd&quality=80&height=553&width=830&smart=true','Dallas News','General','Dallas News','[{"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.831967"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.906068"}]',0.133605,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AEO", "relevance_score": "0.912130", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.112161"}]','{"url": "https://www.dallasnews.com/business/retail/2026/02/03/atlanta-company-takes-on-american-eagle-facility-in-d-fw-preserving-jobs/", "title": "Stord, an Atlanta company, takes on D-FW American Eagle facility in bid to preserve jobs", "source": "Dallas News", "topics": [{"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.831967"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.906068"}], "authors": ["Brian Womack"], "summary": "Stord, an Atlanta-based logistics and software company, has acquired American Eagle Outfitters'' Dallas fulfillment center, formerly operated by Quiet Logistics. This acquisition saves approximately 150 jobs that were at risk after American Eagle decided to shutter its Quiet Logistics business. Stord will also