	 (879,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-04 08:32:04','20260204T083204','Home Depot stock beats Wall Street selloff as investors eye the next HD earnings read','https://ts2.tech/en/home-depot-stock-beats-wall-street-selloff-as-investors-eye-the-next-hd-earnings-read/','Home Depot (HD) shares rose by 0.8% to $381.11, outperforming a wider market downturn driven by concerns over AI''s impact on software and data stocks. The company is heading into a critical earnings period, with investors focusing on demand signals for large projects, its 2026 outlook of flat to 2% comparable sales growth, and upcoming fourth-quarter earnings report on February 24. Challenges include weak housing activity, pricing competition, and the impact of recent job cuts and a mandatory return-to-office policy aimed at improving agility.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/home-depot-stock-beats-wall-street-selloff-as-investors-eye-the-next-hd-earnings-read-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.918471"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.844023"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.722080"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.613668"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.623443"}]',-0.057647,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "HD", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.102652"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.612896", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.243876"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.640684", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.238623"}, {"ticker": "LOW", "relevance_score": "0.609332", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.136297"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/home-depot-stock-beats-wall-street-selloff-as-investors-eye-the-next-hd-earnings-read/", "title": "Home Depot stock beat