	 (886,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-04 03:27:57','20260204T032757','Davis Selected Advisers boosts Amazon.com stake by 291,276 shares','https://www.tipranks.com/news/company-announcements/davis-selected-advisers-boosts-amazon-com-stake-by-291276-shares','Davis Selected Advisers, managed by Chris Davis, has significantly increased its stake in Amazon.Com, Inc. (AMZN) by adding 291,276 shares. Despite a recent choppy and broadly flat stock performance, Wall Street analysts maintain a strong bullish outlook with an average 12-month price target implying substantial upside, driven by expected strong Q4 2025/early 2026 results, accelerating AWS growth, resilient retail demand, and expanding advertising business. TipRanks’ AI Analyst, Spark, rates AMZN as "Outperform" due to strong financials and positive earnings sentiment, though noting short-term technical weakness and premium valuation.','https://blog.tipranks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/shutterstock_681649144-750x406.jpg','TipRanks','General','TipRanks','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.921165"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.827937"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.709709"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.616762"}]',0.437886,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.402337"}]','{"url": "https://www.tipranks.com/news/company-announcements/davis-selected-advisers-boosts-amazon-com-stake-by-291276-shares", "title": "Davis Selected Advisers boosts Amazon.com stake by 291,276 shares", "source": "TipRanks", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.921165"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.827937"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.709709"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.616762"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Davis Selected Advisers, managed by Chris Davis, has significantly increased its