	 (892,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 22:57:46','20260203T225746','Criteo stock hits 52-week low at $18.98 By Investing.com','https://in.investing.com/news/company-news/criteo-stock-hits-52week-low-at-1898-93CH-5216690','Criteo (CRTO) stock has fallen to a 52-week low of $18.98, marking a 49.54% decline over the past year due to challenges in the digital advertising industry and increased competition. Despite this, the company maintains a strong balance sheet and an attractive P/E ratio, with InvestingPro analysis suggesting it is significantly undervalued. Criteo is also undertaking a corporate restructuring, including a proposed domicile change from France to Luxembourg and a direct Nasdaq listing for its ordinary shares, while Stifel has reiterated a Buy rating with a $42 price target.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/world_news_2_69x52._800x533_L_1419494365.jpg','Investing.com India','General','Investing.com India','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929173"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.734118"}]',-0.299996,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CRTO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.621341"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.604294", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.140286"}]','{"url": "https://in.investing.com/news/company-news/criteo-stock-hits-52week-low-at-1898-93CH-5216690", "title": "Criteo stock hits 52-week low at $18.98 By Investing.com", "source": "Investing.com India", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929173"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.734118"}], "authors": ["Investing.com"], "summary": "Criteo (CRTO) stock has fallen to a 52-week low of $18.98, marking a 49.54% decline over the past year due to challenges in the digital advertising indus