	 (893,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 22:57:37','20260203T225737','Alphabet (GOOGL) Q4 Earnings Preview: Can AI and cloud momentum sustain the $4 trillion valuation?','https://www.marketpulse.com/markets/alphabet-googl-q4-earnings-preview-can-ai-and-cloud-momentum-sustain-the-4-trillion-valuation/','Alphabet (GOOGL) is set to release its Q4 2025 earnings, with high investor expectations due to its stock''s significant growth and $4 trillion market cap. The market will focus on whether heavy AI investments are translating into sustained revenue and margin improvements, specifically through AI monetization, Gemini integration, and Google Cloud''s performance. Analysts expect strong revenue and EPS growth, but the market''s reaction will hinge on guidance for 2026 amid increasing capital expenditures and regulatory scrutiny.','https://storage.googleapis.com/web-content.oanda.com/images/Semiconductors_1920x1080-2.26ea2aae.fill-1728x270.jpg','MarketPulse','General','MarketPulse','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.946730"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.809065"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.747144"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.607831"}]',0.175392,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.268968"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.899857", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.250020"}, {"ticker": "AAPL", "relevance_score": "0.720227", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.103305"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.607047", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.146229"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.610722", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.124326"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketpulse.com/markets/alphabet-googl-q4-earnings-preview-can-