	 (894,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 22:40:00','20260203T224000','News | Landlord Simon Property expects to hike rents at former Saks Off 5th stores','https://www.costar.com/article/1292787101/landlord-simon-property-expects-to-hike-rents-at-former-saks-off-5th-stores','Simon Property Group anticipates a significant increase in rent from new tenants occupying former Saks Off 5th stores, despite writing off its $100 million investment in Saks Global. The mall owner expects a roughly 50% uptick in rents from these spaces, leveraging high demand for retail space. Simon Property also gained property and lease termination rights as part of its initial investment, providing additional control over its portfolio.','https://www.costar.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcostar.brightspotcdn.com%2Fdims4%2Fdefault%2F61d3675%2F2147483647%2Fstrip%2Ftrue%2Fcrop%2F5000x3333%2B0%2B0%2Fresize%2F2100x1400!%2Fquality%2F100%2F%3Furl%3Dhttp%253A%252F%252Fcostar-brightspot.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%252F4f%252Fe5%252Ffb7acb414d1f8d430b867fe8dc03%252Fltbuildingphoto-43.jpg&w=3840&q=75','CoStar','General','CoStar','[{"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.920447"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.846401"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.742791"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.604770"}]',0.141003,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "SPG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.548473"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.641756", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.349441"}, {"ticker": "CSGP", "relevance_score": "0.713943", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.142785"}]','{"url": "https://www.costar.com/article/1292787101/landlord-simon-property-expects-to-hike-rents-at-former-saks-off-5th-stores", "title": "News | Landlord Simon Property expects to hike rents at former Saks Off 5th stores", "