	 (895,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 22:25:48','20260203T222548','Amazon moving ahead with massive San Francisco parcel delivery facility after years of delay','https://www.bizjournals.com/sanfrancisco/news/2026/02/03/amazon-900-7th-logistics.html','Amazon is proceeding with its plans for a 710,000-square-foot parcel delivery facility in San Francisco''s Showplace Square neighborhood. The project, for which Amazon acquired land in late 2020 for over $200 million, had faced delays due to a Board of Supervisors moratorium. This development marks a significant step forward for the e-commerce giant''s logistics presence in the city.','https://media.bizj.us/view/img/13133104/900-7th-st-berry-st-perspective*900xx1280-720-0-0.png','The Business Journals','General','The Business Journals','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.819067"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.742792"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.627702"}]',0.314112,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.328850"}]','{"url": "https://www.bizjournals.com/sanfrancisco/news/2026/02/03/amazon-900-7th-logistics.html", "title": "Amazon moving ahead with massive San Francisco parcel delivery facility after years of delay", "source": "The Business Journals", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.819067"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.742792"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.627702"}], "authors": ["Sarah Klearman"], "summary": "Amazon is proceeding with its plans for a 710,000-square-foot parcel delivery facility in San Francisco''s Showplace Square neighborhood. The project, for which Amazon acquired land in late 2020 for over $200 million, had faced delays due to a Board of Supervisors moratorium. This development marks a significant step forward for the e-commerce giant''s logist