	 (896,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 21:59:16','20260203T215916','Cipher targets $2B HPC data center funding as BTC mining profitability continues to slip','https://www.cryptopolitan.com/cipher-data-center-funding-btc-mining-slips/','Cipher Mining''s subsidiary, Black Pearl Compute LLC, is issuing $2 billion in senior secured notes to finance the construction of its 300-megawatt Black Pearl Facility in Wink, Texas. This move signifies Cipher''s pivot from Bitcoin mining, which has become less profitable, to high-performance computing (HPC) and AI hosting. The company has already secured significant long-term leases with major tech companies, aiming for more stable, predictable revenue streams.','https://www.cryptopolitan.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Bitcoin-Mining-3.webp','Cryptopolitan','General','Cryptopolitan','[{"topic": "blockchain", "relevance_score": "0.899517"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.733498"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.628301"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.848164"}]',0.258214,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "CIFR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.292463"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.605576", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.203178"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.592634", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.215034"}]','{"url": "https://www.cryptopolitan.com/cipher-data-center-funding-btc-mining-slips/", "title": "Cipher targets $2B HPC data center funding as BTC mining profitability continues to slip", "source": "Cryptopolitan", "topics": [{"topic": "blockchain", "relevance_score": "0.899517"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.733498"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.628301"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.848164"}], "authors": ["Hannah Collymore"], "su