	 (897,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 20:57:00','20260203T205700','Macroeconomic Strength to Drive AeroVironment Inc’s (AVAV) Shareholder Returns','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/macroeconomic-strength-to-drive-aerovironment-incs-avav-shareholder-returns-1688126/?amp=1','KeyBanc analyst Michael Leshock raised AeroVironment Inc.''s (AVAV) price target from $285 to $330, maintaining a Buy rating and forecasting a 12.5% upside, driven by an expected attractive macroeconomic environment through 2026. The firm anticipates this environment will foster growth and potential re-ratings for space and defense technology stocks. Additionally, AeroVironment''s division, UES, secured a $75 million task order from the United States Air Force to modernize defense systems with next-generation biotechnology materials science.',NULL,'Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.912625"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.815337"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.738166"}]',0.280102,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AVAV", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.491088"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.623145", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.140481"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.643408", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.228933"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/macroeconomic-strength-to-drive-aerovironment-incs-avav-shareholder-returns-1688126/?amp=1", "title": "Macroeconomic Strength to Drive AeroVironment Inc’s (AVAV) Shareholder Returns", "source": "Insider Monkey", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.912625"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.815337"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.738166"}], "authors": ["Jabran Kundi"], "summary": "KeyBanc analyst Michael Lesh