	 (902,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 20:24:22','20260203T202422','Amazon shares ‘a coiled spring’ going into Q4 report: UBS','https://www.proactiveinvestors.com/companies/news/1086761/amazon-shares-a-coiled-spring-going-into-q4-report-ubs-1086761.html','UBS analysts have raised their price target for Amazon to $311 from $310 and reiterated a ''Buy'' rating ahead of the company''s Q4 2025 earnings report. The optimism stems from increasing confidence in Amazon Web Services (AWS) growth, with expectations of AWS revenue doubling by 2028, and significant increases in capital expenditure forecasts for cloud and AI infrastructure. The firm also anticipates continued investor conviction as AWS growth accelerates and sees additional upside from e-commerce improvements and high-margin Prime Video advertising.','https://cdn.proactiveinvestors.com/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJwYS1jZG4iLCJrZXkiOiJ1cGxvYWRcL05ld3NcL0ltYWdlXC8yMDI2XzAyXC9IYWRyaWFuLVNodXR0ZXJzdG9jay0yLmpwZyIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6MTI4MCwiaGVpZ2h0IjoxMjgwLCJmaXQiOiJjb3ZlciJ9fX0=','Proactive financial news','General','Proactive financial news','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929602"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.819169"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.743522"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.605101"}]',0.475317,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.484911"}]','{"url": "https://www.proactiveinvestors.com/companies/news/1086761/amazon-shares-a-coiled-spring-going-into-q4-report-ubs-1086761.html", "title": "Amazon shares ‘a coiled spring’ going into Q4 report: UBS", "source": "Proactive financial news", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929602"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.819169"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.743522"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.605101"}