	 (903,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 19:33:00','20260203T193300','GXAI Shares Surged More Than 45% Today — What’s The Amazon Connection?','https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/equity/gxai-shares-surged-today-amazon-connection/cZb0229R4mZ','Shares of Gaxos.AI Inc. (GXAI) surged over 45% after Amazon Web Services committed to funding the preliminary development of its AI-powered sales coaching platform, Gaxos Labs. This collaboration, which also involves cloud services company Caylent, is expected to enhance Gaxos.AI''s credibility, future revenue generation, and strategic partnership opportunities. Retail sentiment on Stocktwits for GXAI shares shifted to "extremely bullish" following this announcement.','https://news.stocktwits-cdn.com/large_Getty_Images_2230437216_jpg_6078a75ee4.webp','Stocktwits','General','Stocktwits','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.949339"}]',0.286851,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "GXAI", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.899655"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.705676", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.401481"}, {"ticker": "PYPL", "relevance_score": "0.574666", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.518822"}]','{"url": "https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/equity/gxai-shares-surged-today-amazon-connection/cZb0229R4mZ", "title": "GXAI Shares Surged More Than 45% Today — What’s The Amazon Connection?", "source": "Stocktwits", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.949339"}], "authors": ["Aashika Suresh"], "summary": "Shares of Gaxos.AI Inc. (GXAI) surged over 45% after Amazon Web Services committed to funding the preliminary development of its AI-powered sales coaching platform, Gaxos Labs. This collaboration, which also involve