	 (906,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 18:48:02','20260203T184802','Should Investors Buy Amazon Stock Ahead of Q4 Earnings Release?','https://finviz.com/news/297970/should-investors-buy-amazon-stock-ahead-of-q4-earnings-release','Amazon (AMZN) is poised to report its fourth-quarter 2025 earnings, with projections for net sales between $206 billion and $213 billion, and an estimated EPS of $1.98. The company is expected to benefit from strong performance in AWS, generative AI capabilities, e-commerce, and advertising, despite a "stretched valuation." While Amazon has a strong earnings surprise history, its Earnings ESP suggests a potential miss this quarter, yet its strong Zacks Rank #2 indicates a favorable outlook for investors.','https://staticx-tuner.zacks.com/images/articles/charts/bd/144728.jpg?v=1388369452','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.927077"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.842113"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.705058"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.810215"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.623610"}]',0.28449,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.421232"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.716727", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.275050"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.647871", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.232759"}, {"ticker": "ORCL", "relevance_score": "0.593151", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.182015"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/297970/should-investors-buy-amazon-stock-ahead-of-q4-earnings-release", "title": "Should Investors Buy Amazon Stock Ahead of Q4 Earnings Release?", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.927077"}, {"topic": "