	 (913,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 16:22:00','20260203T162200','Barclays Initiates Coverage on Apple Hospitality REIT, Inc. (APLE) as Hotel REITs Face Long-Term Skepticism','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/barclays-initiates-coverage-on-apple-hospitality-reit-inc-aple-as-hotel-reits-face-long-term-skepticism-1688042/?amp=1','Barclays has initiated coverage on Apple Hospitality REIT, Inc. (APLE) with an Overweight rating and a $14 price target, viewing hotel REITs as a short-term trading space rather than a source of long-term excess returns. The firm favors companies with clear business strategies and strong balance sheets, a description that fits Apple Hospitality, which owns 221 upscale, room-focused hotels across 37 states. Despite the positive coverage, the article suggests that certain AI stocks may offer greater upside potential and less risk compared to APLE.',NULL,'Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.813524"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.744192"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.635177"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.624777"}]',0.25279,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "APLE", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.270127"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.604808", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.347631"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.628837", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.201165"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.576738", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.241463"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.569720", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.215958"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/barclays-initiates-coverage-on-apple-hospitality-reit-inc-aple-as-hotel-