	 (914,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 16:20:00','20260203T162000','RBC Capital Says Agree Realty Corporation (ADC)’s Q4 Deal Activity Remains Within Guidance','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/rbc-capital-says-agree-realty-corporation-adcs-q4-deal-activity-remains-within-guidance-1688202/?amp=1','RBC Capital reaffirmed an Outperform rating on Agree Realty Corporation (ADC) while slightly trimming its price target to $79 from $80. The firm noted that Q4 acquisitions were slightly below expectations but still within management''s guidance, and cap rates met their projections. Agree Realty has a strong dividend history, consistently increasing payouts annually since the 2008-09 financial crisis, and plans to invest up to $1.65 billion in real estate in 2025, supported by long-term tenant leases.',NULL,'Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.902204"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.803145"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.724338"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.616266"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.622472"}]',0.272835,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "ADC", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.298071"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.640614", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.340929"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.630870", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.221762"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.608741", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.217644"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.629374", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.210538"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/rbc-capital-says-agree-realty-corporation-adcs-q4-deal-activity-remains-within-guidance-16