	 (915,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 15:26:59','20260203T152659','Rep. David Taylor Has Bought Up to $345K Worth Of Amazon.com Stock: Here''s What You Should Know','https://www.benzinga.com/insights/government/26/02/50335832/rep-david-taylor-has-bought-up-to-345k-worth-of-amazon-com-stock-heres-what-you-should-know','Representative David Taylor recently purchased Amazon.com stock, with the value estimated between $23,023 and $345,000, according to a February 2, 2026 report. This transaction occurred on January 29, 2026. The article also highlights the importance of congressional transactions as a factor for investors, noting that members of Congress are prohibited from using private information for personal gain under the STOCK Act.','https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/11/06/insider_trade_2.jpg?quality=85&auto=webp&width=850','Benzinga','General','Benzinga','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.912023"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.847577"}]',0.074414,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.128492"}, {"ticker": "IBM", "relevance_score": "0.704178", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.121100"}, {"ticker": "LRCX", "relevance_score": "0.634586", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.119946"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.604185", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.105429"}, {"ticker": "LLY", "relevance_score": "0.617916", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.148572"}]','{"url": "https://www.benzinga.com/insights/government/26/02/50335832/rep-david-taylor-has-bought-up-to-345k-worth-of-amazon-com-stock-heres-what-you-should-know", "title": "Rep. David Taylor Has Bought Up to $345K Worth Of Amazon.com Stock: Here''s What You Should Know", "source": "Benzinga", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_m