	 (917,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 14:28:10','20260203T142810','Google and V2X bring secure AI to U.S. national security missions','https://www.stocktitan.net/news/VVX/v2x-to-deploy-secure-responsible-ai-solutions-in-partnership-with-3f0zgqskq0we.html','V2X (NYSE: VVX) announced a partnership with Google Public Sector to deploy secure, accredited AI and cloud solutions for U.S. defense and intelligence agencies. This collaboration will integrate Google’s generative AI within V2X’s secure, on-premises environments, adhering to strict security and data governance standards. The initiative aims to enhance operational speed, mission resilience, and modernized digital infrastructure for national security operations through applications like multi-modal data analysis, training and simulation, and optimized logistics.','https://mma.prnewswire.com/media/1852552/V2X_Color_Logo.jpg','Stock Titan','General','Stock Titan','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.648717"}]',0.336684,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "VVX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.487922"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.721454", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.317321"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.703835", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.333631"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.620565", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.208795"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.584376", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.244779"}]','{"url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/news/VVX/v2x-to-deploy-secure-responsible-ai-solutions-in-partnership-with-3f0zgqskq0we.html", "title": "Google and V2X bring secure AI to U.S. national security missions", "source": "Stock Titan", "topics"