	 (922,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 13:57:30','20260203T135730','December CRE deal volume sinks further, but office is a surprising bright spot','https://www.cnbc.com/amp/2026/02/03/moodys-december-cre-deal-volume-sinks-further.html','Commercial real estate deal volume dropped 20% in December year over year, though the full year 2025 saw a 17% increase compared to 2024. A surprising bright spot was the office sector, with deal volume up 21% due to return-to-office mandates and AI employment growth. Moody''s analysis indicates a resilient recovery in 2025 despite economic challenges, with investor interest shifting towards Class A office assets, multifamily and retail, and significant growth in alternative property sectors and larger dollar deals.',NULL,'CNBC','General','CNBC','[{"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.938072"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.822588"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.631684"}]',0.308697,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "MCO", "relevance_score": "0.917357", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.333596"}, {"ticker": "WELL", "relevance_score": "0.724825", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.322811"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.642802", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.205494"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.634833", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.216578"}, {"ticker": "AAPL", "relevance_score": "0.638226", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.319981"}]','{"url": "https://www.cnbc.com/amp/2026/02/03/moodys-december-cre-deal-volume-sinks-further.html", "title": "December CRE deal volume sinks further, but office is a surprising bright spot", "source": "CNBC", "topics": [{"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.938072"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevanc