	 (926,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 13:32:45','20260203T133245','December CRE deal volume sinks further, but office is a surprising bright spot','https://www.cnbc.com/2026/02/03/moodys-december-cre-deal-volume-sinks-further.html','Commercial real estate (CRE) deal volume dropped 20% in December year over year, marking the second consecutive month of declines. However, for the full year 2025, CRE deal volume was up 17% compared to 2024, with office space emerging as a surprising bright spot due to return-to-office mandates and AI employment growth. Multifamily and retail sectors also saw healthy gains, and institutional investors re-entered the market, indicating cautious optimism for 2026 despite interest rates remaining elevated.','https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108169010-1751991932360-CNBC_PROPERTY_PLAY_WEB_HEADER_BACKGROUND_1497x160_v01.jpg?v=1751991984','CNBC','General','CNBC','[{"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.926719"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.847076"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.746899"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.625232"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.609398"}]',0.263884,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "MCO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.125240"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.723880", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.344197"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.608467", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.338752"}, {"ticker": "AAPL", "relevance_score": "0.623747", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.312377"}]','{"url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/02/03/moodys-december-cre-deal-volume-sinks-further.html", "title": "December CRE deal volume sinks further, but office is a surprising bright spot", "source": "CNBC", "topics": [{"topic": "real_es