	 (927,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 13:29:09','20260203T132909','Wells Fargo and Bernstein upgrade FedEx ahead of investor day next week','https://www.cnbc.com/2026/02/03/wells-fargo-and-bernstein-upgrade-fedex-ahead-of-investor-day-next-week.html','Wells Fargo and Bernstein have upgraded FedEx stock to overweight, citing overlooked value and potential for growth ahead of the company''s investor day next week. Both firms highlighted improving parcel fundamentals, the freight spin, and potential profit upside in FedEx''s Express business as key drivers. Price targets were significantly raised, reflecting an expected rally for the stock.','https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/107364671-1706212455310-2016-10-26T120000Z_1377555760_D1BEUJFKENAA_RTRMADP_3_MICROSOFT-WINDOWS.JPG?v=1730320114&w=600&h=300&vtcrop=y','CNBC','General','CNBC','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.927404"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.837545"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.706595"}]',0.292337,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "WFC", "relevance_score": "0.848093", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.328433"}, {"ticker": "FDX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.477977"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.571391", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.065442"}]','{"url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/02/03/wells-fargo-and-bernstein-upgrade-fedex-ahead-of-investor-day-next-week.html", "title": "Wells Fargo and Bernstein upgrade FedEx ahead of investor day next week", "source": "CNBC", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.927404"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.837545"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.706595"}], "authors": ["Lisa Kailai Han"], "summary": "Wells Fargo and Bernstein have upgraded FedEx stock to overweight, citing overl