	 (928,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-03 13:28:28','20260203T132828','Amazon backs Gaxos.ai’s AI coach for high-stakes sales calls','https://www.stocktitan.net/news/GXAI/amazon-aws-funds-gaxos-ai-sales-platform-hzmf8zmp0s7j.html','Amazon Web Services (AWS) has committed to fund the preliminary development of an AI-powered sales coaching platform by Gaxos.ai (NASDAQ: GXAI), selecting Caylent as the development partner. This initiative aims to create an AWS-native platform with features like live call transcription and automated coaching intelligence for enterprise deployment. The news led to a significant 69.15% surge in GXAI''s stock, despite no specific financial terms being disclosed and the project currently being in early development.','https://ml.globenewswire.com/media/YzdmOTk2MGItN2ZiZS00MmJhLThmNjItNWE0ZmE1ZDQxMmRmLTUwMDExMzU5Mi0yMDI2LTAyLTAzLWVu/tiny/GAXOS-AI-INC-.png','Stock Titan','General','Stock Titan','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.909795"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.806811"}]',0.390925,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "GXAI", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.485125"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.706637", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.347305"}]','{"url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/news/GXAI/amazon-aws-funds-gaxos-ai-sales-platform-hzmf8zmp0s7j.html", "title": "Amazon backs Gaxos.ai’s AI coach for high-stakes sales calls", "source": "Stock Titan", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.909795"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.806811"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Amazon Web Services (AWS) has committed to fund the preliminary development of an AI-powered sales coaching platform by Gaxos.ai (NASDAQ: GXAI), selecting Caylent as the development partner. This initiative aims to create an AWS-native platform with features like live call transcription and au