	 (942,'alpha_vantage','BIRK','BIRK','2026-02-03 15:28:50','20260203T152850','Williams Trading upgrades Birkenstock stock to Buy from Hold on valuation','https://m.investing.com/news/analyst-ratings/williams-trading-upgrades-birkenstock-stock-to-buy-from-hold-on-valuation-93CH-4482249?ampMode=1','Williams Trading has upgraded Birkenstock Holding plc (NYSE:BIRK) from Hold to Buy, maintaining a $49 price target, citing valuation due to the stock trading near its 52-week low. The firm observed that Birkenstock''s current trading multiples are attractive compared to its fiscal year 2026 and 2027 estimates, despite ongoing concerns about its distribution strategy and balancing its identity as both a manufacturing and consumer-led brand. This upgrade comes amidst mixed analyst perspectives following Birkenstock''s recent preliminary earnings report and Capital Markets Day.',NULL,'Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.938705"}]',0.388555,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "BIRK", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.423696"}]','{"url": "https://m.investing.com/news/analyst-ratings/williams-trading-upgrades-birkenstock-stock-to-buy-from-hold-on-valuation-93CH-4482249?ampMode=1", "title": "Williams Trading upgrades Birkenstock stock to Buy from Hold on valuation", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.938705"}], "authors": ["Investing.com"], "summary": "Williams Trading has upgraded Birkenstock Holding plc (NYSE:BIRK) from Hold to Buy, maintaining a $49 price target, citing valuation due to the stock trading near its 52-week low. The firm observed that Birkenstock''s current trading multiples are attractive compared to its fiscal year 2026 and 2027 estimates, despite ongoing concerns about its dis