	 (944,'alpha_vantage','BURL','BURL','2026-02-04 06:58:25','20260204T065825','Burlington to open new store in Oildale, another store spotted near Valley Plaza Mall','https://bakersfieldnow.com/news/local/burlington-to-open-new-store-in-nw-bakersfield-near-valley-plaza-mall-ming-avenue-olive-drive-california-avenue-shopping','Burlington Stores announced plans for a new store in Oildale set to open in the spring, located at 1211 Olive Drive, a former Big Lots site. Additionally, evidence suggests another Burlington location is opening near the Valley Plaza Mall, at the former JOANN''s Fabrics and Crafts store on Ming Avenue, where "now hiring" signs and reconstruction are visible. These openings are part of a larger plan to establish 124 new Burlington stores in California by the end of 2026.','https://bakersfieldnow.com/resources/media2/16x9/4032/986/0x378/90/4e4f24d8-95e2-495f-a771-5202beba3b39-Image20260203T173940.629.jpg','KBAK','General','KBAK','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.839592"}]',0.415988,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "BURL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.449785"}]','{"url": "https://bakersfieldnow.com/news/local/burlington-to-open-new-store-in-nw-bakersfield-near-valley-plaza-mall-ming-avenue-olive-drive-california-avenue-shopping", "title": "Burlington to open new store in Oildale, another store spotted near Valley Plaza Mall", "source": "KBAK", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.839592"}], "authors": ["BakersfieldNow Staff"], "summary": "Burlington Stores announced plans for a new store in Oildale set to open in the spring, located at 1211 Olive Drive, a former Big Lots site. Additionally, evidence suggests another Burlington location is opening near the Valley Plaza Mall, at the former JOANN''s Fabrics and Crafts store on Ming Avenu