	 (945,'alpha_vantage','BURL','BURL','2026-02-04 02:58:25','20260204T025825','New Burlington Coat Factory to bring jobs, more retail in Hanford','https://abc30.com/post/new-burlington-coat-factory-bring-jobs-more-retail-hanford/18537778/','Hanford, California is preparing for the grand opening of a new Burlington store this spring, which is expected to bring new jobs and revenue to the rapidly growing city. Residents overwhelmingly requested the store in a recent survey, indicating a demand for more retail options. This new development is part of a larger trend of growth in Hanford, including new homes, developments, and restaurants, making it one of the nation''s fastest-growing cities.',NULL,'ABC30 Fresno','General','ABC30 Fresno','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.931428"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.822095"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.614529"}]',0.218212,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "BURL", "relevance_score": "0.945329", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.443120"}, {"ticker": "MCD", "relevance_score": "0.611370", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.146921"}, {"ticker": "CMG", "relevance_score": "0.567950", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.142800"}]','{"url": "https://abc30.com/post/new-burlington-coat-factory-bring-jobs-more-retail-hanford/18537778/", "title": "New Burlington Coat Factory to bring jobs, more retail in Hanford", "source": "ABC30 Fresno", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.931428"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.822095"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.614529"}], "authors": ["Kassandra Gutierrez"], "summary": "Hanford, California is preparing for the grand opening of a new Burlington store this spring, which is expected to bring new jobs and revenue to the rapidly growing city. Residents overwhelmingly requested the store in a re