	 (946,'alpha_vantage','BURL','BURL','2026-02-03 16:03:00','20260203T160300','Burlington Store set to open in Hanford in the spring','https://kmph.com/news/local/burlington-store-set-to-open-in-hanford-in-the-spring','Burlington Stores, Inc. is planning to open its 124th California location in Hanford in the spring. The new store in Hanford Towne Center will feature a reimagined design, offering discounted branded merchandise including apparel, beauty products, and home decor, and is actively seeking new employees.','https://kmph.com/resources/media2/16x9/1023/986/0x1/90/aee7fa9e-0333-4e6a-b5eb-ece5fde656e9-AP26034541277771.jpg','KMPH','General','KMPH','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.935698"}]',0.527482,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "BURL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.512482"}]','{"url": "https://kmph.com/news/local/burlington-store-set-to-open-in-hanford-in-the-spring", "title": "Burlington Store set to open in Hanford in the spring", "source": "KMPH", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.935698"}], "authors": ["James Mora"], "summary": "Burlington Stores, Inc. is planning to open its 124th California location in Hanford in the spring. The new store in Hanford Towne Center will feature a reimagined design, offering discounted branded merchandise including apparel, beauty products, and home decor, and is actively seeking new employees.", "banner_image": "https://kmph.com/resources/media2/16x9/1023/986/0x1/90/aee7fa9e-0333-4e6a-b5eb-ece5fde656e9-AP26034541277771.jpg", "source_domain": "KMPH", "time_published": "20260203T160300", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "BURL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.512482"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.527482}','2026-02-04 12:46:11',NULL),
	 (947,'alpha_vantage','CART','CART','2026-02-03 19:28:25','20260203T192825','Instacart can’t stall new NYC delivery driver wage laws','https://www.courthousenews.com/instacart-cant-stall-new-nyc-delivery-driver-wage-laws/','Instacart has lost another attempt to prevent a new New York City law, which extends minimum wage requirements for food delivery drivers to grocery deliverers, from taking effect. The company argues that this requirement will cause "irreparable harm" and has failed to convince a U.S. District Judge of its likelihood of success on appeal. Instacart claims the city misunderstood the unique nature of its "personal shoppers" and that the law will force them to overhaul their business model, reducing flexibility for drivers and increasing costs for customers.','https://imagedelivery.net/wKQ19LTSBT0ARz08tkssqQ/127.0.0.1/2020/08/AP20231496864733.jpg/w=1300,h=731,fit=crop','Courthouse News','General','Courthouse News','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.848729"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.715017"}]',-0.182869,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CART", "relevance_score": "0.315207", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.041834"}, {"ticker": "DASH", "relevance_score": "0.837225", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.296442"}, {"ticker": "UBER", "relevance_score": "0.732125", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.274317"}, {"ticker": "SBUX", "relevance_score": "0.553575", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.104361"}]','{"url": "https://www.courthousenews.com/instacart-cant-stall-new-nyc-delivery-driver-wage-laws/", "title": "Instacart can’t stall new NYC delivery driver wage laws", "source": "Courthouse News", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.848729"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.715017"}], "authors": ["Erik Uebelacker"], "summary": 