	 (980,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-04 02:14:03','20260204T021403','Clorox Q2 Earnings Call Highlights','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/clorox-q2-earnings-call-highlights-2026-02-03/','Clorox''s Q2 earnings call revealed that while the company experienced sequential improvement, categories generally remained subdued with projected 0-1% growth in the back half of the fiscal year. Management highlighted temporary impacts from an ERP rollout which caused shipment and cost fluctuations, but the final phase completed smoothly, with an expected normalization benefit in fiscal 2027. The company plans to drive future growth through innovation in cleaning technologies and product relaunches, alongside selective promotional investments, while anticipating gross margin expansion in the back half of the year.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/the-clorox-company-logo-1200x675.png?v=20250505090624','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.947574"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.847166"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.649693"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.647447"}]',0.028131,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "0.311024", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.007015"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/clorox-q2-earnings-call-highlights-2026-02-03/", "title": "Clorox Q2 Earnings Call Highlights", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.947574"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.847166"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.649693"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.647447"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Clorox''s Q2 earnings call revealed that while the company experienced sequential improvement, categories generally remained subdued with projected 0-1% growth in the back half of the fiscal year. Management highlight