ck dipped 0.69% in after-hours trading, reflecting investor concerns over the EPS miss despite the revenue beat. The company plans new product innovations and marketing investments for the fiscal year''s second half, completed its ERP system implementation, and is acquiring GOJO Industries to strengthen its health and hygiene portfolio.", "banner_image": "https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/world_news_2_69x52._800x533_L_1419494365.jpg", "source_domain": "Investing.com", "time_published": "20260203T232416", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.224326"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "overall_sentiment_score": -0.21112}','2026-02-04 12:46:24',NULL),
	 (982,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-03 22:19:08','20260203T221908','Clorox Posts Lower Profit on Sales Volume Declines','https://www.wsj.com/business/earnings/clorox-posts-lower-profit-on-sales-volume-declines-878f3f57?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqe0iOkOfM-0LLNoDQEBp-XMmIsM3UWRPMbAFAaqiV3z2CWvhm7WuNZP&gaa_ts=6982791e&gaa_sig=u4872p-AxINDZdx6B7SBI0WCWyK4s9ZX4_usUsXAaEHU3ryTwwuhnkvxSUKwPJZfKCgLpr4GOklHQLDxczUzWg%3D%3D','Clorox reported a decline in its second-quarter profit, falling to $157 million from $193 million a year earlier, primarily due to lower sales volumes. The company''s sales decreased 1% to $1.67 billion, driven by reduced consumer demand. Adjusted earnings per share also missed analyst expectations.','https://images.wsj.net/im-21350154?width=700&height=466','The Wall Street Journal','General','The Wall Street Journal','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.944940"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.747086"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.637308"}]',-0.433917,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.404805"}]','{"url": "https://www.wsj.com/business/earnings/clorox-posts-lower-profit-on-sales-volume-declines-878f3f57?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqe0iOkOfM-0LLNoDQEBp-XMmIsM3UWRPMbAFAaqiV3z2CWvhm7WuNZP&gaa_ts=6982791e&gaa_sig=u4872p-AxINDZdx6B7SBI0WCWyK4s9ZX4_usUsXAaEHU3ryTwwuhnkvxSUKwPJZfKCgLpr4GOklHQLDxczUzWg%3D%3D", "title": "Clorox Posts Lower Profit on Sales Volume Declines", "source": "The Wall Street Journal", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.944940"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.747086"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.637308"}], "authors": ["Amira McKee"], "summary": "Clorox reported a decline in its second-quarter profit, falling to $157 million from $193 million a year earlier, primarily due to lower sales volumes. The company''s sales decreased 1% to $1.6