	 (987,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-03 21:42:08','20260203T214208','Clorox (NYSE:CLX) Posts Earnings Results, Misses Expectations By $0.07 EPS','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/clorox-nyseclx-posts-earnings-results-misses-expectations-by-007-eps-2026-02-03/','Clorox (NYSE:CLX) reported quarterly earnings of $1.39 per share, missing the consensus estimate of $1.46 by $0.07. Despite the earnings miss, the company''s revenue of $1.67 billion exceeded analyst estimates, leading to a 1.6% increase in share price to $115.11. Clorox also declared a quarterly dividend of $1.24, and while analyst sentiment is cautious, institutional ownership remains high with a recent director stock purchase.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/the-clorox-company-logo-1200x675.png?v=20250505090624','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.918179"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.845724"}]',0.053992,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "0.997541", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.074996"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/clorox-nyseclx-posts-earnings-results-misses-expectations-by-007-eps-2026-02-03/", "title": "Clorox (NYSE:CLX) Posts Earnings Results, Misses Expectations By $0.07 EPS", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.918179"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.845724"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Clorox (NYSE:CLX) reported quarterly earnings of $1.39 per share, missing the consensus estimate of $1.46 by $0.07. Despite the earnings miss, the company''s revenue of $1.67 billion exceeded analyst estimates, leading to a 1.6% increase in share price to $115.11. Clorox also declared a quarterly dividend of $1.24, and while analyst sentiment is cautious, institutional ownership remains high with a recent director stock purchase.", "banner_image": "https://www.marketbeat.com/l