	 (988,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-03 21:41:25','20260203T214125','Transforming our operations: Clorox completes ERP rollout across US and Canada','https://www.thecloroxcompany.com/blog/transforming-our-operations-clorox-completes-erp-rollout-across-u-s-and-canada/','The Clorox Company has completed the full rollout of its new SAP enterprise resource planning (ERP) system across the United States and Canada. This represents a 5-year, $580 million investment aimed at transforming the company''s digital capabilities and enhancing nearly every aspect of its operations. The new cloud-based system provides real-time data, improves efficiency, and strengthens collaboration, forming a digital backbone to accelerate growth and increase resilience.','https://www.thecloroxcompany.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ERP-blog_TCC-Blog-H.jpg','The Clorox Company','General','The Clorox Company','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.803147"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.749366"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.634305"}]',0.414436,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.430974"}]','{"url": "https://www.thecloroxcompany.com/blog/transforming-our-operations-clorox-completes-erp-rollout-across-u-s-and-canada/", "title": "Transforming our operations: Clorox completes ERP rollout across US and Canada", "source": "The Clorox Company", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.803147"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.749366"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.634305"}], "authors": ["Steve Keil"], "summary": "The Clorox Company has completed the full rollout of its new SAP enterprise resource planning (ERP) system across the United States and Canada. This represents a 5-year, $580 million investment aimed at transforming the company''s digital capabilities and enhancing nearly every aspect of its operations. The new