	 (989,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-03 21:27:16','20260203T212716','Earnings Flash (CLX) The Clorox Company Posts Q2 Adjusted EPS $1.39 per Share, vs. FactSet Est of $1.43','https://www.marketscreener.com/news/earnings-flash-clx-the-clorox-company-posts-q2-adjusted-eps-1-39-per-share-vs-factset-est-of-1-ce7e5bd3dc8bfe27','The Clorox Company (CLX) reported its Q2 adjusted EPS at $1.39 per share, falling short of the FactSet estimate of $1.43. Additionally, the company''s Q2 revenue was $1.67 billion, surpassing the FactSet estimate of $1.64 billion. Despite missing profit estimates, Clorox reaffirmed its fiscal year 2026 adjusted EPS guidance ranging from $5.95 to $6.30, which is higher than FactSet''s estimate of $5.88.',NULL,'marketscreener.com','General','marketscreener.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.941300"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.649031"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.614596"}]',-0.15054,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.238781"}, {"ticker": "FDS", "relevance_score": "0.621472", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.146445"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketscreener.com/news/earnings-flash-clx-the-clorox-company-posts-q2-adjusted-eps-1-39-per-share-vs-factset-est-of-1-ce7e5bd3dc8bfe27", "title": "Earnings Flash (CLX) The Clorox Company Posts Q2 Adjusted EPS $1.39 per Share, vs. FactSet Est of $1.43", "source": "marketscreener.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.941300"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.649031"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.614596"}], "authors": ["MT Newswires"], "summary": "The Clorox Company (CLX) reported its Q2 adjusted EPS at $1.39 per share, falling short of the FactSet estimate of $1.43. Additionally, the company''s Q2 revenue was $1.67 billion, surpassin