	 (990,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-03 21:27:08','20260203T212708','Clorox’s (NYSE:CLX) Q4 CY2025: Beats On Revenue','https://www.tradingview.com/news/stockstory:b298e861e094b:0-clorox-s-nyse-clx-q4-cy2025-beats-on-revenue/','Clorox (NYSE:CLX) reported its Q4 CY2025 earnings, which showed a revenue beat at $1.67 billion, though sales were flat year-on-year. The company''s adjusted EPS of $1.39 missed analyst expectations, and organic revenue declined by 1%. Despite a mixed quarter, management reaffirmed its full-year Adjusted EPS guidance.','https://s3.tradingview.com/news/image/stockstory:b298e861e094b-e4e0a7509db519dde8e5af579b117142-resized.webp','TradingView','General','TradingView','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929014"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.730699"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.641199"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.643871"}]',-0.269419,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.254921"}]','{"url": "https://www.tradingview.com/news/stockstory:b298e861e094b:0-clorox-s-nyse-clx-q4-cy2025-beats-on-revenue/", "title": "Clorox’s (NYSE:CLX) Q4 CY2025: Beats On Revenue", "source": "TradingView", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929014"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.730699"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.641199"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.643871"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Clorox (NYSE:CLX) reported its Q4 CY2025 earnings, which showed a revenue beat at $1.67 billion, though sales were flat year-on-year. The company''s adjusted EPS of $1.39 missed analyst expectations, and organic revenue declined by 1%. Despite a mixed quarter, management reaffirmed its full-year Adjusted EPS guidance.", "banner_image": "https://s3.tradingview.com/news/image/stockstory:b298e861e094b-e4e0a7