	 (991,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-03 21:26:47','20260203T212647','Chair and CEO Linda Rendle on Q2 earnings and outlook for FY26','https://www.thecloroxcompany.com/blog/chair-and-ceo-linda-rendle-on-q2-fy26-performance-and-outlook/','Linda Rendle, Chair and CEO of The Clorox Company, discusses the Q2 FY26 earnings, noting that results were generally in line with expectations despite consumer pressure and the final phase of their U.S. ERP implementation. The company is focusing on innovation and leveraging its digital transformation to enhance value, accelerate decision-making, and improve execution. Clorox also announced the strategic acquisition of GOJO Industries, makers of Purell®, to strengthen its health and hygiene leadership and drive accretive growth.','https://www.thecloroxcompany.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Q2-FY26-Earnings_TCC-Blog-F.jpg','The Clorox Company','General','The Clorox Company','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929568"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.833545"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.627682"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.624868"}]',0.338404,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.341656"}]','{"url": "https://www.thecloroxcompany.com/blog/chair-and-ceo-linda-rendle-on-q2-fy26-performance-and-outlook/", "title": "Chair and CEO Linda Rendle on Q2 earnings and outlook for FY26", "source": "The Clorox Company", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929568"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.833545"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.627682"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.624868"}], "authors": ["Linda Rendle"], "summary": "Linda Rendle, Chair and CEO of The Clorox Company, discusses the Q2 FY26 earnings, noting that results were generally in line with expectation