	 (997,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-03 15:15:23','20260203T151523','Clorox earnings on deck as GOJO deal reshapes growth outlook By Investing.com','https://za.investing.com/news/earnings/clorox-earnings-on-deck-as-gojo-deal-reshapes-growth-outlook-93CH-4093307','Clorox (NYSE: CLX) is set to report its second-quarter fiscal 2026 earnings, with investors focused on the company''s operational recovery from enterprise software disruptions and the integration of its recent $2.25 billion acquisition of GOJO Industries, the maker of Purell. Analysts anticipate earnings of $1.44 per share on revenue of $1.64 billion, showing a significant improvement from the previous quarter. The report will likely address critical issues such as ERP system normalization, consumer demand resilience, and the outlook for GOJO integration to drive growth and cost synergies.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/news_headline_rolled_69x52._800x533_L_1419494221.jpg','Investing.com South Africa','General','Investing.com South Africa','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.943340"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.812423"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.738724"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.604468"}]',0.29786,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.260701"}]','{"url": "https://za.investing.com/news/earnings/clorox-earnings-on-deck-as-gojo-deal-reshapes-growth-outlook-93CH-4093307", "title": "Clorox earnings on deck as GOJO deal reshapes growth outlook By Investing.com", "source": "Investing.com South Africa", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.943340"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.812423"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.738724"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.604468"}], "authors": ["Investing.com"], "summar