	 (1001,'alpha_vantage','COLM','COLM','2026-02-04 10:28:49','20260204T102849','Thrivent Financial for Lutherans Has $24.50 Million Stock Holdings in Columbia Sportswear Company $COLM','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-thrivent-financial-for-lutherans-has-2450-million-stock-holdings-in-columbia-sportswear-company-colm-2026-02-04/','Thrivent Financial for Lutherans increased its stake in Columbia Sportswear Company (NASDAQ:COLM) by 7.1% in the third quarter, now owning 468,358 shares valued at $24.50 million. Other institutional investors also adjusted their positions in COLM. The article details Columbia Sportswear''s recent Q4 earnings beat, positive FY2026 guidance, but also notes cautious Q1 guidance and mixed analyst sentiment.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/columbia-sportswear-logo-1200x675.jpg?v=20221115171105','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.928274"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.823558"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.646996"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.636789"}]',0.051563,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "COLM", "relevance_score": "0.965296", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.085161"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-thrivent-financial-for-lutherans-has-2450-million-stock-holdings-in-columbia-sportswear-company-colm-2026-02-04/", "title": "Thrivent Financial for Lutherans Has $24.50 Million Stock Holdings in Columbia Sportswear Company $COLM", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.928274"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.823558"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.646996"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.636789"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Thrivent Financial for Lutherans increased its stake in Columbia Sportswear Company (NASDAQ:COLM) by 7.1% in the third quarter, now owni