	 (1002,'alpha_vantage','COLM','COLM','2026-02-04 07:28:49','20260204T072849','US'' Columbia Sportswear posts 1% sales growth, margins improve in 2025','https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/company-reports-news/us-columbia-sportswear-posts-1-sales-growth-margins-improve-in-2025-308180-newsdetails.htm?amp=true','Columbia Sportswear reported a 1% increase in net sales to $3.4 billion for full-year 2025, with improved gross margins despite impacts from tariffs and impairment charges. While Q4 sales declined, international growth and stronger margins were noted. For 2026, the company anticipates modest revenue growth but forecasts continued margin pressure from US tariffs and a softer Q1 outlook.',NULL,'Fibre2Fashion','General','Fibre2Fashion','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.944925"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.820152"}]',0.129969,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "COLM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.061340"}, {"ticker": "DECK", "relevance_score": "0.601783", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.327429"}]','{"url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/company-reports-news/us-columbia-sportswear-posts-1-sales-growth-margins-improve-in-2025-308180-newsdetails.htm?amp=true", "title": "US'' Columbia Sportswear posts 1% sales growth, margins improve in 2025", "source": "Fibre2Fashion", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.944925"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.820152"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Columbia Sportswear reported a 1% increase in net sales to $3.4 billion for full-year 2025, with improved gross margins despite impacts from tariffs and impairment charges. While Q4 sales declined, international growth and stronger margins were noted. For 2026, the company anticipates modest revenue growth but forecasts continued margin pressure from US tariffs and a softer Q1 outlook.", "banner_image": null, "s