	 (1007,'alpha_vantage','COLM','COLM','2026-02-03 21:28:40','20260203T212840','Columbia Sportswear (COLM) Forecasts Revenue Growth for FY26','https://www.gurufocus.com/news/8578806/columbia-sportswear-colm-forecasts-revenue-growth-for-fy26','Columbia Sportswear (COLM) expects its fiscal year 2026 revenue to be between $3.43 billion and $3.5 billion, surpassing market consensus. Despite this positive forecast, the company anticipates a slight decline in gross margin by 50 to 70 basis points and plans capital expenditures of $65 million to $75 million. The outdoor and active-lifestyle apparel company, with brands like Columbia and Sorel, maintains strong financial health reflected in its revenue growth and balance sheet strength.','https://static.gurufocus.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=600,quality=100/logos/0C00000AMK.png?20','GuruFocus','General','GuruFocus','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.941372"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.832840"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.747207"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.643591"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.623258"}]',0.252778,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "COLM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.288831"}]','{"url": "https://www.gurufocus.com/news/8578806/columbia-sportswear-colm-forecasts-revenue-growth-for-fy26", "title": "Columbia Sportswear (COLM) Forecasts Revenue Growth for FY26", "source": "GuruFocus", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.941372"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.832840"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.747207"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.643591"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.623258"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Columbia Sportswear (COLM) expects its fiscal year 2026 revenue to be between $3.43 billion and $3.5 billion, surpassing market consensus. D