	 (1017,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-03 14:57:21','20260203T145721','Dollar General Bets on Remodels as Its Next Growth Engine','https://www.tradingview.com/news/zacks:fe0f8b1e8094b:0-dollar-general-bets-on-remodels-as-its-next-growth-engine/','Dollar General is shifting its growth strategy from new store openings to extensive remodel programs like Project Elevate and Project Renovate, which offer attractive returns with lower capital intensity. While new stores remain profitable, remodels are becoming the primary focus, aiming to refresh assortments and improve customer satisfaction across existing locations. This strategy is reflected in their fiscal 2026 real estate plan, with remodels expected to account for 90% of planned projects, alongside a smaller number of new store openings.','https://s3.tradingview.com/news/image/zacks:fe0f8b1e8094b-5eb6f49d78d23aebdaddea9d9ae1e562-resized.webp','TradingView','General','TradingView','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.930929"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.813168"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.642774"}]',0.076685,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "DG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.513705"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.686018", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.381420"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.654413", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.088998"}]','{"url": "https://www.tradingview.com/news/zacks:fe0f8b1e8094b:0-dollar-general-bets-on-remodels-as-its-next-growth-engine/", "title": "Dollar General Bets on Remodels as Its Next Growth Engine", "source": "TradingView", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.930929"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.813168"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.642774"}], "authors": ["Zacks Investment Research", "Zacks"], "summ