	 (1020,'alpha_vantage','WMT','COST','2026-02-03 13:44:21','20260203T134421','Nine Out of Ten Costco Members Renew: Inside the Metric That Powers a $14B Profit Engine','https://247wallst.com/investing/2026/02/03/nine-out-of-ten-costco-members-renew-inside-the-metric-that-powers-a-14b-profit-engine/','Costco boasts an impressive membership renewal rate of 92.3% in the US and Canada, and 89.8% worldwide, which is central to its profitable business model. Membership fees are nearly pure profit, subsidizing low merchandise margins and driving a significant portion of the company''s income and sales. The company is seeing growth in executive memberships and is actively acquiring younger members online, who, despite slightly lower initial renewal rates, represent long-term value.','https://247wallst.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/GettyImages-2161665902-scaled.jpg','24/7 Wall St.','General','24/7 Wall St.','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.908336"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.812206"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.624360"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.635898"}]',0.189225,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.983488", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.740709"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.610009", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.122011"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.629035", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.119298"}]','{"url": "https://247wallst.com/investing/2026/02/03/nine-out-of-ten-costco-members-renew-inside-the-metric-that-powers-a-14b-profit-engine/", "title": "Nine Out of Ten Costco Members Renew: Inside the Metric That Powers a $14B Profit Engine", "source": "24/7 Wall St.", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.908336"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.812206"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "releva