	 (1025,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-04 11:49:26','20260204T114926','UnitedHealth, CVS, Humana Face Double Trouble As Trump''s Medicare Cuts Are Just The Start—PBM ''Spread Pricing'' Comes Under Fire','https://finance.yahoo.com/news/unitedhealth-cvs-humana-face-double-114604435.html','Major healthcare players like UnitedHealth, CVS, and Humana are facing significant financial headwinds. Following negligible increases in Medicare Advantage payments proposed by the Trump administration, a new Department of Labor regulation aims to bring "radical transparency" to Pharmacy Benefit Managers (PBMs) by demanding full disclosure of their compensation, including "spread pricing" and rebates. This dual pressure threatens to squeeze profits from both their insurance and PBM business segments.',NULL,'Yahoo Finance','General','Yahoo Finance','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.919709"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.804273"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.726047"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.636714"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.631369"}]',-0.618215,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.986879", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.678710"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.914621", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.611575"}, {"ticker": "HUM", "relevance_score": "0.897442", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.724886"}, {"ticker": "CI", "relevance_score": "0.743239", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.555498"}, {"ticker": "ELV", "relevance_score": "0.614559", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.417905"}]','{"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/unitedhealth-cvs-humana-face-double-114604435.html", "title": "UnitedHealth, CVS, Humana Face Double Trouble As Trump''s Medicare Cuts Are Just The Start—PBM ''Spread