	 (1026,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-04 11:48:39','20260204T114839','UnitedHealth, CVS, Humana Face Double Trouble As Trump''s Medicare Cuts Are Just The Start—PBM ''Spread Pricing'' Comes Under Fire','https://uk.finance.yahoo.com/news/unitedhealth-cvs-humana-face-double-114604435.html','Health insurance giants UnitedHealth, CVS, and Humana are confronting significant profit pressures from two directions. Firstly, the Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services (CMS) proposed a near-zero increase in Medicare Advantage payments for 2027, below analyst expectations and impacting top-line growth. Secondly, the Department of Labor has introduced a new regulation demanding "radical transparency" from Pharmacy Benefit Managers (PBMs) regarding their compensation, spread pricing, rebates, and clawbacks, which could compress margins for these companies.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/fy.uc6CRzeg0sYevliRZAw--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTY0MA--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/Benzinga/75d957308eee8ebc5878b3fc9f3db526','Yahoo Finance UK','General','Yahoo Finance UK','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.935442"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.716746"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.644379"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.611985"}]',-0.242839,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.261578"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.988828", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.247088"}, {"ticker": "HUM", "relevance_score": "0.921871", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.276718"}, {"ticker": "CI", "relevance_score": "0.857077", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.208489"}, {"ticker": "CNC", "relevance_score": "0.645447", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_sco