	 (1044,'alpha_vantage','DG','DG','2026-02-04 00:17:30','20260204T001730','Dollar General ends negotiations for Cashmere Mill District site, cites poor location, traffic','https://www.wenatcheeworld.com/business/dollar-general-ends-negotiations-for-cashmere-mill-district-site-cites-poor-location-traffic/article_beb4c0bc-23e4-4711-ae96-6e007a181732.html','Dollar General has ended negotiations to build a new store in Cashmere''s Mill District, citing concerns related to the location and traffic volume, according to port officials. This decision follows negotiations facilitated by the Port of Chelan County with developer NNN Retail Development, and comes after local residents expressed opposition to the proposed Dollar General at a recent meeting. The Port is now seeking new prospective tenants for the 20 remaining acres of the Mill District property.','https://bloximages.newyork1.vip.townnews.com/wenatcheeworld.com/content/tncms/assets/v3/editorial/b/6c/b6ca1ba1-17eb-468d-9009-4599eef3012b/697d2d2eae887.image.jpg?resize=749%2C500','The Wenatchee World','General','The Wenatchee World','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.907137"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.809528"}]',-0.263748,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "DG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.283108"}]','{"url": "https://www.wenatcheeworld.com/business/dollar-general-ends-negotiations-for-cashmere-mill-district-site-cites-poor-location-traffic/article_beb4c0bc-23e4-4711-ae96-6e007a181732.html", "title": "Dollar General ends negotiations for Cashmere Mill District site, cites poor location, traffic", "source": "The Wenatchee World", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.907137"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.809528"}], "authors": ["Matthew Carnero-Macias"], "summary": "Dollar General has ended negotiations to build a new store in Cashmere''s Mill District, citing 