	 (1045,'alpha_vantage','DG','DG','2026-02-03 22:27:20','20260203T222720','Dollar General appoints David Rowland as new board chairman','https://www.investing.com/news/company-news/dollar-general-appoints-david-rowland-as-new-board-chairman-93CH-4483192','Dollar General (NYSE:DG) has announced that David P. Rowland will become the new chairman of its board of directors, effective February 4, 2026, succeeding Michael M. Calbert. The transition occurs as the discount retailer has shown strong financial performance, delivering over 105% returns in the past year. Analysts have a mixed but generally positive outlook on the company, with several firms raising price targets due to strategic initiatives like expanded same-day delivery, improved shrink, and growth programs.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/world_news_2_69x52._800x533_L_1419494365.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.941271"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.717545"}]',0.342389,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "DG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.425638"}, {"ticker": "BAC", "relevance_score": "0.586314", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.333782"}, {"ticker": "JPM", "relevance_score": "0.557943", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.318211"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/company-news/dollar-general-appoints-david-rowland-as-new-board-chairman-93CH-4483192", "title": "Dollar General appoints David Rowland as new board chairman", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.941271"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.717545"}], "authors": ["Investing.com"], "summary": "Dollar General (NYSE:DG) has announced that David P. Rowland will become the new chairman of its board of directors, effective February 4, 2026, succeeding M