	 (1047,'alpha_vantage','DG','DG','2026-02-03 21:58:14','20260203T215814','Dollar General Corporation Announces Updates to its Board of Directors','https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260203552107/en/Dollar-General-Corporation-Announces-Updates-to-its-Board-of-Directors','Dollar General Corporation has announced changes to its Board of Directors, with David P. Rowland appointed as the new chairman, succeeding Michael M. Calbert, who will remain an independent director. Additionally, Warren F. Bryant plans to retire from the board after 16 years of service at the expiration of his term in 2026. CEO Todd Vasos expressed gratitude for both Calbert''s leadership and Bryant''s extensive contributions to the company.','https://mms.businesswire.com/media/20260203552107/en/1096717/4/2020_DGLogo_Yellow.jpg','Business Wire','General','Business Wire','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.924826"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.739840"}]',0.254492,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "DG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.275336"}]','{"url": "https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260203552107/en/Dollar-General-Corporation-Announces-Updates-to-its-Board-of-Directors", "title": "Dollar General Corporation Announces Updates to its Board of Directors", "source": "Business Wire", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.924826"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.739840"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Dollar General Corporation has announced changes to its Board of Directors, with David P. Rowland appointed as the new chairman, succeeding Michael M. Calbert, who will remain an independent director. Additionally, Warren F. Bryant plans to retire from the board after 16 years of service at the expiration of his term in 2026. CEO Todd Vasos expressed gratitude for both Calbert''s leadership and Bryant''s extensive contributions to the company.", "banner