	 (1059,'alpha_vantage','TGT','DG','2026-02-03 16:27:23','20260203T162723','Dollar General Bets on Remodels as Its Next Growth Engine','https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/TGT/pressreleases/37386526/dollar-general-bets-on-remodels-as-its-next-growth-engine/','Dollar General is shifting its growth strategy from new store openings to store remodels, particularly through its Project Elevate and Project Renovate programs, which offer attractive returns with lower capital intensity. While new stores remain viable, rising costs make remodels a more efficient way to boost productivity and customer satisfaction. The company plans to prioritize remodels, with approximately 90% of its fiscal 2026 projects dedicated to renovating existing stores.','https://barchart-news-media-prod.aws.barchart.com/SYNDSRC/487af21bb9766d0a7604f15d942498d5/144681.jpg%3Fv%3D1840871139','The Globe and Mail','General','The Globe and Mail','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.939889"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.843733"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.715709"}]',0.116411,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "DG", "relevance_score": "0.991043", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.296905"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.632729", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.101251"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.630425", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.118803"}]','{"url": "https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/TGT/pressreleases/37386526/dollar-general-bets-on-remodels-as-its-next-growth-engine/", "title": "Dollar General Bets on Remodels as Its Next Growth Engine", "source": "The Globe and Mail", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.939889"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.843733"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.715709"}], "authors": ["Zacks Inv