	 (1068,'alpha_vantage','DLTR','DLTR','2026-02-03 19:22:43','20260203T192243','Family of anesthesiologist found dead in Dollar Tree freezer files $50 million suit','https://truecrimenews.com/2026/02/03/family-of-anesthesiologist-found-dead-in-dollar-tree-freezer-files-50-million-suit/','The family of Helen Massiell Garay Sanchez, an anesthesiologist found dead in a Dollar Tree walk-in freezer, has filed a $50 million lawsuit. The suit accuses the store manager of failing to review surveillance footage and the store itself of having a faulty, accessible freezer. Garay Sanchez was a mother of two and worked as an anesthesiologist.','https://tcd-images.akamaized.net/image/50/16by9/2026/02/03/5041587eba14456fb4e45ca2f2c42e90_md.jpg','True Crime News','General','True Crime News','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.841512"}]',-0.600788,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "DLTR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.640338"}]','{"url": "https://truecrimenews.com/2026/02/03/family-of-anesthesiologist-found-dead-in-dollar-tree-freezer-files-50-million-suit/", "title": "Family of anesthesiologist found dead in Dollar Tree freezer files $50 million suit", "source": "True Crime News", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.841512"}], "authors": [], "summary": "The family of Helen Massiell Garay Sanchez, an anesthesiologist found dead in a Dollar Tree walk-in freezer, has filed a $50 million lawsuit. The suit accuses the store manager of failing to review surveillance footage and the store itself of having a faulty, accessible freezer. Garay Sanchez was a mother of two and worked as an anesthesiologist.", "banner_image": "https://tcd-images.akamaized.net/image/50/16by9/2026/02/03/5041587eba14456fb4e45ca2f2c42e90_md.jpg", "source_domain": "True Crime News", "time_published": "20260203T192243", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "DLTR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "B