	 (1069,'alpha_vantage','DLTR','DLTR','2026-02-03 14:42:23','20260203T144223','Dollar Tree (DLTR) Target Price Reduced by Evercore ISI Group','https://www.gurufocus.com/news/8577716/dollar-tree-dltr-target-price-reduced-by-evercore-isi-group-dltr-stock-news','Evercore ISI Group has reduced its target price for Dollar Tree (DLTR) from $165.00 to $160.00, maintaining an "In-Line" rating, which suggests caution despite keeping pace with market sentiment. This adjustment comes amidst several recent analyst updates on DLTR, with other firms like Morgan Stanley and Barclays raising their target prices and ratings. Dollar Tree, founded in 1986, operates nearly 9,000 discount stores and generated over $17 billion in sales in fiscal 2024 through a multi-price strategy.','https://static.gurufocus.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=600,quality=100/logos/0C00000AZT.png?20','GuruFocus','General','GuruFocus','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.801456"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.745095"}]',-0.25779,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "DLTR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.276929"}]','{"url": "https://www.gurufocus.com/news/8577716/dollar-tree-dltr-target-price-reduced-by-evercore-isi-group-dltr-stock-news", "title": "Dollar Tree (DLTR) Target Price Reduced by Evercore ISI Group", "source": "GuruFocus", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.801456"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.745095"}], "authors": ["GuruFocus News"], "summary": "Evercore ISI Group has reduced its target price for Dollar Tree (DLTR) from $165.00 to $160.00, maintaining an \\"In-Line\\" rating, which suggests caution despite keeping pace with market sentiment. This adjustment comes amidst several recent analyst updates on DLTR, with other firms like Morga