	 (1073,'alpha_vantage','EL','EL','2026-02-04 03:27:21','20260204T032721','Hershey (HSY) Reports Earnings Tomorrow: What To Expect','https://finviz.com/news/298593/hershey-hsy-reports-earnings-tomorrow-what-to-expect','Hershey (HSY) is set to report its Q4 earnings this Thursday, with analysts expecting a 3.1% year-on-year revenue increase to $2.98 billion and adjusted earnings of $1.40 per share. The company beat revenue expectations by 2.2% last quarter, and shares have seen positive sentiment, rising 11% in the past month. Investors are looking to see how Hershey performs against a backdrop of mixed results from its shelf-stable food peers.','https://news-assets.stockstory.org/cover-images/_1400x700_crop_center-center_none/hershey-cover-image-785346680229_2023-11-09-170212_wfsz.jpeg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.713070"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.609478"}]',0.215972,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "HSY", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.132134"}, {"ticker": "ADM", "relevance_score": "0.615800", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.346676"}, {"ticker": "EL", "relevance_score": "0.625602", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.127117"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/298593/hershey-hsy-reports-earnings-tomorrow-what-to-expect", "title": "Hershey (HSY) Reports Earnings Tomorrow: What To Expect", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.713070"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.609478"}], "authors": ["Jabin Bastian"], "summary": "Hershey (HSY) is set to report its Q4 earnings this Thursday, with analysts expecting a 3.1% year-on-year revenue increase to $2.98 billion and adjusted earnings