	 (1088,'alpha_vantage','KMB','KMB','2026-02-03 19:02:10','20260203T190210','Why Procter & Gamble stock is rising today while U.S. tech slides','https://ts2.tech/en/why-procter-gamble-stock-is-rising-today-while-u-s-tech-slides/','Procter & Gamble shares rose about 1.6% today, outperforming the U.S. stock market as investors shifted to defensive consumer staples away from sliding tech stocks. This rotation was influenced by concerns over tech valuations, potential disruptions from AI, and a U.S. government shutdown causing data blackouts. P&G is also preparing for its Feb. 17 dividend payment, and big-tech earnings later this week will likely determine if this defensive rotation continues.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/why-procter-gamble-stock-is-rising-today-while-u-s-tech-slides-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.909285"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.807838"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.745250"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.627760"}]',0.094437,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.292029"}, {"ticker": "CL", "relevance_score": "0.703022", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.244729"}, {"ticker": "KMB", "relevance_score": "0.627537", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.186194"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.789759", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.215539"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.627027", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.156720"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/why-procter-gamble-stock-is-rising-today-while-u-s-tech-slides/", "title": "Why Procter & Gamble stock is rising today w