	 (1090,'alpha_vantage','KMB','KMB','2026-02-03 15:58:17','20260203T155817','Earnings call transcript: Graphic Packaging Q4 2025 miss hits stock','https://www.investing.com/news/transcripts/earnings-call-transcript-graphic-packaging-q4-2025-miss-hits-stock-93CH-4482439','Graphic Packaging Holding Company (GPK) reported a Q4 2025 EPS of $0.29, missing the $0.36 forecast by 19.44%, although revenue slightly beat expectations at $2.1 billion against a $2.03 billion forecast. The stock fell 5.41% in pre-market trading, continuing a downward trend. The company plans to focus on debt reduction, operational efficiencies, and innovation to improve performance and generate $700-$800 million in free cash flow for 2026.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/world_news_2_69x52._800x533_L_1419494365.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.836598"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.708120"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.629301"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.628376"}]',-0.069746,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "GPK", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.407817"}, {"ticker": "KMB", "relevance_score": "0.636428", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.316943"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/transcripts/earnings-call-transcript-graphic-packaging-q4-2025-miss-hits-stock-93CH-4482439", "title": "Earnings call transcript: Graphic Packaging Q4 2025 miss hits stock", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.836598"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.708120"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.629301"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.628376"}], "authors": ["Investing.com"], "summa