	 (1091,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-04 10:54:21','20260204T105421','Monster Beverage Corporation $MNST Stock Holdings Decreased by Principal Financial Group Inc.','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-monster-beverage-corporation-mnst-stock-holdings-decreased-by-principal-financial-group-inc-2026-02-04/','Principal Financial Group Inc. reduced its stake in Monster Beverage Corporation by 5.4% in the third quarter of 2025, selling 68,330 shares and now holding 1,192,441 shares valued at approximately $80.26 million. Despite this reduction, Monster''s recent earnings report exceeded expectations with $0.56 EPS against an anticipated $0.48, and revenues of $2.20 billion surpassed estimates of $2.11 billion, marking a 16.8% year-over-year increase. Insider selling also occurred, with 274,981 shares totaling $20.14 million sold in the last quarter, though insiders still retain 7.8% ownership.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/monster-beverage-corp-logo-1200x675.png','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.908443"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.812655"}]',0.026542,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "MNST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.244426"}, {"ticker": "PFG", "relevance_score": "0.830205", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.103787"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.649701", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.127753"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-monster-beverage-corporation-mnst-stock-holdings-decreased-by-principal-financial-group-inc-2026-02-04/", "title": "Monster Beverage Corporation $MNST Stock Holdings Decreased by Principal Financial Group Inc.", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.908443"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.812655"}], "authors": ["Mar