	 (1095,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-04 00:54:01','20260204T005401','How Zico Pitch Shaped Coca-Cola Growth Story And KO Valuation Context','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/food-beverage-tobacco/nyse-ko/coca-cola/news/how-zico-pitch-shaped-coca-cola-growth-story-and-ko-valuatio','This article examines how Coca-Cola''s acquisition of Zico Coconut Water, initiated by an unconventional pitch from Jesse Itzler, showcases the company''s flexible approach to portfolio expansion. The deal highlights how Coca-Cola broadens its non-carbonated beverage offerings through individual dealmakers, influencing its growth strategy and demonstrating to investors how new opportunities are sourced. The analysis also touches on Coca-Cola''s valuation, recent momentum, and key financial considerations for investors.','https://images.ctfassets.net/n07nr2koi959/6YVpCWgrk0c9DenG6UgW8m/d79e37d527c71a95e08b9ce1071ba986/Image_from_iOS.jpg?fit=thumb&w=64&h=64','Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.820207"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.718997"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.632008"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.637806"}]',0.203851,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.330535"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.726957", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.120889"}, {"ticker": "MNST", "relevance_score": "0.600023", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.104645"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/food-beverage-tobacco/nyse-ko/coca-cola/news/how-zico-pitch-shaped-coca-cola-growth-story-and-ko-valuatio", "title": "How Zico Pitch Shaped Coca-Cola Growth Story And KO Valuation Context", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score