	 (1100,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-03 19:26:57','20260203T192657','Coca-Cola FEMSA Strengthens ESG and Workplace Performance','https://mexicobusiness.news/sustainability/news/coca-cola-femsa-strengthens-esg-and-workplace-performance','Coca-Cola FEMSA has announced significant improvements in its ESG and workplace performance, achieving its highest-ever score in the FTSE Russell ESG assessment and maintaining a "B" rating from CDP for Climate and Water. The company also secured the Top Employers™ 2026 certification for Mexico and Latin America, reflecting strong advances in talent management and employee well-being. These achievements highlight Coca-Cola FEMSA''s continued commitment to sustainability, transparent reporting, and fostering a positive work environment.','https://mexicobusiness.news/sites/default/files/2025-06/Sustentability_banner%20%281%29.png','Mexico Business News','General','Mexico Business News','[{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.847374"}]',0.336965,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.719449", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.328859"}]','{"url": "https://mexicobusiness.news/sustainability/news/coca-cola-femsa-strengthens-esg-and-workplace-performance", "title": "Coca-Cola FEMSA Strengthens ESG and Workplace Performance", "source": "Mexico Business News", "topics": [{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.847374"}], "authors": ["Eliza Galeana"], "summary": "Coca-Cola FEMSA has announced significant improvements in its ESG and workplace performance, achieving its highest-ever score in the FTSE Russell ESG assessment and maintaining a \\"B\\" rating from CDP for Climate and Water. The company also secured the Top Employers™ 2026 certification for Mexico and Latin America, reflecting strong advances in talent management and employee well-being. These achieveme