	 (1103,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-03 18:17:40','20260203T181740','In Days, Coca-Cola Announces Its Next Dividend Increase: What Can Investors Expect?','https://finviz.com/news/297914/in-days-coca-cola-announces-its-next-dividend-increase-what-can-investors-expect','Coca-Cola, a Dividend King with 63 consecutive years of dividend increases, is anticipated to announce its 64th hike soon. After a decade of modest dividend growth, new factors like soaring earnings, improved operating margins, and significant share buybacks suggest a potentially substantial, possibly double-digit, increase—the largest since 2007. The article compares recent dividend growth and inflation rates to historical trends, highlighting reasons for a potential resurgence in dividend momentum.','https://g.foolcdn.com/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fg.foolcdn.com%2Feditorial%2Fimages%2F854301%2Fko.jpg&w=700','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.946070"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.936418"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.644289"}]',0.212384,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.489963"}, {"ticker": "NFLX", "relevance_score": "0.569917", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.200877"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.598717", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.229524"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.565582", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.146348"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/297914/in-days-coca-cola-announces-its-next-dividend-increase-what-can-investors-expect", "title": "In Days, Coca-Cola Announces Its Next Dividend Increase: What Can Investors Expect?", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.946070"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_sc