	 (1108,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-03 17:27:46','20260203T172746','Supplier Spotlights: 22nd Century Group, The Coca-Cola Co. & Lula Commerce','https://csnews.com/supplier-spotlights-22nd-century-group-coca-cola-co-lula-commerce','This article highlights new initiatives and partnerships from various c-store suppliers including 22nd Century Group, The Coca-Cola Co., and Lula Commerce. It covers product launches like VLN cigarettes by 22nd Century Group, marketing campaigns such as Coca-Cola''s "Refresh Like a Champion," and funding rounds like Lula Commerce''s $8 million Series A. The report also details strategic partnerships, rebrandings, and new product offerings aimed at capturing consumer interest and driving growth in the convenience retail sector.','https://assets1.csnews.com/images/v/max_width_1440/files/2026-01/vln.png','Convenience Store News','General','Convenience Store News','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.801195"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.741383"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.637872"}]',0.035621,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.334425", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.003490"}]','{"url": "https://csnews.com/supplier-spotlights-22nd-century-group-coca-cola-co-lula-commerce", "title": "Supplier Spotlights: 22nd Century Group, The Coca-Cola Co. & Lula Commerce", "source": "Convenience Store News", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.801195"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.741383"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.637872"}], "authors": [], "summary": "This article highlights new initiatives and partnerships from various c-store suppliers including 22nd Century Group, The Coca-Cola Co., and Lula Commerce. It covers product launches like VLN cigarettes by 22nd Century Group, marketing campaigns such as Coca-Cola''s \\"Refresh Like a Champion,\\" and funding rounds like Lula Com