	 (1109,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-03 16:28:53','20260203T162853','Coca-Cola Consolidated, Inc. (NASDAQ:COKE) Short Interest Up 22.9% in January','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/coca-cola-consolidated-inc-nasdaqcoke-short-interest-up-229-in-january-2026-02-03/','Coca-Cola Consolidated, Inc. (NASDAQ:COKE) experienced a significant 22.9% increase in short interest during January, reaching 1,561,344 shares. Institutional investors like Vanguard Group Inc. and State Street Corp. have substantially increased their holdings in the company. Despite the rise in short interest, the company announced a quarterly dividend of $0.25 per share, and analysts currently have a consensus "Buy" rating on the stock.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/coca-cola-consolidated-inc-logo-1200x675.png?v=20240424114141','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929263"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.837611"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.720054"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.606726"}]',0.17553,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "COKE", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.091898"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.645455", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.310956"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/coca-cola-consolidated-inc-nasdaqcoke-short-interest-up-229-in-january-2026-02-03/", "title": "Coca-Cola Consolidated, Inc. (NASDAQ:COKE) Short Interest Up 22.9% in January", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929263"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.837611"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.720054"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.606726"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Coca-Cola Consolidated, Inc. (NASDAQ:COKE) experienced a significant 22.9% increase