	 (1110,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-03 14:33:14','20260203T143314','Ambani, Blackrock enter India’s wealth advice market','https://www.craincurrency.com/global/ambani-blackrock-enter-indias-wealth-advice-market','Billionaire Mukesh Ambani''s conglomerate and Blackrock Inc. have launched JioBlackRock Investment Advisory, an app-based platform to penetrate India''s rapidly expanding wealth management sector. This initiative, building on their existing mutual funds partnership, aims to cater to India''s vast pool of retail investors with low-cost investment advice, leveraging BlackRock''s Aladdin platform. The venture reflects Ambani''s strategy of entering competitive markets with scalable, lower-priced offerings, mirroring his success in telecommunications and other industries.',NULL,'Crain Currency','General','Crain Currency','[{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.931902"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.804439"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.741017"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.603877"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.642973"}]',0.298989,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "BLK", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.416836"}, {"ticker": "DIS", "relevance_score": "0.713915", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.336813"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.620719", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.247236"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.608381", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.200162"}]','{"url": "https://www.craincurrency.com/global/ambani-blackrock-enter-indias-wealth-advice-market", "title": "Ambani, Blackrock enter India’s wealth advice market", "source": "Crain Currency", "topics": [{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.931902"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_