	 (1113,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-03 12:58:04','20260203T125804','PepsiCo tops estimates, plans to cut U.S. prices on Lay’s, Doritos','https://www.theglobeandmail.com/business/article-pepsico-results-earnings-price-cuts-lays-doritos/','PepsiCo announced plans to cut prices on core snack brands like Lay''s and Doritos by up to 15% in the U.S. following consumer feedback on affordability and previous price hikes. This move comes as the company also reported stronger-than-expected fourth-quarter results and is implementing cost-cutting measures, including reducing product offerings and plant closures. PepsiCo''s strategy aims to address consumer inflation concerns while also improving efficiency, despite analyst predictions of potential near-term earnings per share dilution.','https://www.theglobeandmail.com/resizer/v2/CZWRXUUSKBDTTOMYDIDFGHVL54.JPG?auth=106bcb7eab6c4ec959f43028a22500e0f33b7a4a7eaf24aedddce3f05d2be0b1&width=600&quality=80','The Globe and Mail','General','The Globe and Mail','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.949036"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.827321"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.747446"}]',-0.052144,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.112114"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.730018", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.120584"}, {"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "0.642868", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.147964"}, {"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "0.550989", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.107253"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.590489", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.101838"}]','{"url": "https://www.theglobeandmail.com/business/article-pepsico-results-earnings-price-cuts-lays-doritos/", "title": "PepsiCo tops estimates, plans to cut U