	 (1117,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-04 05:22:59','20260204T052259','What''s taking Kroger so long to name a new CEO?','https://www.cincinnati.com/story/grocery/2026/02/04/kroger-continues-search-for-new-ceo-outside-company/88172072007/','Kroger has been searching for a new CEO for nearly a year following its previous CEO''s abrupt resignation, a process that analysts deem to be dragging. This prolonged search contrasts sharply with the smooth leadership transitions seen at rival retailers like Walmart and Target. The company is actively working with a national search firm to find an external candidate, aiming for a "fresh perspective" and expecting to announce a pick in the first quarter of 2026.','https://www.gannett-cdn.com/authoring/authoring-images/2024/09/10/PCIN/75154248007-kroger-hq-night.jpg?crop=4031,3023,x0,y0?width=320&height=240','Cincinnati Enquirer','General','Cincinnati Enquirer','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.825638"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.626557"}]',0.064272,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.223685"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.738001", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.137277"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.627177", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.116736"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.570300", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.065113"}, {"ticker": "KHC", "relevance_score": "0.580344", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.086903"}]','{"url": "https://www.cincinnati.com/story/grocery/2026/02/04/kroger-continues-search-for-new-ceo-outside-company/88172072007/", "title": "What''s taking Kroger so long to name a new CEO?", "source": "Cincinnati Enquirer", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.825638"}