	 (1128,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-03 20:48:39','20260203T204839','Kroger to close its walk-in health clinics in Georgia','https://www.supermarketnews.com/nonfood-pharmacy/kroger-to-close-its-walk-in-health-clinics-in-georgia','Kroger announced it will be closing all 16 of its "The Little Clinic" walk-in health clinic locations in Georgia, effective April 4. While the clinics are shutting down, the company is encouraging patients to continue using its in-store pharmacies. Kroger did not specify if further clinic closures are planned outside of Georgia.','https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt58a1f8f560a1ab0e/bltb2a7c4ea32574613/69825da3a6134b13a13c2d8a/kroger_exterior-shutterstock-resized_SN.png?width=1280&auto=webp&quality=80&disable=upscale','Supermarket News','General','Supermarket News','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.948750"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.733411"}]',-0.224854,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.188537"}]','{"url": "https://www.supermarketnews.com/nonfood-pharmacy/kroger-to-close-its-walk-in-health-clinics-in-georgia", "title": "Kroger to close its walk-in health clinics in Georgia", "source": "Supermarket News", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.948750"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.733411"}], "authors": ["Heather Lalley"], "summary": "Kroger announced it will be closing all 16 of its \\"The Little Clinic\\" walk-in health clinic locations in Georgia, effective April 4. While the clinics are shutting down, the company is encouraging patients to continue using its in-store pharmacies. Kroger did not specify if further clinic closures are planned outside of Georgia.", "banner_image": "https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt58a1f8f560a1ab0e/bltb2a7c4ea32574613/69825da3a6134b13a13c2d8a/kroger_exterior-shutterstock-resized_SN