	 (1131,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-03 16:20:31','20260203T162031','Kroger doubles down on large-format stores as it chases growth','https://www.grocerydive.com/news/kroger-marketplace-new-locations-indiana-texas-west-virginia-grocery/811010/','Kroger is focusing its growth strategy on expanding its large-format Marketplace stores, which offer an extensive array of general merchandise beyond typical groceries. This move comes as the company seeks to differentiate itself and boost margins after the unsuccessful Albertsons merger attempt. Kroger plans to open new Marketplace locations in Indiana, Texas, and West Virginia over the next two years, despite the significant capital investment required for these larger stores.','https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/idWE2P3NLa7rr5LFw8kYIxYeQ69uy72rm-qqn6suyug/g:ce/rs:fill:1200:675:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9Lcm9nZXJfTWFya2V0cGxhY2VfZXh0ZXJpb3IuanBn.webp','Grocery Dive','General','Grocery Dive','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.914607"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.700341"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.618425"}]',0.418517,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.420303"}]','{"url": "https://www.grocerydive.com/news/kroger-marketplace-new-locations-indiana-texas-west-virginia-grocery/811010/", "title": "Kroger doubles down on large-format stores as it chases growth", "source": "Grocery Dive", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.914607"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.700341"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.618425"}], "authors": ["Sam Silverstein"], "summary": "Kroger is focusing its growth strategy on expanding its large-format Marketplace stores, which offer an extensive array of general merchandise beyond typical groceries. This move comes as the company seeks to differentiate itself and boost margins after the unsuccessful Albertsons merger attempt. Kroger plans to open new Marketplace locations in Indiana, Texas, and West Virginia over the next two years, despite the significant capital investment required for these larger stores.", "banner_image": "https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/idWE2P3NLa7rr5LFw8kYIxYeQ69uy72rm-qqn6suyug/g:ce/rs:fill:1200:675:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9Lcm9nZXJfTWFya2V0cGxhY2VfZXh0ZXJpb3IuanBn.webp", "source_domain": "Grocery Dive", "time_published": "20260203T162031", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.420303"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.418517}','2026-02-04 12:47:17',NULL),
	 (1132,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-03 12:58:04','20260203T125804','PepsiCo tops estimates, plans to cut U.S. prices on Lay’s, Doritos','https://www.theglobeandmail.com/business/article-pepsico-results-earnings-price-cuts-lays-doritos/','PepsiCo announced plans to cut prices on core snack brands like Lay''s and Doritos by up to 15% in the U.S. following consumer feedback on affordability and previous price hikes. This move comes as the company also reported stronger-than-expected fourth-quarter results and is implementing cost-cutting measures, including reducing product offerings and plant closures. PepsiCo''s strategy aims to address consumer inflation concerns while also improving efficiency, despite analyst predictions of potential near-term earnings per share dilution.','https://www.theglobeandmail.com/resizer/v2/CZWRXUUSKBDTTOMYDIDFGHVL54.JPG?auth=106bcb7eab6c4ec959f43028a22500e0f33b7a4a7eaf24aedddce3f05d2be0b1&width=600&quality=80','The Globe and Mail','General','The Globe and Mail','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.924123"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.832533"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.710588"}]',-0.064773,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.108114"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.741106", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.147634"}, {"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "0.649316", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.115214"}, {"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "0.599110", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.129107"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.586680", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.136064"}]','{"url": "https://www.theglobeandmail.com/business/article-pepsico-results-earnings-price-cuts-lays-doritos/", "title": "PepsiCo tops estimates, plans to cut U