strength through steady dividend growth and increased home improvement spending when housing supply is tight. The company has a history of continuous dividend increases since 1961, with a 300%+ payout increase over the last decade.", "banner_image": "https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/28044525/dan-dennis-WEs-6Cwqs4I-unsplash.jpg", "source_domain": "Finviz", "time_published": "20260203T145737", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "LOW", "relevance_score": "0.339176", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.010328"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.04469}','2026-02-04 12:47:23',NULL),
