	 (1142,'alpha_vantage','MDLZ','MDLZ','2026-02-04 05:03:34','20260204T050334','Simply Good Foods Leadership Shifts Versus Depressed Valuation And Profit Pressure','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/food-beverage-tobacco/nasdaq-smpl/simply-good-foods/news/simply-good-foods-leadership-shifts-versus-depressed-valuati','Simply Good Foods (NasdaqCM:SMPL) has announced leadership changes, with Joseph E. Scalzo joining the Board and Christopher J. Bealer, CFO, taking on additional accounting responsibilities following Timothy A. Matthews'' resignation. These shifts come as the company faces a significantly depressed stock valuation, with shares trading at $17.08 and substantial declines over the past one, three, and five years. The article suggests investors closely monitor how the new leadership addresses the weak short-term sentiment, profit margin pressures (down to 6.3% from 10.4% last year), and the stock''s trading position well below analyst targets and fair value.',NULL,'Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.942138"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.829894"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.726875"}]',-0.071786,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "SMPL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.344512"}, {"ticker": "MDLZ", "relevance_score": "0.602247", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.112114"}, {"ticker": "HSY", "relevance_score": "0.600147", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.123154"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/food-beverage-tobacco/nasdaq-smpl/simply-good-foods/news/simply-good-foods-leadership-shifts-versus-depressed-valuati", "title": "Simply Good Foods Leadership Shifts Versus Depressed Valuation And Profit Pressure", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.942138"}, {"topic": "financial_market