	 (1204,'alpha_vantage','PG','PG','2026-02-03 17:22:51','20260203T172251','Why is P&G Renowned as a Successful ''CEO Factory''?','https://businesschief.com/news/why-is-pg-renowned-as-a-successful-ceo-factory','Procter & Gamble (P&G) is known as a "CEO factory" due to its "Build from Within" strategy, which promotes 99% of its senior leaders internally. The company focuses on hiring entry-level talent with long-term potential, providing extensive training and diverse experiences across different roles, brands, and locations. This approach fosters a culture of growth, accountability, and has successfully produced executives who have gone on to lead major global corporations.','https://assets.bizclikmedia.net/138/4e76aa216fa48ac6c3f323c001753331:955399583f1716b30425d24e805b411c/shailesh-jejurikar.webp','Business Chief','General','Business Chief','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.804524"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.704602"}]',0.727896,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.708634"}]','{"url": "https://businesschief.com/news/why-is-pg-renowned-as-a-successful-ceo-factory", "title": "Why is P&G Renowned as a Successful ''CEO Factory''?", "source": "Business Chief", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.804524"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.704602"}], "authors": ["Matt High"], "summary": "Procter & Gamble (P&G) is known as a \\"CEO factory\\" due to its \\"Build from Within\\" strategy, which promotes 99% of its senior leaders internally. The company focuses on hiring entry-level talent with long-term potential, providing extensive training and diverse experiences across different roles, brands, and locations. This approach fosters a culture of growth, accountability, and has successfully produced executives who have gone on to lead major global corporations.", "banner_image": "https://assets.bizclikmedia.net/13