	 (1213,'alpha_vantage','ROST','ROST','2026-02-03 20:18:00','20260203T201800','TJX stock rises as Wall Street tumbles on AI disruption fears — what investors watch next','https://ts2.tech/en/tjx-stock-rises-as-wall-street-tumbles-on-ai-disruption-fears-what-investors-watch-next/','TJX Companies (TJX) stock rose about 1.5% while the broader market declined due to fears that AI could squeeze software and data firm margins. Value-focused retailers like TJX, Walmart, Ross Stores, and Burlington Stores saw gains as investors turned to companies with steady demand. Investors are now looking ahead to TJX''s quarterly update later this month, focusing on comparable sales, inventory levels, markdowns, and freight and wage costs to gauge future performance.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/tjx-stock-rises-as-wall-street-tumbles-on-ai-disruption-fears-what-investors-watch-next-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.918165"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.827063"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.730309"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.645030"}]',0.125314,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TJX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.336264"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.736183", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.339303"}, {"ticker": "ROST", "relevance_score": "0.642583", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.247408"}, {"ticker": "ADBE", "relevance_score": "0.646663", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.304167"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/tjx-stock-rises-as-wall-street-tumbles-on-ai-disruption-fears-what-investors-watch-next/", "title": "TJX stock rises as Wall Street tumbles on AI disruption fears — what investors watch next", "source": "TechStock²", "topics":