	 (1215,'alpha_vantage','SFM','SFM','2026-02-04 00:58:20','20260204T005820','Sprouts Farmers Market opens first store in New York state','https://www.bluebookservices.com/sprouts-farmers-market-opens-first-store-in-new-york-state/','Sprouts Farmers Market has opened its first New York location in Centereach, Long Island, on January 30, 2026. The store features fresh produce sourced from local farmers, a variety of healthy proteins, and numerous wellness products. Sprouts is also investing in the community through a partnership with the Middle Country Library Foundation, donating $325,000 for nutrition education and garden programs.','https://www.bluebookservices.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MicrosoftTeams-image-93.png','www.bluebookservices.com','General','www.bluebookservices.com','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.910233"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.646092"}]',0.487922,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "SFM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.473555"}]','{"url": "https://www.bluebookservices.com/sprouts-farmers-market-opens-first-store-in-new-york-state/", "title": "Sprouts Farmers Market opens first store in New York state", "source": "www.bluebookservices.com", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.910233"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.646092"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Sprouts Farmers Market has opened its first New York location in Centereach, Long Island, on January 30, 2026. The store features fresh produce sourced from local farmers, a variety of healthy proteins, and numerous wellness products. Sprouts is also investing in the community through a partnership with the Middle Country Library Foundation, donating $325,000 for nutrition education and garden programs.", "banner_image": "https://www.bluebookservices.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MicrosoftTeams-image-93.png", "source_domain": "www.bluebookservices.com", "ti