	 (1216,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-04 11:57:11','20260204T115711','Are Wall Street Analysts Predicting Target Stock Will Climb or Sink?','https://www.palmettograin.com/news/story/16178/are-wall-street-analysts-predicting-target-stock-will-climb-or-sink','Target Corporation (TGT) has underperformed the broader market in the past year but has shown strong year-to-date performance. Despite a projected EPS decrease for 2026, the company continues its dividend streak, reinforcing investor confidence. Analyst ratings are mixed with a consensus "Hold," though some foresee significant upside potential.','https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.agricharts.com/sites/1900/Logos/pgbLogo.png','Palmetto Grain Brokerage','General','Palmetto Grain Brokerage','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.909668"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.827605"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.716105"}]',0.133138,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.116635"}]','{"url": "https://www.palmettograin.com/news/story/16178/are-wall-street-analysts-predicting-target-stock-will-climb-or-sink", "title": "Are Wall Street Analysts Predicting Target Stock Will Climb or Sink?", "source": "Palmetto Grain Brokerage", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.909668"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.827605"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.716105"}], "authors": ["Kritika Sarmah"], "summary": "Target Corporation (TGT) has underperformed the broader market in the past year but has shown strong year-to-date performance. Despite a projected EPS decrease for 2026, the company continues its dividend streak, reinforcing investor confidence. Analyst ratings are mixed with a consensus \\"Hold,\\" though some foresee significant upside potential.", "banner_image": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.agricharts.com/sites/1900/Logos/pgbL