	 (1225,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-03 16:28:27','20260203T162827','QVC introduces new beauty, wellness products','https://www.retaildive.com/news/qvc-beauty-wellness-products-turnaround/811109/','QVC is expanding its beauty and wellness offerings with new brands and products, including K18 and Make Time Wellness, signaling these categories as a top priority for 2026. This move comes as the parent company, QVC Group, implements a turnaround strategy amidst a reported 5.6% drop in Q3 revenue year-over-year. The expansion aligns with a broader retail trend of increased focus on beauty and wellness, despite QVC Group''s ongoing financial challenges.','https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/A-oDxn68HiaHooPdnDx3VOo6KAuwrIQU2UMxLDe-thU/g:ce/rs:fill:1200:675:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9RVkMuanBn.webp','Retail Dive','General','Retail Dive','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.839779"}]',0.145222,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "QVCC", "relevance_score": "0.315317", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.031313"}, {"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "0.722690", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.257362"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.606546", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.102655"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.618937", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.140725"}]','{"url": "https://www.retaildive.com/news/qvc-beauty-wellness-products-turnaround/811109/", "title": "QVC introduces new beauty, wellness products", "source": "Retail Dive", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.839779"}], "authors": ["Tatiana Walk-Morris"], "summary": "QVC is expanding its beauty and wellness offerings with new brands and products, including K18 and Make Time Wellness, signaling these cat