	 (1252,'alpha_vantage','TSCO','TSCO','2026-02-03 16:21:13','20260203T162113','EPA: Clean Air Act supports right to repair','https://missoulacurrent.com/epa-right-repair/','The EPA has clarified that the Clean Air Act does not prohibit independent repairs to off-road diesel equipment, overturning manufacturers'' previous interpretations that limited access to repair tools. This clarification, issued in response to a request from John Deere, is expected to save farmers significant costs and reaffirms equipment owners'' right to repair their machinery. It also highlights the Trump administration''s broader efforts to roll back certain environmental regulations and enhance farmers'' autonomy.','https://townsquare.media/site/1098/files/2025/01/attachment-Idaho-agriculture.jpg?w=980&q=75','Missoula Current','General','Missoula Current','[{"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.904963"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.808075"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.740066"}]',0.152753,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "DE", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.445379"}, {"ticker": "CAT", "relevance_score": "0.740003", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.310434"}, {"ticker": "TSCO", "relevance_score": "0.649402", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.224026"}, {"ticker": "F", "relevance_score": "0.558468", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.125431"}, {"ticker": "GM", "relevance_score": "0.563694", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.145703"}]','{"url": "https://missoulacurrent.com/epa-right-repair/", "title": "EPA: Clean Air Act supports right to repair", "source": "Missoula Current", "topics": [{"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.904963"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.808075"}, {"topic": "energy_tra