	 (1253,'alpha_vantage','TSCO','TSCO','2026-02-03 15:03:08','20260203T150308','Recent Report Shows That Rep. April McClain Delaney Sold Up to $210K Worth of Bio-Techne Stock','https://www.benzinga.com/insights/government/26/02/50335816/recent-report-shows-that-rep-april-mcclain-delaney-sold-up-to-210k-worth-of-bio-techne-stock','Representative April McClain Delaney recently filed a sale of Bio-Techne (NASDAQ: TECH) shares, valued between $14,014 and $210,000, with the transaction occurring on January 28, 2026. This sale is part of 163 stock transactions totaling over $387,000 completed by Delaney in the last three years. The article emphasizes the importance of congressional transactions as an investor consideration, noting that the STOCK Act prohibits members of Congress from using private information for personal financial gain.','https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/11/06/insider_trade_2.jpg?quality=85&auto=webp&width=850','Benzinga','General','Benzinga','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.933560"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.844954"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.721845"}]',0.049563,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TECH", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.144518"}, {"ticker": "BRO", "relevance_score": "0.804650", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.132844"}, {"ticker": "TSCO", "relevance_score": "0.736449", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.129679"}, {"ticker": "CPAY", "relevance_score": "0.625834", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.140339"}, {"ticker": "CDW", "relevance_score": "0.623740", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.106700"}]','{"url": "https://www.benzinga.com/insights/government/26/02/50335816/recent-report-shows-that-rep-april-mcclain-delaney-sold-up-to-210k-worth-of-bio-techne-stock", "title": "Rece