	 (1254,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-04 05:04:28','20260204T050428','Ulta Beauty Is Getting In on Sports With Own Athlete Roster','https://wwd.com/beauty-industry-news/beauty-features/ulta-beauty-athletes-roster-dearica-hamby-emma-navarro-1238536758/','Ulta Beauty has launched its "Ulta Beauty Roster," an inaugural collective of six women athletes across various sports and ages. This initiative coincides with National Girls and Women in Sports Day and aims to empower young beauty lovers in sports through social content and on-the-ground activations. Ulta Beauty also introduced a "Roster for Change" grant program to support local sports organizations with funding and guidance from the professional athletes.','https://wwd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Ulta-Beauty-athletes.jpg?w=1000&h=563&crop=1','WWD','General','WWD','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.901929"}]',0.426642,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.420478"}]','{"url": "https://wwd.com/beauty-industry-news/beauty-features/ulta-beauty-athletes-roster-dearica-hamby-emma-navarro-1238536758/", "title": "Ulta Beauty Is Getting In on Sports With Own Athlete Roster", "source": "WWD", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.901929"}], "authors": ["Noor Lobad"], "summary": "Ulta Beauty has launched its \\"Ulta Beauty Roster,\\" an inaugural collective of six women athletes across various sports and ages. This initiative coincides with National Girls and Women in Sports Day and aims to empower young beauty lovers in sports through social content and on-the-ground activations. Ulta Beauty also introduced a \\"Roster for Change\\" grant program to support local sports organizations with funding and guidance from the professional athletes.", "banner_image": "https://wwd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Ulta-Beauty-athletes.jpg?w=1000&h=563&crop=1", "source_domain": "WWD", "time_publ