	 (1255,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-04 05:04:28','20260204T050428','SickScience Debuts at Ulta Beauty','https://wwd.com/beauty-industry-news/skin-care/sickscience-debuts-ulta-beauty-1238536845/','Biotech beauty brand SickScience is launching at Ulta Beauty, both online and in 757 stores, starting in February 2026. The brand, co-founded by Dr. Merve Yildirim and Dr. Polen Koçak, utilizes proprietary NX35TM exosome technology for cellular repair and renewal. This partnership aims to make high-performance biotech beauty more accessible to consumers seeking innovative, clinically backed skincare solutions.','https://wwd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/SickScience-PowerCycle-Exosome-Product-for-Hair-Growth.jpg?w=1000&h=563&crop=1','WWD','General','WWD','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.861155"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.748518"}]',0.407197,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.436106"}]','{"url": "https://wwd.com/beauty-industry-news/skin-care/sickscience-debuts-ulta-beauty-1238536845/", "title": "SickScience Debuts at Ulta Beauty", "source": "WWD", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.861155"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.748518"}], "authors": ["Kathryn Hopkins"], "summary": "Biotech beauty brand SickScience is launching at Ulta Beauty, both online and in 757 stores, starting in February 2026. The brand, co-founded by Dr. Merve Yildirim and Dr. Polen Koçak, utilizes proprietary NX35TM exosome technology for cellular repair and renewal. This partnership aims to make high-performance biotech beauty more accessible to consumers seeking innovative, clinically backed skincare solutions.", "banner_image": "https://wwd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/SickScience-PowerCycle-Exosome-Product-for-Hair-Growth.jpg?w=1000&h=563&crop=1", "source_domain": "WWD", "time_published": "20260204T050428", 