	 (1258,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-03 22:44:29','20260203T224429','Ulta Beauty Opens First UAE Store As Gulf Growth Test Case','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/retail/nasdaq-ulta/ulta-beauty/news/ulta-beauty-opens-first-uae-store-as-gulf-growth-test-case','Ulta Beauty has launched its first store in the United Arab Emirates at Mall of the Emirates, marking its expansion into the Gulf region with plans for additional stores in Dubai and Jeddah. This move introduces Ulta''s specialty beauty format and loyalty-driven model to a new market, aiming to compete with established rivals like Sephora. Investors will monitor the scaling of this concept and its integration with Ulta''s existing operations, considering both the potential for new revenue streams and the execution risks involved.','https://images.ctfassets.net/n07nr2koi959/6YVpCWgrk0c9DenG6UgW8m/d79e37d527c71a95e08b9ce1071ba986/Image_from_iOS.jpg?fit=thumb&w=64&h=64','Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.948811"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.728946"}]',0.32332,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.306657"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/retail/nasdaq-ulta/ulta-beauty/news/ulta-beauty-opens-first-uae-store-as-gulf-growth-test-case", "title": "Ulta Beauty Opens First UAE Store As Gulf Growth Test Case", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.948811"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.728946"}], "authors": ["Simply Wall St", "Bailey Pemberton"], "summary": "Ulta Beauty has launched its first store in the United Arab Emirates at Mall of the Emirates, marking its expansion into the Gulf region with plans for additional stores in Dubai and Jeddah. This move introduces Ulta''s specialty beauty format and loyalty-driven model to a new market, 