	 (1266,'alpha_vantage','URBN','URBN','2026-02-03 16:29:57','20260203T162957','Urban Outfitters Just Released the Cutest Owala Bottle I''ve Ever Seen, And It''s Selling Fast','https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/life/money/a70234600/owala-limited-edition-urban-outfitters/','Urban Outfitters has released an exclusive, vintage-inspired Owala water bottle with a rapidly selling floral and paisley print. The article highlights the Owala FreeSip bottle''s popularity due to its leak-proof design, hidden mouthpiece, and dual sipping functionality, making it a popular gift. The author, a gifts editor, praises its vibrant design and functionality, noting it keeps water cold for hours.','https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/53ac0183-f047-4ffe-98ea-f1e53b773e68.png?crop=0.483xw:0.966xh;0.511xw,0.015xh&resize=640:*','Good Housekeeping','General','Good Housekeeping','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.928172"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.613210"}]',0.428064,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "URBN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.412680"}]','{"url": "https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/life/money/a70234600/owala-limited-edition-urban-outfitters/", "title": "Urban Outfitters Just Released the Cutest Owala Bottle I''ve Ever Seen, And It''s Selling Fast", "source": "Good Housekeeping", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.928172"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.613210"}], "authors": ["Alyssa Gautieri"], "summary": "Urban Outfitters has released an exclusive, vintage-inspired Owala water bottle with a rapidly selling floral and paisley print. The article highlights the Owala FreeSip bottle''s popularity due to its leak-proof design, hidden mouthpiece, and dual sipping functionality, making it a popular gift. The author, a gifts editor, praises its vibrant design and functionality, noting it keeps water cold for hours.", "banner_image": "https://hips.hearsta