	 (1272,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-04 09:58:21','20260204T095821','Walmart Joins Nvidia in the $1 Trillion Club','https://www.inc.com/phil-rosen/stock-market-walmart-wmt-trillion-nvidia-berkshire-economic-ai-boom/91297062','Walmart has joined the exclusive $1 trillion club, with a significant 13.2% gain to start the year pushing its market value past this milestone. This achievement, taking 64 years for the first trillion but only two for the second $500 billion, reflects Wall Street''s re-evaluation of Walmart as a technology-driven enterprise rather than just a traditional retailer. The company''s pivot to an AI-driven logistics giant, implementing machine learning for inventory, pricing, delivery, and customer service, is seen as a key factor in its parabolic growth and validates its strategic transformation.','https://img-cdn.inc.com/image/upload/f_webp,c_fit,w_1920,q_auto/vip/2026/02/walmart-trillion-valuation-inc-2200245958.jpg','Inc.com','General','Inc.com','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.919568"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.810020"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.707236"}]',0.353787,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.406012"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.867610", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.303565"}]','{"url": "https://www.inc.com/phil-rosen/stock-market-walmart-wmt-trillion-nvidia-berkshire-economic-ai-boom/91297062", "title": "Walmart Joins Nvidia in the $1 Trillion Club", "source": "Inc.com", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.919568"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.810020"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.707236"}], "authors": ["PHIL ROSEN"], "summary": "Walmart has joined the exclusive $1 trillion club, with a significant 13.2% gain to start the year pushing its market value past this milestone. This achievement, taking 64 years for the first trillion but only two for the second $500 billion, reflects Wall Street''s re-evaluation of Walmart as a technology-driven enterprise rather than just a traditional retailer. The company''s pivot to an AI-driven logistics giant, implementing machine learning for inventory, pricing, delivery, and customer service, is seen as a key factor in its parabolic growth and validates its strategic transformation.", "banner_image": "https://img-cdn.inc.com/image/upload/f_webp,c_fit,w_1920,q_auto/vip/2026/02/walmart-trillion-valuation-inc-2200245958.jpg", "source_domain": "Inc.com", "time_published": "20260204T095821", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.406012"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.867610", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.303565"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.353787}','2026-02-04 12:48:26',NULL),
	 (1275,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-04 05:35:28','20260204T053528','Jefferies Maintains Buy on Walmart Inc. (WMT) Feb 03, 2026','https://meyka.com/blog/jefferies-maintains-buy-on-walmart-inc-wmt-feb-03-2026-0402/','Jefferies has maintained its Buy rating on Walmart Inc. (WMT) as of February 3, 2026, citing the company''s early branded price investments that enhance its value advantage. While no new price target was announced, the firm believes this strategy supports Walmart''s margins and reinforces investor confidence in its defensive retail position. The market reaction was modest, and this maintained rating signifies ongoing endorsement of Walmart''s strategy without fresh upside from new targets.','https://meyka.com/banner-images/meyka-banner-desktop.png','Meyka','General','Meyka','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.801616"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.724014"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.606588"}]',0.475679,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.482466"}]','{"url": "https://meyka.com/blog/jefferies-maintains-buy-on-walmart-inc-wmt-feb-03-2026-0402/", "title": "Jefferies Maintains Buy on Walmart Inc. (WMT) Feb 03, 2026", "source": "Meyka", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.801616"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.724014"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.606588"}], "authors": ["Danny Kontos"], "summary": "Jefferies has maintained its Buy rating on Walmart Inc. (WMT) as of February 3, 2026, citing the company''s early branded price investments that enhance its value advantage. While no new price target was announced, the firm believes this strategy supports Walmart''s margins and reinforces investor confidence in its defensive retail position. The market reaction was modest, and this maintained rating signifies ongoing endorsement of Walmart''s strategy without fresh upside from new targets.", "banner_image": "https://meyka.com/banner-images/meyka-banner-desktop.png", "source_domain": "Meyka", "time_published": "20260204T053528", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.482466"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.475679}','2026-02-04 12:48:26',NULL),
	 (1278,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-04 03:03:43','20260204T030343','Why Walmart, Verizon, Altria, and Other Safe Dividend Stocks Jumped Today','https://finviz.com/news/298524/why-walmart-verizon-altria-and-other-safe-dividend-stocks-jumped-today','On Tuesday, Walmart, Verizon, and Altria all saw their stock prices rise by roughly 3%, as investors rotated out of volatile tech stocks and into more stable, defensive dividend stocks. Concerns about an AI stock bubble and fluctuating gold and silver prices drove investors to seek reliable income generators. Walmart''s market cap climbed above $1 trillion, Verizon is winning back subscribers, and Altria, despite challenges, continues to pay significant dividends, making these companies attractive during market uncertainty.','https://g.foolcdn.com/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fg.foolcdn.com%2Feditorial%2Fimages%2F854436%2Fcash-gettyimages-qtw8wsjv8tjnctn75tk4xp7k.jpg&w=700','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.936451"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.733348"}]',0.299267,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "MO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.224426"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.940138", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.319617"}, {"ticker": "VZ", "relevance_score": "0.912492", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.347276"}, {"ticker": "NFLX", "relevance_score": "0.639974", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.333753"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.626011", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.317218"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/298524/why-walmart-verizon-altria-and-other-safe-dividend-stocks-jumped-today", "title": "Why Walmart, Verizon, Altria, 