	 (1286,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-03 17:59:25','20260203T175925','Walmart surpasses $1T market cap, joining tech-dominated club','https://www.proactiveinvestors.com/companies/news/1086756/walmart-surpasses-1t-market-cap-joining-tech-dominated-club-1086756.html','Walmart (NYSE:WMT) has achieved a significant financial milestone, with its market capitalization exceeding $1 trillion for the first time. This accomplishment places the retail giant in an exclusive group largely dominated by technology companies. The company''s success is attributed to its ability to maintain low prices through its extensive network and its growing appeal to higher-income shoppers via its online offerings, alongside substantial investments in digital operations.','https://cdn.proactiveinvestors.com/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJwYS1jZG4iLCJrZXkiOiJ1cGxvYWRcL05ld3NcL0ltYWdlXC8yMDI2XzAyXC8yMDIzLTA1LTE4LTA4LTI1LTQzLWY1MmM0MzcyN2FiNzczMzhiNjZmYTdmMTU3ODU4NDUwLmpwZzIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsiZml0IjoiY292ZXIiLCJoZWlnaHQiOjcyMCwid2lkdGgiOjEyODB9fX0=','Proactive financial news','General','Proactive financial news','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.915765"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.842873"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.720768"}]',0.449304,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.407077"}]','{"url": "https://www.proactiveinvestors.com/companies/news/1086756/walmart-surpasses-1t-market-cap-joining-tech-dominated-club-1086756.html", "title": "Walmart surpasses $1T market cap, joining tech-dominated club", "source": "Proactive financial news", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.915765"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.842873"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.720768"}], "authors": ["Emily Jarvie"], "summary": "Walmart (NYSE:WMT) has achieved a significant financial milestone, with its market capi