	 (1290,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-03 15:58:22','20260203T155822','Walmart joins $1 trillion club as tech, frugal shoppers fuel gains','https://www.detroitnews.com/story/business/2026/02/03/walmart-joins-1-trillion-club-as-tech-frugal-shoppers-fuel-gains/88490049007/','Walmart''s market capitalization has surpassed $1 trillion for the first time, driven by its digital transformation, investments in AI, and appeal to a broad range of shoppers. The company''s focus on technology and maintaining low prices has helped it gain market share and attract new, wealthier customers. Despite potential competition, analysts are generally confident about Walmart''s future performance.',NULL,'The Detroit News','General','The Detroit News','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.914923"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.837980"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.719841"}]',0.042155,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.349886", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.010456"}]','{"url": "https://www.detroitnews.com/story/business/2026/02/03/walmart-joins-1-trillion-club-as-tech-frugal-shoppers-fuel-gains/88490049007/", "title": "Walmart joins $1 trillion club as tech, frugal shoppers fuel gains", "source": "The Detroit News", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.914923"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.837980"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.719841"}], "authors": ["Peyton Forte and Jaewon Kang"], "summary": "Walmart''s market capitalization has surpassed $1 trillion for the first time, driven by its digital transformation, investments in AI, and appeal to a broad range of shoppers. The company''s focus on technology and maintaining low prices has helped it gain market share and attract new, wealthier customers. Despi