	 (1291,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-03 15:28:43','20260203T152843','Is Vident U.S. Equity Strategy ETF (VUSE) a Strong ETF Right Now?','https://www.sharewise.com/us/news_articles/Is_Vident_US_Equity_Strategy_ETF_VUSE_a_Strong_ETF_Right_Now_Zacks_20260203_1220','The article evaluates Vident U.S. Equity Strategy ETF (VUSE), a smart beta ETF focusing on the Style Box - All Cap Value category. It highlights VUSE''s structure, expenses, sector exposure, top holdings, and performance, noting its medium risk profile. The article also suggests alternative ETFs like Fidelity High Dividend ETF (FDVV) and iShares Core S&P U.S. Value ETF (IUSV) for investors seeking different risk/cost profiles.','https://www.sharewise.com/assets/news/news7-f5f56cfe8653be9fccdbe05957153806046d0d39c6f95907e86e9b8f150bc307.png','www.sharewise.com','General','www.sharewise.com','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}]',0.152842,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "VUSE", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.243872"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.611082", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.118627"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.641466", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.115623"}, {"ticker": "LLY", "relevance_score": "0.635389", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.109512"}]','{"url": "https://www.sharewise.com/us/news_articles/Is_Vident_US_Equity_Strategy_ETF_VUSE_a_Strong_ETF_Right_Now_Zacks_20260203_1220", "title": "Is Vident U.S. Equity Strategy ETF (VUSE) a Strong ETF Right Now?", "source": "www.sharewise.com", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}], "authors": ["Zacks"], "summary": "The article evaluates Vident U.S. Equity Strategy ETF (VUSE), a smart beta ETF focusing on the Style Box - All Cap Value category. It highlights VUSE''s structure, expen