	 (1292,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-03 14:16:42','20260203T141642','McDonald''s (MCD) Business Model Drives Resilience Across Market Cycles','https://finviz.com/news/297310/mcdonalds-mcd-business-model-drives-resilience-across-market-cycles','McDonald''s (MCD) demonstrates strong resilience due to its robust business model, centered around franchising. Despite consumer spending pressures impacting the restaurant industry, McDonald''s posted solid comparable sales growth and systemwide sales increases in Q3 2025. The company raised its dividend for the 49th straight year, positioning it to become a Dividend King in 2026, largely thanks to its highly franchised operations which insulate it from market volatility and drive higher margins.','https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/20144220/MCD-insidermonkey-1695235338663.jpg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.922227"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.876015"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.798748"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.741756"}]',0.127468,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "MCD", "relevance_score": "0.940298", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.349442"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.609457", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.065843"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/297310/mcdonalds-mcd-business-model-drives-resilience-across-market-cycles", "title": "McDonald''s (MCD) Business Model Drives Resilience Across Market Cycles", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.922227"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.876015"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.798748"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.741756"}], "authors": ["Vardah Gill"], "summary": "McDonald''s (MCD) demonstrates strong resilience due to its robust busi