	 (1312,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 06:29:34','20260205T062934','Transcat (TRNS) Quarterly Loss Challenges Bullish Earnings Growth Narratives','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/capital-goods/nasdaq-trns/transcat/news/transcat-trns-quarterly-loss-challenges-bullish-earnings-gro','Transcat (TRNS) reported a Q3 2026 loss of US$0.12 EPS and US$1.1 million net loss, despite revenue growth to US$83.9 million. While the company still shows a profit over the trailing twelve months, the quarterly loss and compressed net profit margin of 2.5% challenge bullish earnings growth forecasts of 26.2% annually. The stock''s high P/E of 83.5x and a DCF fair value significantly below the current price suggest a rich valuation, prompting investors to scrutinize future profitability and growth execution.',NULL,'Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.920042"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.800729"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.727189"}]',0.04343,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TRNS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.322951"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.632100", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.125664"}, {"ticker": "AMD", "relevance_score": "0.643339", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.136930"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.637044", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.118448"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/capital-goods/nasdaq-trns/transcat/news/transcat-trns-quarterly-loss-challenges-bullish-earnings-gro", "title": "Transcat (TRNS) Quarterly Loss Challenges Bullish Earnings Growth Narratives", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.920042"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.800729"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_