	 (1320,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 00:00:09','20260205T000009','Radware Unveils Agentic AI Protection Solution to Shield Enterprises from New Agentic Threats','https://itwire.com/business-it-news/data/radware-unveils-agentic-ai-protection-solution-to-shield-enterprises-from-new-agentic-threats.html','Radware has launched its Agentic AI Protection Solution, expanding its platform into the AI security market. This solution is designed to protect autonomous AI agents from new threats like direct and indirect prompt injection attacks, tool abuse, and unauthorized data access. It leverages proprietary behavioral analysis to identify malicious intent in real-time, distinguishing it from traditional software-based guardrails, and comes after Radware''s discovery of the "ZombieAgent" vulnerability.','https://itwire.com/media/k2/items/cache/52b58c33d042771b986892b8475e1ff3_M.jpg','iTWire','General','iTWire','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.925665"}]',0.238142,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "RDWR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.458810"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.605401", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.204137"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.574721", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.105140"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.557061", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.105502"}]','{"url": "https://itwire.com/business-it-news/data/radware-unveils-agentic-ai-protection-solution-to-shield-enterprises-from-new-agentic-threats.html", "title": "Radware Unveils Agentic AI Protection Solution to Shield Enterprises from New Agentic Threats", "source": "iTWire", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.925665"}], "authors": ["Radware"], "summary": "Radware has launched its Agentic AI Protection Solution, expanding its platform into th