	 (1327,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-04 20:29:32','20260204T202932','Jim Cramer on Wells Fargo: “That’s a Winner”','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/jim-cramer-on-wells-fargo-thats-a-winner-1688919/','Jim Cramer has expressed a bullish view on Wells Fargo & Company (NYSE: WFC), identifying it as a "winner" for its adoption of AI technology to enhance efficiency. He highlighted the company''s hire of a technologist from Amazon Web Services to help bankers find savings, noting that banks, particularly Wells Fargo, are well-positioned to benefit from AI advancements beyond just chip producers. Cramer stated that Wells Fargo is a key holding for his Charitable Trust due to its strong approach to implementing AI for efficiency.','https://imonkey-blog.imgix.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/03065534/erol-ahmed-ln8zRaM3VmI-unsplash.jpg?auto=format&fit=clip&expires=1801699200&width=480&height=320','Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.906274"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.823783"}]',0.496322,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "WFC", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.646805"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.633289", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.302468"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/jim-cramer-on-wells-fargo-thats-a-winner-1688919/", "title": "Jim Cramer on Wells Fargo: “That’s a Winner”", "source": "Insider Monkey", "topics": [{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.906274"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.823783"}], "authors": ["Syeda Seirut Javed"], "summary": "Jim Cramer has expressed a bullish view on Wells Fargo & Company (NYSE: WFC), identifying it as a \\"winner\\" for its adoption of AI technology to enhance efficiency. He highlighted the company''s hire of a technologist from Amazon Web Services to help bankers find savings, noting that banks, 