	 (1328,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-04 20:28:36','20260204T202836','AI security worries stall enterprise production deployments','https://www.techtarget.com/searchitoperations/news/366638794/AI-security-worries-stall-enterprise-production-deployments','Enterprise AI adoption is being significantly hindered by security concerns, as highlighted by executives from Cisco, OpenAI, and AWS, and a Black Duck report. There''s a growing "trust deficit" in AI, leading to slower production deployments despite rapid technological advancements. Experts emphasize the need for new security paradigms, data access controls, and a shift towards making security a prerequisite rather than an afterthought for AI systems.','https://www.techtarget.com/rms/onlineimages/security_a296619547_searchsitetablet_520X173.jpg','TechTarget','General','TechTarget','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.922203"}]',-0.10001,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TTGT", "relevance_score": "0.313379", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.011993"}, {"ticker": "CSCO", "relevance_score": "0.962719", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.247865"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.696500", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.105716"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.617583", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.116600"}, {"ticker": "NOW", "relevance_score": "0.550132", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.013732"}]','{"url": "https://www.techtarget.com/searchitoperations/news/366638794/AI-security-worries-stall-enterprise-production-deployments", "title": "AI security worries stall enterprise production deployments", "source": "TechTarget", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.922203"}], "authors": ["Beth Pariseau"], "summary": "Enterprise AI adoption is being significantly hindered by security concerns, as highli