	 (1329,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-04 19:26:42','20260204T192642','New Walmart CEO is not afraid to take risks, analyst says','https://www.winsightgrocerybusiness.com/grocery-operations/new-walmart-ceo-is-not-afraid-to-take-risks-analyst-says','John Furner, the new CEO of Walmart, is described by analyst Oliver Chen as a leader with a higher appetite for risk than his predecessor, a necessary trait in a technology-driven environment. Furner plans to spend his initial weeks visiting stores and facilities, engaging directly with employees to understand their challenges. This approach reinforces the company''s commitment to innovation and improving operations, as it navigates challenges from competitors like Amazon in both grocery and pharmacy sectors.','https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt58a1f8f560a1ab0e/blt486895568016e27b/69839bce195be44d116a895f/Walmart_CEO_John_Furner_greets_Walmart_workers_.png?width=1280&auto=webp&quality=80&disable=upscale','Supermarket News','General','Supermarket News','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.914505"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.718810"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.614997"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.610701"}]',0.151549,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.418825"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.749422", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.136789"}]','{"url": "https://www.winsightgrocerybusiness.com/grocery-operations/new-walmart-ceo-is-not-afraid-to-take-risks-analyst-says", "title": "New Walmart CEO is not afraid to take risks, analyst says", "source": "Supermarket News", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.914505"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.718810"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.614997"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_sco