	 (1331,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-04 17:54:29','20260204T175429','Amazon expands access to digital assistant Alexa+','https://www.proactiveinvestors.com/companies/news/1086838/amazon-expands-access-to-digital-assistant-alexa-1086838.html','Amazon has expanded access to its AI-upgraded digital assistant, Alexa+, to all US users, nearly a year after its early access launch. The service is designed to handle various tasks like managing calendars, booking reservations, and controlling smart home devices. Alexa+ is available on Alexa-enabled devices, the Alexa app, and web browsers, with free access for Prime members or a monthly subscription for non-members, and has seen high engagement during its preview.','https://cdn.proactiveinvestors.com/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJwYS1jZG4iLCJrZXkiOiJ1cGxvYWRcL05ld3NcL0ltYWdlXC8yMDI2XzAyXC8yMDI0LTA1LTIyLTExLTQ2LTUzLWJkODUzMDAyOGY1NzhlYWY1ZDAyOGE1NGY2ODdjMmJmLmpwZyIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6MTI4MCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo3MjAsImZpdCI6ImNvdmVyIn19fQ==','Proactive financial news','General','Proactive financial news','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.844310"}]',0.549912,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.511618"}]','{"url": "https://www.proactiveinvestors.com/companies/news/1086838/amazon-expands-access-to-digital-assistant-alexa-1086838.html", "title": "Amazon expands access to digital assistant Alexa+", "source": "Proactive financial news", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.844310"}], "authors": ["Emily Jarvie"], "summary": "Amazon has expanded access to its AI-upgraded digital assistant, Alexa+, to all US users, nearly a year after its early access launch. The service is designed to handle various tasks like managing calendars, booking reservations, and controlling smart home devices