	 (1332,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-04 16:42:00','20260204T164200','SpaceX rivals AST SpaceMobile and Rocket Lab join space-stock selloff','https://www.marketwatch.com/story/spacex-rivals-ast-spacemobile-and-rocket-lab-join-space-stock-selloff-ace22a17?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqfTc1KAaQ4d-I0ok38jA4ODURdFJzSBXfCDj21C0W239njM5IU7mMIf&gaa_ts=698449f0&gaa_sig=AZqmPl3Bn16cI6zUDxY1MQjZykf21wnB6YF_3UmQ5VB7tgqnFHfVhyejGGkisuo7NqE7GMHKbrCz649yrQ4LfA%3D%3D','SpaceX rivals AST SpaceMobile and Rocket Lab are experiencing a significant selloff in their stock prices this week. An analyst suggests these losses might be partly connected to a broader software industry rout. AST SpaceMobile saw its shares drop over 10% after AT&T partnered with Amazon Web Services and Amazon''s satellite-internet business.','https://images.mktw.net/im-33499477?width=1260&height=673','MarketWatch','General','MarketWatch','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.930628"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.801495"}]',-0.198694,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "RKLB", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.478206"}, {"ticker": "T", "relevance_score": "0.730469", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.186117"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.608070", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.081556"}, {"ticker": "VZ", "relevance_score": "0.595081", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.053922"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketwatch.com/story/spacex-rivals-ast-spacemobile-and-rocket-lab-join-space-stock-selloff-ace22a17?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqfTc1KAaQ4d-I0ok38jA4ODURdFJzSBXfCDj21C0W239njM5IU7mMIf&gaa_ts=698449f0&gaa_sig=AZqmPl3Bn16cI6zUDxY1MQjZykf21wnB6YF_3UmQ5VB7tgqnFHfVhyejGGkisuo7NqE7GMHKbrCz649yrQ4LfA%3D%3D", "title": "SpaceX rivals AST SpaceMobile and Rocket Lab join space-stock selloff", "source": "MarketWatch"