	 (1333,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-04 16:24:00','20260204T162400','Freedom Holding plans to acquire another bank and marketplace in Kazakhstan','https://kz.kursiv.media/en/2026-02-04/engk-tank-freedom-holding-plans-to-acquire-another-bank-and-marketplace-in-kazakhstan/','Freedom Holding Corp. CEO Timur Turlov announced plans to acquire another bank and a local marketplace in Kazakhstan, as well as a second-tier bank in Turkey. The company is considering issuing up to $500 million in bonds to finance these acquisitions and also plans to expand its SuperApp into a digital ecosystem in the U.S. Additionally, Freedom Holding aims to raise an extra $200-300 million for technology investments, including a sovereign AI hub with Nvidia.','https://cdn-kz.kursiv.media/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/8.jpg-1024x576.jpeg','Kursiv Media','General','Kursiv Media','[{"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.929396"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.847152"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.726882"}]',0.354402,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "FRHC", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.426774"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.634943", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.327378"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.613721", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.326112"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.630529", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.318634"}]','{"url": "https://kz.kursiv.media/en/2026-02-04/engk-tank-freedom-holding-plans-to-acquire-another-bank-and-marketplace-in-kazakhstan/", "title": "Freedom Holding plans to acquire another bank and marketplace in Kazakhstan", "source": "Kursiv Media", "topics": [{"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": 