	 (1336,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-04 15:58:16','20260204T155816','What’s up with… Amdocs, AT&T & AWS, MásOrange & Starlink','https://www.telecomtv.com/content/digital-platforms-services/what-s-up-with-amdocs-at-t-aws-m-sorange-starlink-54785/','Amdocs has announced Shimie Hortig as its new CEO, effective March 31, 2026. AT&T is expanding its strategic agreements with Amazon Web Services and satellite operator Amazon Leo to migrate workloads and extend broadband services. Meanwhile, MásOrange in Spain is partnering with Starlink to conduct the country''s first direct-to-cell service pilot in Valladolid.','https://assets.telecomtv.com/assets/telecomtv/amdocs-new-ceo-shimie-hortig-source-amdocs-21726.jpeg?w=896&h=504&crop=auto','TelecomTV','General','TelecomTV','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.824882"}]',0.255143,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "DOX", "relevance_score": "0.974661", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.413785"}, {"ticker": "T", "relevance_score": "0.809577", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.314338"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.700977", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.288461"}, {"ticker": "KKR", "relevance_score": "0.613428", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.134490"}, {"ticker": "DELL", "relevance_score": "0.573231", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.131386"}]','{"url": "https://www.telecomtv.com/content/digital-platforms-services/what-s-up-with-amdocs-at-t-aws-m-sorange-starlink-54785/", "title": "What’s up with… Amdocs, AT&T & AWS, MásOrange & Starlink", "source": "TelecomTV", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.824882"}], "authors": ["The staff", "TelecomTV"], "summary": "Amdocs has announced Shimie Hortig as its new CEO, effective March 31, 2026. AT&T is expanding its strategic agreements with Amazon Web Services