	 (1337,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-04 15:41:00','20260204T154100','Amazon stock price today: AMZN edges lower before earnings as AWS flags power delays','https://ts2.tech/en/amazon-stock-price-today-amzn-edges-lower-before-earnings-as-aws-flags-power-delays/','Amazon shares saw a slight dip ahead of its quarterly earnings report, with investors closely watching the performance of AWS, particularly after its head of energy markets noted power grid connection delays in Europe. The company is also expanding its physical grocery presence to cut "last-mile" delivery costs, even as a broader market mixed sentiment and potential disappointment in AWS growth pose risks to the stock.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/amazon-stock-price-today-amzn-edges-lower-before-earnings-as-aws-flags-power-delays-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.946507"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.940443"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.817497"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.742623"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.610756"}]',-0.181447,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.203733"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.633467", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.105203"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.635990", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.139393"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/amazon-stock-price-today-amzn-edges-lower-before-earnings-as-aws-flags-power-delays/", "title": "Amazon stock price today: AMZN edges lower before earnings as AWS flags power delays", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.946507"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.940443"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_sco