	 (1338,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-04 15:27:40','20260204T152740','GOOG stock price drops as Alphabet earnings loom and DOJ appeal adds fresh antitrust risk','https://ts2.tech/en/goog-stock-price-drops-as-alphabet-earnings-loom-and-doj-appeal-adds-fresh-antitrust-risk/','Alphabet Inc.''s stock (GOOG) dropped ahead of its Q4 earnings report, with investors concerned about the impact of the latest AI surge on software and data-analytics stocks, alongside a fresh antitrust appeal from the U.S. government. The company''s earnings call is expected to focus on AI deployments and data center spending, with analysts anticipating EPS near $2.63 on revenue of roughly $111.3 billion. Concerns also stem from a recent judge''s ruling on Google''s monopoly in search, which will be appealed by the DOJ, adding to market jitters.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/goog-stock-price-drops-as-alphabet-earnings-loom-and-doj-appeal-adds-fresh-antitrust-risk-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.922428"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.903619"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.846744"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.627753"}]',-0.233291,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.412815"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.866490", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.401311"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.643917", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.117073"}, {"ticker": "AAPL", "relevance_score": "0.555292", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.103782"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.572207", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.273593"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/goog-stock-price-drops-as-alphabet-e