	 (1339,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-04 14:59:54','20260204T145954','The Sound of Money: How Spotify Turned Audio Into Profit Power','https://finviz.com/news/299307/the-sound-of-money-how-spotify-turned-audio-into-profit-power','Spotify (NYSE: SPOT) is proving to be a dominant force in the audio entertainment sector, successfully decoupling its financial performance from the struggles of video streaming services. While its stock has seen a recent dip, Spotify''s shift to a variable-cost model, expanding margins, and strategic bundling of music, podcasts, and audiobooks are driving strong profitability. The company''s unique position as a utility, coupled with minimal churn after price increases and a savvy approach to video content through partnerships, indicates a robust long-term growth trajectory amidst short-term market fluctuations.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/articles/med_20260203125620_the-sound-of-money-how-spotify-turned-audio-into-p.png','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.939236"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.806827"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.720861"}]',0.175701,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "SPOT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.423670"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.702205", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.115368"}, {"ticker": "NFLX", "relevance_score": "0.640865", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.119955"}, {"ticker": "DIS", "relevance_score": "0.629339", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.121218"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/299307/the-sound-of-money-how-spotify-turned-audio-into-profit-power", "title": "The Sound of Money: How Spotify Turned Audio Into Profit Power", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.939236"}, {"topic": "financi