	 (1340,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-04 14:41:16','20260204T144116','Alphabet Q4 2025 preview. Is the pace of AI monetization sustainable?','https://www.xtb.com/int/market-analysis/news-and-research/alphabet-q4-2025-preview-is-the-pace-of-ai-monetization-sustainable','This article previews Alphabet''s Q4 2025 earnings, focusing on whether the company can maintain its AI monetization pace and cloud growth. Key areas of investor scrutiny include the efficacy of AI products like Gemini, the sustained expansion of Google Cloud and YouTube, and the management of rising infrastructure costs. The report emphasizes that the upcoming results will test the quality and sustainability of Alphabet''s strategic investments in AI and cloud computing against high market expectations.','https://xtb.scdn5.secure.raxcdn.com/postTopImage/0104/15/5d6cdecc-27a3-4494-8e3c-8980ed05788a/postTopImage_front/google.png','XTB.com','General','XTB.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.941290"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.810444"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.748506"}]',0.158469,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.256838"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.707858", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.278805"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.641197", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.125361"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.594844", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.108178"}, {"ticker": "AAPL", "relevance_score": "0.551222", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.075789"}]','{"url": "https://www.xtb.com/int/market-analysis/news-and-research/alphabet-q4-2025-preview-is-the-pace-of-ai-monetization-sustainable", "title": "Alphabet Q4 2025 preview. Is the pace of AI moneti