	 (1342,'alpha_vantage','BABA','BABA','2026-02-05 06:29:42','20260205T062942','Guohai Securities Sticks to Its Buy Rating for Alibaba Group Holding Ltd. (9988)','https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/BABA/pressreleases/35409/guohai-securities-sticks-to-its-buy-rating-for-alibaba-group-holding-ltd-9988/','Guohai Securities has maintained a Buy rating for Alibaba Group Holding Ltd. (9988) with a price target of HK$187.00. This comes as Alibaba reported a quarterly revenue of HK$247.65 billion and a net profit of HK$40.65 billion, showing growth from the previous year. While TipRanks – OpenAI’s OpenAI Consumer Cyclical HK also issued a Buy rating, TipRanks – xAI reiterated a Hold rating for the company.',NULL,'The Globe and Mail','General','The Globe and Mail','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.916668"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.908869"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.828818"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.706767"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.609432"}]',0.16592,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "BABA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.436122"}, {"ticker": "DIS", "relevance_score": "0.561877", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.128185"}]','{"url": "https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/BABA/pressreleases/35409/guohai-securities-sticks-to-its-buy-rating-for-alibaba-group-holding-ltd-9988/", "title": "Guohai Securities Sticks to Its Buy Rating for Alibaba Group Holding Ltd. (9988)", "source": "The Globe and Mail", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.916668"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.908869"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.828818"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.706767"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.609432"}], "authors": ["Tipranks"], "summary": "Guoha