	 (1345,'alpha_vantage','BABA','BABA','2026-02-04 21:29:11','20260204T212911','From chatbots to replays: Alibaba rolls out AI suite for 2026 Winter Olympics','https://www.scmp.com/tech/big-tech/article/3342418/chatbots-replays-alibaba-rolls-out-ai-suite-2026-winter-olympics','Alibaba Cloud has introduced a new suite of AI tools, including its Qwen large language model, for the 2026 Milano Cortina Winter Games. This marks the first time an LLM will be integrated into the Olympics'' digital infrastructure, providing AI assistants for fan engagement and internal operations. The initiative aims to accelerate the overseas adoption of Alibaba Cloud''s Qwen model.','https://cdn.i-scmp.com/sites/default/files/styles/1020x680/public/d8/images/canvas/2026/02/04/23d02128-f21b-4da8-8389-eb88fd24fb58_54f9d383.jpg?itok=Tvog9GNO&v=1770216071','South China Morning Post','General','South China Morning Post','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}]',0.50787,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "BABA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.515359"}]','{"url": "https://www.scmp.com/tech/big-tech/article/3342418/chatbots-replays-alibaba-rolls-out-ai-suite-2026-winter-olympics", "title": "From chatbots to replays: Alibaba rolls out AI suite for 2026 Winter Olympics", "source": "South China Morning Post", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}], "authors": ["Ann Cao"], "summary": "Alibaba Cloud has introduced a new suite of AI tools, including its Qwen large language model, for the 2026 Milano Cortina Winter Games. This marks the first time an LLM will be integrated into the Olympics'' digital infrastructure, providing AI assistants for fan engagement and internal operations. The initiative aims to accelerate the overseas adoption of Alibaba Cloud''s Qwen model.", "banner_image": "https://cdn.i-scmp.com/sites/default/files/styles/1020x680/public/d8/images/canvas/2026/02/04/23d02128-f21b-4da8-8389-eb88