	 (1351,'alpha_vantage','BIRK','BIRK','2026-02-05 12:25:53','20260205T122553','New York State Common Retirement Fund Increases Holdings in Birkenstock Holding PLC $BIRK','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-new-york-state-common-retirement-fund-increases-holdings-in-birkenstock-holding-plc-birk-2026-02-05/','The New York State Common Retirement Fund increased its stake in Birkenstock Holding PLC (NYSE:BIRK) by 26.3% in the third quarter, bringing its total ownership to 154,178 shares valued at approximately $6.98 million. This increase comes as Birkenstock reported strong quarterly earnings, exceeding analyst expectations with $0.60 EPS versus an estimated $0.40, and a revenue of $617.7 million, a 15.5% increase. The company currently holds a "Moderate Buy" analyst consensus with an average price target of $60.18.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/birkenstock-holding-limited-logo-1200x675.png?v=20231025071239','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.908491"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.830000"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.743641"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.631136"}]',0.330336,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "BIRK", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.331483"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-new-york-state-common-retirement-fund-increases-holdings-in-birkenstock-holding-plc-birk-2026-02-05/", "title": "New York State Common Retirement Fund Increases Holdings in Birkenstock Holding PLC $BIRK", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.908491"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.830000"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.743641"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.631136"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "The New York State Common Retirement Fund increased its stake in Birkenstock Holding PLC (NYSE:BIRK) by 26.3% in the third quarter, bringing its total ownership to 154,178 shares valued at approximately $6.98 million. This increase comes as Birkenstock reported strong quarterly earnings, exceeding analyst expectations with $0.60 EPS versus an estimated $0.40, and a revenue of $617.7 million, a 15.5% increase. The company currently holds a \\"Moderate Buy\\" analyst consensus with an average price target of $60.18.", "banner_image": "https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/birkenstock-holding-limited-logo-1200x675.png?v=20231025071239", "source_domain": "MarketBeat", "time_published": "20260205T122553", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "BIRK", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.331483"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.330336}','2026-02-05 14:04:35',NULL),
	 (1352,'alpha_vantage','BURL','BURL','2026-02-04 17:28:53','20260204T172853','‘Off-price retailer’ to open store in weeks after scooping up 45 Joann spots','https://www.the-sun.com/money/15890826/burlington-bakersfield-california-store-opening-joann/','Burlington, an off-price retailer, is set to open a new store in Bakersfield, California, marking its 124th location in the state. This expansion is part of the company''s plan to open at least 110 new stores in 2026, leveraging leases from 45 former Joann locations. Joann Fabrics and Crafts closed all of its stores by May 2025 after filing for bankruptcy twice, and other retailers like Goodwill and Michael''s have also acquired Joann leases.','https://www.the-sun.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/02/newspress-collage-35ex1s29v-1770226156091.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&1770208173','The Sun','General','The Sun','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.925616"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.705753"}]',0.528917,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "BURL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.529295"}]','{"url": "https://www.the-sun.com/money/15890826/burlington-bakersfield-california-store-opening-joann/", "title": "‘Off-price retailer’ to open store in weeks after scooping up 45 Joann spots", "source": "The Sun", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.925616"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.705753"}], "authors": ["James Evenden"], "summary": "Burlington, an off-price retailer, is set to open a new store in Bakersfield, California, marking its 124th location in the state. This expansion is part of the company''s plan to open at least 110 new stores in 2026, leveraging leases from 45 former Joann locations. Joann Fabrics and Crafts closed all of its stores by May 2025 after filing for bankruptcy twice, and other retailers like Goodwill and Michael''s have also acquired Joann leases.", "banner_image": "http