	 (1363,'alpha_vantage','CL','CL','2026-02-04 20:51:24','20260204T205124','NLPC Reaches Deals w/ American Express, Deere to Eliminate DEI for Board Candidates','https://nlpc.org/corporate-integrity-project/nlpc-reaches-deals-w-american-express-deere-to-eliminate-dei-for-board-candidates/','The National Legal and Policy Center (NLPC) successfully negotiated with American Express and Deere & Company to remove Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion (DEI) criteria from their board candidate selection processes. The NLPC had submitted shareholder proposals to address DEI concerns, particularly regarding board composition, after noticing that DEI requirements persisted for board candidates despite being largely removed from executive compensation incentives at most companies they invest in. Both companies agreed to eliminate the contentious DEI language, leading NLPC to withdraw its proposals.','https://nlpc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Amex-Deere-no-board-DEI-Grok-1080x675.jpg','National Legal and Policy Center','General','National Legal and Policy Center','[{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.831090"}]',0.206431,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AXP", "relevance_score": "0.948907", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.307463"}, {"ticker": "DE", "relevance_score": "0.869661", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.337453"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.612637", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.118714"}, {"ticker": "CL", "relevance_score": "0.624799", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.144231"}]','{"url": "https://nlpc.org/corporate-integrity-project/nlpc-reaches-deals-w-american-express-deere-to-eliminate-dei-for-board-candidates/", "title": "NLPC Reaches Deals w/ American Express, Deere to Eliminate DEI for Board Candidates", "source": "National Legal and Policy Center", "topics": [{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "