	 (1371,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-05 10:29:46','20260205T102946','The Clorox Company $CLX Stake Lifted by Ashton Thomas Private Wealth LLC','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-the-clorox-company-clx-stake-lifted-by-ashton-thomas-private-wealth-llc-2026-02-05/','Ashton Thomas Private Wealth LLC significantly increased its stake in The Clorox Company (CLX) by 312.8% during Q3, now holding 37,980 shares valued at approximately $4.683 million. This increase occurred despite Clorox reporting an EPS miss and management warning of margin headwinds, leading to a consensus analyst rating of "Reduce" with a $117 target. The company declared a quarterly dividend of $1.24, reflecting a 4.2% yield.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/the-clorox-company-logo-1200x675.png?v=20250505090624','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.903983"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.802883"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.730720"}]',-0.224375,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.208698"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-the-clorox-company-clx-stake-lifted-by-ashton-thomas-private-wealth-llc-2026-02-05/", "title": "The Clorox Company $CLX Stake Lifted by Ashton Thomas Private Wealth LLC", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.903983"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.802883"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.730720"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Ashton Thomas Private Wealth LLC significantly increased its stake in The Clorox Company (CLX) by 312.8% during Q3, now holding 37,980 shares valued at approximately $4.683 million. This increase occurred despite Clorox reporting an EPS miss and management warning of margin headwinds, leading to a consensus analyst rating of \\"Reduce\\"