	 (1374,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-04 20:27:19','20260204T202719','Clorox completes $580 million ERP overhaul to link operations with digital commerce','https://www.digitalcommerce360.com/2026/02/04/clorox-completes-580-million-erp-overhaul/amp/','Clorox has completed a five-year, $580 million rollout of a new SAP enterprise resource planning (ERP) system across the U.S. and Canada. This cloud-based system replaces a 20-year-old platform, aiming to connect finance, supply chain, sales, and planning with shared, real-time data. The overhaul is intended to improve demand forecasting, production planning, order fulfillment, and supplier collaboration, directly impacting its retail, e-commerce, and omnichannel operations.','https://www.digitalcommerce360.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/AdobeStock_461597447_Editorial_Use_Only-1024x683.jpeg','Digital Commerce 360','General','Digital Commerce 360','[{"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.846272"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.835356"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.707929"}]',0.413765,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.417464"}]','{"url": "https://www.digitalcommerce360.com/2026/02/04/clorox-completes-580-million-erp-overhaul/amp/", "title": "Clorox completes $580 million ERP overhaul to link operations with digital commerce", "source": "Digital Commerce 360", "topics": [{"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.846272"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.835356"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.707929"}], "authors": ["Mark Brohan"], "summary": "Clorox has completed a five-year, $580 million rollout of a new SAP enterprise resource planning (ERP) system across the U.S. and Canada. This cloud-based system replaces a 20-year-old platform, aiming to connect finance, supply chain, sales, and planning with shared, real-time data. The overhau