	 (1381,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-04 14:12:12','20260204T141212','The Clorox Company (NYSE:CLX) Q2 2026 Earnings Call Transcript','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/the-clorox-company-nyseclx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript-1688571/','The Clorox Company held its Q2 fiscal year 2026 earnings call, with Chair and CEO Linda Rendle and CFO Luc Bellet discussing results and strategies. The company missed earnings expectations with an EPS of $1.29 against an expected $1.43 but reaffirmed its full-year guidance, anticipating stronger performance in the second half. Discussions focused on navigating a dynamic macroeconomic environment, the impact of their ERP implementation, and future growth drivers, including the acquisition of Gojo Industries and upcoming product innovations in their core categories.','https://imonkey-blog.imgix.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/02122009/CLX-insidermonkey-1696263605920.jpg?auto=format&fit=clip&expires=1801699200&width=480&height=269','Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.905537"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.707892"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.608562"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.620251"}]',-0.265672,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.269172"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/the-clorox-company-nyseclx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript-1688571/", "title": "The Clorox Company (NYSE:CLX) Q2 2026 Earnings Call Transcript", "source": "Insider Monkey", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.905537"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.707892"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.608562"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.620251"}], "authors": ["Insider Monkey Transcripts"], "summary": "The Clorox Company held its Q2 fiscal year 2026 earn