	 (1385,'alpha_vantage','COLM','COLM','2026-02-04 19:28:28','20260204T192828','Columbia Sportswear Company (NASDAQ:COLM) Announces Quarterly Dividend of $0.30','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/columbia-sportswear-company-nasdaqcolm-announces-quarterly-dividend-of-030-2026-02-04/','Columbia Sportswear Company (NASDAQ:COLM) has declared a quarterly dividend of $0.30 per share, payable on March 20th to shareholders of record on March 9th. The company recently reported strong quarterly results, beating EPS and revenue estimates, which led to a stock price jump. Despite mixed analyst views, the stock currently holds a consensus "Hold" rating with an average price target of $60.50.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/columbia-sportswear-logo-1200x675.jpg?v=20221115171105','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.926845"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.811990"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.748520"}]',0.410722,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "COLM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.419193"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/columbia-sportswear-company-nasdaqcolm-announces-quarterly-dividend-of-030-2026-02-04/", "title": "Columbia Sportswear Company (NASDAQ:COLM) Announces Quarterly Dividend of $0.30", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.926845"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.811990"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.748520"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Columbia Sportswear Company (NASDAQ:COLM) has declared a quarterly dividend of $0.30 per share, payable on March 20th to shareholders of record on March 9th. The company recently reported strong quarterly results, beating EPS and revenue estimates, which led to a stock price jump. Despite mixed analyst views, the stock currently holds a consensus \\"Hold\\" r