	 (1395,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-05 00:32:39','20260205T003239','IBM stock slides again as AI disruption fears grip software; Confluent vote nears','https://ts2.tech/en/ibm-stock-slides-again-as-ai-disruption-fears-grip-software-confluent-vote-nears/','IBM''s stock declined due to fears that AI could disrupt enterprise software and IT services, impacting pricing power in the sector. Additionally, IBM faces deal risk as its acquisition target, Confluent, is dealing with shareholder lawsuits and demand letters concerning its merger proxy statement. Despite these challenges, IBM is actively promoting its AI initiatives and recently reported strong Q4 results, with its AI-related deals pipeline reaching $12.5 billion.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ibm-stock-slides-again-as-ai-disruption-fears-grip-software-confluent-vote-nears-featured-1.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.949129"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.816443"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.730202"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.701472"}]',-0.096587,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "IBM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.268259"}, {"ticker": "ADBE", "relevance_score": "0.611332", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.108314"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.644437", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.106810"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/ibm-stock-slides-again-as-ai-disruption-fears-grip-software-confluent-vote-nears/", "title": "IBM stock slides again as AI disruption fears grip software; Confluent vote nears", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.949129"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.816443"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.7302