	 (1398,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-04 21:20:20','20260204T212020','Target’s new CEO admits retailer has lost trust with shoppers, staff: report','https://nypost.com/2026/02/04/business/targets-new-ceo-admits-retailer-has-lost-trust-with-shoppers-staff-report/','Target''s new CEO, Michael Fiddelke, has acknowledged that the retailer has lost the trust of both shoppers and employees. He stated that the company was not clear enough about its identity, causing confusion that was not adequately addressed. Fiddelke committed to rebuilding these connections and is taking over at a time when Target faces a lengthy sales slump and has pulled back from diversity initiatives.','https://nypost.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/02/michael-fiddelke-speaks-target-opens-117005470.jpg?w=1024','New York Post','General','New York Post','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.629387"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.637091"}]',-0.054349,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.993429", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.320685"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.630053", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.120109"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.578088", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.070664"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.595057", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.084065"}]','{"url": "https://nypost.com/2026/02/04/business/targets-new-ceo-admits-retailer-has-lost-trust-with-shoppers-staff-report/", "title": "Target’s new CEO admits retailer has lost trust with shoppers, staff: report", "source": "New York Post", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.629387"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.637091"}], "authors": ["Re