	 (1404,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-04 17:50:39','20260204T175039','Costco stock rises ahead of January sales report after the bell — what to watch next','https://ts2.tech/en/costco-stock-rises-ahead-of-january-sales-report-after-the-bell-what-to-watch-next/','Costco shares rose 1.5% to $992.44 ahead of its January sales report, which is expected after the market close. Investors are closely watching these figures for insights into customer traffic and basket sizes, especially after January''s private payrolls data came in below forecasts. Mizuho has raised its price target for Costco to $1,065, citing potential upside from membership trend rebound and slower spending growth.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/costco-stock-rises-ahead-of-january-sales-report-after-the-bell-what-to-watch-next-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.938153"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.809252"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.710647"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.601860"}]',0.333027,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.322521"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/costco-stock-rises-ahead-of-january-sales-report-after-the-bell-what-to-watch-next/", "title": "Costco stock rises ahead of January sales report after the bell — what to watch next", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.938153"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.809252"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.710647"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.601860"}], "authors": ["Khadija Saeed"], "summary": "Costco shares rose 1.5% to $992.44 ahead of its January sales report, which is expected after the market close. Investors are closely watching these figures for insights into customer traff