	 (1405,'alpha_vantage','CPNG','CPNG','2026-02-04 20:29:12','20260204T202912','Coupang, Inc. Faces Class Action Lawsuit Notification','https://intellectia.ai/news/stock/coupang-inc-faces-class-action-lawsuit-notification','Coupang, Inc. is facing a class action lawsuit initiated by Levi & Korsinsky LLP due to alleged securities fraud between May 7, 2025, and December 16, 2025. The lawsuit claims inadequate cybersecurity protocols led to a six-month undetected data breach and that the company failed to timely report it to the SEC, resulting in misleading public statements. Investors can request to be appointed as lead plaintiff by February 17, 2026, without out-of-pocket costs.','https://intellectia.ai/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd5bp8bijhhba2.cloudfront.net%2Fimage%2Fcover_image%2F20260205035647_1a5f37a88785a10986e63d0cd8aeea8d.jpg&w=256&q=75','Intellectia AI','General','Intellectia AI','[{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.830445"}]',-0.604068,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "CPNG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.628185"}]','{"url": "https://intellectia.ai/news/stock/coupang-inc-faces-class-action-lawsuit-notification", "title": "Coupang, Inc. Faces Class Action Lawsuit Notification", "source": "Intellectia AI", "topics": [{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.830445"}], "authors": ["Emily J. Thompson"], "summary": "Coupang, Inc. is facing a class action lawsuit initiated by Levi & Korsinsky LLP due to alleged securities fraud between May 7, 2025, and December 16, 2025. The lawsuit claims inadequate cybersecurity protocols led to a six-month undetected data breach and that the company failed to timely report it to the SEC, resulting in misleading public statements. Investors can request to be appointed as lead plaintiff by February 17, 2026, without out-of-pocket costs.", "banner_imag