	 (1406,'alpha_vantage','CROX','CROX','2026-02-05 03:32:50','20260205T033250','Crocs, Inc. (CROX): A Bull Case Theory','https://finviz.com/news/300635/crocs-inc-crox-a-bull-case-theory','This article summarizes a bullish thesis on Crocs, Inc. (CROX) by Brett Schafer, emphasizing its undemanding valuation despite concerns about the HeyDude acquisition and potential margin compression. The current stock price is considered attractive due to a substantial margin of safety, robust core brand resilience, and aggressive share repurchases, suggesting a compelling long-term risk-reward profile if the business stabilizes.','https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/08130216/crocs-1483215_1280-pixabay-768x512.jpg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.815473"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.740264"}]',0.302974,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "CROX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.479758"}, {"ticker": "DECK", "relevance_score": "0.629576", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.118370"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/300635/crocs-inc-crox-a-bull-case-theory", "title": "Crocs, Inc. (CROX): A Bull Case Theory", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.815473"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.740264"}], "authors": ["Ricardo Pillai"], "summary": "This article summarizes a bullish thesis on Crocs, Inc. (CROX) by Brett Schafer, emphasizing its undemanding valuation despite concerns about the HeyDude acquisition and potential margin compression. The current stock price is considered attractive due to a substantial margin of safety, robust core brand resilience, and aggressive share repurchases, suggesting a compelling long-term risk-reward profile if the business stabilizes.", "banner_image": "https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/