	 (1410,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-05 12:08:05','20260205T120805','Aetna Launches Simplified, Digital-first, Benefits Onboarding Experience for Members in 2026','https://www.cvshealth.com/news/company-news/aetna-launches-simplified-digital-first-benefits-onboarding-experience.html','Aetna, a CVS Health company, is launching a new fully-digital benefits onboarding experience for four million members during the 2026 welcome season. This initiative aims to simplify health care navigation and self-service through digital and Rich Communication Services (RCS) enabled text messaging. The company has already seen increased member engagement and reduced opt-out rates from early rollouts of enhanced messaging capabilities, which it plans to extend across other areas like member discharge and chronic condition management throughout the year.',NULL,'CVS Health','General','CVS Health','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.917003"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.844897"}]',0.427843,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.423372"}]','{"url": "https://www.cvshealth.com/news/company-news/aetna-launches-simplified-digital-first-benefits-onboarding-experience.html", "title": "Aetna Launches Simplified, Digital-first, Benefits Onboarding Experience for Members in 2026", "source": "CVS Health", "topics": [{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.917003"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.844897"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Aetna, a CVS Health company, is launching a new fully-digital benefits onboarding experience for four million members during the 2026 welcome season. This initiative aims to simplify health care navigation and self-service through digital and Rich Communication Services (RCS) enabled text messaging. The company has already seen increased member engagement and reduced opt-out rates from early rollouts of enhanced messagin