	 (1411,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-04 22:27:32','20260204T222732','CVS Health (CVS) Suffers a Larger Drop Than the General Market: Key Insights','https://au.finance.yahoo.com/news/cvs-health-cvs-suffers-larger-224502190.html','CVS Health (CVS) recently closed down 2.07% while the S&P 500 only dropped 0.51%, indicating a larger decline for the company than the general market. Over the past month, CVS stock has fallen 4.8%, contrasting with the Medical sector''s 3.1% gain. Investors are anticipating the Q4 2025 earnings report on February 10, 2026, with an expected EPS of $0.99 and revenue of $103.13 billion.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/WFFMmJO1vPAuT.k84Qm7sg--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTc5MA--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/zacks.com/7853de8d69faeccb7d1ad6ebba40b8a2','Yahoo Finance Australia','General','Yahoo Finance Australia','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.904799"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.836747"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.705864"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.611516"}]',-0.208397,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.207570"}]','{"url": "https://au.finance.yahoo.com/news/cvs-health-cvs-suffers-larger-224502190.html", "title": "CVS Health (CVS) Suffers a Larger Drop Than the General Market: Key Insights", "source": "Yahoo Finance Australia", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.904799"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.836747"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.705864"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.611516"}], "authors": ["Zacks Equity Research"], "summary": "CVS Health (CVS) recently closed down 2.07% while the S&P 500 only dropped 0.51%, indicating a larger decline for the company than the general market. Over the past month, CVS stock has fallen 4.8%, contrasting with