	 (1412,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-04 19:34:53','20260204T193453','Express Scripts Reaches Deal With FTC Over Insulin Pricing Practices','https://www.pymnts.com/cpi-posts/express-scripts-reaches-deal-with-ftc-over-insulin-pricing-practices/','Cigna Corp''s pharmacy benefits arm, Express Scripts, has reached a settlement with the US Federal Trade Commission regarding allegations that its insulin pricing methods violated antitrust and consumer protection rules. The agreement aims to reduce prescription drug costs for patients, health plans, and independent pharmacies, and includes changes like limiting business practices that critics say drive up prices. The FTC believes these changes could save patients as much as $7 billion over the next decade.','https://www.pymnts.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/drug-discovery.jpg','PYMNTS.com','General','PYMNTS.com','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.921468"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.826908"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.749989"}]',0.065653,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.897515", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.100243"}, {"ticker": "CI", "relevance_score": "0.924007", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.274315"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.702163", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.107898"}, {"ticker": "PFE", "relevance_score": "0.561633", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.120595"}]','{"url": "https://www.pymnts.com/cpi-posts/express-scripts-reaches-deal-with-ftc-over-insulin-pricing-practices/", "title": "Express Scripts Reaches Deal With FTC Over Insulin Pricing Practices", "source": "PYMNTS.com", "topics": [{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.921468"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.826908"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.749989"}], "authors": ["CPI"], "summary": "Cigna Corp''s pharmacy benefits arm, Express Scripts, has reached a settlement with the US Federal Trade Commission regarding allegations that its insulin pricing methods violated antitrust and consumer protection rules. The agreement aims to reduce prescription drug costs for patients, health plans, and independent pharmacies, and includes changes like limiting business practices that critics say drive up prices. The FTC believes these changes could save patients as much as $7 billion over the next decade.", "banner_image": "https://www.pymnts.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/drug-discovery.jpg", "source_domain": "PYMNTS.com", "time_published": "20260204T193453", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.897515", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.100243"}, {"ticker": "CI", "relevance_score": "0.924007", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.274315"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.702163", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.107898"}, {"ticker": "PFE", "relevance_score": "0.561633", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.120595"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.065653}','2026-02-05 14:05:06',NULL),
	 (1413,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-04 18:30:27','20260204T183027','Cigna settles FTC insulin case, aims to lower drug prices','https://kfgo.com/2026/02/04/exclusive-cigna-settles-ftc-insulin-case-commits-to-overhauling-drug-pricing/','Cigna''s Express Scripts has settled claims with the U.S. Federal Trade Commission regarding its insulin pricing practices, agreeing to changes aimed at lowering costs for patients, insurers, and pharmacies. The 10-year agreement restricts Express Scripts'' ability to profit from rebates based on list prices and requires an independent monitor to oversee compliance, with an estimated savings of up to $7 billion for patients. This settlement allows the FTC to resolve a case brought by the former Biden administration, while cases against UnitedHealth Group''s Optum and CVS Health Corp''s CVS Caremark continue.','https://storage.googleapis.com/media.mwcradio.com/mimesis/2026-02/04/2026-02-04T163736Z_1_LYNXMPEM13154_RTROPTP_3_FACEBOOK-FTC.JPG','The Mighty 790 KFGO','General','The Mighty 790 KFGO','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.907819"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.740622"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.639283"}]',0.173588,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.928391", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.124421"}, {"ticker": "CI", "relevance_score": "0.913980", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.321077"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.847965", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.148039"}, {"ticker": "PFE", "relevance_score": "0.647496", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.327354"}]','{"url": "https://kfgo.com/2026/02/04/exclusive-cigna-settles-ftc-insulin-case-commits-to-overhauling-drug-pricing/", "title": "Cigna settles FTC insulin case, aims to lower drug prices", "source": "The Mighty 790 KFGO", "topic