	 (1414,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-04 18:27:50','20260204T182750','Jim Cramer Notes That "Humana Got Hit the Hardest" By Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services Announcement','https://finviz.com/news/299961/jim-cramer-notes-that-humana-got-hit-the-hardest-by-centers-for-medicare-medicaid-services-announcement','Jim Cramer highlighted that Humana, a managed care company with significant exposure to Medicare Advantage, was the worst-performing S&P 500 stock last month after the Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services announced flat payments for private insurers next year. Wall Street had expected a 5% increase. This news caused an instant sell-off for companies with Medicare Advantage exposure, with Humana being the hardest hit, as companies have struggled to price these plans appropriately while offering generous benefits.','https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/30232541/pexels-jakubzerdzicki-26575862.jpg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.905087"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.832226"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.736416"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.626238"}]',-0.363577,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "HUM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.400315"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.645661", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.309699"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.644412", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.334276"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/299961/jim-cramer-notes-that-humana-got-hit-the-hardest-by-centers-for-medicare-medicaid-services-announcement", "title": "Jim Cramer Notes That \\"Humana Got Hit the Hardest\\" By Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services Announcement", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.