	 (1415,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-04 17:58:53','20260204T175853','UNH Stock: The Factors Behind UnitedHealth''s Struggles in Its Recovery','https://intellectia.ai/news/stock/unh-stock-the-factors-behind-unitedhealths-struggles-in-its-recovery','UnitedHealth Group (UNH) recently experienced a significant 20% stock drop in one day, highlighting its struggles and heavy dependence on the federal government''s Medicare Advantage program. Wall Street analysts forecast a rise in CVS stock over the next 12 months, with an average target of $96.71, despite recent downgrades due to proposed Medicare Advantage reimbursement rates. The article discusses analyst views on CVS Health, the impact of Medicare Advantage program changes on health insurers, and new regulations proposed by the U.S. Labor Department for drug pricing transparency, which could pressure profit margins for companies like CVS, UnitedHealth, and Cigna.','https://intellectia.ai/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd5bp8bijhhba2.cloudfront.net%2Fimage%2Fcover_image%2F4e9b4ef557754e9529f839e3760a7318ba6279258337cbc4f0828c6b9f133b3b.png&w=256&q=75','Intellectia AI','General','Intellectia AI','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929590"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.834575"}]',0.074845,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.951428", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.345165"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.926344", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.222636"}, {"ticker": "HUM", "relevance_score": "0.746883", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.244969"}]','{"url": "https://intellectia.ai/news/stock/unh-stock-the-factors-behind-unitedhealths-struggles-in-its-recovery", "title": "UNH Stock: The Factors Behind UnitedHealth''s Struggles in Its Recovery", "source": "Intellectia AI", "to