	 (1416,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-04 17:58:08','20260204T175808','UnitedHealth stock price slides 3% as Optum pricing study and FTC pressure keep UNH in focus','https://ts2.tech/en/unitedhealth-stock-price-slides-3-as-optum-pricing-study-and-ftc-pressure-keep-unh-in-focus/','UnitedHealth (UNH) shares dropped 3% due to rising scrutiny on its Optum division''s pricing practices and ongoing regulatory pressure from the FTC. A Cornell University study linked Optum''s acquisitions of surgery centers to an 11% hike in prices, while investors also await the final Medicare Advantage rate decision expected in early April, which could significantly impact the company''s 2027 margins. These factors, alongside broader PBM regulation, are creating uncertainty for the managed-care giant.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/unitedhealth-stock-price-slides-3-as-optum-pricing-study-and-ftc-pressure-keep-unh-in-focus-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.941762"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.813899"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.706087"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.635524"}]',-0.244569,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.466191"}, {"ticker": "CI", "relevance_score": "0.749974", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.213051"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.748447", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.209372"}, {"ticker": "HUM", "relevance_score": "0.632812", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.111972"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/unitedhealth-stock-price-slides-3-as-optum-pricing-study-and-ftc-pressure-keep-unh-in-focus/", "title": "UnitedHealth stock price slides 3% as Optum pricing study and FTC pressure keep UNH in fo