	 (1417,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-04 16:32:55','20260204T163255','UNH Stock Was on a Roll. Then Came the Medicare Advantage News.','https://www.barrons.com/articles/unh-stock-optum-medicare-advantage-unitedhealth-6db7c259?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqdzhveSzKr_T3FXalhK-P7XFHc_572cRmXTRFi4IKu9Fa4PcvBG3Jr7&gaa_ts=69837d83&gaa_sig=XBQ77CgEcQ1Z6TnTu0_YXw0rhp9wKWPUIpQpbyP_zax9u_9VAuPOMlekgvpgZOIoECYez4xjQUfh_yvhYBUI2w%3D%3D','UnitedHealth Group''s stock experienced a significant 20% one-day drop, highlighting persistent challenges for the company. This tumble underscores health insurers'' substantial dependency on the federal government''s Medicare Advantage program for seniors, a factor that continues to pose difficulties for the sector. The event serves as a reminder of the volatile nature of healthcare stocks tied to federal programs.','https://images.barrons.com/im-36132543?width=700&height=466','Barron''s','General','Barron''s','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.914558"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.819295"}]',-0.272244,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.416870"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.714444", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.227081"}, {"ticker": "HUM", "relevance_score": "0.605231", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.220700"}]','{"url": "https://www.barrons.com/articles/unh-stock-optum-medicare-advantage-unitedhealth-6db7c259?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqdzhveSzKr_T3FXalhK-P7XFHc_572cRmXTRFi4IKu9Fa4PcvBG3Jr7&gaa_ts=69837d83&gaa_sig=XBQ77CgEcQ1Z6TnTu0_YXw0rhp9wKWPUIpQpbyP_zax9u_9VAuPOMlekgvpgZOIoECYez4xjQUfh_yvhYBUI2w%3D%3D", "title": "UNH Stock Was on a Roll. Then Came the Medicare Advantage News.", "source": "Barron''s", "topics": [{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.914558"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "