	 (1418,'alpha_vantage','DASH','DASH','2026-02-04 23:18:07','20260204T231807','Uber Earnings: Network Effect Is Strengthening, but Future AV Impact Remains Uncertain','https://www.morningstar.com/stocks/uber-earnings-network-effect-is-strengthening-future-av-impact-remains-uncertain','Morningstar has lowered its fair value estimate for Uber stock to $85 from $93, maintaining a narrow moat rating, despite strong network effects visible in accelerating user growth and food delivery. The reduction reflects persistent uncertainty about the impact of autonomous vehicles, as companies like Waymo and Tesla seem more inclined to control rider relationships directly rather than through partnerships. While Uber''s two-sided marketplace remains strong, the long-term question of its asset-light model versus the need for AV investment creates a significant headwind, making shares appear cheap but recommending investment only if they drop to the $60 range.','https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/morningstar/HVMUEKV25FHMDLG4QNZBD7AHX4.jpg','Morningstar','General','Morningstar','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929276"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.808465"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.721944"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.622678"}]',-0.143024,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "UBER", "relevance_score": "0.954825", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.291969"}, {"ticker": "TSLA", "relevance_score": "0.613100", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.002204"}, {"ticker": "DASH", "relevance_score": "0.574080", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.113118"}]','{"url": "https://www.morningstar.com/stocks/uber-earnings-network-effect-is-strengthening-future-av-impact-remains-uncertain", "title": "Uber Earnings: Network Effect Is Strengthening, but Future AV Impact Remains Uncertain", "source": "Morningstar"