	 (1435,'alpha_vantage','DG','DG','2026-02-04 20:29:08','20260204T202908','Off-price retailer praised as ‘Costco for kids’ to open 150 new stores in 2026 – and first 15 coming in hours','https://www.the-sun.com/money/15891799/five-below-new-stores-opening-list/','Five Below, an off-price retailer often called "Costco for kids," plans to open 150 new stores by the end of February 2026. The expansion includes 15 new locations opening this Friday, with additional waves of store openings scheduled throughout February and March, adding to their presence across multiple states. CEO Winifred Park expressed satisfaction with the growth, highlighting the company''s belief in further market opportunities.','https://www.the-sun.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/02/newspress-collage-2tqgntsd5-1770233988241.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&1770216007','The Sun','General','The Sun','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}]',0.304776,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "FIVE", "relevance_score": "0.971834", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.741397"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.609134", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.312750"}, {"ticker": "DG", "relevance_score": "0.638280", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.125595"}, {"ticker": "DLTR", "relevance_score": "0.620201", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.107846"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.567171", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.146528"}]','{"url": "https://www.the-sun.com/money/15891799/five-below-new-stores-opening-list/", "title": "Off-price retailer praised as ‘Costco for kids’ to open 150 new stores in 2026 – and first 15 coming in hours", "source": "The Sun", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}], "authors": ["James Evenden"], "summary": "Five Below, an off-price retailer often called 