	 (1440,'alpha_vantage','DKS','DKS','2026-02-04 14:29:36','20260204T142936','Ben Griffin extends Maxfli golf ball deal, debuts new model','https://www.stocktitan.net/news/DKS/maxfli-extends-golf-ball-partnership-with-three-time-pga-tour-winner-3coh1ewbwxke.html','Maxfli, a DICK''S Sporting Goods brand, has extended its partnership with three-time PGA Tour winner Ben Griffin through 2028. Griffin, ranked 9th globally, will continue to exclusively play Maxfli Tour X balls and will debut the new Tour X-LS at the WM Phoenix Open. This expansion aligns with DICK''S strategy of leveraging athletes to promote its private label brands and will see the new Tour X-LS golf ball sold in limited quantities at DICK''S Sporting Goods and Golf Galaxy.','https://mma.prnewswire.com/media/2876119/Ben_Griffin_x_Maxfli.jpg','Stock Titan','General','Stock Titan','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.928073"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.702678"}]',0.039213,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "DKS", "relevance_score": "0.349348", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.047620"}]','{"url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/news/DKS/maxfli-extends-golf-ball-partnership-with-three-time-pga-tour-winner-3coh1ewbwxke.html", "title": "Ben Griffin extends Maxfli golf ball deal, debuts new model", "source": "Stock Titan", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.928073"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.702678"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Maxfli, a DICK''S Sporting Goods brand, has extended its partnership with three-time PGA Tour winner Ben Griffin through 2028. Griffin, ranked 9th globally, will continue to exclusively play Maxfli Tour X balls and will debut the new Tour X-LS at the WM Phoenix Open. This expansion aligns with DICK''S strategy of leveraging athletes to promote its private label brands and will see the new Tour X-LS golf ball sold in limited quantities at DICK''S Sporting Goods and Golf Galaxy.", "banner_imag