	 (1444,'alpha_vantage','EBAY','EBAY','2026-02-04 20:48:33','20260204T204833','Upwork and eBay Shares Are Falling, What You Need To Know','https://www.tradingview.com/news/stockstory:0db97e4dd094b:0-upwork-and-ebay-shares-are-falling-what-you-need-to-know/','Shares of Upwork and eBay fell by 6.9% and 6.5% respectively, after Anthropic unveiled significant upgrades to its enterprise AI tools, sparking concerns that AI could directly replace current software-driven work rather than just enhance productivity. This news led investors to fear that AI is becoming a direct substitute for parts of the software and services industry. Upwork''s stock is down 14.1% since the beginning of the year, trading significantly below its 52-week high.','https://s3.tradingview.com/news/image/stockstory:0db97e4dd094b-8b0a6d4ebe9453ae91f07f43a63d5fc8-resized.webp','TradingView','General','TradingView','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.915606"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.800758"}]',0.154089,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "EBAY", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.208586"}, {"ticker": "AMD", "relevance_score": "0.646575", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.336799"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.601021", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.348646"}]','{"url": "https://www.tradingview.com/news/stockstory:0db97e4dd094b:0-upwork-and-ebay-shares-are-falling-what-you-need-to-know/", "title": "Upwork and eBay Shares Are Falling, What You Need To Know", "source": "TradingView", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.915606"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.800758"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Shares of Upwork and eBay fell by 6.9% and 6.5% respectively, after Anthropic unveiled significant upgrades to its enterprise AI tools, sparking concerns that AI could