	 (1449,'alpha_vantage','EBAY','EBAY','2026-02-04 15:45:00','20260204T154500','Upwork and eBay Shares Are Falling, What You Need To Know','https://finviz.com/news/300144/upwork-and-ebay-shares-are-falling-what-you-need-to-know','Shares of Upwork (UPWK) and eBay (EBAY) both fell significantly after Anthropic unveiled a major upgrade to its enterprise AI tools, which were positioned as solutions for end-to-end workflow automation, directly competing with established software platforms. This sparked investor fears that AI is shifting from productivity enhancement to direct substitution for parts of the software and services industry. The article also notes Upwork''s volatility and its year-to-date performance.','https://news-assets.stockstory.org/cover-images/_1400x700_crop_center-center_none/upwork-cover-image-d36397fff023_2022-01-03-170327_ntqd.jpeg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.914718"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.816638"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.703877"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.640736"}]',-0.105724,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "UPWK", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.418581"}, {"ticker": "EBAY", "relevance_score": "0.812714", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.420672"}, {"ticker": "AMD", "relevance_score": "0.631219", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.256175"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.636540", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.263927"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/300144/upwork-and-ebay-shares-are-falling-what-you-need-to-know", "title": "Upwork and eBay Shares Are Falling, What You Need To Know", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.914718"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.816638"}, {