	 (1450,'alpha_vantage','EBAY','EBAY','2026-02-04 14:38:10','20260204T143810','eBay Risk & Compliance Leadership Back in Flux Following Ryan Jones’ Departure','https://www.valueaddedresource.net/ebay-chief-risk-compliance-officer-ryan-jones-departs/','eBay is facing renewed uncertainty in its Risk & Compliance leadership after Ryan Jones departed for ByteDance, raising questions about continuity and governance. Jones'' LinkedIn profile was surprisingly backdated to October 2025, and no successor has been publicly named, leaving a potential gap in a critical role. This comes as eBay confronts several ongoing challenges, including the upcoming cyberstalking civil trial, compliance issues in Europe, and potential changes to Section 230 protections.','https://www.valueaddedresource.net/content/images/2026/02/ryanjones1.jpg','Value Added Resource','General','Value Added Resource','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.901185"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.802984"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.714699"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.605989"}]',0.021238,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "EBAY", "relevance_score": "0.326096", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.024952"}]','{"url": "https://www.valueaddedresource.net/ebay-chief-risk-compliance-officer-ryan-jones-departs/", "title": "eBay Risk & Compliance Leadership Back in Flux Following Ryan Jones’ Departure", "source": "Value Added Resource", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.901185"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.802984"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.714699"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.605989"}], "authors": ["Liz Morton"], "summary": "eBay is facing renewed uncertainty in its Risk & Compliance leadership after Ryan Jones departed for ByteDance, raising questions about continuity and governance. Jones'' LinkedIn profile was surprisingly 