	 (1465,'alpha_vantage','HD','HD','2026-02-04 18:02:57','20260204T180257','Big Changes Are Coming To Home Depot In 2026','https://www.housedigest.com/2093175/big-changes-home-depot-2026/','Home Depot is implementing significant changes in 2026, driven by lower-than-expected profits, to attract more customers and adapt to market needs. Key updates include Hubspace 2.0 for enhanced smart home integration, a partnership with Wahlburgers for on-site food trucks, and a focus on professional builders through the GMS Inc. acquisition and the new Material List Builder AI. These initiatives aim to improve customer experience and strengthen market position.','https://www.housedigest.com/img/gallery/big-changes-are-coming-to-home-depot-in-2026/intro-1770224327.jpg','House Digest','General','House Digest','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.921451"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.711994"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.628444"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.610290"}]',0.049385,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "HD", "relevance_score": "0.987607", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.035396"}]','{"url": "https://www.housedigest.com/2093175/big-changes-home-depot-2026/", "title": "Big Changes Are Coming To Home Depot In 2026", "source": "House Digest", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.921451"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.711994"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.628444"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.610290"}], "authors": ["Nina Phillips"], "summary": "Home Depot is implementing significant changes in 2026, driven by lower-than-expected profits, to attract more customers and adapt to market needs. Key updates include Hubspace 2.0 for enhanced smart home integration, a partnership with Wahlburgers for on-site food trucks, and a focus on professional builders through the GMS Inc. acquisition and the new Material List Buil