	 (1468,'alpha_vantage','KMB','KMB','2026-02-04 23:51:43','20260204T235143','Kenvue Valuation In Focus As Kimberly-Clark Deal Gains Approval','https://uk.finance.yahoo.com/news/kenvue-valuation-focus-kimberly-clark-002301139.html','Kimberly-Clark''s acquisition of Kenvue has received approval from both companies'' shareholders, moving the deal closer to completion. The transaction will integrate Kenvue, a consumer health company, into the Kimberly-Clark group, which has implications for Kenvue shareholders regarding valuation and its future role within a larger conglomerate. Current analysis suggests Kenvue (KVUE) is trading below its fair value and analyst targets, though its dividend sustainability is questioned.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/J..hExpd5KAqEBC8ZETJkA--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTY2NA--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/simply_wall_st__316/86a4dcff88c9bf1d50615f488589d7dc','Yahoo Finance UK','General','Yahoo Finance UK','[{"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.844331"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.635854"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.609916"}]',0.246539,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KMB", "relevance_score": "0.957504", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.280000"}, {"ticker": "KVUE", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.236014"}]','{"url": "https://uk.finance.yahoo.com/news/kenvue-valuation-focus-kimberly-clark-002301139.html", "title": "Kenvue Valuation In Focus As Kimberly-Clark Deal Gains Approval", "source": "Yahoo Finance UK", "topics": [{"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.844331"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.635854"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.609916"}], "authors": ["Sim