	 (1469,'alpha_vantage','KMB','KMB','2026-02-04 18:15:06','20260204T181506','Jefferies Downgrades Kenvue (KVUE) to Hold With $18 PT Over Limited Upside, Litigation Risks','https://ca.finance.yahoo.com/news/jefferies-downgrades-kenvue-kvue-hold-181156130.html','Jefferies has downgraded Kenvue (KVUE) to Hold from Buy, lowering its price target to $18 from $23, citing limited upside as shares trade near the offer value following the Kimberly-Clark merger approval and ongoing litigation risks. The firm removed KVUE from its Franchise Pick list as Kimberly-Clark appears comfortable with Kenvue''s litigation and slowing trends. Shareholders of both Kimberly-Clark and Kenvue recently approved the merger, which is expected to close in H2 2026 and aims to create a global leader in health and wellness.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/KQl.NITWo.iiiRdxJOON8g--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTY1Mw--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/insidermonkey.com/4d6876a66ea76f113a7356731f459457','Yahoo! Finance Canada','General','Yahoo! Finance Canada','[{"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.944378"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.736860"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.612419"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.646360"}]',-0.185855,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "KVUE", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.395857"}, {"ticker": "KMB", "relevance_score": "0.870148", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.130004"}]','{"url": "https://ca.finance.yahoo.com/news/jefferies-downgrades-kenvue-kvue-hold-181156130.html", "title": "Jefferies Downgrades Kenvue (KVUE) to Hold With $18 PT Over Limited Upside, Litigation Risks", "source": "Yahoo! Finance Canada", "topics": [{"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_s