	 (1470,'alpha_vantage','KMB','KMB','2026-02-04 17:58:19','20260204T175819','Essity completes acquisition of Carefree, Stayfree and o.b. in US$340 million deal with Edgewell','https://tissueonlinenorthamerica.com/essity-completes-acquisition-of-carefree-stayfree-and-o-b-in-us340-million-deal-with-edgewell/','Essity has finalized its US$340 million all-cash acquisition of Edgewell Personal Care''s feminine hygiene business. This deal includes the Carefree, Stayfree, and o.b. brands in North America, global rights to the Playtex feminine hygiene products, and a manufacturing facility in Dover, Delaware. The acquisition reinforces Essity''s strategy to expand into higher-margin categories and strengthen its presence in the North American hygiene market.','https://tissueonlinenorthamerica.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Essity-completes-acquisition-of-Carefree-Stayfree-and-o.b.-in-US340-million-deal-with-Edgewell.jpg','Tissue Online North America','General','Tissue Online North America','[{"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.837099"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.823941"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.724113"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.619373"}]',0.144412,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "EPC", "relevance_score": "0.309022", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.002980"}, {"ticker": "KMB", "relevance_score": "0.800907", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.323915"}, {"ticker": "IP", "relevance_score": "0.641247", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.142353"}]','{"url": "https://tissueonlinenorthamerica.com/essity-completes-acquisition-of-carefree-stayfree-and-o-b-in-us340-million-deal-with-edgewell/", "title": "Essity completes acquisition of Carefree, Stayfree and o.b. in US$340 million deal with Edgewell", "source": "Tissue Online North America", "to