	 (1475,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-05 12:04:19','20260205T120419','Minute Maid frozen juice concentrates won''t be made anymore','https://www.cbsnews.com/news/minute-maid-frozen-oj-concentrate-production-ending/','Minute Maid, owned by Coca-Cola, is discontinuing all its frozen juice concentrates in the U.S. and Canada by April. This move comes as the company shifts its focus to fresh juices, reflecting changing consumer preferences away from concentrated frozen products. The decision marks the end of an era for a product that helped popularize orange juice as a morning staple for decades.','https://assets3.cbsnewsstatic.com/hub/i/r/2026/02/05/55d2a44d-ce59-48f6-ae8f-b53bca487d03/thumbnail/620x390/e07e68718e3c7dc921d78bb1bcfa963a/ap26035821817136.jpg#','CBS News','General','CBS News','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.920819"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.646896"}]',0.115166,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.980837", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.109055"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.607880", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.107172"}]','{"url": "https://www.cbsnews.com/news/minute-maid-frozen-oj-concentrate-production-ending/", "title": "Minute Maid frozen juice concentrates won''t be made anymore", "source": "CBS News", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.920819"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.646896"}], "authors": ["AP"], "summary": "Minute Maid, owned by Coca-Cola, is discontinuing all its frozen juice concentrates in the U.S. and Canada by April. This move comes as the company shifts its focus to fresh juices, reflecting changing consumer preferences away from concentrated frozen products. The decision marks the end of an era for a product that helped popularize orange juice as a morning staple for decades.", "banner_image": "https://assets3.cbsnewsstatic.com/hub/i/r/2026/