	 (1485,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-04 22:59:29','20260204T225929','After 80 years, Minute Maid''s frozen canned juices are getting put on ice','https://www.wsbradio.com/news/business/after-80-years/Z5PTRWL5QE2I5IK5ZH7E74ZNFM/','Coca-Cola announced it is discontinuing Minute Maid''s frozen juice concentrates in the U.S. and Canada, citing shifting consumer preferences towards fresh juices. This move comes 80 years after Minute Maid revolutionized orange juice consumption with its frozen concentrates. The frozen juice market has seen declining sales, with 12-ounce frozen orange juice cans increasing 13% to an average of $4.82 in December.','https://cmg-cmg-rd-20021-prod.cdn.arcpublishing.com/resizer/v2/NMPQTFARFM4K5CUDXF5BUDNLHM.jpg?smart=true&auth=7d0456f12b10ac2231d64cdd39b9b6d04358ba941999bf278a80c3497ff7ee1d&width=3225&height=1814','95.5 WSB','General','95.5 WSB','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.817156"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.622197"}]',-0.129152,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.115733"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.616633", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.129416"}]','{"url": "https://www.wsbradio.com/news/business/after-80-years/Z5PTRWL5QE2I5IK5ZH7E74ZNFM/", "title": "After 80 years, Minute Maid''s frozen canned juices are getting put on ice", "source": "95.5 WSB", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.817156"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.622197"}], "authors": ["DEE-ANN DURBIN"], "summary": "Coca-Cola announced it is discontinuing Minute Maid''s frozen juice concentrates in the U.S. and Canada, citing shifting consumer preferences towards fresh juices. This move comes 80 years after Minute Maid revolutionized orange juice consumption with its frozen concentrates. The frozen juice market has seen declining sales, with 12-ou