	 (1489,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-04 22:29:44','20260204T222944','AAT Q4 2025 Earnings Surge Amid Retail Breakthrough','https://news.alphastreet.com/aat-q4-2025-earnings-surge-amid-retail-breakthrough/amp/','American Assets Trust, Inc. (AAT) reported Q4 2025 net income of $4.2 million on total revenue of $110.1 million. The company provided 2026 FFO guidance with a midpoint of $2.03 per diluted share, indicating anticipated growth from the $2.00 FFO per diluted share achieved in 2025. Despite a slight year-over-year revenue decline, AAT demonstrated strong leasing activity with significant rent increases in both office and retail segments.',NULL,'AlphaStreet','General','AlphaStreet','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.910042"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.826450"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.724331"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.605171"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.616263"}]',-0.037752,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AAT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.204865"}, {"ticker": "QCOM", "relevance_score": "0.745154", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.287486"}, {"ticker": "EA", "relevance_score": "0.642178", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.227013"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.642554", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.204195"}]','{"url": "https://news.alphastreet.com/aat-q4-2025-earnings-surge-amid-retail-breakthrough/amp/", "title": "AAT Q4 2025 Earnings Surge Amid Retail Breakthrough", "source": "AlphaStreet", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.910042"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.826450"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.724331"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.605171"}, {"topic": "fi