	 (1504,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-04 14:52:21','20260204T145221','Coca-Cola''s All-Weather Strategy: Built for Volatility or Peak Cycle?','https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/KO/pressreleases/22203/coca-colas-all-weather-strategy-built-for-volatility-or-peak-cycle/','Coca-Cola (KO) has adopted an "all-weather strategy" focused on resilience and consistent growth across varying economic conditions, rather than just outperforming in downturns. This approach relies on marketing excellence, innovation, revenue-growth management, and a diversified product portfolio to mitigate volatility and reduce seasonality dependency. Despite challenges like unseasonal weather and inflation, KO achieved volume growth in Q3 2025, driven by its strategic initiatives and strong brand portfolio, while its stock performance and valuation metrics show it trading at a premium compared to its industry peers.','https://staticx-tuner.zacks.com/images/articles/main/e3/65.jpg','The Globe and Mail','General','The Globe and Mail','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.918391"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.820261"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.740299"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.625680"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.627632"}]',0.317497,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.325565"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.718395", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.296726"}, {"ticker": "MNST", "relevance_score": "0.646150", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.349567"}]','{"url": "https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/KO/pressreleases/22203/coca-colas-all-weather-strategy-built-for-volatility-or-peak-cycle/", "title": "Coca-Cola''s All-Weather Strategy: Built for Volatility or 