	 (1506,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-04 14:29:28','20260204T142928','Denison Mines stock jumps nearly 8% premarket as uranium names lift again','https://ts2.tech/en/denison-mines-stock-jumps-nearly-8-premarket-as-uranium-names-lift-again/','Denison Mines (DNN) saw its stock jump nearly 8% in premarket trading, leading other uranium-related shares after Uzbekistan announced increased uranium production and new mine openings. The rise follows spot uranium prices breaking $100 per pound. Investors are now focused on permitting updates and investment decisions for Denison''s Phoenix uranium project, with the company awaiting final regulatory approval to begin construction.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/denison-mines-stock-jumps-nearly-8-premarket-as-uranium-names-lift-again-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.911652"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.842476"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.610063"}]',0.26897,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "DNN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.645709"}, {"ticker": "ODFL", "relevance_score": "0.603337", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.529910"}, {"ticker": "PLTR", "relevance_score": "0.627462", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.225909"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.620124", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.328685"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.622625", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.144370"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/denison-mines-stock-jumps-nearly-8-premarket-as-uranium-names-lift-again/", "title": "Denison Mines stock jumps nearly 8% premarket as uranium names lift again", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.