	 (1509,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-05 13:07:10','20260205T130710','The 5 Biggest Changes You''ll Notice At Kroger In 2026','https://www.tastingtable.com/2093474/kroger-changes-coming-2026/','Kroger is poised for significant changes in 2026, including a new partnership with Uber for faster grocery delivery, an expanded Simple Truth brand focusing on high-protein products, and the integration of AI-powered personal shopping assistants. The company will also introduce a Verified Savings Program for discounts to those in need and plans to open more Kroger Marketplace stores after strategic closures in 2025. These initiatives aim to enhance customer experience, promote healthier eating, and expand Kroger''s market presence following its failed merger with Albertsons.','https://www.tastingtable.com/img/gallery/kroger-changes-coming-2026/intro-1770242085.jpg','Tasting Table','General','Tasting Table','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.912165"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.838945"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.712563"}]',0.227657,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.321968"}, {"ticker": "UBER", "relevance_score": "0.708575", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.324240"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.612977", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.125023"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.605554", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.244213"}]','{"url": "https://www.tastingtable.com/2093474/kroger-changes-coming-2026/", "title": "The 5 Biggest Changes You''ll Notice At Kroger In 2026", "source": "Tasting Table", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.912165"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.838945"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisition