	 (1515,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-04 19:55:09','20260204T195509','Kroger to reportedly close 18 health clinics in Georgia','https://chainstoreage.com/kroger-reportedly-close-18-health-clinics-georgia','Kroger is reportedly closing all 18 of its The Little Clinic locations in Georgia by April 4, 2026, though in-store pharmacies will remain open. This comes despite data from Placer.ai showing that health clinics boost store traffic significantly at various Kroger banners. The supermarket giant operates over 2,200 pharmacies and more than 220 in-person clinics across eight states.','https://assets1.chainstoreage.com/images/v/max_width_1440/2023-07/kroger_health_logo.jpg','Chain Store Age','General','Chain Store Age','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.937223"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.711267"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.615443"}]',-0.242065,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.223511"}]','{"url": "https://chainstoreage.com/kroger-reportedly-close-18-health-clinics-georgia", "title": "Kroger to reportedly close 18 health clinics in Georgia", "source": "Chain Store Age", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.937223"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.711267"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.615443"}], "authors": ["Dan Berthiaume"], "summary": "Kroger is reportedly closing all 18 of its The Little Clinic locations in Georgia by April 4, 2026, though in-store pharmacies will remain open. This comes despite data from Placer.ai showing that health clinics boost store traffic significantly at various Kroger banners. The supermarket giant operates over 2,200 pharmacies and more than 220 in-person clinics across eight states.", "banner_image": "https://assets1.chainstoreage.com/images/v/max_width_1440/2023-07/kroger_health_logo.jpg", "source_do