	 (1555,'alpha_vantage','PEP','PEP','2026-02-04 20:31:13','20260204T203113','PepsiCo: The Carbonation Is Out Of The Bottle — Strong Sell (NASDAQ:PEP)','https://seekingalpha.com/article/4866021-pepsico-the-carbonation-is-out-of-the-bottle-strong-sell','This article downgrades PepsiCo (PEP) to a strong sell due to operational weaknesses and a deteriorating balance sheet. While recent results show robust headline growth and a dividend hike, these are attributed to price increases rather than volume growth, and net debt has surged to $40 billion. The author believes PepsiCo''s current valuation, with an EV/FCF multiple of 33.5x, reflects an overly optimistic scenario given its underlying financial issues.','https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1270424860/image_1270424860.jpg?io=getty-c-w630','Seeking Alpha','General','Seeking Alpha','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.903433"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.830607"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.606309"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.624042"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.628213"}]',-0.614056,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.625534"}]','{"url": "https://seekingalpha.com/article/4866021-pepsico-the-carbonation-is-out-of-the-bottle-strong-sell", "title": "PepsiCo: The Carbonation Is Out Of The Bottle — Strong Sell (NASDAQ:PEP)", "source": "Seeking Alpha", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.903433"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.830607"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.606309"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.624042"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.628213"}], "authors": ["Alan Galecki"], "summary": "This article downgrades PepsiCo (PEP) to a strong sell due to operational weaknesses and a deteriorating balance sheet. While r