	 (1587,'alpha_vantage','ROST','ROST','2026-02-04 20:24:25','20260204T202425','Ross Dress for Less® partners with Boys & Girls Clubs of Northeast Texas to help local kids succeed','https://blueribbonnews.com/2026/02/ross-dress-for-less-partners-with-boys-girls-clubs-of-northeast-texas-to-help-local-kids-succeed/','Ross Dress for Less is partnering with Boys & Girls Clubs of Northeast Texas for its annual "Help Local Kids Succeed" in-store fundraising campaign from February 7 to March 1, 2026. Customers can donate at checkout to support local youth programs, particularly the Power Hour homework help initiative. Ross will match customer donations nationwide up to $500,000, ensuring 80% of funds raised directly benefit local Boys & Girls Clubs.','https://blueribbonnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/2026-Ross-Thank-you-701x876.png','Blue Ribbon News','General','Blue Ribbon News','[{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.710723"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}]',0.498279,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ROST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.455678"}]','{"url": "https://blueribbonnews.com/2026/02/ross-dress-for-less-partners-with-boys-girls-clubs-of-northeast-texas-to-help-local-kids-succeed/", "title": "Ross Dress for Less® partners with Boys & Girls Clubs of Northeast Texas to help local kids succeed", "source": "Blue Ribbon News", "topics": [{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.710723"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}], "authors": ["Editor"], "summary": "Ross Dress for Less is partnering with Boys & Girls Clubs of Northeast Texas for its annual \\"Help Local Kids Succeed\\" in-store fundraising campaign from February 7 to March 1, 2026. Customers can donate at checkout to support local youth programs, particularly the Power Hour homework help initiative. Ross will match customer donations nationwide up to $500,000, ensuring 80% of funds raised