	 (1589,'alpha_vantage','SFM','SFM','2026-02-04 17:55:30','20260204T175530','Sprouts Farmers Market (SFM): Goldman Sachs Lowers Price Target','https://www.gurufocus.com/news/8582306/sprouts-farmers-market-sfm-goldman-sachs-lowers-price-target-sfm-stock-news','Goldman Sachs has reaffirmed its "Buy" rating for Sprouts Farmers Market (SFM) but has reduced its price target to $130 from $152, a 14.47% decrease. This adjustment by analyst Kate McShane aligns with a broader trend of cautious outlooks from other analysts, who have also lowered price targets while largely maintaining positive ratings. Despite these adjustments, the average target price from 12 analysts is $116, suggesting an upside of 64.75% from the current price.','https://static.gurufocus.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=600,quality=100/logos/0C0000479Z.png?20','GuruFocus','General','GuruFocus','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.909861"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.824383"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.705908"}]',-0.245158,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "SFM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.203836"}]','{"url": "https://www.gurufocus.com/news/8582306/sprouts-farmers-market-sfm-goldman-sachs-lowers-price-target-sfm-stock-news", "title": "Sprouts Farmers Market (SFM): Goldman Sachs Lowers Price Target", "source": "GuruFocus", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.909861"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.824383"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.705908"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Goldman Sachs has reaffirmed its \\"Buy\\" rating for Sprouts Farmers Market (SFM) but has reduced its price target to $130 from $152, a 14.47% decrease. This adjustment by analyst Kate McShane aligns with a broader trend of cautious outlooks from other analysts, who have also lowered price targets while largely maintaining positive ratings. Desp