	 (1590,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-05 13:28:10','20260205T132810','Jones Financial Companies Lllp Acquires 72,121 Shares of Kenvue Inc. $KVUE','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-jones-financial-companies-lllp-acquires-72121-shares-of-kenvue-inc-kvue-2026-02-05/','Jones Financial Companies Lllp has increased its stake in Kenvue Inc. by 14.4% during the third quarter, acquiring an additional 72,121 shares to bring its total holdings to 572,013 shares valued at approximately $9.39 million. This news comes alongside significant insider buying, with Director Jeffrey C. Smith purchasing 3,200,000 shares for about $55.6 million, increasing his ownership to over 27 million shares. Kenvue also announced a quarterly dividend of $0.2075 per share, representing an annualized yield of 4.6%.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/kenvue-inc-logo-1200x675.jpg?v=20230508144051','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.936370"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.709928"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.639184"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.639367"}]',0.110565,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KVUE", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.220898"}, {"ticker": "JNJ", "relevance_score": "0.676921", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.047525"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.646275", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.021636"}, {"ticker": "NOW", "relevance_score": "0.586216", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.105300"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-jones-financial-companies-lllp-acquires-72121-shares-of-kenvue-inc-kvue-2026-02-05/", "title": "Jones Financial Companies Lllp Acquires 72,121 Shares of Kenvue Inc. $KVUE", "source": 