	 (1597,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-05 03:55:08','20260205T035508','Target’s new CEO acknowledges ‘loss of trust’ with shoppers','https://us.fashionnetwork.com/news/Target-s-new-ceo-acknowledges-loss-of-trust-with-shoppers,1804677.html','Target''s new CEO, Michael Fiddelke, acknowledged a loss of trust with shoppers and employees due to unclear company positioning, particularly after a pullback from diversity initiatives. He aims to rebuild this connection by improving merchandise and in-store experiences, and by addressing concerns such as a federal immigration crackdown through careful engagement and support for staff. The company is actively working to reconnect with alienated customers.','https://media.fashionnetwork.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=contain,width=1000,height=1000,format=auto/m/f04b/2e82/bbf5/13cf/9a6c/f84d/74cd/c2e7/dda0/569a/569a.jpg','FashionNetwork USA','General','FashionNetwork USA','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.930405"}]',-0.255785,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.263816"}]','{"url": "https://us.fashionnetwork.com/news/Target-s-new-ceo-acknowledges-loss-of-trust-with-shoppers,1804677.html", "title": "Target’s new CEO acknowledges ‘loss of trust’ with shoppers", "source": "FashionNetwork USA", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.930405"}], "authors": ["Bloomberg"], "summary": "Target''s new CEO, Michael Fiddelke, acknowledged a loss of trust with shoppers and employees due to unclear company positioning, particularly after a pullback from diversity initiatives. He aims to rebuild this connection by improving merchandise and in-store experiences, and by addressing concerns such as a federal immigration crackdown through careful engagement and support for staff. The company is actively working to reconnect with alienated customers.", "banner_image": "https://media.fashionnetwork.com/c