	 (1605,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-04 20:57:44','20260204T205744','Target''s new CEO says retailer lost trust with shoppers and staff, Bloomberg News reports','https://www.detroitnews.com/story/business/2026/02/04/targets-new-ceo-says-retailer-lost-trust-with-shoppers-and-staff-bloomberg-news-reports/88514439007/','Target''s new CEO, Michael Fiddelke, acknowledges the retailer has lost trust with both shoppers and staff due to unclear company messaging and its handling of recent issues. He pledged to rebuild these connections, particularly with customers the company has alienated. The leadership change comes amidst a sales slump, a pullback from diversity initiatives, and internal confusion.','https://www.detroitnews.com/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/02/04/PDTN/88514405007-20250820-t-104056-z-1263801701-rc-2-waga-52946-rtrmadp-3-targetresults.JPG?crop=828,1161,x312,y158&width=300&height=421&format=pjpg&auto=webp','The Detroit News','General','The Detroit News','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.906517"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.713949"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.622753"}]',-0.341112,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.324294"}]','{"url": "https://www.detroitnews.com/story/business/2026/02/04/targets-new-ceo-says-retailer-lost-trust-with-shoppers-and-staff-bloomberg-news-reports/88514439007/", "title": "Target''s new CEO says retailer lost trust with shoppers and staff, Bloomberg News reports", "source": "The Detroit News", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.906517"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.713949"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.622753"}], "authors": ["Reuters"], "summary": "Target''s new CEO, Michael Fiddelke, acknowledges the retailer has lost trust with both shoppers and staff due to unclear company messagin