	 (1610,'alpha_vantage','WMT','TGT','2026-02-04 20:15:25','20260204T201525','Target Grapples With Identity Questions Under New CEO','https://www.ttnews.com/articles/target-identity-ceo-fiddelke','Target''s new CEO, Michael Fiddelke, acknowledged in his first town hall that the retailer has lost trust with shoppers and employees, pledging to rebuild this connection and clarify the company''s identity. The company faces challenges including a sales slump, an abrupt pullback from diversity initiatives, and pressure regarding its stance on federal immigration crackdowns. Fiddelke committed to improving merchandise, in-store experiences, and technology, while carefully navigating the immigration issue to prioritize employee safety.','https://www.ttnews.com/sites/default/files/styles/article_full_width_image/public/2026-02/Target-CEO-1200.jpg','Transport Topics','General','Transport Topics','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.600499"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.645555"}]',-0.042011,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.299716"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.705414", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.107608"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.635679", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.128290"}]','{"url": "https://www.ttnews.com/articles/target-identity-ceo-fiddelke", "title": "Target Grapples With Identity Questions Under New CEO", "source": "Transport Topics", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.600499"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.645555"}], "authors": ["Jaewon Kang"], "summary": "Target''s new CEO, Michael Fiddelke, acknowledged in his first town hall that the retailer has lost trust with shoppers a