	 (1619,'alpha_vantage','TPR','TPR','2026-02-05 12:35:37','20260205T123537','Earnings Flash (TPR) Tapestry, Inc. Posts Q2 Adjusted EPS $2.69 per Share, vs. FactSet Est of $2.22','https://www.marketscreener.com/news/earnings-flash-tpr-tapestry-inc-posts-q2-adjusted-eps-2-69-per-share-vs-factset-est-of-2-22-ce7e5adbd18cf322','Tapestry, Inc. (TPR) has reported its Q2 adjusted earnings per share (EPS) of $2.69, significantly surpassing the FactSet estimate of $2.22. This news comes alongside other positive financial updates, including increased fiscal Q2 non-GAAP earnings and net sales, and lifted fiscal 2026 guidance with expected revenue of $7.75 billion and adjusted EPS of $6.40 - $6.45.',NULL,'marketscreener.com','General','marketscreener.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.940207"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.732016"}]',0.277821,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "TPR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.468634"}, {"ticker": "FDS", "relevance_score": "0.640211", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.117366"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketscreener.com/news/earnings-flash-tpr-tapestry-inc-posts-q2-adjusted-eps-2-69-per-share-vs-factset-est-of-2-22-ce7e5adbd18cf322", "title": "Earnings Flash (TPR) Tapestry, Inc. Posts Q2 Adjusted EPS $2.69 per Share, vs. FactSet Est of $2.22", "source": "marketscreener.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.940207"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.732016"}], "authors": ["MT Newswires"], "summary": "Tapestry, Inc. (TPR) has reported its Q2 adjusted earnings per share (EPS) of $2.69, significantly surpassing the FactSet estimate of $2.22. This news comes alongside other positive financial updates, including increased fiscal Q2 non-GAAP earnings and net sales, and lifted fiscal 2026 guidance with expected revenue of $7.75 billion and adjusted EPS of $6.40 - $6.45.", "ban