	 (1625,'alpha_vantage','TPR','TPR','2026-02-05 11:48:00','20260205T114800','Tapestry lifts annual forecasts as Tabby handbag craze fuels blowout holiday quarter','https://www.reuters.com/business/retail-consumer/tapestry-lifts-annual-forecasts-tabby-handbag-craze-fuels-blowout-holiday-2026-02-05/','Tapestry (TPR.N) significantly raised its annual earnings forecasts for a second time after strong demand for its Tabby handbags drove better-than-expected holiday-quarter results. The success of the Coach brand, fueled by marketing to Gen Z customers, helped offset struggles at Kate Spade and contributed to a 5% rise in shares before the bell. The company now expects full-year adjusted earnings of $6.40 to $6.45 per share and revenue exceeding $7.75 billion.','https://www.reuters.com/resizer/v2/O5IN2GI5J5IV3EJUVGYQ36QZNI.jpg?auth=2b0ab98f78ac04f3d4bec42e21fb7448c769ac365b4c94df5d9fa46975d65d96&width=1920&quality=80','Reuters','General','Reuters','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.928554"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.811791"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.639215"}]',0.738013,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "TPR", "relevance_score": "0.958542", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.717225"}]','{"url": "https://www.reuters.com/business/retail-consumer/tapestry-lifts-annual-forecasts-tabby-handbag-craze-fuels-blowout-holiday-2026-02-05/", "title": "Tapestry lifts annual forecasts as Tabby handbag craze fuels blowout holiday quarter", "source": "Reuters", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.928554"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.811791"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.639215"}], "authors": ["Juveria Tabassum", "Angela Christy M"], "summary": "Tapestry (TPR.N) significantly raised its annual earnings forecasts for a second time after strong demand for its Tabby handbags drove better-than-expected holiday-quarter results. The success of the Coach brand, fueled by marketing to Gen Z customers, helped offset struggles at Kate Spade and contributed to a 5% rise in shares before the bell. The company now expects full-year adjusted earnings of $6.40 to $6.45 per share and revenue exceeding $7.75 billion.", "banner_image": "https://www.reuters.com/resizer/v2/O5IN2GI5J5IV3EJUVGYQ36QZNI.jpg?auth=2b0ab98f78ac04f3d4bec42e21fb7448c769ac365b4c94df5d9fa46975d65d96&width=1920&quality=80", "source_domain": "Reuters", "time_published": "20260205T114800", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "TPR", "relevance_score": "0.958542", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.717225"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.738013}','2026-02-05 14:06:39',NULL),
	 (1626,'alpha_vantage','TPR','TPR','2026-02-04 15:28:20','20260204T152820','Tapestry faces earnings test as Coach momentum meets tariff squeeze','https://m.investing.com/news/earnings/tapestry-faces-earnings-test-as-coach-momentum-meets-tariff-squeeze-93CH-4485340?ampMode=1','Tapestry Inc. is set to report its fiscal second-quarter earnings, with analysts focusing on whether its Coach brand can maintain its strong performance despite facing $160 million in tariff costs. Investors will also scrutinize management''s guidance for the upcoming quarter and the progress of the Kate Spade brand''s turnaround. While Street estimates have risen, recent analyst activity suggests a cautious tone due to execution risks and elevated market expectations for an earnings beat.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/msite/img/install_apps/mobile-icon-banner.svg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.939427"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.811674"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.707823"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.632975"}]',0.076312,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TPR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.059721"}, {"ticker": "WFC", "relevance_score": "0.577733", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.110559"}, {"ticker": "C", "relevance_score": "0.580714", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.106464"}]','{"url": "https://m.investing.com/news/earnings/tapestry-faces-earnings-test-as-coach-momentum-meets-tariff-squeeze-93CH-4485340?ampMode=1", "title": "Tapestry faces earnings test as Coach momentum meets tariff squeeze", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.939427"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.811674"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.707823"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal"