	 (1627,'alpha_vantage','TPR','TPR','2026-02-04 15:27:48','20260204T152748','Tapestry faces earnings test as Coach momentum meets tariff squeeze By Investing.com','https://m.in.investing.com/news/earnings/tapestry-faces-earnings-test-as-coach-momentum-meets-tariff-squeeze-93CH-5221661?ampMode=1','Tapestry Inc. is set to report its fiscal second-quarter earnings, with investors focused on whether its Coach brand can maintain growth amidst $160 million in tariff costs. Analysts anticipate strong December quarter results, but recent downgrades and cautious price target adjustments highlight execution risks and the need for significant guidance upside. The health of the Coach brand and the turnaround progress of Kate Spade will be key areas of investor scrutiny.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/msite/img/install_apps/mobile-icon-banner.svg','Investing.com India','General','Investing.com India','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.949727"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.821063"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.738721"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.636081"}]',-0.062672,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TPR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.092319"}]','{"url": "https://m.in.investing.com/news/earnings/tapestry-faces-earnings-test-as-coach-momentum-meets-tariff-squeeze-93CH-5221661?ampMode=1", "title": "Tapestry faces earnings test as Coach momentum meets tariff squeeze By Investing.com", "source": "Investing.com India", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.949727"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.821063"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.738721"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.636081"}], "authors": ["Investing.com", "Frank DeMatteo"], "summary": "Tapestry Inc. is set to report its fiscal second-quarter earnings, with investors focused on whether its Coach brand c