	 (1630,'alpha_vantage','TSCO','TSCO','2026-02-05 05:30:31','20260205T053031','5 Revealing Analyst Questions From Tractor Supply’s Q4 Earnings Call','https://www.tradingview.com/news/stockstory:afeaea327094b:0-5-revealing-analyst-questions-from-tractor-supply-s-q4-earnings-call/','Tractor Supply''s Q4 results missed analyst expectations due to a quieter storm season and reduced discretionary demand, though essential categories showed resilience. The article highlights five key analyst questions and management''s responses regarding gross margin trends, Q1 demand trajectory, discretionary spending, tariff impacts, and the path to historical comparable growth rates. The company is focusing on new store openings, direct sales, and efficiency to navigate competitive landscapes and promotional pressures.','https://s3.tradingview.com/news/image/stockstory:afeaea327094b-ec72614ea7bd0a8d4c0652ad8ae0ee5e-resized.webp','TradingView','General','TradingView','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.912357"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.827557"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.649112"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.642324"}]',-0.298558,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "TSCO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.277436"}]','{"url": "https://www.tradingview.com/news/stockstory:afeaea327094b:0-5-revealing-analyst-questions-from-tractor-supply-s-q4-earnings-call/", "title": "5 Revealing Analyst Questions From Tractor Supply’s Q4 Earnings Call", "source": "TradingView", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.912357"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.827557"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.649112"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.642324"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Tractor Supply''s Q4 results missed analyst expectations due to a quieter storm season and reduced discre