	 (1631,'alpha_vantage','TSCO','TSCO','2026-02-04 19:13:35','20260204T191335','Tractor Supply readies next phase of final-mile delivery plan','https://www.supplychaindive.com/news/tractor-supply-final-mile-delivery-2026/811258/','Tractor Supply Co. is expanding its final-mile delivery initiative in 2026 to enhance efficiency and reduce transportation costs. This expansion includes adding over 150 new hub locations, bringing the total to about 375 hubs covering more than half of its stores and reaching over 15 million customers. The company aims to self-fund this initiative through an estimated $10 million in freight-related savings annually, while also integrating more with gig providers like UPS''s Roadie.','https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/-QTeCXKZMde4BDhFvU-nWjAH6xYcEbZoDtmIiaMJx4s/g:nowe:0:581/c:6600:3728/rs:fill:1200:675:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9UU0MtU3RvcmUtRnJvbnQuanBn.webp','Supply Chain Dive','General','Supply Chain Dive','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.940686"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.837721"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.639014"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.733588"}]',0.26276,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "TSCO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.307883"}, {"ticker": "UPS", "relevance_score": "0.604301", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.224398"}]','{"url": "https://www.supplychaindive.com/news/tractor-supply-final-mile-delivery-2026/811258/", "title": "Tractor Supply readies next phase of final-mile delivery plan", "source": "Supply Chain Dive", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.940686"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.837721"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.639014"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.733588"}], "authors": ["Max Garland"], "summary": 