	 (1633,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-05 00:29:09','20260205T002909','Ulta Beauty names first-ever Ulta Beauty Roster','https://us.fashionnetwork.com/news/Ulta-beauty-names-first-ever-ulta-beauty-roster,1804598.html','Ulta Beauty has announced its inaugural Ulta Beauty Roster, a collective of six professional female athletes who will represent the brand and help redefine sports through the lens of beauty and empowerment. The roster includes athletes from pickleball, basketball, tennis, volleyball, soccer, and flag football. Coinciding with this initiative, Ulta Beauty is launching the Roster for Change grant program to support local communities and sports organizations, and fans can explore digital trading cards featuring the athletes and their essential beauty products.','https://media.fashionnetwork.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=contain,width=1000,height=1000,format=auto/m/48a4/7b91/f301/843c/52c5/060d/93c2/c273/fb33/d259/d259.jpg','FashionNetwork USA','General','FashionNetwork USA','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.801333"}]',0.419114,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.400464"}]','{"url": "https://us.fashionnetwork.com/news/Ulta-beauty-names-first-ever-ulta-beauty-roster,1804598.html", "title": "Ulta Beauty names first-ever Ulta Beauty Roster", "source": "FashionNetwork USA", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.801333"}], "authors": ["Jennifer Braun"], "summary": "Ulta Beauty has announced its inaugural Ulta Beauty Roster, a collective of six professional female athletes who will represent the brand and help redefine sports through the lens of beauty and empowerment. The roster includes athletes from pickleball, basketball, tennis, volleyball, soccer, and flag football. Coinciding with this initiative, Ulta Beauty is launching the Roster for Change grant program to support local communities and sports organizations, and fans