	 (1634,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-04 22:25:00','20260204T222500','E.l.f. Beauty Raises 2026 Forecasts as Rhode Breaks Records and New Super Bowl Campaign Debuts','https://wwd.com/beauty-industry-news/skin-care/elf-beauty-raises-2026-forecasts-rhode-superbowl-1238538998/','E.l.f. Beauty has increased its full-year 2026 forecasts for both revenue and net income following a strong third quarter. The company, which owns E.l.f., Rhode, and Naturium, reported a 38% surge in Q3 net sales to $489.5 million, surpassing analyst expectations. This positive outlook is driven by the continued international expansion and record-breaking performance of Rhode, along with Naturium''s growth and E.l.f.''s upcoming Super Bowl campaign and new fragrance launch.','https://wwd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/e.l.f.-Cosmetics-Big-Game-Hero-Image.jpg?w=1000&h=563&crop=1','WWD','General','WWD','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.930028"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.817736"}]',0.328955,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "ELF", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.477161"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.639642", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.208185"}, {"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "0.627621", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.241758"}]','{"url": "https://wwd.com/beauty-industry-news/skin-care/elf-beauty-raises-2026-forecasts-rhode-superbowl-1238538998/", "title": "E.l.f. Beauty Raises 2026 Forecasts as Rhode Breaks Records and New Super Bowl Campaign Debuts", "source": "WWD", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.930028"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.817736"}], "authors": ["Kathryn Hopkins"], "summary": "E.l.f. Beauty has increased its full-year 2026 forecasts for both revenue and net income following a strong third quarter. The company, which owns