	 (1638,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-04 16:28:33','20260204T162833','Ulta Beauty Inc.: How a Hybrid Retail Platform Became Beauty’s Powerhouse Product','https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/ueberblick/ulta-beauty-inc-how-a-hybrid-retail-platform-became-beauty-s/68551639','Ulta Beauty Inc. has transformed from a traditional retail chain into a robust, hybrid beauty platform. This platform integrates physical stores, in-store services, a powerful loyalty program (Ultimate Rewards), and an enhanced digital experience, making it a unique product in the beauty industry. Ulta''s strategy of combining mass and prestige beauty products, along with its strategic partnerships and data-driven approach, provides it with a significant competitive advantage over rivals like Sephora, Target, and Amazon, driving its strong market performance and valuation.',NULL,'AD HOC NEWS','General','AD HOC NEWS','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.944305"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.802334"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.708588"}]',0.046284,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "0.328506", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.043466"}]','{"url": "https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/ueberblick/ulta-beauty-inc-how-a-hybrid-retail-platform-became-beauty-s/68551639", "title": "Ulta Beauty Inc.: How a Hybrid Retail Platform Became Beauty’s Powerhouse Product", "source": "AD HOC NEWS", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.944305"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.802334"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.708588"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Ulta Beauty Inc. has transformed from a traditional retail chain into a robust, hybrid beauty platform. This platform integrates physical stores, in-store services, a powerful loyalty program (Ultimate Rewards), and an enhanced digital experience, making it a unique product in the beauty indus