	 (1643,'alpha_vantage','VFC','VFC','2026-02-05 03:30:24','20260205T033024','Under Armour (UAA) Q4 Earnings: What To Expect','https://www.tradingview.com/news/stockstory:371b8cf6e094b:0-under-armour-uaa-q4-earnings-what-to-expect/','Under Armour (UAA) is set to announce its Q4 earnings before market hours on Friday. Analysts anticipate a 6.3% year-on-year revenue decline to $1.31 billion and an adjusted loss of -$0.01 per share, with estimates remaining largely consistent. The company has previously missed Wall Street''s revenue forecasts twice in the last two years, but its stock has seen a significant 15.8% increase over the past month.','https://s3.tradingview.com/news/image/stockstory:371b8cf6e094b-446b5f8518cfa6411dcd4aee36df79e8-resized.webp','TradingView','General','TradingView','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.925629"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.706731"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.620165"}]',0.038114,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "VFC", "relevance_score": "0.719557", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.020295"}]','{"url": "https://www.tradingview.com/news/stockstory:371b8cf6e094b:0-under-armour-uaa-q4-earnings-what-to-expect/", "title": "Under Armour (UAA) Q4 Earnings: What To Expect", "source": "TradingView", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.925629"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.706731"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.620165"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Under Armour (UAA) is set to announce its Q4 earnings before market hours on Friday. Analysts anticipate a 6.3% year-on-year revenue decline to $1.31 billion and an adjusted loss of -$0.01 per share, with estimates remaining largely consistent. The company has previously missed Wall Street''s revenue forecasts twice in the last two years, but its stock has seen a significant 15.8% increase over the past month.", "banner_image": "https://s3.tradingview