	 (1644,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-05 13:18:40','20260205T131840','Avery Dennison Corporation (NYSE:AVY) Q4 2025 Earnings Call Transcript','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/avery-dennison-corporation-nyseavy-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript-1689427/','Avery Dennison Corporation announced solid full-year 2025 results with adjusted EPS of $9.53 and $700 million in adjusted free cash flow, exceeding earnings expectations with a reported EPS of $2.45. Despite organic sales being flat due to deflationary pricing and softer consumer sentiment, the company emphasized its focus on high-value categories, innovation acceleration, and productivity to drive future growth. For 2026, Avery Dennison anticipates approximately 6% adjusted earnings per share growth on organic sales growth of zero to 2%, with a sequential increase in earnings throughout the year.','https://imonkey-blog.imgix.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/12224529/AVY-insidermonkey-1697165126808.jpg?auto=format&fit=clip&expires=1801785600&width=480&height=269','Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.811956"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.716701"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.723818"}]',0.205766,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AVY", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.207399"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.653172", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.244071"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/avery-dennison-corporation-nyseavy-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript-1689427/", "title": "Avery Dennison Corporation (NYSE:AVY) Q4 2025 Earnings Call Transcript", "source": "Insider Monkey", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.811956"}, {"topic": "manufactu