	 (1666,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-04 17:02:27','20260204T170227','Kosterina Launches Vinegars Nationwide in Walmart Stores','https://finance.yahoo.com/news/kosterina-launches-vinegars-nationwide-walmart-170000664.html','Kosterina, a Mediterranean wellness brand, has significantly expanded its retail presence by launching its Crushed Fruit Vinegars and Balsamic Vinegars in approximately 4,300 Walmart stores nationwide and on Walmart.com. These vinegars, known for their clean ingredients and versatility, are designed for various culinary uses, including drinks, dressings, and marinades, and cater to digestion- and blood sugar-conscious lifestyles. This move marks a key milestone for Kosterina, bringing premium Mediterranean pantry staples to a broader mass audience.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/YHMymDaOg2EjfgXCDfoBAQ--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTQyMDtoPTIwNA--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/globenewswire.com/a892aab55def62631b54783d5dead01e','Yahoo Finance','General','Yahoo Finance','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.827184"}]',0.472122,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.478185"}]','{"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/kosterina-launches-vinegars-nationwide-walmart-170000664.html", "title": "Kosterina Launches Vinegars Nationwide in Walmart Stores", "source": "Yahoo Finance", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.827184"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Kosterina, a Mediterranean wellness brand, has significantly expanded its retail presence by launching its Crushed Fruit Vinegars and Balsamic Vinegars in approximately 4,300 Walmart stores nationwide and on Walmart.com. These vinegars, known for their clean ingredients and versatility, are designed for various culinary uses, including drinks, dressings, and marinades, and cater to digestion- and blood sugar-conscious lifestyles. This move marks a key milestone for Kosterina, bringing premium Mediterranean pantry staples to a broader mass audience.", "banner_image": "https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/YHMymDaOg2EjfgXCDfoBAQ--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTQyMDtoPTIwNA--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/globenewswire.com/a892aab55def62631b54783d5dead01e", "source_domain": "Yahoo Finance", "time_published": "20260204T170227", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.478185"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.472122}','2026-02-05 14:06:56',NULL),
	 (1667,'alpha_vantage','WSM','WSM','2026-02-04 17:34:30','20260204T173430','Williams-Sonoma, Inc. (WSM): A Bull Case Theory','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/williams-sonoma-inc-wsm-a-bull-case-theory-3-1688459/','This article summarizes a bullish thesis on Williams-Sonoma, Inc. (WSM) from Quality Value Investing, emphasizing the company''s strong brand equity, customer loyalty, and omnichannel execution. The analysis highlights WSM''s resilient revenue growth, strong profitability, and effective capital allocation strategies, including significant share repurchases and healthy returns on equity and invested capital. Despite a "no-moat" rating from Morningstar, QVI argues WSM''s fundamentals align with a narrow-moat business, underscoring its long-term shareholder return potential.','https://imonkey-blog.imgix.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/02205807/WSM-insidermonkey-1696294685406.jpg?auto=format&expires=1801699200&w=480&h=270&fit=crop','Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.828062"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.733250"}]',0.518231,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "WSM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.511056"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/williams-sonoma-inc-wsm-a-bull-case-theory-3-1688459/", "title": "Williams-Sonoma, Inc. (WSM): A Bull Case Theory", "source": "Insider Monkey", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.828062"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.733250"}], "authors": ["Ricardo Pillai"], "summary": "This article summarizes a bullish thesis on Williams-Sonoma, Inc. (WSM) from Quality Value Investing, emphasizing the company''s strong brand equity, customer loyalty, and omnichannel execution. The analysis highlights WSM''s resilient revenue growth, strong profi