	 (1668,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 11:46:46','20260206T114646','Goldman Sachs raises StepStone Group stock price target on wealth growth','https://www.investing.com/news/analyst-ratings/goldman-sachs-raises-stepstone-group-stock-price-target-on-wealth-growth-93CH-4490055','Goldman Sachs has increased its price target for StepStone Group (NASDAQ:STEP) to $93.00 from $90.00, maintaining a Buy rating due to the strength of its Private Wealth franchise and upcoming fundraising cycles. The new target suggests a 57% upside from the current price. The firm also revised its earnings per share estimates upward for 2026, 2027, and 2028, projecting significant management fee and fee-related earnings growth.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/World_News_9_800x533_L_1420026261.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.942404"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.817905"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.731251"}]',0.046439,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "GS", "relevance_score": "0.922650", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.413776"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.579771", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.428364"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/analyst-ratings/goldman-sachs-raises-stepstone-group-stock-price-target-on-wealth-growth-93CH-4490055", "title": "Goldman Sachs raises StepStone Group stock price target on wealth growth", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.942404"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.817905"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.731251"}], "authors": ["Investing.com"], "summary": "Goldman Sachs has increased its price target for StepStone Group (NASDAQ:STEP) to $93.00 from $90.00, maintaining a Buy rating due to the strength of its Private Wealth franchise and upcoming fundraising cycles. The new target sug