	 (1669,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 10:01:39','20260206T100139','Fortinet Stock Rises After Earnings Beat. Why It Can Dodge the Tech Selloff.','https://www.barrons.com/articles/fortinet-earnings-stock-price-0b1ee3f1?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqesYAudRCyIo3CUva58XFToS8rMwD99RlgwZLfCVPn-asfCpuMRVaGV&gaa_ts=6985cc13&gaa_sig=tWx9XmFVd5Sl0YNSLp8t2mT7gGXYcX8T2CdmT8gbx4ETwEilCmmlOm0g4NFcw5WFSuxIs8xZxGE25EUhgITfGQ%3D%3D','Fortinet (FTNT) stock rose on Friday after the cybersecurity company announced better-than-expected fourth-quarter earnings and revenue, along with strong guidance. This performance allowed Fortinet to defy a broader market downturn, suggesting it may be able to avoid a larger tech selloff. The company''s financial results topped analysts'' expectations.','https://images.barrons.com/im-26149098?width=700&height=466','Barron''s','General','Barron''s','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.940758"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.839846"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.704065"}]',0.199864,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "FTNT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.470265"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.580311", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.139573"}, {"ticker": "AMD", "relevance_score": "0.581115", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.105855"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.575624", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.135985"}]','{"url": "https://www.barrons.com/articles/fortinet-earnings-stock-price-0b1ee3f1?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqesYAudRCyIo3CUva58XFToS8rMwD99RlgwZLfCVPn-asfCpuMRVaGV&gaa_ts=6985cc13&gaa_sig=tWx9XmFVd5Sl0YNSLp8t2mT7gGXYcX8T2CdmT8gbx4ETwEilCmmlOm0g4NFcw5WFSuxIs8xZxGE25EUhgITfGQ%3D%3D", "title": "Fortinet Stock Rises After Earnings Beat. Why It Can Dodge the Tech Selloff.", "source": "Barron''s", "topics": [{"to