	 (1670,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 09:58:54','20260206T095854','Stock market today: S&P 500, Nasdaq poised to deepen tech rout as Amazon''s earnings flop','https://finance.yahoo.com/news/live/stock-market-today-sp-500-nasdaq-poised-to-deepen-tech-rout-as-amazons-earnings-flop-000711574.html','US stock futures, including the S&P 500 and Nasdaq, are set to fall further due to Amazon''s post-earnings slide and broader concerns about tech valuations amid increased AI spending. Amazon shares tumbled after its operating income forecast fell short despite significant spending plans, contributing to the S&P 500 and Nasdaq Composite slipping into negative territory for 2026. Other market movements include silver''s continued decline, Bitcoin''s drop to 2024 levels impacting Strategy, and Reddit and Roblox surging on positive earnings and guidance.',NULL,'Yahoo Finance','General','Yahoo Finance','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.918671"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.934570"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.844849"}, {"topic": "blockchain", "relevance_score": "0.739314"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.618051"}]',-0.46385,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.456316"}, {"ticker": "COIN", "relevance_score": "0.625119", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.430797"}]','{"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/live/stock-market-today-sp-500-nasdaq-poised-to-deepen-tech-rout-as-amazons-earnings-flop-000711574.html", "title": "Stock market today: S&P 500, Nasdaq poised to deepen tech rout as Amazon''s earnings flop", "source": "Yahoo Finance", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.918671"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.934570"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.844849"}, {"topic": "blockchain", "relevance_score": "0.739314"}, {"