	 (1682,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 22:39:00','20260205T223900','Salesforce stock sinks as ‘software-mageddon’ bites again — what to watch before earnings','https://ts2.tech/en/salesforce-stock-sinks-as-software-mageddon-bites-again-what-to-watch-before-earnings/','Salesforce shares dropped 4.8% due to investor concerns about AI impacting subscription-based revenue models, a trend dubbed "software-mageddon" affecting the broader SaaS sector. All attention is now on Salesforce''s upcoming Q4 and full-year fiscal 2026 earnings report on February 25th, where investors will scrutinize the company''s AI initiatives and guidance amidst the market selloff. Despite the downturn, some analysts remain bullish, viewing the selloff as a temporary “garage sale” and noting Salesforce''s current valuation is below historical norms and the S&P 500.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/salesforce-stock-sinks-as-software-mageddon-bites-again-what-to-watch-before-earnings-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.934299"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.901540"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.801003"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.617421"}]',-0.248144,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CRM", "relevance_score": "0.980975", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.315416"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.639020", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.219372"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/salesforce-stock-sinks-as-software-mageddon-bites-again-what-to-watch-before-earnings/", "title": "Salesforce stock sinks as ‘software-mageddon’ bites again — what to watch before earnings", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.934299"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.901540"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.80