	 (1689,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 21:28:25','20260205T212825','Molina Healthcare shares plunge 33% on surprise Q4 loss, disappointing guidance','https://www.investing.com/news/earnings/molina-healthcare-shares-plunge-33-on-surprise-q4-loss--disappointing-guidance-4489018','Molina Healthcare (NYSE: MOH) shares plummeted 33% after reporting a significant fourth-quarter adjusted loss of -$2.75 per share, far below analyst estimates of $0.34 per share. The company also issued disappointing 2026 guidance, projecting adjusted earnings of at least $5.00 per share against an estimated $13.71, and revenue guidance of at least $44.5 billion, falling short of the $46.785 billion analysts anticipated. Factors contributing to the poor performance include unfavorable retroactive premium adjustments and medical cost pressures, as well as burdens from a new Florida Medicaid contract and underperformance in Medicare Advantage Part D.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/moved_LYNXMPEM0F0UJ_L.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.939431"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.808366"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.741268"}]',-0.702063,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "MOH", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.840805"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.637723", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.628736"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/earnings/molina-healthcare-shares-plunge-33-on-surprise-q4-loss--disappointing-guidance-4489018", "title": "Molina Healthcare shares plunge 33% on surprise Q4 loss, disappointing guidance", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.939431"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.808366"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.741268"}], "authors": ["Rachael Rajan"], "summary": "