	 (1690,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 21:27:26','20260205T212726','GOOG stock whipsaws after Alphabet flags up to $185 billion in AI capex','https://ts2.tech/en/goog-stock-whipsaws-after-alphabet-flags-up-to-185-billion-in-ai-capex/','Alphabet''s Class C shares experienced significant volatility after the company announced plans to nearly double its capital spending on AI infrastructure, projecting $175 billion to $185 billion in capex for 2026. This aggressive investment, despite strong Q4 earnings and cloud growth, has raised investor concerns about the timeline and ultimate payoff of such large-scale AI expenditures. The market is increasingly questioning whether these massive investments by tech giants will justify their costs, especially with rising depreciation and operating expenses.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/goog-stock-whipsaws-after-alphabet-flags-up-to-185-billion-in-ai-capex-featured-1.jpg.webp','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932437"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.824249"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.846708"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.615237"}]',-0.03265,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.965453", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.032551"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.723984", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.102489"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.641405", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.186289"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/goog-stock-whipsaws-after-alphabet-flags-up-to-185-billion-in-ai-capex/", "title": "GOOG stock whipsaws after Alphabet flags up to $185 billion in AI capex", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932437"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.824249"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "r