	 (1691,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 21:04:47','20260205T210447','Amazon.com Announces Fourth Quarter Results','https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260204777163/en/Amazon.com-Announces-Fourth-Quarter-Results','Amazon.com (NASDAQ: AMZN) reported strong financial results for its fourth quarter and full year 2025. Fourth-quarter net sales increased 14% to $213.4 billion, with AWS sales up 24%. For the full year, net sales reached $716.9 billion, a 12% increase, and net income rose to $77.7 billion. The company highlighted significant innovation in AI, chips, and delivery speeds, and provided optimistic guidance for the first quarter of 2026.','https://mms.businesswire.com/media/20260204777163/en/2712262/4/Amazon_logo.jpg','Business Wire','General','Business Wire','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.802175"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.709534"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.633653"}]',0.281784,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.472533"}, {"ticker": "CRM", "relevance_score": "0.648639", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.211395"}, {"ticker": "ADBE", "relevance_score": "0.602274", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.223270"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.561983", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.177270"}]','{"url": "https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260204777163/en/Amazon.com-Announces-Fourth-Quarter-Results", "title": "Amazon.com Announces Fourth Quarter Results", "source": "Business Wire", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.802175"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.709534"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance