	 (1692,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 20:58:14','20260205T205814','Revisiting asset allocation in an AI world','https://www.troweprice.com/en/uk/insights/revisiting-asset-allocation-in-an-ai-world','The article discusses how the artificial intelligence (AI) boom has significantly reshaped the U.S. stock market, leading to increased concentration in technology and higher-beta stocks, and elevated factor volatility. It argues that while current valuations are supported by profitability, investors need to rethink asset allocation and employ active risk management. The authors suggest that resilience can be built through incorporating alternative return sources, better hedges, and sophisticated alpha generation, alongside tactical allocations to areas like healthcare, small-to-mid cap equities, and emerging markets.','https://www.troweprice.com/content/dam/public/enterprise/investment-institute/images/Insights-hero.svg','T. Rowe Price','General','T. Rowe Price','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.940682"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.821432"}]',0.393581,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "TROW", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.207311"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.744491", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.436599"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.711451", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.420208"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.611913", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.404692"}, {"ticker": "META", "relevance_score": "0.617026", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.424913"}]','{"url": "https://www.troweprice.com/en/uk/insights/revisiting-asset-allocation-in-an-ai-world", "title": "Revisiting asset allocation in an AI world", "source": "T. Rowe Price", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_