	 (1693,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 20:57:24','20260205T205724','Earnings Flash (AMZN) Amazon.com, Inc. Reports Q4 Revenue $213.39B, vs. FactSet Est of $211.44B','https://www.marketscreener.com/news/earnings-flash-amzn-amazon-com-inc-reports-q4-revenue-213-39b-vs-factset-est-of-211-44b-ce7e5ad8dd88ff23','Amazon.com, Inc. reported its Q4 revenue at $213.39 billion, surpassing FactSet''s estimate of $211.44 billion. The company also posted Q4 EPS of $1.95, slightly below the FactSet estimate of $1.97. For Q1, Amazon expects revenue to range between $173.5 billion and $178.5 billion, compared to FactSet''s estimate of $175.62 billion, and anticipates a 50% boost to capital spending this year.',NULL,'marketscreener.com','General','marketscreener.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.808297"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.709173"}]',0.20926,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.266302"}, {"ticker": "FDS", "relevance_score": "0.643359", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.131510"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketscreener.com/news/earnings-flash-amzn-amazon-com-inc-reports-q4-revenue-213-39b-vs-factset-est-of-211-44b-ce7e5ad8dd88ff23", "title": "Earnings Flash (AMZN) Amazon.com, Inc. Reports Q4 Revenue $213.39B, vs. FactSet Est of $211.44B", "source": "marketscreener.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.808297"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.709173"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Amazon.com, Inc. reported its Q4 revenue at $213.39 billion, surpassing FactSet''s estimate of $211.44 billion. The company also posted Q4 EPS of $1.95, slightly below the FactSet estimate of $1.97. For Q1, Amazon expects revenue to range between