	 (1694,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 20:33:06','20260205T203306','UPS vs. FedEx: Which Logistics Giant Looks Like the Better Long-Term Play?​','https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/UPS/pressreleases/56404/ups-vs-fedex-which-logistics-giant-looks-like-the-better-long-term-play/','This article analyzes UPS and FedEx as long-term investments, highlighting FedEx''s superior performance in stock returns and revenue growth compared to UPS. While UPS focuses on cost-cutting and margin expansion through significant layoffs and reduced Amazon shipments, FedEx prioritizes growth and market share. The analysis suggests FedEx appears to be the stronger investment currently, offering both growth and margin expansion, whereas UPS''s aggressive cost-cutting may hinder future growth opportunities.','https://barchart-news-media-prod.aws.barchart.com/FC/b6ed94f25a6162eb6d3efde298ae4812/%3Furl%3Dhttps%253a%252f%252fg.foolcdn.com%252feditorial%252fimages%252f850403%252fgetty-delivery-fedex-ups-amazon-1200x798-36b7a2e.jpg%26amp%3Bw%3D700','The Globe and Mail','General','The Globe and Mail','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.815491"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.933088"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.610543"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.937345"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.706576"}]',0.080592,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "FDX", "relevance_score": "0.950133", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.345697"}, {"ticker": "UPS", "relevance_score": "0.949278", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.081310"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.611460", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.029328"}, {"ticker": "NFLX", "relevance_score": "0.558234", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.015424"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.