	 (1697,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 18:29:43','20260205T182943','This fund is shrinking share counts: 10 HERZ shares become 1 on Feb. 9','https://www.stocktitan.net/news/HERZ/herzfeld-credit-income-fund-inc-announces-effective-date-for-reverse-zqmco801x0gb.html','Herzfeld Credit Income Fund (HERZ) announced a 10-for-1 reverse stock split, effective 5:00 PM ET on February 6, 2026, with post-split trading beginning on Nasdaq on February 9, 2026, under the same ticker. This action will consolidate outstanding shares, reducing the total count by approximately 90%, and introduce a new CUSIP (42804T205). The company''s goal is to potentially boost its stock price and appear more stable to investors, following previous capital actions and distributions.','https://ml.globenewswire.com/media/NTUwZGM0OTAtZWRiOC00NDhhLWFhY2QtZTI0YmQ3ZjMzYTFjLTEyMTg3NzQtMjAyNi0wMi0wNS1lbg==/tiny/Herzfeld-Caribbean-Basin-Fund.png','Stock Titan','General','Stock Titan','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.843040"}]',-0.074968,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "HERZ", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.208787"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.647366", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.050434"}, {"ticker": "FTNT", "relevance_score": "0.601915", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.071965"}]','{"url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/news/HERZ/herzfeld-credit-income-fund-inc-announces-effective-date-for-reverse-zqmco801x0gb.html", "title": "This fund is shrinking share counts: 10 HERZ shares become 1 on Feb. 9", "source": "Stock Titan", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.843040"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Herzfeld Credit Income Fund (HERZ) announced a 10-for-1 reverse stock split, effective 5:00 PM ET on Feb