	 (1698,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 17:31:00','20260205T173100','The AI Storage Pivot: Seagate Shares Rocket 19% as Hard Drive Demand Hits Unprecedented Peaks','https://markets.financialcontent.com/stocks/article/marketminute-2026-2-5-the-ai-storage-pivot-seagate-shares-rocket-19-as-hard-drive-demand-hits-unprecedented-peaks','Seagate Technology Holdings plc (NASDAQ: STX) saw its stock surge by 19% after a strong fiscal second-quarter earnings report, driven by unprecedented demand for high-capacity hard drives due to the AI boom. The company''s manufacturing capacity for nearline HDDs is fully allocated for the rest of the year, signaling a new "supercycle" for the storage industry. This shift highlights the critical need for cost-effective, high-capacity storage for AI training data, proving that hard drives remain essential alongside faster SSDs.','https://marketminute.ghost.io/content/images/size/w1200/2026/02/01583241-10bc-4055-b657-0e28b03bba6e.png','FinancialContent','General','FinancialContent','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.938501"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.832615"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.705268"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.634084"}]',0.154328,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "STX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.462153"}, {"ticker": "WDC", "relevance_score": "0.729005", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.254196"}, {"ticker": "MU", "relevance_score": "0.592619", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.247826"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.607754", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.117384"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.646400", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.116862"}]','{"url": "https://markets.financialcontent.com/stocks/ar