	 (1700,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 16:34:43','20260205T163443','Stock of the week: Alphabet is no longer just a search engine (05.02.2026)','https://www.xtb.com/int/market-analysis/news-and-research/stock-of-the-week-alphabet-is-no-longer-just-a-search-engine-05-02-2026','Alphabet reported strong Q4 2025 results, with revenues exceeding $113 billion, driven by growth in Google Services, Search, and a significant 48% increase in Google Cloud revenue. The company plans to ramp up investment spending to $175–185 billion in 2026 to solidify its leadership in AI and cloud computing, despite potential short-term impacts on margins. A DCF analysis suggests an 18% upside potential, valuing Alphabet at $373.36 per share.','https://xtb.scdn5.secure.raxcdn.com/postTopImage/0104/19/b2024fb1-6fa9-4f1c-b795-4c722ad8b4fc/postTopImage_front/mike-kononov-lfv0v3-2h6s.jpg','XTB.com','General','XTB.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.939213"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.803080"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.634765"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.640242"}]',0.325753,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.627340"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.928061", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.591249"}, {"ticker": "NFLX", "relevance_score": "0.586856", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.101926"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.564198", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.146211"}, {"ticker": "AAPL", "relevance_score": "0.598144", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.101519"}]','{"url": "https://www.xtb.com/int/market-analysis/news-and-research/stock-of-the-week-alphabet-is-no-longer-just-a-search-engine-05-02-202