	 (1701,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 16:33:14','20260205T163314','AT&T hooks up with Amazon Leo to connect businesses','https://www.lightreading.com/satellite/at-t-hooks-up-with-amazon-leo-to-connect-business-customers','AT&T has entered into a multi-faceted agreement with Amazon, which includes utilizing Amazon Leo''s upcoming satellite broadband network to provide connectivity to business customers beyond AT&T''s existing network reach. Additionally, AT&T will integrate with AWS Outposts, Amazon Web Services'' hybrid cloud offering, to migrate workloads and modernize its business support systems. The financial terms and specific launch timings for these services have not yet been disclosed, though Amazon Leo is still in the process of deploying its LEO satellite constellation.','https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt23eb5bbc4124baa6/blt0115a958bbe89bdd/69272de2edf82bd00f66508f/Amazon_Leo_receiver.png?width=1280&auto=webp&quality=80&disable=upscale','Light Reading','General','Light Reading','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}]',0.233227,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "T", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.323770"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.841269", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.297168"}, {"ticker": "CMCSA", "relevance_score": "0.627296", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.147118"}]','{"url": "https://www.lightreading.com/satellite/at-t-hooks-up-with-amazon-leo-to-connect-business-customers", "title": "AT&T hooks up with Amazon Leo to connect businesses", "source": "Light Reading", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}], "authors": ["Jeff Baumgartner"], "summary": "AT&T has entered into a multi-faceted agreement with Amazon, which includes utilizing Amazon Leo''s upcoming satellite broadband network to provide connectivity to busines