	 (1705,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 15:58:46','20260205T155846','Analysts Estimate Maplebear (CART) to Report a Decline in Earnings: What to Look Out for','https://finviz.com/news/301693/analysts-estimate-maplebear-cart-to-report-a-decline-in-earnings-what-to-look-out-for','Analysts expect Maplebear (CART) to report a year-over-year decline in earnings but higher revenues for the quarter ended December 2025. The company''s Most Accurate Estimate is lower than the Zacks Consensus Estimate, resulting in a negative Earnings ESP of -15.61%, which, combined with a Zacks Rank of #3, makes it difficult to definitively predict an earnings beat. Despite a strong history of beating EPS estimates over the last four quarters, investors should consider other factors beyond just earnings surprise history.','https://chart-service.zacks.com/images/daily/yesop_price_consensus_surprise/CART.png','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.912226"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.723607"}]',-0.082428,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "CART", "relevance_score": "0.966353", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.276027"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.612250", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.142174"}, {"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "0.588633", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.112731"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.579739", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.053429"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/301693/analysts-estimate-maplebear-cart-to-report-a-decline-in-earnings-what-to-look-out-for", "title": "Analysts Estimate Maplebear (CART) to Report a Decline in Earnings: What to Look Out for", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.912226"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.723607"}], "authors": ["Zacks Equity Resear