	 (1708,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 15:58:13','20260205T155813','Oppenheimer Raises Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) Target as AWS Momentum and Margin Expansion Accelerate','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/oppenheimer-raises-amazon-com-inc-amzn-target-as-aws-momentum-and-margin-expansion-accelerate-1689206/','Oppenheimer has raised its price target for Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) to $315 from $305, maintaining an Outperform rating. This adjustment is based on anticipated accelerated growth in Amazon Web Services (AWS) and significant margin expansion in its e-commerce sector due to automation investments. The firm projects Amazon to be a leading mega-cap investment, despite news of Saks Global ending its e-commerce partnership with Amazon, which is not expected to materially impact Amazon''s operations.','https://imonkey-blog.imgix.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/28105216/christian-wiediger-rymh7EZPqRs-unsplash.jpg?auto=format&fit=clip&expires=1801785600&width=480&height=320','Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.924555"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.920624"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.828208"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.749520"}]',0.479262,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.460483"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/oppenheimer-raises-amazon-com-inc-amzn-target-as-aws-momentum-and-margin-expansion-accelerate-1689206/", "title": "Oppenheimer Raises Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) Target as AWS Momentum and Margin Expansion Accelerate", "source": "Insider Monkey", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.924555"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.920624"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.828208"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.749520"}], "authors": ["Sajjl Nooranne"], "summ