	 (1709,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 15:45:11','20260205T154511','Oppenheimer Raises Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) Target as AWS Momentum and Margin Expansion Accelerate','https://uk.finance.yahoo.com/news/oppenheimer-raises-amazon-com-inc-154154491.html','Oppenheimer has raised its price target for Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) to $315 from $305, maintaining an Outperform rating. This increase is driven by strong Amazon Web Services (AWS) momentum, with Oppenheimer forecasting 24% AWS revenue growth for FY26, alongside significant margin expansion in Amazon''s e-commerce segment due to automation investments. The firm estimates $7 billion in cumulative cost savings by FY27, reinforcing Amazon''s position as a top mega-cap opportunity despite Saks Global ending its e-commerce partnership.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/00PO0wFp0v_iQ0XrMbmHGw--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTY0MA--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/insidermonkey.com/90e386a06858d8b4751ec77797010aed','Yahoo Finance UK','General','Yahoo Finance UK','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.926253"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.841628"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.727413"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.903385"}]',0.437005,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.425291"}]','{"url": "https://uk.finance.yahoo.com/news/oppenheimer-raises-amazon-com-inc-154154491.html", "title": "Oppenheimer Raises Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) Target as AWS Momentum and Margin Expansion Accelerate", "source": "Yahoo Finance UK", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.926253"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.841628"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.727413"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.903385"}], "authors": ["Sajjl Nooranne"], "summary": "Oppenheimer has raised its price target for Amazon.com, Inc