	 (1717,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 14:28:38','20260205T142838','From Petah Tikva to orbit: Gilat Satellite Networks surges 160%, becoming an investor favorite','https://www.ynetnews.com/business/article/r1fw8rwv11x','Gilat Satellite Networks, an Israeli company, has seen its share price jump over 160% in the past year due to strategic acquisitions, defense contracts, and major tender wins in the burgeoning satellite communications industry. While companies like Starlink and Amazon focus on deploying satellites, Gilat specializes in providing the crucial ground equipment that connects them, catering to telecom operators and militaries worldwide. CEO Adi Sfadia details the company''s transformation from a struggling firm to an investor favorite, now valued at approximately 3.5 billion shekels, with significant growth potential in defense and new satellite platforms.','https://ynet-pic1.yit.co.il/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto/picserver6/crop_images/2026/02/04/SJidlhxPbe/SJidlhxPbe_0_0_1200_628_0_x-large.jpg','ynetnews','General','ynetnews','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.946304"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.832835"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.711842"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.733455"}]',0.55121,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "GILT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.733514"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.733928", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.426005"}]','{"url": "https://www.ynetnews.com/business/article/r1fw8rwv11x", "title": "From Petah Tikva to orbit: Gilat Satellite Networks surges 160%, becoming an investor favorite", "source": "ynetnews", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.946304"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.832835"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "re