	 (1718,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 13:59:19','20260205T135919','Akari cancer ADC plans spotlighted in Webull’s Feb. 10 online event','https://www.stocktitan.net/news/AKTX/akari-therapeutics-to-participate-in-the-corporate-connect-webinar-kzl87sjgnf01.html','Akari Therapeutics will participate in Webull Financial’s Corporate Connect Webinar Series on February 10, 2026, where CEO Abizer Gaslightwala will provide an overview of the company''s ADC platform and lead cancer drug candidates AKTX-101 and AKTX-102. The presentation will detail IND-enabling activities for AKTX-101, targeting a first-in-human trial in late 2026 or early 2027. Despite recent positive corporate updates, market reactions have often been muted or negative, suggesting a cautious investor sentiment.','https://ml.globenewswire.com/media/ZTRlYjE1MTQtMzBiNi00NTdhLWFhYTEtOTE4Y2MwYWI3N2Y4LTEwMzE4MzUtMjAyNi0wMi0wNS1lbg==/tiny/Akari-Therapeutics-Plc.png','Stock Titan','General','Stock Titan','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.818565"}]',0.105605,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AKTX", "relevance_score": "0.980165", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.142014"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.675119", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.104436"}, {"ticker": "CTSH", "relevance_score": "0.684017", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.118544"}, {"ticker": "PLTR", "relevance_score": "0.708953", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.117305"}]','{"url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/news/AKTX/akari-therapeutics-to-participate-in-the-corporate-connect-webinar-kzl87sjgnf01.html", "title": "Akari cancer ADC plans spotlighted in Webull’s Feb. 10 online event", "source": "Stock Titan", "topics": [{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.818565