	 (1721,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 13:46:50','20260205T134650','Cummins (NYSE:CMI) Posts Better-Than-Expected Sales In Q4 CY2025','https://finviz.com/news/301181/cummins-nyse-cmi-posts-better-than-expected-sales-in-q4-cy2025','Cummins (NYSE:CMI) reported better-than-expected revenue in Q4 CY2025, with sales increasing 1.1% year-on-year to $8.54 billion, surpassing analyst estimates. Despite robust sales and record full-year results in its Distribution and Power Systems segments, GAAP EPS missed expectations at $4.27 per share. The company''s stock dipped slightly post-announcement, indicating mixed market reaction to the results.','https://news-assets.stockstory.org/cover-images/_1400x700_crop_center-center_none/cummins-cover-image-0f6bc7443fea_2024-06-26-071200_vzzb.jpeg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.829173"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.702921"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.628512"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.637455"}]',0.107584,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "CMI", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.250080"}, {"ticker": "TSLA", "relevance_score": "0.581391", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.138453"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.574084", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.076866"}, {"ticker": "AAPL", "relevance_score": "0.596168", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.069464"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.553990", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.090080"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/301181/cummins-nyse-cmi-posts-better-than-expected-sales-in-q4-cy2025", "title": "Cummins (NYSE:CMI) Posts Better-Than-Expected Sales In Q4 CY2025", "source": "Finviz", "top