	 (1724,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 13:30:58','20260205T133058','LiveOne (Nasdaq: LVO) Expects $57.9M+ Fiscal 2026 YTD','https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/02/05/3232956/0/en/LiveOne-Nasdaq-LVO-Expects-57-9M-Fiscal-2026-YTD-Revenue-19-9M-Q3-Fiscal-2026-Revenue-1-0M-Q3-Fiscal-2026-Adjusted-EBITDA-up-200-QoQ.html','LiveOne (Nasdaq: LVO) announced anticipated financial results for Q3 Fiscal 2026 and the nine months ended December 31, 2025, expecting over $57.9 million in YTD Fiscal 2026 revenue and over $19.9 million in Q3 Fiscal 2026 revenue. The company also anticipates over $1.0 million in Q3 Fiscal 2026 Adjusted EBITDA, a 200% quarter-over-quarter increase, driven by B2B partnerships and cost optimization through AI. LiveOne is targeting a 34% year-over-year headcount reduction, resulting in $4 million to $5 million in savings, and has paid off $2.5 million in debt.','https://ml.globenewswire.com/media/OTJmYzY4MzgtMmU0Ni00MmY1LWFhOTYtMzIwNDM2ZmQ0ZDZjLTEyNjkwMzUtMjAyNi0wMi0wNS1lbg==/tiny/LiveOne-Inc-.png','GlobeNewswire','General','GlobeNewswire','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.904751"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.845684"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.648718"}]',0.373342,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "LVO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.624618"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.629325", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.218541"}, {"ticker": "AAPL", "relevance_score": "0.620068", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.228219"}]','{"url": "https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/02/05/3232956/0/en/LiveOne-Nasdaq-LVO-Expects-57-9M-Fiscal-2026-YTD-Revenue-19-9M-Q3-Fiscal-2026-Revenue-1-0M-Q3-Fiscal-2026-Adjusted-EBITDA-up-200-QoQ.html", "title": "LiveOne (Nasdaq: LVO) Expects $57.9M+ Fiscal 2026 YTD", "source": "GlobeNewswire", "topics