	 (1725,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 13:28:46','20260205T132846','Digital Brands taps college athletes in $36.4B sports merch push','https://www.stocktitan.net/news/DBGI/dbg-announces-four-campus-photo-shoots-for-february-including-two-a4waiek4hhp4.html','Digital Brands Group (NASDAQ:DBGI) announced plans for four campus photo shoots in February, expanding its Name, Image, and Likeness (NIL) strategic initiative. This includes new partnerships with the University of Colorado and Vanderbilt University, alongside return visits to the University of Alabama and the University of Mississippi. The company aims to capitalize on the licensed sports merchandise market, valued at $36.4 billion in 2024 and projected to reach $49.0 billion by 2030, through its AVO women’s apparel brand featuring female student athletes.','https://ml.globenewswire.com/media/Y2RmZGEyZjAtNDI1OS00YWM2LWJmYTUtOGZlYTEzNmYxMzEzLTUwMDEyNDM4MS0yMDI2LTAyLTA1LWVu/tiny/Digital-Brands-Group-Inc-.png','Stock Titan','General','Stock Titan','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.942353"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.848181"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.746760"}]',0.178317,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "DBGI", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.229188"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.629929", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.122443"}, {"ticker": "FTNT", "relevance_score": "0.629168", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.133028"}]','{"url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/news/DBGI/dbg-announces-four-campus-photo-shoots-for-february-including-two-a4waiek4hhp4.html", "title": "Digital Brands taps college athletes in $36.4B sports merch push", "source": "Stock Titan", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.942353"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.848181"}, {"to