	 (1727,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 13:01:27','20260205T130127','Oracle''s Larry Ellison is down an unmatched $49 billion this year after the plunge in software stocks','https://ca.finance.yahoo.com/news/oracles-larry-ellison-down-unmatched-123416309.html','Oracle cofounder Larry Ellison has seen his net worth drop by an "unmatched" $49 billion this year, largely due to a 5% slump in Oracle stock. This decline follows a broader sell-off in software stocks, fueled by fears that new AI tools like Anthropic''s Claude Cowork AI agent could reduce corporate demand for traditional software. Despite Oracle''s significant investments in the AI boom, some analysts, like Michael Burry, have expressed concerns about the company''s aggressive spending and growing debt pile.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/0YPcSF_hAh1REO6vk.s_FA--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTMyNjtoPTQ4/https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2026-01/455be6f0-f194-11f0-b877-da875de334fc','Yahoo! Finance Canada','General','Yahoo! Finance Canada','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.921732"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.801874"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.647074"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.623950"}]',-0.26047,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "ORCL", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.404029"}, {"ticker": "ADBE", "relevance_score": "0.706915", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.212548"}, {"ticker": "CRM", "relevance_score": "0.706560", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.221214"}, {"ticker": "INTU", "relevance_score": "0.648817", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.230472"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.615052", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.207038"}]','{"url": "https://ca.finance.ya