	 (1729,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-05 12:59:09','20260205T125909','Why SanDisk Is Still A Strong Buy Near All-Time Highs (NASDAQ:SNDK)','https://seekingalpha.com/article/4866346-why-sandisk-is-still-a-strong-buy-near-all-time-highs','SanDisk (SNDK) is considered a strong buy due to surging NAND demand driven by AI, coupled with constrained supply and robust pricing. Competitors prioritizing memory over SSDs are tightening enterprise NAND supply, benefiting SanDisk''s pricing power. The article also notes that AI workloads accelerate NAND wear and replacement cycles, and hyperscalers are engaging in long-term supply contracts with SNDK, making its valuation attractive despite recent price rallies.','https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/511875906/image_511875906.jpg?io=getty-c-w630','Seeking Alpha','General','Seeking Alpha','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.923692"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.823026"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.720221"}]',0.413399,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "SNDKV", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.868552"}, {"ticker": "MU", "relevance_score": "0.712343", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.413238"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.649544", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.302300"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.615978", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.251418"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.554926", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.229311"}]','{"url": "https://seekingalpha.com/article/4866346-why-sandisk-is-still-a-strong-buy-near-all-time-highs", "title": "Why SanDisk Is Still A Strong Buy Near All-Time Highs (NASDAQ:SNDK)", "source": "Seeking Alpha", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0