	 (1730,'alpha_vantage','BBWI','BBWI','2026-02-05 23:28:50','20260205T232850','BBWI Announcement: Kessler Topaz Meltzer & Check, LLP Encourages Bath & Body Works, Inc. (BBWI) Investors to Contact the Firm About Securities Fraud Class Action Lawsuit','https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/BBWI/pressreleases/60385/bbwi-announcement-kessler-topaz-meltzer-check-llp-encourages-bath-body-works-inc-bbwi-investors-to-contact-the-firm-about-securities-fraud-class-action-lawsuit/','Kessler Topaz Meltzer & Check, LLP (KTMC) has filed a securities fraud class action lawsuit against Bath & Body Works, Inc. (BBWI) on behalf of investors who purchased securities between June 4, 2024, and November 19, 2025. The lawsuit alleges that the company made materially false and misleading statements regarding its business growth strategies and financial prospects. Investors who suffered losses are encouraged to contact KTMC by March 16, 2026, to learn about becoming a lead plaintiff.',NULL,'The Globe and Mail','General','The Globe and Mail','[{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.900010"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.841811"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.609761"}]',-0.727944,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "BBWI", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.705921"}]','{"url": "https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/BBWI/pressreleases/60385/bbwi-announcement-kessler-topaz-meltzer-check-llp-encourages-bath-body-works-inc-bbwi-investors-to-contact-the-firm-about-securities-fraud-class-action-lawsuit/", "title": "BBWI Announcement: Kessler Topaz Meltzer & Check, LLP Encourages Bath & Body Works, Inc. (BBWI) Investors to Contact the Firm About Securities Fraud Class Action Lawsuit", "source": "The Globe and Mail", "topics": [{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.900010"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.841811"}, {"topic": "retail_whol