	 (1757,'alpha_vantage','CL','CL','2026-02-05 19:59:53','20260205T195953','Barclays Lifts Colgate (CL) Target as 2026 Growth Outlook Improves','https://uk.finance.yahoo.com/news/barclays-lifts-colgate-cl-target-191836601.html','Barclays analyst Lauren Lieberman increased the price target for Colgate-Palmolive (NYSE:CL) to $88 from $83, maintaining an Equal Weight rating. The adjustment came after Colgate projected 2026 net sales growth of 2% to 6%, with improved growth outlook compared to 2025, despite an expected decrease in inflation-driven pricing in emerging markets. The company''s sales of household products and Hill''s Pet Nutrition segment showed resilience and outperformed analyst expectations for the last quarter of the previous year.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/QHCk_s.RSgJGURTHgMrXIw--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGhsYW5kZXJ0O3c9OTYwO2g9NjQw/https://media.zenfs.com/en/insidermonkey.com/18ebe3f32257976ce054ba036bb11b53','Yahoo Finance UK','General','Yahoo Finance UK','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.935310"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.823310"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.624422"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.600684"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.641727"}]',0.176906,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "BCS", "relevance_score": "0.343035", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.045300"}, {"ticker": "CL", "relevance_score": "0.953206", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.334079"}]','{"url": "https://uk.finance.yahoo.com/news/barclays-lifts-colgate-cl-target-191836601.html", "title": "Barclays Lifts Colgate (CL) Target as 2026 Growth Outlook Improves", "source": "Yahoo Finance UK", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.935310"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.823310"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.624422"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevan