	 (1762,'alpha_vantage','CL','CL','2026-02-05 17:17:17','20260205T171717','Colgate-Palmolive (CL) Is Up 11.0% After 2026 Margin Expansion And Brand Investment Guidance - What''s Changed','https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/colgate-palmolive-cl-11-0-171333158.html','Colgate-Palmolive''s stock rose 11.0% following its Q4 2025 earnings report, which included higher sales but a net loss due to one-off items. The company provided 2026 guidance forecasting modest sales growth, gross margin expansion, and double-digit GAAP EPS growth, alongside increased advertising investment. This strategy signals a focus on margin improvement and brand investment, rather than demand surge, although the elevated valuation and leverage present risks if these targets are not met.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/NUA2o3431PKjKDe430Ho5A--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTIwODtoPTQ4/https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2021-03/7d6207c0-7d34-11eb-bbee-858baefb8682','Yahoo Finance Singapore','General','Yahoo Finance Singapore','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.924820"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.833363"}]',0.733915,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "CL", "relevance_score": "0.953350", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.734730"}]','{"url": "https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/colgate-palmolive-cl-11-0-171333158.html", "title": "Colgate-Palmolive (CL) Is Up 11.0% After 2026 Margin Expansion And Brand Investment Guidance - What''s Changed", "source": "Yahoo Finance Singapore", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.924820"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.833363"}], "authors": ["Simply Wall St"], "summary": "Colgate-Palmolive''s stock rose 11.0% following its Q4 2025 earnings report, which included higher sales but a net loss due to one-off items. The company provided 2026 guidance forecasting modest sales growth, gross margin expansion, and double-digit GAAP EPS growth, alongside increased advertisin