	 (1764,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-06 07:08:11','20260206T070811','The Clorox Company (NYSE:CLX) Receives Average Rating of "Reduce" from Analysts','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/the-clorox-company-nyseclx-receives-average-rating-of-reduce-from-analysts-2026-02-06/','The Clorox Company (NYSE:CLX) has received a consensus "Reduce" rating from sixteen analysts, with an average 12-month price target of $117.93. This recommendation comes after mixed Q2 results, a year-over-year organic sales decline, and ongoing margin pressure, leading to multiple price target cuts. Despite these challenges, insider buying and a quarterly dividend offer some support for income investors.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/the-clorox-company-logo-1200x675.png?v=20250505090624','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.926598"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.801376"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.614931"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.629069"}]',-0.242747,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.234806"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/the-clorox-company-nyseclx-receives-average-rating-of-reduce-from-analysts-2026-02-06/", "title": "The Clorox Company (NYSE:CLX) Receives Average Rating of \\"Reduce\\" from Analysts", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.926598"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.801376"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.614931"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.629069"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "The Clorox Company (NYSE:CLX) has received a consensus \\"Reduce\\" rating from sixteen analysts, with an avera