ty around improved consumption trends and margins. Clorox reported adjusted EPS of $1.39, below estimates, and a 1% year-over-year revenue decline, with its Household segment particularly affected by shoppers trading down to cheaper alternatives.", "banner_image": "https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/02122009/CLX-insidermonkey-1696263605920.jpg", "source_domain": "Finviz", "time_published": "20260205T191341", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.293421"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "overall_sentiment_score": -0.254719}','2026-02-06 12:39:20',NULL);
