	 (1769,'alpha_vantage','CLX','CLX','2026-02-05 14:06:00','20260205T140600','BofA Flags Margin Uncertainty for Clorox (CLX) After Q2 Earnings Miss','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/bofa-flags-margin-uncertainty-for-clorox-clx-after-q2-earnings-miss-1689638/?amp=1','BofA analyst Anna Lizzul maintained a Neutral rating on The Clorox Company (CLX) but raised the price target to $112 from $110 following the company''s fiscal Q2 earnings miss. Clorox''s adjusted EPS fell below estimates due to lower gross margins caused by higher costs, while weaker demand for branded products as consumers turn to cheaper alternatives also impacted results. The company''s Household segment was particularly affected, though management reaffirmed its full-year outlook despite acknowledging challenges.',NULL,'Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.948665"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.814728"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.710085"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.640619"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.610553"}]',-0.111242,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "CLX", "relevance_score": "0.969042", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.344390"}, {"ticker": "BAC", "relevance_score": "0.694039", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.106487"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/bofa-flags-margin-uncertainty-for-clorox-clx-after-q2-earnings-miss-1689638/?amp=1", "title": "BofA Flags Margin Uncertainty for Clorox (CLX) After Q2 Earnings Miss", "source": "Insider Monkey", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.948665"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.814728"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.710085"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.640619"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.610553"}], "authors": ["Varda