	 (1771,'alpha_vantage','COLM','COLM','2026-02-06 10:41:41','20260206T104141','Columbia Sportswear posts mixed fourth-quarter results','https://www.worldfootwear.com/news/columbia-sportswear-posts-mixed-fourthquarter-results/11241.html','Columbia Sportswear reported mixed results for its fourth quarter and full fiscal year 2025. While international demand was strong, compensating for weakness in the U.S., net sales in Q4 decreased by 2% to $1.09 billion, and net income fell to $93.2 million. For the full year, net sales increased by 1% to $3.4 billion, but operating income and net income were negatively impacted by rising expenses and impairment charges. The company expects net sales to grow between 1.0% and 3.0% in 2026.','https://www.worldfootwear.com/media/images/news/wf2026611241p.jpg','World Footwear','General','World Footwear','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.913538"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.817362"}]',0.015686,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "COLM", "relevance_score": "0.322972", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.016698"}]','{"url": "https://www.worldfootwear.com/news/columbia-sportswear-posts-mixed-fourthquarter-results/11241.html", "title": "Columbia Sportswear posts mixed fourth-quarter results", "source": "World Footwear", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.913538"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.817362"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Columbia Sportswear reported mixed results for its fourth quarter and full fiscal year 2025. While international demand was strong, compensating for weakness in the U.S., net sales in Q4 decreased by 2% to $1.09 billion, and net income fell to $93.2 million. For the full year, net sales increased by 1% to $3.4 billion, but operating income and net income were negatively impacted by rising expenses and impairment charges. The company expects net sales to grow between 1.0% and 3.0% in 2026.", "banner_image": "https://www.w