	 (1777,'alpha_vantage','WMT','COST','2026-02-05 23:42:27','20260205T234227','Costco stock price closes near $1,000 after January sales jump and online surge','https://ts2.tech/en/costco-stock-price-closes-near-1000-after-january-sales-jump-and-online-surge/','Costco''s stock closed near $989.29 after briefly topping $1,000, driven by a 9.3% increase in January net sales to $21.33 billion and a significant 34.4% surge in digitally-enabled comparable sales. This performance contrasted with a weaker market for other retailers, and investors are now anticipating Costco''s fiscal Q2 earnings call on March 5 for updates on margins and membership figures. Oppenheimer raised its price target to $1,100, citing strong non-food categories and potential for a special dividend or stock split.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/costco-stock-price-closes-near-1000-after-january-sales-jump-and-online-surge-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.910245"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.906103"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.845808"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.630752"}]',-0.079592,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.980806", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.422631"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.675159", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.203011"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.623113", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.207527"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.590713", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.287517"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.563927", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.127511"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/costco-stock-price-closes-near-1000-after-january-sales-jump-and-online-surge/", "