	 (1786,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-05 17:58:26','20260205T175826','Walmart Brings ''Next-Gen'' Supercenter to Jacksonville','https://progressivegrocer.com/walmart-brings-next-gen-supercenter-jacksonville','Walmart has opened a new "next-gen" supercenter in Jacksonville, Florida, as part of its plan to build or convert over 150 stores in the coming years. The store features a modern layout with expanded home, apparel, and grocery offerings, as well as interactive digital touchpoints for an enhanced shopping experience. This opening follows other recent expansions in Florida and coincides with significant company news, including a new CEO and Walmart crossing the $1 trillion market capitalization threshold.','https://assets1.progressivegrocer.com/images/v/max_width_1440/files/2026-02/img_4141walmart.jpg','Progressive Grocer','General','Progressive Grocer','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.921148"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.632085"}]',0.267162,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.444439"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.639057", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.246154"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.609048", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.229209"}]','{"url": "https://progressivegrocer.com/walmart-brings-next-gen-supercenter-jacksonville", "title": "Walmart Brings ''Next-Gen'' Supercenter to Jacksonville", "source": "Progressive Grocer", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.921148"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.632085"}], "authors": ["Zachary Russell"], "summary": "Walmart has opened a new \\"next-gen\\" supercenter in Jacksonville, Florida, as part of its plan to build or convert over 150 stores in the coming years. The store features a modern layout with expanded home,