	 (1789,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-05 17:27:58','20260205T172758','Costco Lawsuit Tests Kirkland Trust And Costco Wholesale Investment Story','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/consumer-retailing/nasdaq-cost/costco-wholesale/news/costco-lawsuit-tests-kirkland-trust-and-costco-wholesale-inv','Costco Wholesale is facing a class-action lawsuit alleging that its Kirkland Signature Rotisserie Chicken was falsely advertised as preservative-free, despite containing preservatives. This legal challenge spotlights Costco''s brand trust and product transparency, particularly regarding its private label Kirkland brand, which is crucial to its value proposition. While Costco''s overall business remains strong with high sales and renewal rates, investors are watching how the company addresses these claims, as the outcome could influence consumer perception and potentially lead to financial and reputational risks.',NULL,'Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.810652"}]',-0.167983,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.286004"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.630373", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.132273"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.575230", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.100472"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/consumer-retailing/nasdaq-cost/costco-wholesale/news/costco-lawsuit-tests-kirkland-trust-and-costco-wholesale-inv", "title": "Costco Lawsuit Tests Kirkland Trust And Costco Wholesale Investment Story", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.810652"}], "authors": ["Simply Wall St"], "summary": "Costco Wholesal