	 (1797,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-05 15:02:57','20260205T150257','PepsiCo, Inc. (NASDAQ:PEP) Announces Quarterly Dividend of $1.42','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/pepsico-inc-nasdaqpep-announces-quarterly-dividend-of-142-2026-02-05/','PepsiCo, Inc. (NASDAQ:PEP) has announced a quarterly dividend of $1.4225 per share, payable on March 31st to shareholders of record on March 6th. This translates to an annualized dividend of $5.69 and a yield of 3.4%, marking the 54th consecutive year the company has increased its dividend. The dividend is well-covered by earnings, with a current payout ratio of 68.1% expected to decrease to 64.4% next year.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/pepsico-inc-logo-1200x675.jpg?v=20210728083446','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.917973"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.812943"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.710998"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.604597"}]',0.325607,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.507277"}, {"ticker": "KDP", "relevance_score": "0.627645", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.327606"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.629142", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.111113"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/pepsico-inc-nasdaqpep-announces-quarterly-dividend-of-142-2026-02-05/", "title": "PepsiCo, Inc. (NASDAQ:PEP) Announces Quarterly Dividend of $1.42", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.917973"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.812943"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.710998"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.604597"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "PepsiCo, Inc. (NASDAQ:PEP) has announced a quarter