	 (1799,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-05 14:58:25','20260205T145825','Costco Wholesale (COST): Wells Fargo Raises Price Target to $950','https://www.gurufocus.com/news/8586681/costco-wholesale-cost-wells-fargo-raises-price-target-to-950-cost-stock-news','Wells Fargo has reaffirmed its "Equal-Weight" rating for Costco Wholesale (COST) but increased its price target from $900 to $950, reflecting a 5.56% uptick. This follows a series of positive analyst revisions, including an "Outperform" rating from Mizuho with a raised price target of $1065 in early February 2026. The average target price from 32 analysts is $1,041.85, indicating a potential upside of 6.49% from the current price, with GuruFocus estimating a fair value of $1003.07.','https://static.gurufocus.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=600,quality=100/logos/0C00000ARG.png?20','GuruFocus','General','GuruFocus','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.801381"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.920825"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.742642"}]',0.479716,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.487334"}]','{"url": "https://www.gurufocus.com/news/8586681/costco-wholesale-cost-wells-fargo-raises-price-target-to-950-cost-stock-news", "title": "Costco Wholesale (COST): Wells Fargo Raises Price Target to $950", "source": "GuruFocus", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.801381"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.920825"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.742642"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Wells Fargo has reaffirmed its \\"Equal-Weight\\" rating for Costco Wholesale (COST) but increased its price target from $900 to $950, reflecting a 5.56% uptick. This follows a series of positive analyst revisions, including an \\"Outperform\\" rating from Mizuho with a raised price target of $1065 in early February 2026. The average target pric