	 (1807,'alpha_vantage','CPNG','CPNG','2026-02-05 16:00:10','20260205T160010','Coupang Shareholder Alert: ClaimsFiler Reminds Investors','https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/02/05/3233260/35454/en/Coupang-Shareholder-Alert-ClaimsFiler-Reminds-Investors-With-Losses-In-Excess-Of-100-000-Of-Lead-Plaintiff-Deadline-In-Class-Action-Lawsuits-Against-Coupang-Inc-CPNG.html','ClaimsFiler is reminding investors who lost over $100,000 in Coupang, Inc. (NYSE: CPNG) to file as lead plaintiff in a securities class action lawsuit by February 17, 2026. The lawsuit alleges that Coupang and its executives failed to disclose inadequate cybersecurity protocols and a related data breach, violating federal securities laws. Investors who purchased Coupang securities between May 7, 2025, and December 16, 2025, are affected.','https://ml.globenewswire.com/media/YTgxNDFjZmQtNDUxMC00NDRmLTkyODMtZTcwMDM3MDY2ZmMyLTEwMzY0NDktMjAyNi0wMi0wNS1lbg==/tiny/SkyMedia-LLC.png','GlobeNewswire','General','GlobeNewswire','[{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.940064"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.611652"}]',-0.438924,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "CPNG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.433292"}]','{"url": "https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/02/05/3233260/35454/en/Coupang-Shareholder-Alert-ClaimsFiler-Reminds-Investors-With-Losses-In-Excess-Of-100-000-Of-Lead-Plaintiff-Deadline-In-Class-Action-Lawsuits-Against-Coupang-Inc-CPNG.html", "title": "Coupang Shareholder Alert: ClaimsFiler Reminds Investors", "source": "GlobeNewswire", "topics": [{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.940064"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.611652"}], "authors": ["SkyMedia", "LLC"], "summary": "ClaimsFiler is reminding investors who lost over $100,000 in Coupang, Inc. (NYSE: CPNG) to file as lead plaintiff in a securities class action lawsuit by February 17, 2026. The lawsuit alleges that Coupan