	 (1808,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-06 11:33:28','20260206T113328','3,190 Shares in Amgen Inc. $AMGN Acquired by ABN AMRO Bank N.V.','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-3190-shares-in-amgen-inc-amgn-acquired-by-abn-amro-bank-nv-2026-02-06/','ABN AMRO Bank N.V. recently acquired 3,190 shares of Amgen Inc. (NASDAQ:AMGN) in the third quarter, valued at approximately $897,000, as disclosed in their latest SEC filing. This acquisition follows Amgen''s strong Q4 performance, beating analyst estimates and issuing a robust FY2026 outlook, which led to several analyst price-target increases and institutional accumulation. Despite a mixed outlook due to CVS Health removing some Amgen treatments from preferred drug lists, the company also raised its quarterly dividend.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/amgen-inc-logo-1200x675.jpg?v=20231228113741','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.922470"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.819142"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.949640"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.734178"}]',0.124686,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMGN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.252786"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.632167", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.018131"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-3190-shares-in-amgen-inc-amgn-acquired-by-abn-amro-bank-nv-2026-02-06/", "title": "3,190 Shares in Amgen Inc. $AMGN Acquired by ABN AMRO Bank N.V.", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.922470"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.819142"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.949640"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.734178"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "ABN AMRO Bank N.V. recently acquired 3,190 shares of Amgen Inc. (