	 (1809,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-06 10:58:14','20260206T105814','UnitedHealth stock slips in premarket after Mizuho cuts target, as Medicare Advantage pressure builds','https://ts2.tech/en/unitedhealth-stock-slips-in-premarket-after-mizuho-cuts-target-as-medicare-advantage-pressure-builds/','UnitedHealth stock fell 2.7% premarket after Mizuho lowered its price target from $430 to $350 due to mounting pressure from Medicare Advantage payment forecasts and new PBM regulations. The company also faces regulatory scrutiny and litigation related to its Optum unit, while investors anticipate the CMS 2027 rate decision and other government rulings that could impact future earnings. This situation highlights a challenging outlook for managed-care insurers amid tighter Medicare Advantage rates and increased regulatory oversight.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/unitedhealth-stock-slips-in-premarket-after-mizuho-cuts-target-as-medicare-advantage-pressure-builds-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932414"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.918446"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.845180"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.712685"}]',-0.134592,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.434893"}, {"ticker": "CI", "relevance_score": "0.603330", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.127069"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.600405", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.139995"}, {"ticker": "ELV", "relevance_score": "0.643034", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.324847"}, {"ticker": "HUM", "relevance_score": "0.609793", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.240312"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/unitedhealth-stock-slip