	 (1816,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-05 17:50:31','20260205T175031','CVS Health to swap Amgen and Lilly’s bone drugs with biosimilars in commercial formularies','https://seekingalpha.com/news/4548052-cvs-health-swap-amgen-lillys-bone-drugs','CVS Health is revising its commercial formularies to replace branded bone disease therapies Prolia (Amgen) and Forteo (Eli Lilly) with lower-cost biosimilars. This change, announced on Thursday, aims to integrate more affordable options into its healthcare plans for bone-related conditions.','https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1401250676/image_1401250676.jpg?io=getty-c-w630','Seeking Alpha','General','Seeking Alpha','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.911893"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.743119"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.617179"}]',-0.101645,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMGN", "relevance_score": "0.925791", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.243202"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.824547", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.209910"}, {"ticker": "LLY", "relevance_score": "0.745722", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.237027"}]','{"url": "https://seekingalpha.com/news/4548052-cvs-health-swap-amgen-lillys-bone-drugs", "title": "CVS Health to swap Amgen and Lilly’s bone drugs with biosimilars in commercial formularies", "source": "Seeking Alpha", "topics": [{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.911893"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.743119"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.617179"}], "authors": ["Dulan Lokuwithana"], "summary": "CVS Health is revising its commercial formularies to replace branded bone disease therapies Prolia (Amgen) and Forteo (Eli Lilly) with lower-cost biosimilars. This change, announced on Thursday, aims to integrate more affordable options into its he