	 (1848,'alpha_vantage','DECK','DECK','2026-02-05 14:29:54','20260205T142954','The Truth About Deckers (DECK): Is This Silent Stock About To Explode Or Is The Hype Over?','https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/ueberblick/the-truth-about-deckers-deck-is-this-silent-stock-about-to-explode-or/68554643','This article examines Deckers Outdoor Corp (DECK), the company behind popular brands like UGG and HOKA, to determine if its stock is a worthwhile investment or merely riding a wave of social media hype. It discusses the strength of Deckers'' diverse brand portfolio, its successful shift from seasonal to year-round demand for its products, and how it strategically competes against larger rivals like Nike and Adidas. The piece concludes that while DECK is a solid, long-term growth stock rather than a quick flip, potential investors should still conduct their own due diligence.','https://mdb.ad-hoc-news.de/img/artikel/coin-1549045_1920.jpg','AD HOC NEWS','General','AD HOC NEWS','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.944506"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.857104"}]',0.219488,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "DECK", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.412403"}, {"ticker": "NKE", "relevance_score": "0.627658", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.127335"}, {"ticker": "LULU", "relevance_score": "0.636151", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.126927"}]','{"url": "https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/ueberblick/the-truth-about-deckers-deck-is-this-silent-stock-about-to-explode-or/68554643", "title": "The Truth About Deckers (DECK): Is This Silent Stock About To Explode Or Is The Hype Over?", "source": "AD HOC NEWS", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.944506"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.857104"}], "authors": [], "summary": "This article examines Deckers Outdoor Corp (