	 (1860,'alpha_vantage','EBAY','EBAY','2026-02-06 02:57:29','20260206T025729','eBay Inc. Is Rebuilding the Marketplace: Can the Original E?Commerce Giant Still Win?','https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/ueberblick/ebay-inc-is-rebuilding-the-marketplace-can-the-original-e-commerce-giant/68556166','eBay Inc. is actively re-strategizing its marketplace by leveraging AI, focusing on specialized verticals, and integrating payments to compete against giants like Amazon and Walmart, as well as niche platforms. The company aims to position itself as a high-intent, enthusiast-driven platform for collectibles, refurbished items, and luxury goods, enhancing trust through authentication and improving seller tools. This revitalization effort is crucial for eBay''s stock performance, shifting from a pure growth story to a stable, cash-generative business focused on higher-margin areas.',NULL,'AD HOC NEWS','General','AD HOC NEWS','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.820871"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.837426"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.648257"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.626953"}]',0.035589,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "EBAY", "relevance_score": "0.328155", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.013138"}]','{"url": "https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/ueberblick/ebay-inc-is-rebuilding-the-marketplace-can-the-original-e-commerce-giant/68556166", "title": "eBay Inc. Is Rebuilding the Marketplace: Can the Original E?Commerce Giant Still Win?", "source": "AD HOC NEWS", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.820871"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.837426"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.648257"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.626953"}], "authors": [], "summary": "eBay Inc. is actively re-strategizing its marketplace by leveraging AI, focusing on specialized verticals, and integrating payments