	 (1869,'alpha_vantage','KMB','KMB','2026-02-06 00:37:19','20260206T003719','Kenvue stock hovers near $18 after hours as it sets Feb. 17 results date and scraps earnings call','https://ts2.tech/en/kenvue-stock-hovers-near-18-after-hours-as-it-sets-feb-17-results-date-and-scraps-earnings-call/','Kenvue (KVUE) stock edged up 0.2% to $18.07 in after-hours trading as the company announced it would release its Q4 and full-year results on February 17, but would not hold an earnings call due to its pending acquisition by Kimberly-Clark. Investors are focusing on the merger-arbitrage spread, which currently values Kenvue around $18.75 per share, as the stock''s performance is heavily influenced by the anticipated closing of the deal in the second half of 2026. Litigation risks related to Tylenol and talc-based baby powder, as well as regulatory approvals, continue to be key factors influencing investor sentiment and the spread.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/kenvue-stock-hovers-near-18-after-hours-as-it-sets-feb-17-results-date-and-scraps-earnings-call-featured-1.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.934150"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.929837"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.835431"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.647593"}]',0.063897,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KVUE", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.116293"}, {"ticker": "KMB", "relevance_score": "0.883630", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.097353"}, {"ticker": "TXN", "relevance_score": "0.634856", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.101421"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/kenvue-stock-hovers-near-18-after-hours-as-it-sets-feb-17-results-date-and-scraps-earnings-call/", "title": "Kenvue stock hovers near $18 after hours as it sets Feb. 17 results date and scraps e