	 (1873,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-06 10:39:49','20260206T103949','Coca-Cola to discontinue Minute Maid frozen range in US and Canada - Reuters','https://www.foodbev.com/news/coca-cola-to-discontinue-minute-maid-frozen-range-in-us-and-canada-reuters','Coca-Cola announced it will discontinue its frozen product portfolio, including the Minute Maid frozen line, in the US and Canada. This decision is a response to evolving consumer preferences and a strategic shift towards zero-sugar beverages and higher-value offerings like its Fairlife milk brand. The company plans to exit the frozen can category, with products being discontinued in Q1 2026 as current in-store inventory sells out.','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8a42ce_61cfef484f844a678f90e990865b7f55~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_147,h_63,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/8a42ce_61cfef484f844a678f90e990865b7f55~mv2.jpg','FoodBev Media','General','FoodBev Media','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.839984"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.622343"}]',0.028051,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.322691", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.042571"}]','{"url": "https://www.foodbev.com/news/coca-cola-to-discontinue-minute-maid-frozen-range-in-us-and-canada-reuters", "title": "Coca-Cola to discontinue Minute Maid frozen range in US and Canada - Reuters", "source": "FoodBev Media", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.839984"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.622343"}], "authors": ["Rafaela Sousa"], "summary": "Coca-Cola announced it will discontinue its frozen product portfolio, including the Minute Maid frozen line, in the US and Canada. This decision is a response to evolving consumer preferences and a strategic shift towards zero-sugar beverages and higher-value offerings like its Fairlife milk brand. The company plans to exit the frozen can category, with products being discontinued 