	 (1884,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-05 18:28:30','20260205T182830','PepsiCo''s Productivity Strategy: A Catalyst for EPS Expansion?','https://finance.yahoo.com/news/pepsicos-productivity-strategy-catalyst-eps-183000026.html','PepsiCo is strategically leveraging a comprehensive productivity strategy, including supply-chain optimization, automation, and SKU rationalization, to drive earnings per share expansion amidst challenging operating conditions. These efforts are expected to offset input-cost inflation, expand margins, and strengthen operating leverage, with significant reinvestment into the business to accelerate sales growth and profitability. The company''s robust Q4 2025 results and plans for increased productivity savings in 2026 highlight the effectiveness of these initiatives, positioning PepsiCo for continued growth and margin expansion.',NULL,'Yahoo Finance','General','Yahoo Finance','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.910007"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.846894"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.625845"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.600399"}]',0.369452,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.422349"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.616019", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.348896"}, {"ticker": "MNST", "relevance_score": "0.638334", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.321603"}]','{"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/pepsicos-productivity-strategy-catalyst-eps-183000026.html", "title": "PepsiCo''s Productivity Strategy: A Catalyst for EPS Expansion?", "source": "Yahoo Finance", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.910007"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.846894"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.625845"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "rele