	 (1894,'alpha_vantage','WMT','KR','2026-02-05 18:10:00','20260205T181000','Kroger Georgia Clinic Closures Recast Health Strategy And Capital Use','https://finance.yahoo.com/news/kroger-georgia-clinic-closures-recast-181018768.html','Kroger is closing all 18 of its The Little Clinic health centers within its Georgia grocery stores, signaling a shift in its health and wellness strategy. This move aims to streamline operations and reallocate resources to potentially higher-return areas like large-format stores, e-commerce, and pharmacy services. Investors should monitor how Kroger redeploys capital and whether this change impacts customer traffic and loyalty, especially given recent pressures on same-store sales and earnings.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/VIEgYU8yy__gxL6nB7iHNg--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTYxMw--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/simply_wall_st__316/6785b582aefd94bdfd0a090cac7727c8','Yahoo Finance','General','Yahoo Finance','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.923201"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.804733"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.720233"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.635537"}]',0.129225,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.070770"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.685034", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.106513"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.579582", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.114173"}]','{"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/kroger-georgia-clinic-closures-recast-181018768.html", "title": "Kroger Georgia Clinic Closures Recast Health Strategy And Capital Use", "source": "Yahoo Finance", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.923201"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.804733"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.720233"}, {"topic": "finance", "