	 (1896,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-05 17:05:44','20260205T170544','Kroger appoints Mike Goodwin as president of Central Division','https://massmarketretailers.com/kroger-appoints-mike-goodwin-as-president-of-central-division/','Kroger has appointed Mike Goodwin as the new president of its Central Division, effective April 1, 2026. Goodwin, currently vice president of operations for Fred Meyer Division, will succeed Colleen Juergensen, who is retiring after 45 years with the company. This appointment is part of Kroger''s ongoing organizational evolution, which has included several leadership changes since mid-2025.','https://massmarketretailers.com/content/images/size/w1304/format/webp/2026/02/Kroger-exterior-new-logo.webp','Mass Market Retailers','General','Mass Market Retailers','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.844934"}]',0.278246,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.267340"}]','{"url": "https://massmarketretailers.com/kroger-appoints-mike-goodwin-as-president-of-central-division/", "title": "Kroger appoints Mike Goodwin as president of Central Division", "source": "Mass Market Retailers", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.844934"}], "authors": ["MMR"], "summary": "Kroger has appointed Mike Goodwin as the new president of its Central Division, effective April 1, 2026. Goodwin, currently vice president of operations for Fred Meyer Division, will succeed Colleen Juergensen, who is retiring after 45 years with the company. This appointment is part of Kroger''s ongoing organizational evolution, which has included several leadership changes since mid-2025.", "banner_image": "https://massmarketretailers.com/content/images/size/w1304/format/webp/2026/02/Kroger-exterior-new-logo.webp", "source_domain": "Mass Market Retailers", "time_published": "20260205T170544", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "KR", "relevance