	 (1899,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-05 15:57:11','20260205T155711','Kroger’s divisional shuffling continues with new Central Division president','https://www.grocerydive.com/news/kroger-executive-central-division-president-mike-goodwin/811460/','Kroger has appointed Mike Goodwin, formerly vice president of operations for its Fred Meyer Division, as the new president of its Central Division, effective April 1, 2026. This move is part of ongoing executive changes at Kroger as it prepares to name a new CEO. Goodwin succeeds Colleen Juergensen, who is retiring, and will oversee stores across Indiana, Illinois, Missouri, and Ohio.','https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/LYojjAQE1KN9KybR1tUF_YgV3Z3xAb5DMeHeJUtq6k8/g:nowe:0:0/c:2027:1145/rs:fill:1200:675:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9JTUdfMzQ0My5qcGc=.webp','Grocery Dive','General','Grocery Dive','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}]',0.144575,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.125087"}]','{"url": "https://www.grocerydive.com/news/kroger-executive-central-division-president-mike-goodwin/811460/", "title": "Kroger’s divisional shuffling continues with new Central Division president", "source": "Grocery Dive", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}], "authors": ["Peyton Bigora"], "summary": "Kroger has appointed Mike Goodwin, formerly vice president of operations for its Fred Meyer Division, as the new president of its Central Division, effective April 1, 2026. This move is part of ongoing executive changes at Kroger as it prepares to name a new CEO. Goodwin succeeds Colleen Juergensen, who is retiring, and will oversee stores across Indiana, Illinois, Missouri, and Ohio.", "banner_image": "https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/LYojjAQE1KN9KybR1tUF_YgV3Z3xAb5DMeHeJUtq6k8/g:nowe:0:0/c:2027:1145/rs:fill:1200:675:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9JTUdfMzQ0My5qcGc=.w