	 (1908,'alpha_vantage','LULU','LULU','2026-02-05 13:28:52','20260205T132852','Strs Ohio Reduces Stock Holdings in Amer Sports, Inc. $AS','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-strs-ohio-reduces-stock-holdings-in-amer-sports-inc-as-2026-02-05/','Strs Ohio significantly reduced its stake in Amer Sports (NYSE:AS) by 88.7% in the third quarter, selling 27,984 shares and retaining 3,567 shares valued at $124,000. Despite this reduction, Amer Sports reported strong third-quarter earnings, beating EPS estimates by $0.08 and revenue expectations by $0.03 billion, with a 29.7% year-over-year revenue increase. Analysts maintain a generally bullish outlook on Amer Sports, with an average "Buy" rating and a consensus price target of $46.06.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/amer-sports-inc-logo-1200x675.png?v=20240212140633','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.904486"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.819416"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.725054"}]',0.134621,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.252026"}, {"ticker": "WFC", "relevance_score": "0.620557", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.103359"}, {"ticker": "LULU", "relevance_score": "0.609171", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.124802"}, {"ticker": "NOW", "relevance_score": "0.565827", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.286671"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-strs-ohio-reduces-stock-holdings-in-amer-sports-inc-as-2026-02-05/", "title": "Strs Ohio Reduces Stock Holdings in Amer Sports, Inc. $AS", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.904486"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.819416"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.7