	 (1909,'alpha_vantage','MDLZ','MDLZ','2026-02-06 08:21:29','20260206T082129','What Hormel Foods (HRL)''s US$540 Million ESOP Shelf Registration Means For Shareholders','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/food-beverage-tobacco/nyse-hrl/hormel-foods/news/what-hormel-foods-hrls-us540-million-esop-shelf-registration','Hormel Foods recently filed a shelf registration for an ESOP-related offering of shares worth approximately US$540.23 million, indicating their continued use of equity-based employee ownership. This filing is viewed as capital structure housekeeping rather than a new risk, with key near-term factors being upcoming earnings, sales guidance, and profit recovery. The article suggests focusing on dividend sustainability and exploring multiple perspectives due to differing fair value estimates.','https://images.ctfassets.net/n07nr2koi959/2zXqBK9eFqVJCGTQWhQWFX/c3400470ed0819d8056c9b1de6e897a0/Sasha_Jovanovic_-_Equity_Analyst.jpg?fit=thumb&w=64&h=64','Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.826312"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.909150"}]',0.043198,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "HRL", "relevance_score": "0.978621", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.051743"}, {"ticker": "MDLZ", "relevance_score": "0.605473", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.087853"}, {"ticker": "HSY", "relevance_score": "0.635003", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.057140"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/food-beverage-tobacco/nyse-hrl/hormel-foods/news/what-hormel-foods-hrls-us540-million-esop-shelf-registration", "title": "What Hormel Foods (HRL)''s US$540 Million ESOP Shelf Registration Means For Shareholders", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.826312"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.909150"}], "authors": ["Simply Wall St"], "summary": "Hor