	 (1910,'alpha_vantage','MDLZ','MDLZ','2026-02-05 21:36:27','20260205T213627','C-suite recruit brings consumer health experience to J.M. Smucker','https://commercialbaking.com/c-suite-recruit-brings-consumer-health-experience-to-jm-smucker/','The J.M. Smucker Co. has appointed Katie Williams as its new chief marketing officer, effective March 9. Williams, previously the US chief marketing officer for Haleon, brings over 20 years of marketing leadership experience from companies like Mondelez International and Kraft-Heinz. She will report to CEO Mark Smucker and is tasked with advancing the company''s brand portfolio, succeeding Gail Hollander who will retire on April 30.','https://commercialbaking.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/020526-smucker-cmo-1024x684.jpg','Commercial Baking','General','Commercial Baking','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.814433"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.637587"}]',0.226678,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "SJM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.434042"}, {"ticker": "KHC", "relevance_score": "0.625029", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.125659"}, {"ticker": "MDLZ", "relevance_score": "0.626982", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.104486"}]','{"url": "https://commercialbaking.com/c-suite-recruit-brings-consumer-health-experience-to-jm-smucker/", "title": "C-suite recruit brings consumer health experience to J.M. Smucker", "source": "Commercial Baking", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.814433"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.637587"}], "authors": ["Lily Cota"], "summary": "The J.M. Smucker Co. has appointed Katie Williams as its new chief marketing officer, effective March 9. Williams, previously the US chief marketing officer for Haleon, brings over 20 years of marketing leadership experience from companies like Mondelez Internat