	 (1940,'alpha_vantage','PG','PG','2026-02-05 15:59:17','20260205T155917','3M Company investments in R&D: up to 4.7% of net sales','https://www.opportimes.com/en/3m-company-investments-in-rd-up-to-4-7-of-net-sales/','3M Company increased its investments in research and development to 4.7% of net sales in 2025, up from 4.4% in 2024. The company recorded net sales of $24.575 billion in 2025, with significant contributions from the Americas, Asia-Pacific, and EMEA regions. Innovation, supported by facilities in the US and 25 other countries, is crucial for 3M to compete with large industrial and technology conglomerates and accelerate product turnover.','https://8d073164.delivery.rocketcdn.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/3M-3M-Company.png','Opportimes','General','Opportimes','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.904614"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.831231"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.743699"}]',0.083642,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "MMM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.254919"}, {"ticker": "HON", "relevance_score": "0.736083", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.034469"}, {"ticker": "DD", "relevance_score": "0.737743", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.022950"}, {"ticker": "GE", "relevance_score": "0.628536", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.021730"}, {"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "0.600652", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.008403"}]','{"url": "https://www.opportimes.com/en/3m-company-investments-in-rd-up-to-4-7-of-net-sales/", "title": "3M Company investments in R&D: up to 4.7% of net sales", "source": "Opportimes", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.904614"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.831231"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.743699"}], "authors": [], "summary": "