	 (1944,'alpha_vantage','RL','RL','2026-02-05 17:25:57','20260205T172557','Tapestry quarterly revenue jumps 14% to $2.5 billion','https://us.fashionnetwork.com/news/Tapestry-quarterly-revenue-jumps-14-to-2-5-billion,1805025.html','Tapestry Inc., the parent company of Coach and Kate Spade, reported a 14% increase in revenue to $2.5 billion for the second quarter of its 2026 financial year. Gross profits rose by 16% to $1.89 billion, and operating income increased by 45% to $716.4 million. The company attributed this growth to its Amplify strategy, strong consumer engagement, and significant performance in Greater China and Europe, leading to an raised outlook for the full fiscal year.','https://media.fashionnetwork.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=contain,width=1000,height=1000,format=auto/m/1a15/09b8/1c5b/37be/1881/6324/ffe4/cc9d/e00c/6df0/6df0.jpg','FashionNetwork USA','General','FashionNetwork USA','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.934176"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.831261"}]',0.510609,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "TPR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.879061"}, {"ticker": "RL", "relevance_score": "0.614001", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.144793"}]','{"url": "https://us.fashionnetwork.com/news/Tapestry-quarterly-revenue-jumps-14-to-2-5-billion,1805025.html", "title": "Tapestry quarterly revenue jumps 14% to $2.5 billion", "source": "FashionNetwork USA", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.934176"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.831261"}], "authors": ["Isabelle Crossley"], "summary": "Tapestry Inc., the parent company of Coach and Kate Spade, reported a 14% increase in revenue to $2.5 billion for the second quarter of its 2026 financial year. Gross profits rose by 16% to $1.89 billion, and operating income increased by 45% to $716.4 million. The company attributed this growth to its Amplify strategy, str