	 (1948,'alpha_vantage','RL','RL','2026-02-05 13:39:59','20260205T133959','Ralph Lauren beats Q3 on strong holiday demand but shares dive','https://in.investing.com/news/earnings/ralph-lauren-beats-q3-on-strong-holiday-demand-but-shares-dive-5223862','Ralph Lauren (NYSE:RL) exceeded Wall Street''s profit and revenue forecasts for its third quarter, driven by strong holiday season sales and consistent demand from high-income consumers. Despite the positive results, the luxury retailer''s shares dropped 8% before the market opened due to an anticipated margin contraction in Q4, attributed to higher U.S. tariffs. The company also raised its full-year fiscal 2026 revenue and operating margin outlook.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/LYNXMPED330UE_L.jpg','Investing.com India','General','Investing.com India','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.905471"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.845286"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.619760"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.609590"}]',0.042785,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "RL", "relevance_score": "0.335714", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.034379"}]','{"url": "https://in.investing.com/news/earnings/ralph-lauren-beats-q3-on-strong-holiday-demand-but-shares-dive-5223862", "title": "Ralph Lauren beats Q3 on strong holiday demand but shares dive", "source": "Investing.com India", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.905471"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.845286"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.619760"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.609590"}], "authors": ["Pratyush Thakur"], "summary": "Ralph Lauren (NYSE:RL) exceeded Wall Street''s profit and revenue forecasts for its third quarter, driven by strong holiday season sales and consistent demand from high-income consumers. Despite the positive results, the luxury retailer''s shares dropped 8% before th