	 (1950,'alpha_vantage','ROST','ROST','2026-02-06 00:41:33','20260206T004133','Ross Dress for Less, Boys & Girls Clubs of Bend team up for in-store fundraiser to help kids succeed in school','https://ktvz.com/community/2026/02/05/ross-dress-for-less-boys-girls-clubs-of-bend-team-up-for-in-store-fundraiser-to-help-kids-succeed-in-school/','Ross Stores is launching its 12th annual "Help Local Kids Succeed in School" fundraiser from February 6 to March 1, benefiting the Boys & Girls Clubs of America, including the Bend chapter. Customers at Ross Dress for Less in Bend and Redmond can donate at the register, with the Ross Stores Foundation matching donations up to $500,000. Funds collected will support academic programs like Power Hour, which provides homework assistance and tutoring for students, and 80% of funds raised at each store will directly benefit the local club.','https://ktvz.b-cdn.net/2026/02/Ross-Dress-for-Less-Boys-and-Girls-Clubs.jpg','KTVZ','General','KTVZ','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.747871"}]',0.405652,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ROST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.423088"}]','{"url": "https://ktvz.com/community/2026/02/05/ross-dress-for-less-boys-girls-clubs-of-bend-team-up-for-in-store-fundraiser-to-help-kids-succeed-in-school/", "title": "Ross Dress for Less, Boys & Girls Clubs of Bend team up for in-store fundraiser to help kids succeed in school", "source": "KTVZ", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.747871"}], "authors": ["Barney Lerten"], "summary": "Ross Stores is launching its 12th annual \\"Help Local Kids Succeed in School\\" fundraiser from February 6 to March 1, benefiting the Boys & Girls Clubs of America, including the Bend chapter. Customers at Ross Dress for Less in Bend and Redmond can donate at the register, with t