	 (1963,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-05 13:29:00','20260205T132900','e.l.f. Beauty, Inc. (NYSE:ELF) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/e-l-f-beauty-inc-nyseelf-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript-1689460/','e.l.f. Beauty, Inc. (NYSE: ELF) reported Q3 2026 earnings, discussing a 38% net sales growth and a 79% adjusted EBITDA increase, marking its 28th consecutive quarter of net sales growth. The company highlighted strong performance from its core e.l.f. Cosmetics brand and recent acquisitions like Rhode and Naturium, which significantly contributed to sales and market share gains. e.l.f. Beauty also raised its fiscal 2026 outlook, expecting net sales growth of 22-23% and adjusted EBITDA of $323-$326 million, primarily driven by Rhode''s outperformance, while detailing strategic investments in marketing, space expansion, and team building.','https://imonkey-blog.imgix.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/04151320/ELF-insidermonkey-1696446798047.jpg?auto=format&fit=clip&expires=1801785600&width=480&height=269','Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.947099"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.821698"}]',0.266477,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "ELF", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.385315"}, {"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "0.653489", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.228623"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.587114", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.121593"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/e-l-f-beauty-inc-nyseelf-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript-1689460/", "title": "e.l.f. Beauty, Inc. (NYSE:ELF) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript", "source": "Insider Monkey", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.947099"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.821698"}], "authors": [