	 (1989,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-05 20:23:53','20260205T202353','Ulta Beauty Partners With Six Star Athletes to Connect Beauty and Sport','https://storebrands.com/ulta-beauty-partners-six-star-athletes-connect-beauty-and-sport','Ulta Beauty has launched the "Ulta Beauty Roster," partnering with six female athletes from various sports to redefine the connection between beauty and athleticism. The initiative aims to inspire confidence and empower young girls through omnichannel marketing, digital content, and the "Roster for Change" grant program, which supports local communities and sports organizations. The athletes will share their beauty routines, give back to communities, and be featured on digital trading cards highlighting their achievements and essential beauty products.','https://assets1.storebrands.com/images/v/max_width_1440/sb/2022-05/ulta_storefront.jpg','Store Brands','General','Store Brands','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}]',0.442979,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.442442"}]','{"url": "https://storebrands.com/ulta-beauty-partners-six-star-athletes-connect-beauty-and-sport", "title": "Ulta Beauty Partners With Six Star Athletes to Connect Beauty and Sport", "source": "Store Brands", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}], "authors": ["Greg Sleter"], "summary": "Ulta Beauty has launched the \\"Ulta Beauty Roster,\\" partnering with six female athletes from various sports to redefine the connection between beauty and athleticism. The initiative aims to inspire confidence and empower young girls through omnichannel marketing, digital content, and the \\"Roster for Change\\" grant program, which supports local communities and sports organizations. The athletes will share their beauty routines, give back to communities, and be featured on digital trading cards highlighting their achievem