	 (2024,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-05 13:59:43','20260205T135943','Impinj set to report earnings as retail mandates fuel RFID push','https://m.investing.com/news/earnings/impinj-set-to-report-earnings-as-retail-mandates-fuel-rfid-push-93CH-4488043?ampMode=1','Impinj Inc. is preparing to report its fourth-quarter earnings, with investors focused on whether the company can maintain its growth despite expected sequential revenue softness. The company is benefiting from expanded retail RFID mandates, such as Walmart''s, and the integration of its technology by Avery Dennison. Key metrics to watch include gross margins and guidance related to the new Gen2X protocol enhancements, which are expected to boost inventory efficiency and combat counterfeiting.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/msite/img/install_apps/mobile-icon-banner.svg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.917442"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.831257"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.722512"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.636610"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.629274"}]',0.27289,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "PI", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.389265"}, {"ticker": "AVGO", "relevance_score": "0.618118", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.112622"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.555387", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.224771"}]','{"url": "https://m.investing.com/news/earnings/impinj-set-to-report-earnings-as-retail-mandates-fuel-rfid-push-93CH-4488043?ampMode=1", "title": "Impinj set to report earnings as retail mandates fuel RFID push", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.917442"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.831257"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "rel