	 (2025,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-05 13:59:40','20260205T135940','Walmart introduces new minimum $40.50 rule across all US stores','https://www.the-sun.com/money/15895094/walmart-pharmacy-leaders-technicians-pay-rise/','Walmart has announced a significant pay increase for its pharmacy team, particularly for newly created team leader and technician positions. Pharmacy team leaders will see their average pay rise from $28 to $42 per hour, and pharmacy technicians will go from $22 to $40.50 per hour, representing an 86% pay raise for technicians. This move is part of Walmart''s investment in its Health & Wellness division and aims to strengthen the care experience in communities while providing clear career pathways for associates.','https://www.the-sun.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/11/NINTCHDBPICT001039872012.jpg?quality=90&strip=all','The Sun','General','The Sun','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.939200"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.717041"}]',0.331339,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.333511"}]','{"url": "https://www.the-sun.com/money/15895094/walmart-pharmacy-leaders-technicians-pay-rise/", "title": "Walmart introduces new minimum $40.50 rule across all US stores", "source": "The Sun", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.939200"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.717041"}], "authors": ["James Evenden"], "summary": "Walmart has announced a significant pay increase for its pharmacy team, particularly for newly created team leader and technician positions. Pharmacy team leaders will see their average pay rise from $28 to $42 per hour, and pharmacy technicians will go from $22 to $40.50 per hour, representing an 86% pay raise for technicians. This move is part of Walmart''s investment in its Health & Wellness division and aims to strengthen the care experience in communities while providing clear career pathways for associates.", "banner_image": "https://www.the-sun.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/11/NINTCHDBPICT001039872012.jpg?quality=90&strip=all", "source_domain": "The Sun", "time_published": "20260205T135940", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.333511"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.331339}','2026-02-06 12:41:23',NULL),
	 (2031,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-07 10:14:06','20260207T101406','Caterpillar stock price jumps 7% to $726 as Dow cracks 50,000 — what matters next week','https://ts2.tech/en/caterpillar-stock-price-jumps-7-to-726-as-dow-cracks-50000-what-matters-next-week/','Caterpillar (CAT) stock surged 7.1% to $726.20, pushing the Dow Jones Industrial Average above 50,000 for the first time. This rally, along with gains in other industrial stocks like Deere and CNH Industrial, suggests investors are shifting towards economically sensitive companies beyond the tech and AI sectors. The market will closely watch upcoming U.S. jobs and inflation data next week to determine if Friday''s gains have sustained conviction.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/caterpillar-stock-price-jumps-7-to-726-as-dow-cracks-50000-what-matters-next-week-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.905102"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.717150"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.626302"}]',0.156136,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "CAT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.483264"}, {"ticker": "DE", "relevance_score": "0.647521", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.339763"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.640012", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.302584"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/caterpillar-stock-price-jumps-7-to-726-as-dow-cracks-50000-what-matters-next-week/", "title": "Caterpillar stock price jumps 7% to $726 as Dow cracks 50,000 — what matters next week", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.905102"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.717150"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.626302"}], "authors": ["Shan Ahmed Khan"], "summary": "Caterpillar (C