	 (2036,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-07 02:01:15','20260207T020115','How Stronger Cloud and AI Momentum At Alibaba Group Holding (BABA) Has Changed Its Investment Story','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/retail/nyse-baba/alibaba-group-holding/news/how-stronger-cloud-and-ai-momentum-at-alibaba-group-holding','Alibaba Group Holding''s recent stronger-than-expected second quarter, driven by a 34% surge in its cloud division due to higher AI and enterprise demand, is reshaping its investment narrative. The company''s increased focus and investment in AI, cloud, and automation, including its Qwen AI app and Cainiao''s autonomous logistics, indicate a shift towards infrastructure over pure retail. While this acceleration in cloud growth presents new catalysts for monetization and AI workloads, it also introduces execution risks from increased AI spending and competition, which may impact margins.','https://images.simplywall.st/company/c8250615-877a-4ae1-bef3-636b69cd83e8/chart/quote-price','Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.920015"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.802090"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.706549"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.639921"}]',0.199591,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "BABA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.254878"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.610770", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.105810"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/retail/nyse-baba/alibaba-group-holding/news/how-stronger-cloud-and-ai-momentum-at-alibaba-group-holding", "title": "How Stronger Cloud and AI Momentum At Alibaba Group Holding (BABA) Has Changed Its Investment Story", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.920015"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.802090"}, {"topi