	 (2038,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-07 01:58:53','20260207T015853','News | Tesla expands in Silicon Valley factory hub as it pivots toward robots','https://www.costar.com/article/353783529/tesla-grows-in-silicon-valley-manufacturing-hub-as-it-pivots-to-robots','Tesla has expanded its presence in Fremont, California, by leasing a large advanced manufacturing space, signaling a strategic shift to become a leading company in humanoid robots and AI. This move comes as the company aims to reduce its reliance on car manufacturing, particularly with plans to phase out Model S and Model X production in favor of its Optimus robot program. The leased properties will bolster Tesla''s efforts to develop and mass-produce Optimus robots, leveraging Silicon Valley''s concentration of skilled AI talent.','https://www.costar.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcostar.brightspotcdn.com%2Fdims4%2Fdefault%2F39a164d%2F2147483647%2Fstrip%2Ftrue%2Fcrop%2F2048x1151%2B0%2B0%2Fresize%2F2048x1151!%2Fquality%2F100%2F%3Furl%3Dhttp%253A%252F%252Fcostar-brightspot.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%252F72%252F2f%252Fbf5529ec499b8fc349e05f4f4618%252Fbuildingphoto-2026-02-05t155224.715.jpg&w=3840&q=75','CoStar','General','CoStar','[{"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.916955"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.815762"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.707510"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.612083"}]',0.223248,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "TSLA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.464350"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.644508", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.101140"}, {"ticker": "WDC", "relevance_score": "0.645524", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.109005"}]','{"url": "https://www.costar.com/article/353783529/tesla-grows-in-silicon-valley-manufacturing-hub-as-it-pivots-to-robots", "title":