	 (2039,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-07 01:37:38','20260207T013738','Analog Devices stock lags chip rebound — what traders watch ahead of Feb. 18 earnings','https://ts2.tech/en/analog-devices-stock-lags-chip-rebound-what-traders-watch-ahead-of-feb-18-earnings/','Analog Devices (ADI) stock slipped 0.5% despite a broader chip market rally fueled by increased AI-related capital expenditures from Amazon and Alphabet. While ADI''s chips are crucial for various electronics, the company is not directly at the forefront of the AI boom, leading investors to weigh its reliability against more volatile AI chip stocks. Ahead of its Q1 earnings report on February 18, traders will be looking for updates on pricing, gross margins, backlog, and potential impacts from data-center construction on demand for power management components.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/analog-devices-stock-lags-chip-rebound-what-traders-watch-ahead-of-feb-18-earnings-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.915108"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.808871"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.711813"}]',0.451142,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ADI", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.214487"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.637059", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.503258"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.601754", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.647525"}, {"ticker": "AMD", "relevance_score": "0.643777", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.627169"}, {"ticker": "AVGO", "relevance_score": "0.637472", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.565693"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/analog-devices-stock-lags-chip-rebound-what-traders-watch-ahead-of-feb-18-earnings/", "title": "Analog Devices stoc