	 (2042,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 23:57:38','20260206T235738','Why CSW (CSW) Stock Is Up Today','https://finviz.com/news/303385/why-csw-csw-stock-is-up-today','Shares of industrial products company CSW (NYSE:CSW) rose 5.4% today as the broader market rebounded from a tech-driven sell-off. The rally was supported by a recovery in technology stocks, a bounce in Bitcoin, and an improvement in U.S. consumer sentiment, with the Dow Jones Industrial Average surpassing 50,000. CSW''s shares are up 5.5% today at $290.25, though they are still down 1.6% year-to-date and 13.7% below their 52-week high.','https://news-assets.stockstory.org/cover-images/_1400x700_crop_center-center_none/csw-industrials-cover-image-6fb02a785061_2024-05-23-164925_fznb.jpeg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.946270"}]',0.365775,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "CSW", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.332989"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.639022", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.361644"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.637188", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.417577"}, {"ticker": "AVGO", "relevance_score": "0.599092", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.384430"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/303385/why-csw-csw-stock-is-up-today", "title": "Why CSW (CSW) Stock Is Up Today", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.946270"}], "authors": ["Kayode Omotosho"], "summary": "Shares of industrial products company CSW (NYSE:CSW) rose 5.4% today as the broader market rebounded from a tech-driven sell-off. The rally was supported by a recovery in technology stocks, a bounce in Bitcoin, and an improvement in U.S. consumer sentiment, with the Dow Jones Industrial Average surpassing 50,000. CSW''s shares are up 5.5% today