	 (2045,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 23:28:08','20260206T232808','Amazon.com announces fourth quarter results','https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/amazon-earnings-q4-2025-report','Amazon.com, Inc. reported robust financial results for the fourth quarter and full year ended December 31, 2025. Net sales for Q4 2025 increased by 14% to $213.4 billion, while full-year net sales grew 12% to $716.9 billion, driven by strong performances in AWS, advertising, and international stores. The company highlighted significant innovation and investment in AI, custom chips, and delivery services, with CEO Andy Jassy projecting $200 billion in capital expenditures for 2026.','https://assets.aboutamazon.com/b0/91/7600f30a4cf78ef4e1e02019fc98/about-amazon-hero-q4earnings-herogrid2-amazon-news-lt-020226-1.jpg','About Amazon','General','About Amazon','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.914218"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.836314"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.708561"}]',0.220005,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.535128"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.638199", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.216211"}, {"ticker": "CRM", "relevance_score": "0.615286", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.206493"}, {"ticker": "V", "relevance_score": "0.610861", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.142536"}, {"ticker": "BLK", "relevance_score": "0.613841", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.133250"}]','{"url": "https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/amazon-earnings-q4-2025-report", "title": "Amazon.com announces fourth quarter results", "source": "About Amazon", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.914218"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.836