	 (2046,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 22:59:33','20260206T225933','Tech Stocks, Crypto, and Gold Whipsaw After a Volatile Week','https://www.morningstar.com/markets/tech-stocks-crypto-gold-whipsaw-after-volatile-week','Technology stocks, cryptocurrencies like bitcoin, and gold experienced significant volatility this week, characterized by a sharp three-day selloff followed by a strong rebound on Friday. Analysts attribute the initial market downturn to concerns over the short-term returns of massive AI investments, rather than a single event. The rebound suggests that these fears may have been overdone, though some software companies continue to struggle, and there are signs of a broader sector rotation towards less AI-exposed industries.','https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/morningstar/C2C2LT5FVREKTLBNC7YGWU53CQ.png','Morningstar','General','Morningstar','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.922192"}, {"topic": "blockchain", "relevance_score": "0.828372"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.716320"}]',-0.032366,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "MORN", "relevance_score": "0.617597", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.338494"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.908888", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.307900"}, {"ticker": "CRM", "relevance_score": "0.939002", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.300576"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.847093", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.449022"}]','{"url": "https://www.morningstar.com/markets/tech-stocks-crypto-gold-whipsaw-after-volatile-week", "title": "Tech Stocks, Crypto, and Gold Whipsaw After a Volatile Week", "source": "Morningstar", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_sco