	 (2047,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 22:38:18','20260206T223818','Howmet Aerospace Stock Rally: Up 6.4% on February 6, 2026 Market Surge - News and Statistics','https://www.indexbox.io/blog/howmet-aerospace-hwm-stock-rises-62-as-dow-crosses-50000/','Howmet Aerospace (HWM) stock surged 6.4% on February 6, 2026, closing at $223.14, driven by a broader market rally including a rebound in technology stocks, a stabilized Bitcoin, and improved consumer sentiment. The Dow Jones Industrial Average crossed the 50,000 threshold for the first time on the same day. This positive movement for Howmet follows a recent price target increase by Baird and strong year-over-year revenue growth in commercial and defense aerospace segments.',NULL,'IndexBox','General','IndexBox','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.933790"}]',0.385872,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "HWM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.450338"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.622764", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.313602"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.566307", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.320350"}, {"ticker": "AVGO", "relevance_score": "0.570129", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.325934"}]','{"url": "https://www.indexbox.io/blog/howmet-aerospace-hwm-stock-rises-62-as-dow-crosses-50000/", "title": "Howmet Aerospace Stock Rally: Up 6.4% on February 6, 2026 Market Surge - News and Statistics", "source": "IndexBox", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.933790"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Howmet Aerospace (HWM) stock surged 6.4% on February 6, 2026, closing at $223.14, driven by a broader market rally including a rebound in technology stocks, a stabili