	 (2048,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 22:35:11','20260206T223511','Why Is Blue Bird (BLBD) Stock Soaring Today','https://finviz.com/news/303396/why-is-blue-bird-blbd-stock-soaring-today','Blue Bird (BLBD) stock surged 5.2% following a broader market rebound and strong recent financial performance. The company recently reported better-than-expected Q4 2025 earnings and provided an upbeat full-year profit forecast, with adjusted EPS of $1.00 against an anticipated $0.80 and revenue exceeding forecasts. CEO John Wyskiel noted a significant 45% increase in Q1 order intake, pushing the backlog to 3,400 units, indicating confidence in future growth despite a mixed full-year revenue outlook.','https://news-assets.stockstory.org/cover-images/_1400x700_crop_center-center_none/blue-bird-cover-image-d130460fa0e4_2024-06-26-070239_vgau.jpeg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.903374"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.611388"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.706957"}]',0.325489,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "BLBD", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.402070"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.606807", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.347552"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.729204", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.316283"}, {"ticker": "AVGO", "relevance_score": "0.605196", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.306394"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/303396/why-is-blue-bird-blbd-stock-soaring-today", "title": "Why Is Blue Bird (BLBD) Stock Soaring Today", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.903374"}, {"topic": "economy_ma