	 (2050,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 21:58:45','20260206T215845','Increased Amazon flight activity boosts Sun Country cargo revenue','https://finance.yahoo.com/news/increased-amazon-flight-activity-boots-213349938.html','Sun Country Airlines reported record cargo revenue of $48 million for the fourth quarter, primarily due to adding eight freighter aircraft to its Amazon transportation service agreement. The Minneapolis-based carrier, which is being acquired by Allegiant, saw a 68% year-over-year increase in cargo revenue, with full-year cargo revenue jumping 44.6% to $155 million. Sun Country plans to further expand its Amazon-supplied freighter fleet to 22 aircraft by July and open a new operations base at Cincinnati/Northern Kentucky International Airport to improve efficiency.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/Qjhv9MyAXFJ28tEYJoPsYg--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTU0MA--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/freightwaves_373/4f6c4ef851935cf4a6437ad5ecc3b2cc','Yahoo Finance','General','Yahoo Finance','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.915234"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.840306"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.921544"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.731747"}]',0.13411,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "SNCY", "relevance_score": "0.346842", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.038556"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.932722", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.330510"}, {"ticker": "BA", "relevance_score": "0.615743", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.127804"}]','{"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/increased-amazon-flight-activity-boots-213349938.html", "title": "Increased Amazon flight activity boosts Sun Country cargo revenue", "source": "Yahoo Finance", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.915234"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relev