	 (2056,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 20:28:32','20260206T202832','Chip Stocks Soar as Nvidia CEO Huang Says Demand Is ''Through the Roof''','https://www.investopedia.com/chip-stocks-soar-as-nvidia-ceo-huang-says-demand-is-through-the-roof-nvda-ai-11901525','Semiconductor stocks, led by Nvidia, rallied significantly after Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang stated that demand for AI technology is "through the roof" and the industry may be at an "inflection point." This surge follows massive AI spending forecasts from major cloud providers like Amazon, which are investing heavily in AI hardware. While cloud giants shoulder the costs, chipmakers are benefiting from increased orders, sending their stocks higher.','https://www.investopedia.com/thmb/zRkp_y6FnsjOWzgqzbyjym1v9J0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc():format(webp)/GettyImages-2254355395-5d1a9e06199347589e5d5d14f670f7a5.jpg','Investopedia','General','Investopedia','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.901884"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.812090"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.718363"}]',0.203547,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.446164"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.747568", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.275753"}, {"ticker": "AMD", "relevance_score": "0.632725", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.316186"}, {"ticker": "AVGO", "relevance_score": "0.647419", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.329765"}]','{"url": "https://www.investopedia.com/chip-stocks-soar-as-nvidia-ceo-huang-says-demand-is-through-the-roof-nvda-ai-11901525", "title": "Chip Stocks Soar as Nvidia CEO Huang Says Demand Is ''Through the Roof''", "source": "Investopedia", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.901884"}, {