	 (2058,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 20:25:31','20260206T202531','KLA stock jumps 8% as AI capex talk lifts chip equipment names','https://ts2.tech/en/kla-stock-jumps-8-as-ai-capex-talk-lifts-chip-equipment-names/','KLA Corp''s stock surged by 8% following increased capital expenditure announcements from Amazon and Alphabet, signaling strong demand for AI-related chipmaking equipment. The company, a key player in the AI ecosystem, recently reported solid quarterly revenue and announced a cash dividend of $1.90 per share, reiterating its goal to return at least 85% of free cash flow to shareholders. Despite broad market enthusiasm for AI spending, investor anxiety persists regarding the long-term returns and sustainability of this demand boom.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/kla-stock-jumps-8-as-ai-capex-talk-lifts-chip-equipment-names-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.824478"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.917077"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.640988"}]',0.246067,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KLAC", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.423334"}, {"ticker": "AMAT", "relevance_score": "0.742172", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.340714"}, {"ticker": "LRCX", "relevance_score": "0.708197", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.306149"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.637861", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.106946"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/kla-stock-jumps-8-as-ai-capex-talk-lifts-chip-equipment-names/", "title": "KLA stock jumps 8% as AI capex talk lifts chip equipment names", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.824478"}, {"topic": "financial_markets