	 (2070,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 17:59:20','20260206T175920','Amazon stock sinks after company touts $200 billion AI spending plans, offers cautious profit outlook','https://finance.yahoo.com/news/amazon-stock-sinks-after-company-touts-200-billion-ai-spending-plans-offers-cautious-profit-outlook-173054116.html','Amazon''s stock fell after the company announced a cautious Q1 operating income outlook and plans to significantly increase capital expenditures for 2026, allocating $200 billion primarily towards AI, chips, robotics, and satellites. Despite strong Q4 earnings results that largely met analyst expectations for revenue and slightly missed on EPS, investor concern over the massive spending jump and Q1 projections led to a share price decline. This spending increase mirrors similar moves by other tech giants like Google, Meta, and Microsoft, highlighting the industry''s large investment in AI.',NULL,'Yahoo Finance','General','Yahoo Finance','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.942397"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.829920"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.714272"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.601928"}]',-0.496646,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.638388"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.718295", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.406856"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.748728", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.412992"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.625876", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.410616"}]','{"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/amazon-stock-sinks-after-company-touts-200-billion-ai-spending-plans-offers-cautious-profit-outlook-173054116.html", "title": "Amazon stock sinks after company touts $200 billion AI spending plans, offers cautious