	 (2071,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 17:57:48','20260206T175748','FedEx stock hits all-time high at 367.69 USD','https://www.investing.com/news/company-news/fedex-stock-hits-alltime-high-at-36769-usd-93CH-4491559','FedEx stock reached an all-time high of $367.69, reflecting strong performance with a 43.98% return over the past year. Despite an overbought RSI and potential overvaluation, the company has raised dividends for five consecutive years. Recent analyst upgrades and strategic advancements, including AI-powered tracking tools and plans to return grounded MD-11 cargo jets to service, underscore its strong market position.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/world_news_2_69x52._800x533_L_1419494365.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.931768"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.828611"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.744487"}]',0.304524,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "FDX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.476461"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.607988", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.105277"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/company-news/fedex-stock-hits-alltime-high-at-36769-usd-93CH-4491559", "title": "FedEx stock hits all-time high at 367.69 USD", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.931768"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.828611"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.744487"}], "authors": ["Investing.com"], "summary": "FedEx stock reached an all-time high of $367.69, reflecting strong performance with a 43.98% return over the past year. Despite an overbought RSI and potential overvaluation, the company has raised dividends for five consecutive years. Recent analyst upgrades and strategic advancements, including AI-powered tracking t