	 (2079,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 16:29:05','20260206T162905','US, EU, Japan Move To Break China''s Control Of Critical Mineral Supply Chains','https://www.benzinga.com/Opinion/26/02/50452547/us-eu-japan-move-to-break-chinas-control-of-critical-mineral-supply-chains','The US, EU, and Japan are collaborating to reduce China''s dominance in critical mineral supply chains, citing predatory trade practices. This initiative includes new deals, legislation like Project Vault and the Critical Mineral Dominance Act in the US, and efforts to boost domestic mining and refining. The increasing demand for copper, driven by AI, EVs, and data centers, highlights the urgency of these actions to secure vital supplies and diversify sources.','https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/07/24/article-header-background-image.png?quality=85&auto=webp&width=1300','Benzinga','General','Benzinga','[{"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.946907"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.706499"}]',0.25642,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "ICOP", "relevance_score": "0.736584", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.332609"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.714144", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.223944"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.625401", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.232677"}, {"ticker": "FCX", "relevance_score": "0.934806", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.344998"}]','{"url": "https://www.benzinga.com/Opinion/26/02/50452547/us-eu-japan-move-to-break-chinas-control-of-critical-mineral-supply-chains", "title": "US, EU, Japan Move To Break China''s Control Of Critical Mineral Supply Chains", "source": "Benzinga", "topics": [{"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.946907"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.706499"}], "authors": ["Eur