	 (2080,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 16:29:02','20260206T162902','Form DEF 14A Dominari Holdings Inc. For: Mar 04','https://www.streetinsider.com/SEC+Filings/Form+DEF+14A+Dominari+Holdings+Inc.+For%3A+Mar+04/25959768.html','Dominari Holdings Inc. has filed Form DEF 14A for a Special Meeting of Stockholders on March 4, 2026. The company is seeking approval to amend its 2022 Equity Incentive Plan to increase the number of shares reserved for issuance by 10,000,000 to a total of 21,720,750, and to clarify the calculation of its annual "evergreen" increase provision. These amendments are crucial for attracting and retaining talent, with a significant portion of the additional shares intended for special awards to CEO Anthony Hayes and President Kyle Wool in recognition of their contributions.',NULL,'StreetInsider','General','StreetInsider','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.915713"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.807022"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.744997"}]',0.07686,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "DOMH", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.235988"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.615147", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.229943"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.615181", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.220524"}]','{"url": "https://www.streetinsider.com/SEC+Filings/Form+DEF+14A+Dominari+Holdings+Inc.+For%3A+Mar+04/25959768.html", "title": "Form DEF 14A Dominari Holdings Inc. For: Mar 04", "source": "StreetInsider", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.915713"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.807022"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.744997"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Dominari Holdings Inc. has filed Form DEF 14A for a Special Meeting of Stockholders on March 4, 2026. The company is seeking 