	 (2082,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-06 16:00:41','20260206T160041','Sea Ltd stock price target lowered to $170 by Bernstein SocGen','https://www.investing.com/news/analyst-ratings/sea-ltd-stock-price-target-lowered-to-170-by-bernstein-socgen-93CH-4491282','Bernstein SocGen Group has lowered its price target for Sea Ltd. (NYSE:SE) to $170 from $185, while maintaining an Outperform rating. Despite the reduced target, which is still above the current trading price of $108.71, the firm believes the recent AI-led stock pullback is overdone and that Sea Ltd. can benefit from AI advancements. Other firms like Maybank Kim Eng and Phillip Securities have upgraded Sea Ltd.''s rating to Buy, citing attractive risk-reward profiles and improved growth expectations.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/World_News_9_800x533_L_1420026261.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.948504"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.842828"}]',0.311701,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "SE", "relevance_score": "0.964945", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.296972"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.643829", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.325725"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/analyst-ratings/sea-ltd-stock-price-target-lowered-to-170-by-bernstein-socgen-93CH-4491282", "title": "Sea Ltd stock price target lowered to $170 by Bernstein SocGen", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.948504"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.842828"}], "authors": ["Investing.com"], "summary": "Bernstein SocGen Group has lowered its price target for Sea Ltd. (NYSE:SE) to $170 from $185, while maintaining an Outperform rating. Despite the reduced target, which is still above the current trading price of $108.71, the firm believes the recent AI-led stock pullback is