	 (2099,'alpha_vantage','BBWI','BBWI','2026-02-06 14:10:25','20260206T141025','BBWI Investor Alert: Faruqi & Faruqi, LLP Reminds Bath & Body Works Investors of the Securities Class Action Lawsuit Deadline on March 16, 2026','https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bbwi-investor-alert-faruqi--faruqi-llp-reminds-bath--body-works-investors-of-the-securities-class-action-lawsuit-deadline-on-march-16-2026-302680865.html','Faruqi & Faruqi, LLP has issued an investor alert for Bath & Body Works (NYSE: BBWI) concerning a securities class action lawsuit. The lawsuit alleges that the company and its executives made false or misleading statements regarding their business strategy and financial prospects. Investors who suffered losses between June 4, 2024, and November 19, 2025, are encouraged to contact the firm, as the deadline to seek the role of lead plaintiff is March 16, 2026.','https://mma.prnewswire.com/media/2457438/Faruqi_Logo.jpg?w=300','PR Newswire','General','PR Newswire','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.930340"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.825604"}]',-0.413603,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "BBWI", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.407278"}]','{"url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bbwi-investor-alert-faruqi--faruqi-llp-reminds-bath--body-works-investors-of-the-securities-class-action-lawsuit-deadline-on-march-16-2026-302680865.html", "title": "BBWI Investor Alert: Faruqi & Faruqi, LLP Reminds Bath & Body Works Investors of the Securities Class Action Lawsuit Deadline on March 16, 2026", "source": "PR Newswire", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.930340"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.825604"}], "authors": ["Faruqi & Faruqi", "LLP"], "summary": "Faruqi & Faruqi, LLP has issued an investor alert for Bath & Body Works (NYSE: BBWI) concerning a securities class action lawsuit. The lawsuit alleges that the company and its e