	 (2126,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-07 01:10:38','20260207T011038','Costco stock price closes above $1,000 as January sales jump; what COST investors watch next','https://ts2.tech/en/costco-stock-price-closes-above-1000-as-january-sales-jump-what-cost-investors-watch-next/','Costco (COST.O) stock closed above $1,000 after reporting a 9.3% jump in January net sales and a 34.4% surge in digital sales. Analysts are divided on whether this momentum will continue into February, with some raising price targets and others maintaining "Sell" ratings due to concerns about traffic numbers and potential unwinding of winter-storm driven stock-ups. Investors are now looking to the next sales update on March 5 and the upcoming $1.30 per share dividend on February 13.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/costco-stock-price-closes-above-1000-as-january-sales-jump-what-cost-investors-watch-next-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.936539"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.824284"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.613668"}]',0.155452,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.405118"}, {"ticker": "WFC", "relevance_score": "0.646888", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.127569"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/costco-stock-price-closes-above-1000-as-january-sales-jump-what-cost-investors-watch-next/", "title": "Costco stock price closes above $1,000 as January sales jump; what COST investors watch next", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.936539"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.824284"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.613668"}], "authors": ["