	 (2127,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-06 21:58:47','20260206T215847','Natural Grocers to open first Wisconsin store','https://chainstoreage.com/natural-grocers-open-first-wisconsin-store','Natural Grocers, an organic and natural grocery chain based in Colorado, is expanding its presence by opening its first store in Wisconsin, located in Lake Geneva, this spring. The company reaffirmed plans for 6-8 new locations and several remodels in fiscal 2026, following a 1.6% increase in net sales for Q1 2026 compared to Q1 2025. This expansion aligns with a trend of significant year-over-year growth in foot traffic for non-traditional grocery retailers.','https://chainstoreage.com/images/v/16_x_9_480/s3fs-public/2024-06/natural_grocers.jpg','Chain Store Age','General','Chain Store Age','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.838968"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.717626"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.633709"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.604143"}]',0.304064,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "NGVC", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.480840"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.924156", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.324047"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.724032", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.327193"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.634420", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.128465"}]','{"url": "https://chainstoreage.com/natural-grocers-open-first-wisconsin-store", "title": "Natural Grocers to open first Wisconsin store", "source": "Chain Store Age", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.838968"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.717626"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.633709"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_s