	 (2138,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-07 09:04:30','20260207T090430','Twin Capital Management Inc. Sells 5,541 Shares of Amgen Inc. $AMGN','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-twin-capital-management-inc-sells-5541-shares-of-amgen-inc-amgn-2026-02-07/','Twin Capital Management Inc. has reduced its stake in Amgen Inc. by 27.3%, selling 5,541 shares and leaving it with 14,780 shares valued at approximately $4.17 million. Meanwhile, Amgen reported strong Q4 results, beating EPS and revenue estimates, raising its FY-2026 EPS guidance, and increasing its quarterly dividend. Despite positive analyst sentiment and recent stock highs, near-term risks include CVS replacing some Amgen bone-disease treatments with lower-cost alternatives and recent insider selling.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/amgen-inc-logo-1200x675.jpg?v=20231228113741','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.935156"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.844950"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.706131"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.932777"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.610577"}]',-0.128262,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMGN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.103449"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.732959", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.330729"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-twin-capital-management-inc-sells-5541-shares-of-amgen-inc-amgn-2026-02-07/", "title": "Twin Capital Management Inc. Sells 5,541 Shares of Amgen Inc. $AMGN", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.935156"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.844950"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.706131"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.932777"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_scor