	 (2139,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-07 08:59:38','20260207T085938','SBI Securities Co. Ltd. Has $977,000 Stock Holdings in Amgen Inc. $AMGN','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-sbi-securities-co-ltd-has-977000-stock-holdings-in-amgen-inc-amgn-2026-02-07/','SBI Securities Co. Ltd. recently reduced its stake in Amgen Inc. by 46.1% to 3,461 shares, valued at $977,000. Despite this, other hedge funds increased their holdings, and Amgen demonstrated strong Q4 results, surpassing estimates and raising FY 2026 guidance, leading to a "Moderate Buy" consensus rating among analysts. However, Amgen faces a commercial headwind as CVS plans to replace its bone-disease treatments with lower-cost alternatives.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/amgen-inc-logo-1200x675.jpg?v=20231228113741','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.905160"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.837314"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.948727"}]',-0.086149,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMGN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.212615"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.740852", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.307213"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-sbi-securities-co-ltd-has-977000-stock-holdings-in-amgen-inc-amgn-2026-02-07/", "title": "SBI Securities Co. Ltd. Has $977,000 Stock Holdings in Amgen Inc. $AMGN", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.905160"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.837314"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.948727"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "SBI Securities Co. Ltd. recently reduced its stake in Amgen Inc. by 46.1% to 3,461 shares, valued at $977,000. Despite this, other hedge funds increased their holdings, and Amgen demonstrated strong Q4 results