	 (2140,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-07 07:43:12','20260207T074312','Amgen (NASDAQ:AMGN) Lowered to "Buy" Rating by Wall Street Zen','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/amgen-nasdaqamgn-lowered-to-buy-rating-by-wall-street-zen-2026-02-07/','Wall Street Zen has downgraded Amgen (NASDAQ:AMGN) from a "strong-buy" to a "buy" rating, despite the overall analyst consensus remaining a "Moderate Buy" with a $351.65 price target. The company recently surpassed Q4 earnings estimates and provided optimistic FY2026 guidance, but faces challenges from CVS replacing some of its bone disease treatments with lower-cost alternatives and recent insider stock sales. Other analysts have recently reiterated or increased their price targets for Amgen.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/amgen-inc-logo-1200x675.jpg?v=20231228113741','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.923939"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.816503"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.709173"}]',0.018561,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMGN", "relevance_score": "0.977778", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.102245"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.714542", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.044557"}, {"ticker": "LLY", "relevance_score": "0.592697", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.126739"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/amgen-nasdaqamgn-lowered-to-buy-rating-by-wall-street-zen-2026-02-07/", "title": "Amgen (NASDAQ:AMGN) Lowered to \\"Buy\\" Rating by Wall Street Zen", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.923939"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.816503"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.709173"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Wall Street Zen has downgraded Amgen (NASDAQ:AMGN) from a \\"strong-buy\\" to a \\"buy\\" rating