	 (2149,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-06 14:05:48','20260206T140548','Kroger quietly reduces a vital store service for customers','https://www.thestreet.com/retail/kroger-quietly-reduces-a-vital-store-service-for-customers','Kroger is scaling back its in-store medical clinics, The Little Clinic, by closing all 18 locations in Georgia, following a trend seen with other major retailers like Walmart, Walgreens, and CVS. This decision comes despite strong growth in Kroger''s pharmacy division, as retailers face challenges with high operating costs, a difficult reimbursement environment, and low margins in primary care services. Industry experts suggest these closures are a result of rapid expansion without fully understanding cost structures and the impact of inflation on medical expenses.','https://www.thestreet.com/.image/w_3840,q_auto:good,c_limit/NDA6MDAwMDAwMDAyODc1ODg4/kroger_shutterstock_.jpg?arena_f_auto','TheStreet','General','TheStreet','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.919328"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.713969"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.629988"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.625222"}]',-0.212151,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.252317"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.663403", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.240541"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.637964", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.185966"}, {"ticker": "WBA", "relevance_score": "0.566439", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.180941"}]','{"url": "https://www.thestreet.com/retail/kroger-quietly-reduces-a-vital-store-service-for-customers", "title": "Kroger quietly reduces a vital store service for customers", "source": "TheStreet", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_w