	 (2204,'alpha_vantage','DKS','DKS','2026-02-07 09:58:53','20260207T095853','BI Asset Management Fondsmaeglerselskab A S Acquires 5,953 Shares of DICK''S Sporting Goods, Inc. $DKS','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-bi-asset-management-fondsmaeglerselskab-a-s-acquires-5953-shares-of-dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-2026-02-07/','BI Asset Management Fondsmaeglerselskab A S has increased its stake in DICK''S Sporting Goods, Inc. by 34.0%, acquiring an additional 5,953 shares to hold a total of 23,446 shares valued at approximately $5.21 million. This comes as DICK''S Sporting Goods reported an EPS beat of $2.78 against expectations of $2.62, though revenue of $4.17 billion missed estimates. The company also announced a quarterly dividend of $1.2125 per share and carries a consensus "Hold" rating from analysts with a target price of $236.95.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-logo-1200x675.png?v=20221109153449','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.905417"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.806117"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.715096"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.649914"}]',0.277266,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "DKS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.290993"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-bi-asset-management-fondsmaeglerselskab-a-s-acquires-5953-shares-of-dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-2026-02-07/", "title": "BI Asset Management Fondsmaeglerselskab A S Acquires 5,953 Shares of DICK''S Sporting Goods, Inc. $DKS", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.905417"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.806117"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.715096"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.649914"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "BI Asset Manag