	 (2210,'alpha_vantage','DLTR','DLTR','2026-02-06 15:28:57','20260206T152857','South Sacramento Dollar Tree targeted in retail theft operation that nets 21 arrests','https://www.cbsnews.com/sacramento/news/sacramento-dollar-tree-florin-rd-retail-theft-21-arrests/','A retail theft operation at a Dollar Tree store in south Sacramento led to 21 arrests, including four minors, after the Sacramento County Sheriff''s Office responded to 67 calls at the location in three months. Six of those arrested may be eligible for prosecution under California''s Prop. 36. This initiative follows a similar operation in December 2025 targeting Target stores, highlighting ongoing efforts to combat rising retail theft impacting "quality-of-life crimes" across neighborhoods.','https://assets3.cbsnewsstatic.com/hub/i/r/2026/02/05/334d68d9-9718-4d1d-9a81-1c01d3ee6711/thumbnail/1200x630/a3e9ff3b13c5bc4d25a51a1a16a91adc/foggy-crash-i5.jpg#','CBS News','General','CBS News','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.832946"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.607816"}]',-0.142652,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "DLTR", "relevance_score": "0.955387", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.345139"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.641781", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.135719"}]','{"url": "https://www.cbsnews.com/sacramento/news/sacramento-dollar-tree-florin-rd-retail-theft-21-arrests/", "title": "South Sacramento Dollar Tree targeted in retail theft operation that nets 21 arrests", "source": "CBS News", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.832946"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.607816"}], "authors": ["Cecilio Padilla"], "summary": "A retail theft operation at a Dollar Tree store in south Sacramento led to 21 arrests, including four minors, after the Sacramento County Sheriff''s Office responded to 67 calls at the location in three months. Six of those ar