	 (2221,'alpha_vantage','HD','HD','2026-02-07 12:10:56','20260207T121056','Home Depot Is Up 10% This Month. How Far Could the Stock Go in 2026','https://www.tikr.com/blog/home-depot-is-up-10-this-month-how-far-could-the-stock-go-in-2026','Home Depot''s stock has risen 10% this month, reaching $385 per share, driven by improved sentiment in housing-linked stocks and stabilization in home improvement demand. Despite mixed institutional rebalancing, fundamental analysis suggests the stock is undervalued with a target price of $434, implying a 13% upside, due to earnings durability and resilient Pro demand. The article emphasizes that future growth relies on project reactivation and disciplined execution.','https://res.cloudinary.com/tikr/images/w_2296,h_2560,c_scale/f_webp,q_auto/v1770426228/images/HD_valuation_model-4/HD_valuation_model-4.webp?_i=AA','TIKR.com','General','TIKR.com','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.918404"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.823463"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.718770"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.623101"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.605680"}]',0.335692,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "HD", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.412422"}, {"ticker": "CRM", "relevance_score": "0.685207", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.250235"}]','{"url": "https://www.tikr.com/blog/home-depot-is-up-10-this-month-how-far-could-the-stock-go-in-2026", "title": "Home Depot Is Up 10% This Month. How Far Could the Stock Go in 2026", "source": "TIKR.com", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.918404"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.823463"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.718770"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.623101"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.605680"}], "author