	 (2226,'alpha_vantage','HD','HD','2026-02-06 18:02:08','20260206T180208','The Home Depot debuts Material List Builder AI','https://www.retaildive.com/news/home-depot-material-list-builder-ai-tool/810883/','The Home Depot has introduced its Material List Builder AI tool for Pro Xtra members, designed to help professional renovators, remodelers, builders, and tradespeople quickly generate project material lists. The AI tool allows users to create lists using natural language prompts, existing documents, or templates, and then autopopulates product recommendations with preferred pricing and inventory. This initiative is part of Home Depot''s broader strategy to enhance tech features for Pro customers, aiming to save time and streamline project management.','https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/iWUBO_p8PKV8TgXsCA56JHY6ywmW-OmUOvhGHOhBgLk/g:nowe:18:129/c:1991:1125/rs:fill:1200:675:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9ob21lX2RlcG90X25vdmVtYmVyXzIwMjQuanBn.webp','Retail Dive','General','Retail Dive','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.933914"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.814565"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.730405"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.608154"}]',0.283434,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "HD", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.423232"}, {"ticker": "LOW", "relevance_score": "0.608445", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.130962"}]','{"url": "https://www.retaildive.com/news/home-depot-material-list-builder-ai-tool/810883/", "title": "The Home Depot debuts Material List Builder AI", "source": "Retail Dive", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.933914"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.814565"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.730405"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.608154"}], "authors": ["Tatiana Walk-Mor