	 (2231,'alpha_vantage','HD','HD','2026-02-06 14:30:37','20260206T143037','SKYX Announces Launch at Home Depot of its Ceiling Plug & Play SKYFAN & TURBO HEATER, including a Launch of a Dedicated SkyPlug Branding Page at HomeDepot.com','https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/02/06/3233879/0/en/SKYX-Announces-Launch-at-Home-Depot-of-its-Ceiling-Plug-Play-SKYFAN-TURBO-HEATER-including-a-Launch-of-a-Dedicated-SkyPlug-Branding-Page-at-HomeDepot-com.html','SKYX Platforms Corp. announced the launch of its patented ceiling plug & play SKYFAN & Turbo Heater at Home Depot, alongside a new dedicated SkyPlug branding page on HomeDepot.com. This initiative aims to increase visibility, consumer education, and demand for SKYX''s innovative smart home products throughout 2026. The new product combines a ceiling fan with an integrated turbo heater, promoting safety and efficiency, and expands SKYX''s retail footprint into the multi-billion-dollar North American ceiling fan and space heater markets.','https://ml.globenewswire.com/Resource/Download/a3e4e258-8a22-49b0-807c-9336240fefdc','GlobeNewswire','General','GlobeNewswire','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.838234"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.747722"}]',0.337722,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "HD", "relevance_score": "0.914308", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.309273"}]','{"url": "https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/02/06/3233879/0/en/SKYX-Announces-Launch-at-Home-Depot-of-its-Ceiling-Plug-Play-SKYFAN-TURBO-HEATER-including-a-Launch-of-a-Dedicated-SkyPlug-Branding-Page-at-HomeDepot-com.html", "title": "SKYX Announces Launch at Home Depot of its Ceiling Plug & Play SKYFAN & TURBO HEATER, including a Launch of a Dedicated SkyPlug Branding Page at HomeDepot.com", "source": "GlobeNewswire", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.838234"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.747722"}], "authors": [],