	 (2237,'alpha_vantage','KMB','KMB','2026-02-06 19:31:43','20260206T193143','Kenvue stock price today: KVUE inches up as Feb. 17 results near and Kimberly-Clark deal math grips shares','https://ts2.tech/en/kenvue-stock-price-today-kvue-inches-up-as-feb-17-results-near-and-kimberly-clark-deal-math-grips-shares/','Kenvue (KVUE) shares rose slightly as the company approaches its Q4 and full-year 2025 earnings report on February 17, which will be released without a conference call due to its pending acquisition by Kimberly-Clark (KMB). The deal, valued at approximately $18.79 per share, currently sees KVUE trading about 3.6% below this implied offer value, making it a merger-arbitrage play. Investors are focused on the closing of the deal, expected in the second half of 2026, and how the upcoming earnings release will impact the stock''s performance relative to the offer price.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/kenvue-stock-price-today-kvue-inches-up-as-feb-17-results-near-and-kimberly-clark-deal-math-grips-shares-featured-1.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.911834"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.842061"}]',0.148501,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KVUE", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.130957"}, {"ticker": "KMB", "relevance_score": "0.822199", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.245105"}, {"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "0.649649", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.121268"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/kenvue-stock-price-today-kvue-inches-up-as-feb-17-results-near-and-kimberly-clark-deal-math-grips-shares/", "title": "Kenvue stock price today: KVUE inches up as Feb. 17 results near and Kimberly-Clark deal math grips shares", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "mergers_and