	 (2264,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-06 14:20:44','20260206T142044','Coca-Cola discontinues frozen juice can product category','https://www.vendingtimes.com/news/coca-cola-discontinues-frozen-juice-can-product-category/','Coca-Cola has announced it is discontinuing its frozen juice can product category, including the Minute Maid line. This decision is reportedly based on evolving consumer preferences, with the company opting to focus on products that align better with current demand. Minute Maid frozen juices, which Coca-Cola acquired in 1960, have been available since 1946.','https://nmgprod.s3.amazonaws.com/media/file/a2/a6/8078a1b45df4ae968a04a9de7d6a/cover_image__U9skBJcC__AdobeStock_431022699_Editorial_U.jpeg.960x540_q85_crop_upscale.jpg','Vending Times','General','Vending Times','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.917674"}]',0.034481,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.301808", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.035344"}]','{"url": "https://www.vendingtimes.com/news/coca-cola-discontinues-frozen-juice-can-product-category/", "title": "Coca-Cola discontinues frozen juice can product category", "source": "Vending Times", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.917674"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Coca-Cola has announced it is discontinuing its frozen juice can product category, including the Minute Maid line. This decision is reportedly based on evolving consumer preferences, with the company opting to focus on products that align better with current demand. Minute Maid frozen juices, which Coca-Cola acquired in 1960, have been available since 1946.", "banner_image": "https://nmgprod.s3.amazonaws.com/media/file/a2/a6/8078a1b45df4ae968a04a9de7d6a/cover_image__U9skBJcC__AdobeStock_431022699_Editorial_U.jpeg.960x540_q85_crop_upscale.jpg", "source_domain": "Vending Times", "time_published": "20260206T142044", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.30180