	 (2269,'alpha_vantage','WMT','KR','2026-02-07 10:49:23','20260207T104923','Kroger Stock Is Quietly Popping Off: Is This Boring Grocery Giant Your Next Power Play?','https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/ueberblick/kroger-stock-is-quietly-popping-off-is-this-boring-grocery-giant-your/68560533','Kroger stock may seem boring on the surface, but it''s showing steady growth and offers consistent dividends, making it an interesting prospect for investors. While not a trendy meme stock, Kroger''s focus on private-label brands, digital strategies, and fundamental human need for groceries gives it a defensible business model against market volatility. Despite intense competition and thin margins inherent to the grocery sector, Kroger presents a solid value play for long-term portfolio stability rather than overnight gains.',NULL,'AD HOC NEWS','General','AD HOC NEWS','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.806436"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.721511"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.637619"}]',0.145871,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.345109"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.749757", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.112705"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.606229", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.101020"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.582709", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.030597"}]','{"url": "https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/ueberblick/kroger-stock-is-quietly-popping-off-is-this-boring-grocery-giant-your/68560533", "title": "Kroger Stock Is Quietly Popping Off: Is This Boring Grocery Giant Your Next Power Play?", "source": "AD HOC NEWS", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.806436"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.721511"}, {"topic"