	 (2272,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-07 09:04:04','20260207T090404','State of Michigan Retirement System Raises Holdings in The Kroger Co. $KR','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-state-of-michigan-retirement-system-raises-holdings-in-the-kroger-co-kr-2026-02-07/','The State of Michigan Retirement System significantly increased its stake in The Kroger Co. (NYSE:KR) by 99.6% in the third quarter, purchasing an additional 297,900 shares, bringing its total ownership to 596,887 shares valued at $40.24 million. This move is part of a broader institutional buying trend, with Norges Bank also acquiring a new substantial position, resulting in institutional investors owning over 80% of Kroger''s stock. Kroger reported strong Q3 earnings, beating analyst estimates, and provided positive FY 2025 guidance, although its high dividend payout ratio raises some questions about sustainability.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/the-kroger-co-logo-1200x675.png?v=20221101143339','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929326"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.929527"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.831162"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.745308"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.603831"}]',0.284909,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.317848"}, {"ticker": "BK", "relevance_score": "0.605429", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.213270"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-state-of-michigan-retirement-system-raises-holdings-in-the-kroger-co-kr-2026-02-07/", "title": "State of Michigan Retirement System Raises Holdings in The Kroger Co. $KR", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.929326"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.929