	 (2273,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-07 08:46:39','20260207T084639','Twin Capital Management Inc. Cuts Position in The Kroger Co. $KR','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-twin-capital-management-inc-cuts-position-in-the-kroger-co-kr-2026-02-07/','Twin Capital Management Inc. decreased its stake in The Kroger Co. by 37.0% in Q3, selling 22,351 shares and retaining 38,077 shares valued at approximately $2.57 million. Despite this, institutional ownership remains high at 80.93%, with significant buys from major asset managers like Wellington, UBS, and Goldman offsetting some sales. Kroger reported strong quarterly EPS, provided positive FY2025 guidance, and announced a quarterly dividend, maintaining a "Moderate Buy" consensus rating among analysts with an average target price of $74.07.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/the-kroger-co-logo-1200x675.png?v=20221101143339','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.910893"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.821844"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.821194"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.721066"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.609476"}]',0.000152,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.036748"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-twin-capital-management-inc-cuts-position-in-the-kroger-co-kr-2026-02-07/", "title": "Twin Capital Management Inc. Cuts Position in The Kroger Co. $KR", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.910893"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.821844"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.821194"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.721066"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.609476"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Twin Capital Management Inc. decreased its st