	 (2294,'alpha_vantage','LULU','LULU','2026-02-07 08:43:41','20260207T084341','Principal Financial Group Inc. Has $31.87 Million Holdings in lululemon athletica inc. $LULU','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-principal-financial-group-inc-has-3187-million-holdings-in-lululemon-athletica-inc-lulu-2026-02-07/','Principal Financial Group Inc. reduced its stake in lululemon athletica inc. by 5.1%, now holding 179,127 shares valued at approximately $31.87 million. This comes as lululemon beat its recent earnings expectations, reporting $2.59 EPS versus $2.22 expected, and analysts maintain a "Hold" rating with an average price target of $227.05. Insider activity also shows Celeste Burgoyne selling 13,511 shares for over $2.75 million.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/lululemon-logo-1200x675.jpg','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.921366"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.805985"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.714243"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.628924"}]',0.106623,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "LULU", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.125210"}, {"ticker": "PFG", "relevance_score": "0.882468", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.169316"}, {"ticker": "BAC", "relevance_score": "0.563427", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.189396"}, {"ticker": "JPM", "relevance_score": "0.576555", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.184040"}, {"ticker": "NOW", "relevance_score": "0.563850", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.175980"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-principal-financial-group-inc-has-3187-million-holdings-in-lululemon-athletica-inc-lulu-2026-02-07/", "title": "Principal Financial Group Inc. Has $31.87 Million Holdi