	 (2295,'alpha_vantage','MDLZ','MDLZ','2026-02-07 00:58:21','20260207T005821','Katie Williams Joins J. M. Smucker As CMO With Valuation Upside In Focus','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/food-beverage-tobacco/nyse-sjm/j-m-smucker/news/katie-williams-joins-j-m-smucker-as-cmo-with-valuation-upsid','J. M. Smucker (NYSE:SJM) has appointed Katie Williams, formerly of Haleon, as its new Chief Marketing Officer, aiming to address competitive pressures and evolving industry conditions. This leadership change comes as J. M. Smucker''s stock has seen mixed performance, with recent short-term gains but a decline over three years. Investors are advised to monitor how Williams''s broad consumer brand experience will influence marketing priorities, brand investment, and overall commercial strategy, especially considering the current valuation and financial health indicators.',NULL,'Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.914758"}]',0.204768,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "SJM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.336430"}, {"ticker": "MDLZ", "relevance_score": "0.641307", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.135576"}, {"ticker": "HSY", "relevance_score": "0.634035", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.147969"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/food-beverage-tobacco/nyse-sjm/j-m-smucker/news/katie-williams-joins-j-m-smucker-as-cmo-with-valuation-upsid", "title": "Katie Williams Joins J. M. Smucker As CMO With Valuation Upside In Focus", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.914758"}], "authors": ["Simply Wall St", "Bailey Pemberton"], "summary": "J. M. Smucker (NYSE:SJM) has appointed Katie Williams, formerly of Haleon, as its new Chief Marketing Officer, aiming to address competitive pressures and evolving industry condit