	 (2296,'alpha_vantage','MDLZ','MDLZ','2026-02-06 21:05:50','20260206T210550','PR News | On the Move: J.M. Smucker Names Williams CMO - Fri., Feb. 6, 2026','https://www.odwyerpr.com/story/public/24269/2026-02-06/move-jm-smucker-names-williams-cmo.html','The J.M. Smucker Co. has appointed Katie Williams as its new CMO, effective March 9, succeeding Gail Hollander. Williams brings extensive marketing experience from Haleon, GSK, Mondelez International, and Kraft Heinz. Additionally, Jones Lang LaSalle Incorporated named Mencía Barreiros as head of communications, and Hub International Limited appointed Sue Lee as SVP of investor relations.','https://www.odwyerpr.com/images/odwyers-website-logo-revised.webp','O''Dwyer''s PR','General','O''Dwyer''s PR','[{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.816148"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.618746"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.700885"}]',0.196969,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "SJM", "relevance_score": "0.933885", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.336935"}, {"ticker": "KHC", "relevance_score": "0.612330", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.114778"}, {"ticker": "MDLZ", "relevance_score": "0.632216", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.107215"}]','{"url": "https://www.odwyerpr.com/story/public/24269/2026-02-06/move-jm-smucker-names-williams-cmo.html", "title": "PR News | On the Move: J.M. Smucker Names Williams CMO - Fri., Feb. 6, 2026", "source": "O''Dwyer''s PR", "topics": [{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.816148"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.618746"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.700885"}], "authors": ["Steve Barnes"], "summary": "The J.M. Smucker Co. has appointed Katie Williams as its new CMO, effective March 9, succeeding Gail Hollander. Williams brings extensive marketing experience from Haleon, GSK, Mondelez International, and Kra