	 (2298,'alpha_vantage','MDLZ','MDLZ','2026-02-06 14:16:00','20260206T141600','Sweet Recovery: Hershey Shares Surge 9% as Earnings Beat and Bullish Outlook Signal a Turnaround for the Snacking Giant','https://markets.financialcontent.com/stocks/article/marketminute-2026-2-6-sweet-recovery-hershey-shares-surge-9-as-earnings-beat-and-bullish-outlook-signal-a-turnaround-for-the-snacking-giant','The Hershey Company (NYSE: HSY) saw its stock surge over 9% following a strong Q4 2025 earnings report that beat analyst expectations. This recovery is attributed to a significant drop in cocoa prices and successful diversification into salty snacks, leading to a bullish outlook for 2026. The performance signals a potential "mean reversion" for defensive stocks and highlights Hershey''s effective management of supply chain costs amidst changing commodity markets.','https://marketminute.ghost.io/content/images/size/w1200/2026/02/40171229-a1dd-483c-9957-dd63282b1cd2.png','FinancialContent','General','FinancialContent','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.935103"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.716636"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.619562"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.815550"}]',0.171478,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "HSY", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.872483"}, {"ticker": "MDLZ", "relevance_score": "0.748672", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.257488"}, {"ticker": "SJM", "relevance_score": "0.606307", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.221367"}]','{"url": "https://markets.financialcontent.com/stocks/article/marketminute-2026-2-6-sweet-recovery-hershey-shares-surge-9-as-earnings-beat-and-bullish-outlook-signal-a-turnaround-for-the-snacking-giant", "title": "Sweet Recovery: Hershey Shares Surge 9% as Earnings Beat and Bullish Outlook Signal a Turnaround fo