	 (2341,'alpha_vantage','ROST','ROST','2026-02-07 11:58:20','20260207T115820','7 Ross Dress for Less Kitchen Finds Shoppers Are Loving This February','https://bestlifeonline.com/ross-dress-for-less-kitchen-finds-feb-2026/','This article highlights seven popular kitchen finds at Ross Dress for Less in February, celebrated by shoppers for their affordability and utility. Items include a Cuisinart veggie chopper, various small kitchen tools, spring-themed placemats, a high-end KitchenAid saute pan, affordable dish sets, coffee and espresso mug sets, and themed ramen bowls. The author notes that Ross offers significant discounts on these items compared to other retailers.','https://bestlifeonline.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/02/Ross-Dress-For-Less_83f61d.jpg?quality=82&strip=1&resize=640%2C360','Best Life','General','Best Life','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.937195"}]',0.426131,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ROST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.417473"}]','{"url": "https://bestlifeonline.com/ross-dress-for-less-kitchen-finds-feb-2026/", "title": "7 Ross Dress for Less Kitchen Finds Shoppers Are Loving This February", "source": "Best Life", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.937195"}], "authors": ["Leah Groth"], "summary": "This article highlights seven popular kitchen finds at Ross Dress for Less in February, celebrated by shoppers for their affordability and utility. Items include a Cuisinart veggie chopper, various small kitchen tools, spring-themed placemats, a high-end KitchenAid saute pan, affordable dish sets, coffee and espresso mug sets, and themed ramen bowls. The author notes that Ross offers significant discounts on these items compared to other retailers.", "banner_image": "https://bestlifeonline.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/02/Ross-Dress-For-Less_83f61d.jpg?quality=82&strip=1&resize=640%2C360", "source_domain": "Best Life", "time_publ