	 (2342,'alpha_vantage','ROST','ROST','2026-02-07 11:01:19','20260207T110119','BI Asset Management Fondsmaeglerselskab A S Acquires 22,675 Shares of Ross Stores, Inc. $ROST','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-bi-asset-management-fondsmaeglerselskab-a-s-acquires-22675-shares-of-ross-stores-inc-rost-2026-02-07/','BI Asset Management Fondsmaeglerselskab A S significantly increased its stake in Ross Stores, Inc. (NASDAQ:ROST) by 126.3% in the third quarter, acquiring an additional 22,675 shares and bringing its total holdings to 40,628 shares valued at approximately $6.19 million. The apparel retailer recently reported strong quarterly earnings, beating expectations with an EPS of $1.58 and revenue of $5.60 billion, and offers a quarterly dividend of $0.405 per share. Analysts maintain a "Moderate Buy" consensus rating for Ross Stores, with an average price target of $186.41.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/ross-stores-inc-logo-1200x675.jpg','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932832"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.803679"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.742132"}]',0.541494,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ROST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.545548"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-bi-asset-management-fondsmaeglerselskab-a-s-acquires-22675-shares-of-ross-stores-inc-rost-2026-02-07/", "title": "BI Asset Management Fondsmaeglerselskab A S Acquires 22,675 Shares of Ross Stores, Inc. $ROST", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932832"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.803679"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.742132"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "BI Asset Management Fondsmaeglerselskab A S significantly increased its stake in Ross Stores, Inc. (NASDAQ:ROST) by 126.3% in the third quart