	 (2343,'alpha_vantage','ROST','ROST','2026-02-07 08:57:10','20260207T085710','Ross Dress for Less® Holds In-Store Fundraiser to Help Local Bend Kids Succeed in School','https://www.mycentraloregon.com/event/ross-dress-for-less-holds-in-store-fundraiser-to-help-local-bend-kids-succeed-in-school/','Ross Dress for Less is holding its 12th annual "Help Local Kids Succeed in School" fundraiser from February 7th through March 1st. Customers in Bend and Redmond can donate at checkout to benefit the Boys & Girls Clubs of Bend''s Power Hour program, which provides homework help and tutoring. The Ross Stores Foundation will match donations up to $500,000 to amplify the impact.','https://dehayf5mhw1h7.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/sites/38/2026/02/05144540/73bb5b9d-1.webp','MyCentralOregon.com','General','MyCentralOregon.com','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.917181"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.643741"}]',0.425622,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ROST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.449523"}]','{"url": "https://www.mycentraloregon.com/event/ross-dress-for-less-holds-in-store-fundraiser-to-help-local-bend-kids-succeed-in-school/", "title": "Ross Dress for Less® Holds In-Store Fundraiser to Help Local Bend Kids Succeed in School", "source": "MyCentralOregon.com", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.917181"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.643741"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Ross Dress for Less is holding its 12th annual \\"Help Local Kids Succeed in School\\" fundraiser from February 7th through March 1st. Customers in Bend and Redmond can donate at checkout to benefit the Boys & Girls Clubs of Bend''s Power Hour program, which provides homework help and tutoring. The Ross Stores Foundation will match donations up to $500,000 to amplify the impact.", "banner_image": "https://dehayf5mhw1h7.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/sites/38/2026/02/0