	 (2346,'alpha_vantage','SFM','SFM','2026-02-06 14:58:39','20260206T145839','Ranger Investment Management L.P. Trims Holdings in Sprouts Farmers Market, Inc. $SFM','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-ranger-investment-management-lp-trims-holdings-in-sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-2026-02-06/','Ranger Investment Management L.P. significantly reduced its stake in Sprouts Farmers Market (NASDAQ:SFM) by 65.8% in Q3, selling 98,980 shares to hold 51,355 shares valued at approximately $5.59 million. This reduction occurred despite several other large institutions like Bank of America and Norges Bank materially increasing their positions in the same period. Sprouts Farmers Market is currently trading near its 52-week low, but analysts maintain a "Moderate Buy" consensus rating with a target price of $127.69.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-logo-1200x675.png?v=20240325163305','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.915604"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.827043"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.724489"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.614563"}]',0.034525,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "SFM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.118600"}, {"ticker": "BAC", "relevance_score": "0.701302", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.137662"}, {"ticker": "IVZ", "relevance_score": "0.643964", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.105411"}, {"ticker": "NOW", "relevance_score": "0.554794", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.111483"}, {"ticker": "TSN", "relevance_score": "0.570702", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.116303"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-ranger-investment-management-lp-trims-holdings-in-sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-2026-02-06/", "