	 (2381,'alpha_vantage','TSCO','TSCO','2026-02-06 21:31:19','20260206T213119','Tractor Supply Company Donates 200K to Support Winter Storm Recovery','https://wilsoncountysource.com/tractor-supply-company-donates-200k-to-support-winter-storm-recovery/','Tractor Supply Company and its Foundation have donated $250,000 to United Way of Greater Nashville''s Winter Storm Recovery Fund to aid in the aftermath of a severe winter storm in Middle Tennessee. The donation provides initial funding for recovery efforts, which include addressing immediate needs like food and supplies, as well as cleanup and debris removal. The company is also working with the Nashville Office of Emergency Management to provide emergency response supplies to affected residents.','https://wilsoncountysource.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Winter-Storm_6587-696x522.jpg','Wilson County Source','General','Wilson County Source','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.805540"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.630489"}]',0.446662,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "TSCO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.436208"}]','{"url": "https://wilsoncountysource.com/tractor-supply-company-donates-200k-to-support-winter-storm-recovery/", "title": "Tractor Supply Company Donates 200K to Support Winter Storm Recovery", "source": "Wilson County Source", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.805540"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.630489"}], "authors": ["Source Staff"], "summary": "Tractor Supply Company and its Foundation have donated $250,000 to United Way of Greater Nashville''s Winter Storm Recovery Fund to aid in the aftermath of a severe winter storm in Middle Tennessee. The donation provides initial funding for recovery efforts, which include addressing immediate needs like food and supplies, as well as cleanup and debris removal. The company is also working with the Nashville Office of Eme