	 (2407,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-06 18:01:03','20260206T180103','2 arrested for string of thefts at Walmart stores in Orleans, Genesee, Monroe counties','https://13wham.com/news/local/2-arrested-for-string-of-thefts-at-walmart-stores-in-orleans-genesee-monroe-counties-county-albion-batavia-brockport-sweden-ny','Two individuals, Kirk Thomas and Nevada Nichols, both from Batavia, have been arrested in connection with a series of thefts from Walmart stores in Orleans, Genesee, and Monroe counties, west of Rochester. The alleged thefts, primarily involving electronics, exceeded $1,400 from the Albion Walmart alone, with thousands more stolen from Batavia and Brockport locations. Thomas, who has an extensive criminal history with 48 previous arrests and eight felony convictions, was held in custody, while Nichols was released on appearance tickets.','https://13wham.com/resources/media2/16x9/full/210/center/80/06af0dcd-8c58-43ed-a742-bfb4da958075-large16x9_JCOBrockportWalmart_0001_frame_3596.jpeg','13WHAM-TV','General','13WHAM-TV','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.930188"}]',-0.200771,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.212500"}]','{"url": "https://13wham.com/news/local/2-arrested-for-string-of-thefts-at-walmart-stores-in-orleans-genesee-monroe-counties-county-albion-batavia-brockport-sweden-ny", "title": "2 arrested for string of thefts at Walmart stores in Orleans, Genesee, Monroe counties", "source": "13WHAM-TV", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.930188"}], "authors": ["WHAM"], "summary": "Two individuals, Kirk Thomas and Nevada Nichols, both from Batavia, have been arrested in connection with a series of thefts from Walmart stores in Orleans, Genesee, and Monroe counties, west of Rochester. The alleged thefts, primarily involving electronics, exceeded $1,400 from the Albion Walmart alone, with thousa