	 (2426,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-07 18:31:00','20260207T183100','Jim Cramer On Amazon Stock Slip: Not Saying Downside Overdone, ''I Figure Tomorrow''s Pretty Ugly''','https://finance.yahoo.com/news/jim-cramer-amazon-stock-slip-233145336.html','Jim Cramer commented on Amazon''s recent stock decline, acknowledging that the immediate future for the stock looks "pretty ugly" but maintains that the company''s significant investment in capital expenditures, particularly in AI infrastructure, is justifiable. Amazon''s shares fell sharply despite beating Q4 revenue expectations, primarily due to CEO Andy Jassy''s announcement of a projected $200 billion capital expenditure in 2026. Analysts like Gene Munster and Daniel Newman support Amazon''s long-term strategy, viewing the increased spending as beneficial for the company and the broader AI market, as Amazon aims to catch up and leverage AI across various business segments.',NULL,'Yahoo Finance','General','Yahoo Finance','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.918501"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.803597"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.723603"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.609169"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.639066"}]',0.110158,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.743156", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.214136"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.707439", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.210441"}, {"ticker": "META", "relevance_score": "0.701730", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.228102"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.634352", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.201185"}]','{"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/jim-cramer-amazon-stock-slip-233145336.html", "title": "Jim Cramer On Amazon Stock Slip: Not Saying Downs