	 (2427,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-07 18:29:17','20260207T182917','Roth Capital Upgraded Energy Fuels Inc. (UUUU) to Neutral from Sell','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/roth-capital-upgraded-energy-fuels-inc-uuuu-to-neutral-from-sell-1689810/?amp=1','Roth Capital upgraded Energy Fuels Inc. (UUUU) to Neutral from Sell, raising its price target to $15.50 from $13.00, citing strong market sentiment and rising uranium prices. Other firms like Canaccord and B. Riley also increased their price targets and maintained Buy ratings for the company, attributing its outperformance to White Mesa’s rare earth refining capabilities and supportive U.S. critical minerals policy. Energy Fuels also exceeded its uranium production and sales guidance for Q4 2025.',NULL,'Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.914889"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.807679"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.727192"}]',0.179555,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "UUUU", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.450858"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.570876", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.125459"}, {"ticker": "TSLA", "relevance_score": "0.562742", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.123952"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.572599", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.103053"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.565634", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.143168"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/roth-capital-upgraded-energy-fuels-inc-uuuu-to-neutral-from-sell-1689810/?amp=1", "title": "Roth Capital Upgraded Energy Fuels Inc. (UUUU) to Neutral from Sell", "source": "Insider Monkey", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.914889"}, {"topic": "energy_tran