	 (2430,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-07 15:28:19','20260207T152819','Aterian recalls PurSteam Elite Travel Steamers and Mighty Lil Steamers due to risk of serious burn injury','https://myparistexas.com/aterian-recalls-pursteam-elite-travel-steamers-and-mighty-lil-steamers-due-to-risk-of-serious-burn-injury/','Aterian has recalled approximately 75,400 PurSteam Elite Travel Steamers and 119,000 PurSteam Mighty Lil Steamers due to a significant burn hazard. The steamers can expel hot water, with 80 reports of injury from the Elite Travel Steamer (14 burns) and 392 from the Mighty Lil Steamer (40 burns, two second-degree). Consumers are advised to immediately stop using the products and visit recall.pursteam.com for a refund after cutting the power cord and providing photographic evidence.','https://myparistexas.com/wp-content/themes/soledad/images/penci-holder.png','MyParisTexas','General','MyParisTexas','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.912017"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.720050"}]',-0.360789,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "ATER", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.620300"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.627159", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.146972"}]','{"url": "https://myparistexas.com/aterian-recalls-pursteam-elite-travel-steamers-and-mighty-lil-steamers-due-to-risk-of-serious-burn-injury/", "title": "Aterian recalls PurSteam Elite Travel Steamers and Mighty Lil Steamers due to risk of serious burn injury", "source": "MyParisTexas", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.912017"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.720050"}], "authors": ["Trey Wright"], "summary": "Aterian has recalled approximately 75,400 PurSteam Elite Travel Steamers and 119,000 PurSteam Mighty Lil Steamers due to a significant burn hazard. The steamers can expel hot water, with 80 reports of injury from 