	 (2435,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-07 12:55:00','20260207T125500','Morgan Stanley Downgrades Himax Tech (HIMX) from Overweight to Equal Weight','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/morgan-stanley-downgrades-himax-tech-himx-from-overweight-to-equal-weight-1690462/?amp=1','Morgan Stanley downgraded Himax Technologies Inc. (HIMX) from Overweight to Equal Weight with an $8 price target, citing weakened demand in computer, smartphone, and automotive sectors, gross margin pressure, and rising memory costs. This decision follows a recent collaboration between Himax and Vuzix Corp. to introduce a new optical component reference design for AR glasses at CES 2026. Himax is a fabless semiconductor company operating globally in Driver IC and Non-Driver Products segments.',NULL,'Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.942871"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.815009"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.742792"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.634310"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.630945"}]',0.092758,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "HIMX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.250117"}, {"ticker": "MS", "relevance_score": "0.746505", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.344443"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.620008", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.345246"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.620799", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.308475"}, {"ticker": "TSLA", "relevance_score": "0.629610", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.341763"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/morgan-stanley-downgrades-himax-tech-himx-from-overweight-to-equal-weight-1690462/?amp=1", "title": "Morgan Stanley Downgrades Himax Tech (