	 (2446,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-07 22:27:23','20260207T222723','Amgen stock price hits 52-week high after Friday rally — what to watch into Monday','https://ts2.tech/en/amgen-stock-price-hits-52-week-high-after-friday-rally-what-to-watch-into-monday/','Amgen''s stock reached a new 52-week high after a 4.5% rally on Friday, closing at $384.32. This surge comes despite CVS Caremark''s decision to remove Amgen''s Prolia from preferred drug lists starting April 1, favoring biosimilars. Investors are now watching upcoming inflation figures, U.S. drug-pricing developments, and the progress of Amgen''s experimental obesity drug, MariTide.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/amgen-stock-price-hits-52-week-high-after-friday-rally-what-to-watch-into-monday-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.831446"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.846521"}]',-0.144004,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMGN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.136785"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.731121", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.304037"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/amgen-stock-price-hits-52-week-high-after-friday-rally-what-to-watch-into-monday/", "title": "Amgen stock price hits 52-week high after Friday rally — what to watch into Monday", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.831446"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.846521"}], "authors": ["Khadija Saeed"], "summary": "Amgen''s stock reached a new 52-week high after a 4.5% rally on Friday, closing at $384.32. This surge comes despite CVS