	 (2488,'alpha_vantage','KMB','KMB','2026-02-08 11:20:37','20260208T112037','Canada Post Corp Registered Pension Plan Acquires 20,436 Shares of Kimberly-Clark Corporation $KMB','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-canada-post-corp-registered-pension-plan-acquires-20436-shares-of-kimberly-clark-corporation-kmb-2026-02-08/','Canada Post Corp Registered Pension Plan significantly increased its stake in Kimberly-Clark Corporation (KMB) by 401.1% in Q3, purchasing an additional 20,436 shares to hold a total of 25,531 shares valued at $3.13 million. Kimberly-Clark recently raised its quarterly dividend to $1.28 per share, resulting in an annualized dividend of $5.12 and a yield of approximately 4.9%. The company reported Q3 EPS of $1.86, surpassing estimates, though revenue was slightly down year-over-year, and analysts maintain a "Hold" rating with an average price target of $118.58.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/kimberly-clark-co-logo-1200x675.jpg?v=20221024144613','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.919582"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.809683"}]',0.127414,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KMB", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.139240"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-canada-post-corp-registered-pension-plan-acquires-20436-shares-of-kimberly-clark-corporation-kmb-2026-02-08/", "title": "Canada Post Corp Registered Pension Plan Acquires 20,436 Shares of Kimberly-Clark Corporation $KMB", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.919582"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.809683"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Canada Post Corp Registered Pension Plan significantly increased its stake in Kimberly-Clark Corporation (KMB) by 401.1% in Q3, purchasing an additional 20,436 shares to hold a total of 25,531 shares valued at $3.13 million. Kimbe