	 (2490,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-08 10:03:26','20260208T100326','What to Expect in Markets This Week: Delayed January Jobs Report, Inflation and Retail Sales Data, Earnings From Cisco, Coca-Cola, McDonald’s, Ford','https://www.investopedia.com/what-to-expect-in-markets-this-week-delayed-january-jobs-report-inflation-and-retail-sales-data-earnings-from-cisco-coca-cola-mcdonald-s-ford-11900448','Market watchers are anticipating a week packed with crucial economic data and corporate earnings. Key releases include the delayed January jobs report, consumer inflation data, and December retail sales figures, all of which were postponed due to recent government shutdowns. Major companies like Cisco, Coca-Cola, McDonald’s, and Ford are also scheduled to announce their latest financial results, providing insights into various sectors including technology, consumer goods, and automotive.','https://www.investopedia.com/thmb/qp5JSKAnt-nOWSZtIZ4jwVBej3c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc():format(webp)/CocaColaHQ_GettyImages-1242106137-d5f6e11586fc487b84588de394f522a8.jpg','Investopedia','General','Investopedia','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.906652"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.901897"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.840065"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.710834"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.622996"}]',0.019578,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.334566", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.044139"}]','{"url": "https://www.investopedia.com/what-to-expect-in-markets-this-week-delayed-january-jobs-report-inflation-and-retail-sales-data-earnings-from-cisco-coca-cola-mcdonald-s-ford-11900448", "title": "What to Expect in Markets This Week: Delayed January Jobs Report, Inflation and Retail Sales Data, Earnings From Cisco, Coca-Cola, McDonald’s, Ford", "source": "Investopedia", "topics": [{"topic": "financial