	 (2493,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-07 21:25:54','20260207T212554','McDonald’s stock nears a 52-week high heading into earnings week: what to watch next','https://ts2.tech/en/mcdonalds-stock-nears-a-52-week-high-heading-into-earnings-week-what-to-watch-next/','McDonald''s stock (MCD) closed near its 52-week high, making its upcoming earnings report critical as there is little room for error in guidance. Analysts are anticipating $3.04 earnings per share for the fourth quarter, but valuation concerns have led to cautious analyst ratings despite price target increases. Investors will also be watching the U.S. January consumer price index and McDonald''s comparable sales, traffic, and pricing strategies for indications of future performance.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/mcdonalds-stock-nears-a-52-week-high-heading-into-earnings-week-what-to-watch-next-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.900168"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.909478"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.711629"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.628435"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.614155"}]',0.203358,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "MCD", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.121050"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.622202", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.198542"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.627099", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.275665"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/mcdonalds-stock-nears-a-52-week-high-heading-into-earnings-week-what-to-watch-next/", "title": "McDonald’s stock nears a 52-week high heading into earnings week: what to watch next", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.900168"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relev