	 (2525,'alpha_vantage','TJX','TJX','2026-02-07 13:29:16','20260207T132916','Is It Smart To Buy The TJX Companies, Inc. (NYSE:TJX) Before It Goes Ex-Dividend?','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/retail/nyse-tjx/tjx-companies/news/is-it-smart-to-buy-the-tjx-companies-inc-nysetjx-before-it-g','The TJX Companies, Inc. (NYSE:TJX) is expected to go ex-dividend in the next four days, with a payment of US$0.425 per share. The company''s dividend is well-covered by both its profits (36% payout ratio) and free cash flow (41% payout ratio), indicating sustainability. With earnings per share growing at 11% annually and a historical dividend growth of 15% per year, TJX appears to be an attractive option for dividend-focused investors.','https://simplywall.st/news/images/blue-bear.svg','Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.917562"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.811916"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.713844"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.625143"}]',0.311727,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "TJX", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.346259"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/retail/nyse-tjx/tjx-companies/news/is-it-smart-to-buy-the-tjx-companies-inc-nysetjx-before-it-g", "title": "Is It Smart To Buy The TJX Companies, Inc. (NYSE:TJX) Before It Goes Ex-Dividend?", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.917562"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.811916"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.713844"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.625143"}], "authors": ["Simply Wall St"], "summary": "The TJX Companies, Inc. (NYSE:TJX) is expected to go ex-dividend in the next four days, with a payment of US$0.425 per share. The company''s dividend is well-covered by both its profits (36% payout ratio) and free