	 (2533,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-09 12:07:57','20260209T120757','AMD Rally Raises 2026 Expectations as Chip Demand Strengthens','https://eand.co/amd-rally-raises-2026-expectations-as-chip-demand-strengthens','Advanced Micro Devices (AMD) is at a critical "inflection point" following a significant stock surge, driven by factors like limited server CPU supply, China sales approval, and demand for its MI325X AI accelerators. The company''s 2026 outlook is highly dependent on its MI400 Series & Helios AI accelerators, which are expected to compete with Nvidia, with some experts suggesting AMD could achieve a trillion-dollar valuation if it executes well on AI and data center growth. Investors are currently focused on the sustainability of AI demand and AMD''s ability to capitalize on the AI chip market.','https://eand.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/AMD-Rally-Raises-2026-Expectations-as-Chip-Demand-Strengthens.webp','Eudaimonia and Co','General','Eudaimonia and Co','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.914132"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.807411"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.702089"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.603290"}]',0.243937,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMD", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.472388"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.740740", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.257445"}, {"ticker": "QCOM", "relevance_score": "0.558017", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.128033"}, {"ticker": "TSLA", "relevance_score": "0.586591", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.108538"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.591879", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.108494"}]','{"url": "https://eand.co/amd-rally-raises-2026-expectations-as-chip-demand-strengthens", "title": "AMD Rall