	 (2534,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-09 10:37:47','20260209T103747','RBC Maintains Outperform on Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) Feb 2026','https://meyka.com/blog/rbc-maintains-outperform-on-amazoncom-inc-amzn-feb-2026-0902/','RBC Capital has reaffirmed its Outperform rating for Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) on February 6, 2026, citing strong AWS performance and resilient retail trends, without changing its price target. This decision comes amidst varied analyst opinions, with Wells Fargo setting a $305 target and DA Davidson lowering its target to $175 on the same date. Investors are advised to use analyst ratings as one input, balancing them with fundamentals like AWS growth metrics and capex guidance, especially given Amazon''s substantial market capitalization.',NULL,'Meyka','General','Meyka','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.932291"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.833316"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.702883"}]',0.202964,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.991196", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.262238"}, {"ticker": "WFC", "relevance_score": "0.634708", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.209288"}, {"ticker": "JPM", "relevance_score": "0.581327", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.070203"}]','{"url": "https://meyka.com/blog/rbc-maintains-outperform-on-amazoncom-inc-amzn-feb-2026-0902/", "title": "RBC Maintains Outperform on Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) Feb 2026", "source": "Meyka", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.932291"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.833316"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.702883"}], "authors": ["Danny Kontos"], "summary": "RBC Capital has reaffirmed its Outperform rating for Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN) on February 6, 2026, citing strong AWS performance and resilient retail trends, without