	 (2538,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-09 02:28:14','20260209T022814','CMSI Chops Amazon.com(AMZN.US) TP to US$283, Rating Overweight','https://www.aastocks.com/en/usq/news/comment.aspx?source=AAFN&id=NOW.1501926&catg=1','CMSI has lowered its target price for Amazon.com (AMZN.US) to US$283 from US$301, while maintaining an "Overweight" rating. This decision follows Amazon''s strong 4Q25 results, characterized by stable e-commerce, rapid advertising growth, and accelerated AWS growth. CMSI views the shift in sentiment towards AI capital expenditure as a good entry opportunity, citing Amazon''s comprehensive tech stack and collaboration with Anthropic as competitive advantages.','https://plib.aastocks.com/aafnnews/image/medialib/20241003093231035_l.jpg','AASTOCKS.com','General','AASTOCKS.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.935183"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.848767"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.717497"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.604463"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.640760"}]',0.275386,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.295115"}]','{"url": "https://www.aastocks.com/en/usq/news/comment.aspx?source=AAFN&id=NOW.1501926&catg=1", "title": "CMSI Chops Amazon.com(AMZN.US) TP to US$283, Rating Overweight", "source": "AASTOCKS.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.935183"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.848767"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.717497"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.604463"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.640760"}], "authors": [], "summary": "CMSI has lowered its target price for Amazon.com (AMZN.US) to US$283 from US$301, while maintaining an \\"Overweight\\" rating. This decision follows Amazon''s strong 4Q25 results, characterized by stable e-co