	 (2545,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-08 15:29:58','20260208T152958','ASML stock price jumps into weekend as chip rally returns — here’s what matters next week','https://ts2.tech/en/asml-stock-price-jumps-into-weekend-as-chip-rally-returns-heres-what-matters-next-week/','ASML''s U.S. shares gained 4.6% on Friday, closing at $1,413.01, as chip stocks rallied due to renewed investor interest in AI, spurred by new capital expenditure hints from major tech companies. The article highlights ASML''s ex-dividend dates in Europe and the U.S. next week, alongside upcoming critical U.S. economic data releases like nonfarm payrolls and CPI, which could influence market sentiment. Despite the rally, experts caution about the "AI build-out trade" becoming too pricey and the potential for volatility, especially with ASML''s vulnerability to changes in export regulations and customer demand shifts.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/asml-stock-price-jumps-into-weekend-as-chip-rally-returns-heres-what-matters-next-week-featured.jpg.webp','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.933758"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.838337"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.736794"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.616111"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.639476"}]',0.236718,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "ASML", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.435186"}, {"ticker": "AMAT", "relevance_score": "0.621544", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.299048"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.584808", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.223064"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.606115", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.342855"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/asml-stock-price