	 (2546,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-08 15:28:20','20260208T152820','Costco stock price closes above $1,000 — what investors watch next for COST','https://ts2.tech/en/costco-stock-price-closes-above-1000-what-investors-watch-next-for-cost/','Costco Wholesale''s stock closed above $1,000 for the first time on Friday, gaining 1.2% to $1,001.16. Investors are now looking ahead to the company''s fiscal Q2 earnings report and February sales numbers on March 5. Despite broader market gains, with the Dow and S&P 500 seeing significant jumps, Costco''s robust membership model and strong January sales performance (net sales up 9.3% to $21.33 billion) position it well, though market watchers will closely scrutinize upcoming reports for any signs of consumer spending shifts or potential hazards to its growth narrative.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/costco-stock-price-closes-above-1000-what-investors-watch-next-for-cost-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.927292"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.847210"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.726470"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.938516"}]',0.075296,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.254007"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.705363", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.127643"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.654564", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.142169"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.617967", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.335283"}, {"ticker": "NDAQ", "relevance_score": "0.609059", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.086804"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/costco-stock-price-closes-above-1000-what-investors-watch-next