	 (2548,'alpha_vantage','BABA','BABA','2026-02-08 16:59:15','20260208T165915','Alibaba stock ends skid after Friday jump as Qwen giveaway hits glitches and earnings near','https://ts2.tech/en/alibaba-stock-ends-skid-after-friday-jump-as-qwen-giveaway-hits-glitches-and-earnings-near/','Alibaba''s U.S.-listed shares climbed roughly 3% on Friday, recovering after a volatile period, partly due to investor re-entry into tech stocks. The company''s AI ambitions gained attention as its Qwen app experienced a surge in users following a 3 billion yuan Lunar New Year giveaway, briefly knocking the app offline and facing restrictions on WeChat for sharing campaign links. Despite these glitches and privacy concerns, Qwen rapidly rose in the App Store, and Alibaba is now looking ahead to its quarterly earnings release on February 19th, with investors particularly interested in the sustained momentum of the Qwen rollout and spending patterns.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/alibaba-stock-ends-skid-after-friday-jump-as-qwen-giveaway-hits-glitches-and-earnings-near-featured.jpg.webp','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.919015"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.904868"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.825362"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.614475"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.622877"}]',0.186791,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "BABA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.287625"}, {"ticker": "AAPL", "relevance_score": "0.631240", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.105867"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/alibaba-stock-ends-skid-after-friday-jump-as-qwen-giveaway-hits-glitches-and-earnings-near/", "title": "Alibaba stock ends skid after Friday jump as Qwen giveaway hits glitches and earnings near", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "ear