	 (2566,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-08 14:38:19','20260208T143819','Costco Wholesale Corp: Steady Climber Or Overloved Retail Fortress?','https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/ueberblick/costco-wholesale-corp-steady-climber-or-overloved-retail-fortress/68564040','Costco Wholesale Corp has reached new highs, sparking debate among investors and Wall Street analysts about its future growth potential. While some view its consistent performance, strong membership loyalty, and disciplined execution as indicators of continued upside, others warn its current valuation may already price in perfection. The company''s resilience amidst economic uncertainties, driven by robust renewal rates and consistent sales growth, remains a key factor in its strong market position, with a potential membership fee increase acting as a future catalyst.','https://mdb.ad-hoc-news.de/img/artikel/1708834_1920_new-york-stock-exchange-1708834_1920.jpg','AD HOC NEWS','General','AD HOC NEWS','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.946361"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.835840"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.709808"}]',0.419082,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.425880"}]','{"url": "https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/ueberblick/costco-wholesale-corp-steady-climber-or-overloved-retail-fortress/68564040", "title": "Costco Wholesale Corp: Steady Climber Or Overloved Retail Fortress?", "source": "AD HOC NEWS", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.946361"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.835840"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.709808"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Costco Wholesale Corp has reached new highs, sparking debate among investors and Wall Street analysts about