	 (2570,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-09 08:40:19','20260209T084019','Candriam S.C.A. Cuts Holdings in Amgen Inc. $AMGN','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-candriam-sca-cuts-holdings-in-amgen-inc-amgn-2026-02-09/','Candriam S.C.A. reduced its stake in Amgen Inc. by 12.0% in the third quarter, selling 60,500 shares, though Amgen remains its 27th largest holding. Despite this reduction and recent insider selling, Amgen reported strong Q4 earnings, surpassing expectations, and increased its quarterly dividend to $2.52. The company also issued optimistic FY2026 guidance, which has contributed to analyst upgrades and a stock rally, though potential headwinds exist from CVS replacing some of Amgen''s bone-disease drugs with cheaper alternatives.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/amgen-inc-logo-1200x675.jpg?v=20231228113741','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.941253"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.850000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.832190"}]',0.089625,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMGN", "relevance_score": "0.965218", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.074476"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.702089", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.138045"}, {"ticker": "LLY", "relevance_score": "0.567330", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.119904"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-candriam-sca-cuts-holdings-in-amgen-inc-amgn-2026-02-09/", "title": "Candriam S.C.A. Cuts Holdings in Amgen Inc. $AMGN", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.941253"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.850000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.832190"}], "authors": ["MarketBeat"], "summary": "Candriam S.C.A. reduced its stake in Amgen Inc. by 12.0% in the third quarter, selling 60,500 shares, t