	 (2577,'alpha_vantage','GLDG','GLDG','2026-02-08 19:58:54','20260208T195854','U.S. GoldMining Nears a Defining Juncture with Key Catalysts Approaching','https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/ueberblick/u-s-goldmining-nears-a-defining-juncture-with-key-catalysts-approaching/68564687','U.S. GoldMining Inc. is approaching a critical period with the anticipated release of a Preliminary Economic Assessment (PEA) for its Whistler project by Q1 2026, which will detail its economic viability. Concurrently, the company plans an extensive diamond core drilling campaign in summer 2026 to explore new gold-copper targets and expand its resource base, building on a recently enhanced resource estimate of over 10 million gold equivalent ounces. These developments coincide with favorable market conditions in the gold mining sector, positioning the company for potential significant growth and investor interest.','https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/img/logos/logo_264x69.jpg','AD HOC NEWS','General','AD HOC NEWS','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.900490"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.822987"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.648999"}]',0.487583,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "GLDG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.475892"}]','{"url": "https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/ueberblick/u-s-goldmining-nears-a-defining-juncture-with-key-catalysts-approaching/68564687", "title": "U.S. GoldMining Nears a Defining Juncture with Key Catalysts Approaching", "source": "AD HOC NEWS", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.900490"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.822987"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.648999"}], "authors": [], "summary": "U.S. GoldMining Inc. is approaching a critical period with the anticipated release of a Preliminary Economic Assessment (PEA) for its Whistler project by Q1 2026, which will detail its economic viability. Concurr