	 (2587,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-08 19:41:43','20260208T194143','Coca-Cola signs new football partnership with Irish FA and NIFL','https://www.azernews.az/region/254127.html','The Coca-Cola Company and its bottling partner, Coca-Cola HBC Ireland and Northern Ireland, have signed a new soft drinks partnership with the Irish Football Association (Irish FA) and the Northern Ireland Football League (NIFL). This partnership aims to support and promote national and domestic football teams across Northern Ireland through various activations, including providing drinks on match days, branding, social media campaigns, and exclusive fan access to events. The agreement highlights Coca-Cola''s ongoing commitment to grassroots football and community investment.','https://www.azernews.az/media/2026/02/08/b25ly21zomy4ogmznzu2lwi1mmytngrhyy1hoddlltrknjmxytc1mzyxmto5mji4mzc0ys02yjaxltrmzwetytrjyy1kzmiwzduzymq1yzk.jpg','AzerNews','General','AzerNews','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.825553"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.649568"}]',0.422164,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.437415"}]','{"url": "https://www.azernews.az/region/254127.html", "title": "Coca-Cola signs new football partnership with Irish FA and NIFL", "source": "AzerNews", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.825553"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.649568"}], "authors": ["Alemat Aliyeva"], "summary": "The Coca-Cola Company and its bottling partner, Coca-Cola HBC Ireland and Northern Ireland, have signed a new soft drinks partnership with the Irish Football Association (Irish FA) and the Northern Ireland Football League (NIFL). This partnership aims to support and promote national and domestic football teams across Northern Ireland through various activations, including providing drinks on match days, branding, social media campaigns, and exclusive f