	 (2598,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-09 10:59:39','20260209T105939','Stock Market Today: Dow Jones Futures Drop After Friday''s Record Close—STMicroelectronics, Kroger, FedEx In Focus','https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/02/50473679/stock-market-today-dow-jones-futures-drop-after-fridays-record-close-stmicroelectronics-kroger-fedex-in-focus','U.S. stock futures, including Dow Jones, S&P 500, and Nasdaq 100, are down on Monday despite a strong close in Asian markets and the Nikkei 225 breaking 57,000 points. The market awaits key economic data this week, including CPI and jobless claims, and earnings reports from major companies like Coca-Cola, McDonald''s, and T-Mobile. Analysts attribute Friday''s rally to cooling inflation and corporate strength, with expectations for Federal Reserve rate cuts later in the year.','https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/02/09/Close-Up-Of-Wall-Street-Sign-With-Iconic.jpeg?quality=85&auto=webp&width=850','Benzinga','General','Benzinga','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.824450"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.844797"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.729882"}]',0.168249,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "FDX", "relevance_score": "0.949781", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.306920"}, {"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "0.849555", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.431788"}, {"ticker": "ON", "relevance_score": "0.774191", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.207558"}]','{"url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/02/50473679/stock-market-today-dow-jones-futures-drop-after-fridays-record-close-stmicroelectronics-kroger-fedex-in-focus", "title": "Stock Market Today: Dow Jones Futures Drop After Friday''s Record Close—STMicroelectronics, Kroger, FedEx In Focus", "source": "Benzinga",