	 (2600,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-09 09:58:33','20260209T095833','Kroger Plans to Appoint Ex-Walmart Executive Foran as CEO','https://finance.yahoo.com/news/kroger-plans-appoint-ex-walmart-092418330.html','Kroger Co. is expected to name former Walmart executive Greg Foran as its new chief executive, following the unexpected departure of its previous CEO and a failed merger attempt. Foran, known for his turnaround work at Walmart''s U.S. business and most recently CEO of Air New Zealand, would be the first external CEO for the nation''s largest grocer. The appointment comes as Kroger navigates a competitive market and looks to establish a new strategic direction.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/e186VchLmf_eF1SGWRQMeg--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTk2MDtoPTY0MA--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/bloomberg_holding_pen_162/ae48b24320b99198231e234b00f93f32','Yahoo Finance','General','Yahoo Finance','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.940271"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.841366"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.737733"}]',0.216094,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.835749", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.101461"}, {"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.317589"}]','{"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/kroger-plans-appoint-ex-walmart-092418330.html", "title": "Kroger Plans to Appoint Ex-Walmart Executive Foran as CEO", "source": "Yahoo Finance", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.940271"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.841366"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.737733"}], "authors": ["María Paula Mijares Torres", "Jaewon Kang"], "summary": "Kroger Co. is expected to name former Walmart executive Greg Foran as its new chief executive, following the unexpected departure of its previous CEO and a fa