	 (2603,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-09 01:18:00','20260209T011800','Kroger Stock Jumps Overnight As Buzz Of New CEO Takes Hold','https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/equity/kroger-stock-jumps-overnight-as-buzz-of-new-ceo-takes-hold/cZbHYAER48S','Kroger''s stock jumped nearly 3% overnight following reports that former Walmart executive Greg Foran is expected to be named its next CEO. Foran is credited with turning around Walmart''s U.S. business, and his potential appointment comes after Kroger''s previous CEO resigned amidst a board investigation and the termination of a $25 billion merger with Albertsons. The news has sent Kroger''s shares higher, continuing a positive performance trend for the company this year.','https://news.stocktwits-cdn.com/large_kroger_resized_jpg_df58ccdaf5.webp','Stocktwits','General','Stocktwits','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.901568"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.805143"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.705722"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.606178"}]',0.297117,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.312901"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.711055", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.237946"}]','{"url": "https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/equity/kroger-stock-jumps-overnight-as-buzz-of-new-ceo-takes-hold/cZbHYAER48S", "title": "Kroger Stock Jumps Overnight As Buzz Of New CEO Takes Hold", "source": "Stocktwits", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.901568"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.805143"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.705722"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.606178"}], "authors": ["Ananya Mariam Rajesh"], "summary": "Kroger''s stock jumped nearly 3% overnight following reports 