	 (2622,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-08 13:39:30','20260208T133930','We Wouldn''t Be Too Quick To Buy The Kroger Co. (NYSE:KR) Before It Goes Ex-Dividend','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/consumer-retailing/nyse-kr/kroger/news/we-wouldnt-be-too-quick-to-buy-the-kroger-co-nysekr-before-i','Kroger (NYSE:KR) is approaching its ex-dividend date, with a dividend payment of US$0.35 per share. While the company''s dividend is well-covered by free cash flow at 39%, its payout ratio from profits is unsustainably high at 115%. Furthermore, Kroger''s earnings per share have declined by 9.7% annually over the last five years, raising concerns about the long-term sustainability of its dividend growth despite a 14% annual increase over the past decade.',NULL,'Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.944665"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.817045"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.743430"}]',-0.220191,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "0.946572", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.246938"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/consumer-retailing/nyse-kr/kroger/news/we-wouldnt-be-too-quick-to-buy-the-kroger-co-nysekr-before-i", "title": "We Wouldn''t Be Too Quick To Buy The Kroger Co. (NYSE:KR) Before It Goes Ex-Dividend", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.944665"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.817045"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.743430"}], "authors": ["Simply Wall St"], "summary": "Kroger (NYSE:KR) is approaching its ex-dividend date, with a dividend payment of US$0.35 per share. While the company''s dividend is well-covered by free cash flow at 39%, its payout ratio from profits is unsustainably high at 115%. Furthermore, Kroger''s earnings per share have declined by 9.7% annually over the last five years, 