	 (2625,'alpha_vantage','LULU','LULU','2026-02-09 08:15:40','20260209T081540','Diamond Hill Capital Management Inc. Trims Holdings in lululemon athletica inc. $LULU','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-diamond-hill-capital-management-inc-trims-holdings-in-lululemon-athletica-inc-lulu-2026-02-09/','Diamond Hill Capital Management Inc. significantly reduced its stake in lululemon athletica inc. (NASDAQ:LULU) by 92.5% in the third quarter, selling over a million shares and retaining 89,940 shares. This divestment contrasts with several other large institutions like Norges Bank, Pacer Advisors Inc., Geode Capital Management LLC, Invesco Ltd., and Flossbach Von Storch SE, which all substantially increased their holdings in LULU, bringing institutional ownership to about 85.20%. lululemon also reported strong Q3 earnings, beating estimates with EPS of $2.59 and revenue of $2.57 billion, and provided positive FY2025 EPS guidance.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/lululemon-logo-1200x675.jpg','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932860"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.843703"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.711229"}]',0.16992,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "LULU", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.129705"}, {"ticker": "AMD", "relevance_score": "0.555808", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.238681"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-diamond-hill-capital-management-inc-trims-holdings-in-lululemon-athletica-inc-lulu-2026-02-09/", "title": "Diamond Hill Capital Management Inc. Trims Holdings in lululemon athletica inc. $LULU", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932860"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.843703"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.711229"}], "authors