	 (2627,'alpha_vantage','LULU','LULU','2026-02-08 20:41:47','20260208T204147','Lululemon Stock 2026 Outlook: What the Number Say After a 60% Decline Last Year','https://www.tikr.com/blog/lululemon-stock-2026-outlook-what-the-number-say-after-a-60-decline-last-year','Lululemon is undergoing a leadership transition and operational shifts to reset accountability and target a product inflection in 2026. Despite a 60% decline in the stock last year, a valuation model suggests a potential 24% upside over two years (12% annualized return) to $215 by January 2028, based on conservative assumptions of 5% revenue growth, 18% operating margins, and a 14x exit P/E. The company''s future performance hinges on successful product refreshes, disciplined pricing, and stabilization of U.S. demand.','https://res.cloudinary.com/tikr/images/f_auto,q_auto,w_800/v1770574260/images/FEATURED-IMAGE-MAKER-186/FEATURED-IMAGE-MAKER-186','TIKR.com','General','TIKR.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.902043"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.815454"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.605127"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.811580"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.738681"}]',0.257956,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "LULU", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.277043"}]','{"url": "https://www.tikr.com/blog/lululemon-stock-2026-outlook-what-the-number-say-after-a-60-decline-last-year", "title": "Lululemon Stock 2026 Outlook: What the Number Say After a 60% Decline Last Year", "source": "TIKR.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.902043"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.815454"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.605127"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.811580"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.738681"}], "authors": ["Gian Estrada"], "summary": "Lululemon is