	 (2628,'alpha_vantage','LULU','LULU','2026-02-08 20:29:41','20260208T202941','Qualys Plunged 13% Despite Growth: Can the Stock Bounce Back to $150 in 2026?','https://www.tikr.com/blog/qualys-plunged-13-despite-growth-can-the-stock-bounce-back-to-150-in-2026','Shares of Qualys (QLYS) recently tumbled 13.3% despite strong quarterly results, due to investor concerns over future EBITDA margin guidance. Although management clarified this as a strategic investment in sales and marketing for long-term growth, the stock is currently seen as undervalued by TIKR''s Advanced Valuation Model and analysts, presenting a potential entry point for investors with a target price of $149. The company''s profitability and consistent revenue growth suggest a possible rebound to the $150 mark in 2026 if strategic investments yield fruit.','https://res.cloudinary.com/tikr/images/f_auto,q_auto,w_800/v1770526375/images/4-4_91570eb8ea/4-4_91570eb8ea','TIKR.com','General','TIKR.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.916774"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.827004"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.717348"}]',0.292318,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "QLYS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.438894"}, {"ticker": "LULU", "relevance_score": "0.602519", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.148589"}]','{"url": "https://www.tikr.com/blog/qualys-plunged-13-despite-growth-can-the-stock-bounce-back-to-150-in-2026", "title": "Qualys Plunged 13% Despite Growth: Can the Stock Bounce Back to $150 in 2026?", "source": "TIKR.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.916774"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.827004"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.717348"}], "authors": ["Wiltone Asuncion"], "summary": "Shares of Qualys (QLYS) recently tumbled 13.3% despite strong quarterly results, due to investor concerns over futu