	 (2631,'alpha_vantage','MDLZ','MDLZ','2026-02-09 00:59:16','20260209T005916','Better Consumer Staples ETF: Vanguard''s VDC vs. First Trust''s FTXG','https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/MDLZ/pressreleases/97872/better-consumer-staples-etf-vanguards-vdc-vs-first-trusts-ftxg/','This article compares two consumer staples ETFs, Vanguard''s VDC and First Trust''s FTXG, highlighting their costs, performance, and holdings. VDC offers broader diversification, a lower expense ratio, and better historical growth, making it generally preferable for broad consumer staples exposure. FTXG, while having a slightly higher dividend yield, focuses specifically on food and beverage stocks with a higher expense ratio and less diversification.','https://barchart-news-media-prod.aws.barchart.com/FC/5410549fab5e290fcd7f1a0a78413c0b/pixel%3Fslug%3Dmotleyfoolgm-2026-2-8-better-consumer-staples-etf-vanguards-vdc-vs-first-trusts-ftxg','The Globe and Mail','General','The Globe and Mail','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.932356"}]',0.258012,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "FTXG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.100253"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.746285", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.334834"}, {"ticker": "ADM", "relevance_score": "0.615181", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.343369"}, {"ticker": "MDLZ", "relevance_score": "0.602764", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.339537"}]','{"url": "https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/MDLZ/pressreleases/97872/better-consumer-staples-etf-vanguards-vdc-vs-first-trusts-ftxg/", "title": "Better Consumer Staples ETF: Vanguard''s VDC vs. First Trust''s FTXG", "source": "The Globe and Mail", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.932356"}], "authors": ["Motley Fool"], "summ