	 (2649,'alpha_vantage','PG','PG','2026-02-08 17:57:32','20260208T175732','Olympic partner P&G offer athletes a makeover at Milano Cortina 2026: "Look good, feel good"','https://www.olympics.com/en/milano-cortina-2026/news/olympic-partner-pg-athletes-makeover-milano-cortina-2026-look-good-feel-good/','Procter & Gamble, a Worldwide Olympic and Paralympic partner, is providing self-care and grooming services to athletes at the Olympic Villages for Milano Cortina 2026 through its P&G Champions Clubhouse. This initiative offers bespoke experiences like hair care and welcome kits, aiming to boost athletes'' confidence and well-being between training and competitions. Athletes like Rose Laliberté-Roy, Josie Hofmann, and Tomàs-Llorenç Guarino Sabaté have expressed enthusiasm for these services, highlighting the importance of feeling good to perform well.','https://img.olympics.com/images/image/private/t_s_16_9_g_auto/t_s_w960/f_auto/primary/xishjo56smaulwrwga72','Milano Cortina 2026','General','Milano Cortina 2026','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.606573"}]',0.817651,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.829092"}]','{"url": "https://www.olympics.com/en/milano-cortina-2026/news/olympic-partner-pg-athletes-makeover-milano-cortina-2026-look-good-feel-good/", "title": "Olympic partner P&G offer athletes a makeover at Milano Cortina 2026: \\"Look good, feel good\\"", "source": "Milano Cortina 2026", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.606573"}], "authors": ["Olympics.com"], "summary": "Procter & Gamble, a Worldwide Olympic and Paralympic partner, is providing self-care and grooming services to athletes at the Olympic Villages for Milano Cortina 2026 through its P&G Champions Clubhouse. This initiative offers bespoke experiences like hair care and welcome kits, aiming to boost athletes'' confidence and well-being between training and competition