	 (2650,'alpha_vantage','ROST','ROST','2026-02-09 03:03:30','20260209T030330','Boys & Girls Clubs of America Holding 12th Annual ‘Help Local Kids Succeed in School’ Fundraiser February 7-March 1','https://kymkemp.com/2026/02/08/boys-girls-clubs-of-america-holding-12th-annual-help-local-kids-succeed-in-school-fundraiser-february-7-march-1/','Boys & Girls Clubs of America, in partnership with Ross Stores, Inc., is holding its 12th annual "Help Local Kids Succeed in School" fundraiser from February 7 to March 1. Customers can donate at Ross Dress for Less stores in Eureka, with all proceeds benefiting the Power Hour program at Boys & Girls Club of the Redwoods, which provides homework help and tutoring. The Ross Stores Foundation will match donations up to $500,000, underscoring their commitment to youth development and academic success.','https://kymkemp.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Thank-You-Ross-900x900.png','Redheaded Blackbelt','General','Redheaded Blackbelt','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.934626"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.747983"}]',0.473874,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ROST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.476425"}]','{"url": "https://kymkemp.com/2026/02/08/boys-girls-clubs-of-america-holding-12th-annual-help-local-kids-succeed-in-school-fundraiser-february-7-march-1/", "title": "Boys & Girls Clubs of America Holding 12th Annual ‘Help Local Kids Succeed in School’ Fundraiser February 7-March 1", "source": "Redheaded Blackbelt", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.934626"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.747983"}], "authors": ["Staff"], "summary": "Boys & Girls Clubs of America, in partnership with Ross Stores, Inc., is holding its 12th annual \\"Help Local Kids Succeed in School\\" fundraiser from February 7 to March 1. Customers can donate at Ross Dress for Less stores in Eureka, with all proceeds benefiting the Power H