	 (2658,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-08 19:05:04','20260208T190504','Best moves for your portfolio: Buy Ulta Beauty, avoid Arista','https://finance.yahoo.com/video/best-moves-portfolio-buy-ulta-110055303.html','Zacks Investment Management''s Brian Mulberry recommends buying Ulta Beauty (ULTA) due to its diverse product line, strong consumer engagement, and effective loyalty program, despite the inherent risks of consumer discretionary spending. Conversely, he advises avoiding Arista Networks (ANET) because of margin erosion from competition, high customer concentration, and ongoing supply chain issues, though acknowledges the potential for growth if these challenges are addressed.','https://s.yimg.com/cv/apiv2/default/20260122/polymarket-logo-white.svg','Yahoo Finance','General','Yahoo Finance','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.912412"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.812013"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.836647"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.739416"}]',0.046145,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.414237"}, {"ticker": "ANET", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.435697"}]','{"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/video/best-moves-portfolio-buy-ulta-110055303.html", "title": "Best moves for your portfolio: Buy Ulta Beauty, avoid Arista", "source": "Yahoo Finance", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.912412"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.812013"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.836647"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.739416"}], "authors": ["Yahoo Finance Video and Josh Lipton"], "summary": "Zacks Investment Management''s Brian Mulberry recommends buying Ulta Beauty (ULTA) due to its diverse product line, strong consumer engagement, and effective loyalty progr