	 (2659,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-08 15:28:24','20260208T152824','Woman Arrested for Suspicion of Ulta Thefts in Irvine','https://mynewsla.com/crime/2026/02/08/woman-arrested-for-suspicion-of-ulta-thefts-in-irvine-2/','A 31-year-old Las Vegas woman, Jasele Alicia Villanueva, was arrested in Corona for allegedly stealing over $2,000 in merchandise from an Ulta beauty store in Irvine. Authorities reported that she is also suspected of committing over $60,000 in thefts from Ulta stores across Nevada and Arizona, and had an active extradition warrant for her arrest. She has been booked into the Orange County Jail on suspicion of grand theft and organized retail theft.','https://i0.wp.com/mynewsla.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/shutterstock_2554106895-scaled.jpg?fit=780%2C520&ssl=1','MyNewsLA.com','General','MyNewsLA.com','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.812614"}]',-0.251447,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.251760"}]','{"url": "https://mynewsla.com/crime/2026/02/08/woman-arrested-for-suspicion-of-ulta-thefts-in-irvine-2/", "title": "Woman Arrested for Suspicion of Ulta Thefts in Irvine", "source": "MyNewsLA.com", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.812614"}], "authors": ["Contributing Editor"], "summary": "A 31-year-old Las Vegas woman, Jasele Alicia Villanueva, was arrested in Corona for allegedly stealing over $2,000 in merchandise from an Ulta beauty store in Irvine. Authorities reported that she is also suspected of committing over $60,000 in thefts from Ulta stores across Nevada and Arizona, and had an active extradition warrant for her arrest. She has been booked into the Orange County Jail on suspicion of grand theft and organized retail theft.", "banner_image": "https://i0.wp.com/mynewsla.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/shutterstock_2554106895-scaled.jpg?fit=780%2C520&ssl=1", "source_domain":