	 (2670,'alpha_vantage','WMT','WMT','2026-02-09 08:38:21','20260209T083821','Oppenheimer & Co. Inc. Trims Stock Holdings in AT&T Inc. $T','https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-oppenheimer-co-inc-trims-stock-holdings-in-att-inc-t-2026-02-09/','Oppenheimer & Co. Inc. has reduced its stake in AT&T Inc. (NYSE:T) by 12.5% during the third quarter, selling over 109,000 shares but still holding over 762,000 shares valued at $21.54 million. Despite the trim by Oppenheimer, institutional investors and hedge funds own 57.10% of AT&T stock, and analysts maintain a "Moderate Buy" rating with a consensus target price of $29.83. AT&T recently reported strong quarterly earnings, beating EPS estimates, and announced a quarterly dividend.','https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/139387-attlogo-1200x675.jpg','MarketBeat','General','MarketBeat','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.924856"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.922872"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.840901"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.717170"}]',0.139309,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "T-P-A", "relevance_score": "0.319867", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.000080"}, {"ticker": "T", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.093085"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.556428", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.093797"}, {"ticker": "TSN", "relevance_score": "0.557346", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.291705"}, {"ticker": "AMD", "relevance_score": "0.554049", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.268848"}]','{"url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-oppenheimer-co-inc-trims-stock-holdings-in-att-inc-t-2026-02-09/", "title": "Oppenheimer & Co. Inc. Trims Stock Holdings in AT&T Inc. $T", "source": "MarketBeat", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relev