	 (2696,'alpha_vantage','AEO','AEO','2026-02-09 18:29:24','20260209T182924','Sydney Sweeney rings stock exchange opening bell alongside American Eagle CEO','https://www.foxbusiness.com/markets/sydney-sweeney-rings-stock-exchange-opening-bell-alongside-american-eagle-ceo','Actress Sydney Sweeney rang the opening bell at the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) with American Eagle Outfitters CEO Jay Schottenstein. This event follows her viral 2025 advertising campaign with American Eagle, which featured the slogan "Sydney Sweeney Has Great Jeans" and generated significant online attention and discussion. Sweeney wore a denim outfit to the NYSE, nodding to the campaign that previously drew some criticism but also sparked sales for the brand.','https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2026/02/931/523/sydney-sweeney-american-eagle.jpg?ve=1&tl=1','Fox Business','General','Fox Business','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.903514"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.812472"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.638397"}]',0.20692,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "AEO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.441948"}, {"ticker": "FOX", "relevance_score": "0.648114", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.126442"}, {"ticker": "FOXA", "relevance_score": "0.639299", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.149378"}]','{"url": "https://www.foxbusiness.com/markets/sydney-sweeney-rings-stock-exchange-opening-bell-alongside-american-eagle-ceo", "title": "Sydney Sweeney rings stock exchange opening bell alongside American Eagle CEO", "source": "Fox Business", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.903514"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.812472"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.638397"}], "authors": ["Ashley Carnahan"], "summary": "Actress Sydn