	 (2697,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-10 14:02:30','20260210T140230','From Track to Tabletop: Mattel Brick Shop™ Debuts the Hot Wheels® Aston Martin Vantage GT3','https://www.bdtonline.com/news/nation_world/from-track-to-tabletop-mattel-brick-shop-debuts-the-hot-wheels-aston-martin-vantage-gt3/article_1a53ffe0-f97f-5c3b-ab51-564a4c2023e5.html','Mattel Brick Shop™ has launched a 793-piece Hot Wheels® Aston Martin Vantage GT3 building set, expanding its licensed automotive portfolio. This 1:16 scale model, inspired by modern GT racing, features real metal parts, customizable decals, and includes an exclusive 1:64 scale die-cast Aston Martin Vantage GT3. The set is available for pre-order at Walmart.com and will be sold at select retailers worldwide for $49.99 starting this summer.','https://bloximages.chicago2.vip.townnews.com/bdtonline.com/content/tncms/assets/v3/editorial/e/d1/ed1f2ad7-fae5-554c-8f3b-46cf573376f4/698b3b8d9e032.image.jpg?resize=400%2C400','Bluefield Daily Telegraph','General','Bluefield Daily Telegraph','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.842464"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.710435"}]',0.298303,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "MAT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.443935"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.605671", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.273701"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.618540", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.275405"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.618216", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.292827"}]','{"url": "https://www.bdtonline.com/news/nation_world/from-track-to-tabletop-mattel-brick-shop-debuts-the-hot-wheels-aston-martin-vantage-gt3/article_1a53ffe0-f97f-5c3b-ab51-564a4c2023e5.html", "title": "From Track to Tabletop: Mattel Brick Shop™ Debuts the Hot Wheels® Ast