	 (2700,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-10 13:32:36','20260210T133236','How 3M AI Tools Accelerate How Ideas Become Products','https://ca.finance.yahoo.com/news/3m-ai-tools-accelerate-ideas-133000036.html','3M has introduced new AI-powered digital tools, Ask 3M and the expanded 3M Digital Materials Hub, to accelerate product development for engineers, particularly those in small and medium-sized businesses. These innovations leverage generative AI, advanced modeling, and simulation-ready data to help customers quickly identify suitable materials, digitally validate designs, and even explore generative solutions before creating physical prototypes. The goal is to reduce iteration cycles, lower prototyping costs, and bring better products to market faster, especially in fast-moving industries like electronics and automotive.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/5g5dATerBQM778kW11RoTg--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTE4ODtoPTQ4/https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2025-01/88364d00-d410-11ef-beff-b428e6fcfd64','Yahoo! Finance Canada','General','Yahoo! Finance Canada','[{"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.942252"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.829393"}]',0.374593,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "MMM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.422466"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.617079", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.329799"}]','{"url": "https://ca.finance.yahoo.com/news/3m-ai-tools-accelerate-ideas-133000036.html", "title": "How 3M AI Tools Accelerate How Ideas Become Products", "source": "Yahoo! Finance Canada", "topics": [{"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.942252"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.829393"}], "authors": [], "summary": "3M has introduced new AI-powered digital tools, Ask 3M and the expanded 3M Digital Materials Hub, to accelerate product development for engineers, particularly those i