	 (2701,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-10 13:28:57','20260210T132857','Cybersecurity firm Intrusion hires veterans to chase U.S. government deals','https://www.stocktitan.net/news/INTZ/intrusion-inc-expands-business-development-efforts-with-strategic-pjay581ohtal.html','Intrusion Inc. (NASDAQ:INTZ) has strategically expanded its business development team by hiring Valencia Reaves as Public Sector VP of Sales and Patrick Duggan as Director of Channel Sales & Partnerships. These additions are aimed at strengthening the company''s presence and accelerating growth within the U.S. government sector and broadening its channel and partner networks. The company anticipates these hires will deepen its coverage across federal, enterprise, and channel markets, leveraging their extensive experience to drive new contracts and partnerships.','https://app.accessnewswire.com/img.ashx?id=1135427','Stock Titan','General','Stock Titan','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.815647"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.648261"}]',0.259542,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "INTZ", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.322203"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.615247", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.243275"}]','{"url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/news/INTZ/intrusion-inc-expands-business-development-efforts-with-strategic-pjay581ohtal.html", "title": "Cybersecurity firm Intrusion hires veterans to chase U.S. government deals", "source": "Stock Titan", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.815647"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.648261"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Intrusion Inc. (NASDAQ:INTZ) has strategically expanded its business development team by hiring Valencia Reaves as Public Sector VP of Sales and Patrick Duggan as Director of Channel Sales & Partnerships. These additions are aimed at s