	 (2707,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-10 11:48:20','20260210T114820','Advanced Micro Devices (AMD)''s Datacenter Momentum Builds as Goldman Flags Operating Expense Pressure','https://finviz.com/news/305287/advanced-micro-devices-amds-datacenter-momentum-builds-as-goldman-flags-operating-expense-pressure','Advanced Micro Devices (AMD) reported strong fourth-quarter revenue and guidance, primarily driven by its Datacenter segment, yet Goldman Sachs maintained a Neutral rating due to higher-than-expected operating expenses. The firm highlights AMD''s robust momentum in its Datacenter business for 2026, supported by market share gains and new product ramps, but notes limited near-term operating leverage due to significant AI infrastructure investments. Goldman Sachs''s rating reflects concerns over immediate operating leverage and customer concentration, though a more positive outlook is possible with improved revenue and execution.','https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/19160555/AMD-insidermonkey-1695153952842-768x430.jpg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.926737"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.800283"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.703280"}]',0.102742,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMD", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.132456"}, {"ticker": "GS", "relevance_score": "0.610851", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.224795"}, {"ticker": "NVDA", "relevance_score": "0.543288", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.209626"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.558107", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.137808"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/305287/advanced-micro-devices-amds-datacenter-momentum-builds-as-goldman-flags-operating-expense-pressure", "title": "Advanced Micro Devices (