	 (2708,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-10 11:48:20','20260210T114820','DA Davidson Thinks Amazon.com (AMZN) is "Losing the Lead" - Here''s Why','https://finviz.com/news/305302/da-davidson-thinks-amazoncom-amzn-is-losing-the-lead-heres-why','DA Davidson downgraded Amazon.com (AMZN) from Buy to Neutral and lowered its price target to $175, citing concerns that the company is losing its lead in cloud computing and lagging in the AI-driven retail landscape. The firm noted AWS''s slower growth compared to competitors like Azure and Google Cloud, and suggested Amazon might need significant investment in AI to remain competitive. Despite a separate price target revision from Bank of America maintaining a Buy rating, DA Davidson believes Amazon faces strategic disadvantages without direct AI integrations.','https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/19152853/AMZN-insidermonkey-1695151731080.jpg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.807740"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.921139"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.735594"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}]',-0.064899,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.398626"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.645969", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.120596"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.632870", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.122909"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.614416", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.131069"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/305302/da-davidson-thinks-amazoncom-amzn-is-losing-the-lead-heres-why", "title": "DA Davidson Thinks Amazon.com (AMZN) is \\"Losing the Lead\\" - Here''s Why", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.