	 (2709,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-10 11:36:00','20260210T113600','Mexico Construction Equipment Industry Report 2026-2031 - Caterpillar, LiuGong, Komatsu, Liebherr, Volvo CE, John Deere, XCMG are the Front-runners by Offering a Diverse Set of Equipment','https://finance.yahoo.com/news/mexico-construction-equipment-industry-report-103200671.html','The Mexico construction equipment market is projected to grow from 32,188 units in 2025 to 38,612 units by 2031, driven by a CAGR of 3.08%. Key factors influencing this growth include the expanding mining sector, rising demand for material handling equipment due to nearshoring and e-commerce, and substantial infrastructure projects in road construction. Caterpillar, John Deere, LiuGong, and other major players are leading the market, with increasing competition from Chinese brands like XCMG.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/ZzRllEwmBJRmtO.L0Gf1ZA--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTIyNDtoPTQ4/https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2025-08/b2b7bbc0-8385-11f0-977e-d9d7d4cd04d2','Yahoo Finance','General','Yahoo Finance','[{"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.904695"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.836200"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.711447"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.633057"}]',0.460704,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "DE", "relevance_score": "0.904594", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.526705"}, {"ticker": "CAT", "relevance_score": "0.872509", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.490815"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.741504", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.343978"}]','{"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/mexico-construction-equipment-industry-report-103200671.html", "title": "Mexico Construction Equipment Industry Report 2026-2031 - Caterpillar, LiuGong, Komatsu, Liebherr, Volvo CE, John Deere, XCMG are the Front-runners by Offering