	 (2711,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-10 06:36:00','20260210T063600','Melius Downgrades Microsoft (MSFT) to Hold, Flags AI Capex and Cash Flow Risks','https://finviz.com/news/305283/melius-downgrades-microsoft-msft-to-hold-flags-ai-capex-and-cash-flow-risks','Melius analyst Ben Reitzes downgraded Microsoft (MSFT) from Buy to Hold with a $430 price target, citing concerns about AI-related capital expenditure and cash flow risks. The analyst believes Microsoft''s 365 business faces threats from AI, requiring increased spending to compete with Amazon and Google, which could further impact free cash flow. Additionally, Melius noted the slow progress of Microsoft''s AI assistant, Copilot, suggesting it may struggle against competitors and affect growth and margins in the Productivity segment, despite valuation concerns related to revised free cash flow estimates.','https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2016/02/12061153/shutterstock_199396142.jpg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.906131"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.809771"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.708256"}]',-0.071526,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.380705"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.607612", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.127759"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.624981", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.095902"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.607742", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.058293"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/305283/melius-downgrades-microsoft-msft-to-hold-flags-ai-capex-and-cash-flow-risks", "title": "Melius Downgrades Microsoft (MSFT) to Hold, Flags AI Capex and Cash Flow Risks", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_sc