	 (2712,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-10 04:27:48','20260210T042748','Amazon.com Inc. (AMZN) Citigroup Cuts Price Target to $265','https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/AMZN/pressreleases/120286/amazoncom-inc-amzn-citigroup-cuts-price-target-to-265/','Citigroup analyst Ronald Josey has lowered the 12-month price target for Amazon (AMZN) stock from $320 to $265, while maintaining a "Buy" rating. This adjustment reflects a more conservative near-term outlook due to a volatile macroeconomic environment, tempered expectations for margin expansion and revenue growth, and increased scrutiny on large-cap technology valuations. Concerns include normalizing consumer demand in e-commerce, cost pressures in logistics, and more measured growth in Amazon Web Services as enterprise customers optimize cloud spending.','https://www.stocktargetadvisor.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/untitled-design-2023-10-04T161450.074.png','The Globe and Mail','General','The Globe and Mail','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.919278"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.827322"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.726004"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.625803"}]',-0.172666,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.210051"}, {"ticker": "C", "relevance_score": "0.702445", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.105031"}]','{"url": "https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/AMZN/pressreleases/120286/amazoncom-inc-amzn-citigroup-cuts-price-target-to-265/", "title": "Amazon.com Inc. (AMZN) Citigroup Cuts Price Target to $265", "source": "The Globe and Mail", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.919278"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.827322"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.726004"}, {"topic": "eco