	 (2713,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-10 02:57:55','20260210T025755','Salesforce cuts fewer than 1,000 jobs, Business Insider reports','https://www.reuters.com/business/world-at-work/salesforce-cuts-less-than-1000-jobs-business-insider-reports-2026-02-10/','Salesforce reportedly cut fewer than 1,000 roles at the beginning of February 2026, impacting areas like marketing, product management, and AI product teams. This comes as U.S. companies streamline operations and adopt AI tools, following earlier comments from Salesforce CEO Marc Benioff about reducing customer support roles due to AI''s impact. Despite these cuts, the company had previously raised its fiscal 2026 revenue and profit forecasts, anticipating growth from its AI agent platform.','https://www.reuters.com/resizer/v2/WPA4HQFEZFN25NCLTTPFWSHELA.jpg?auth=52f1cc600593a620fb26bc56620faecdbbefe561c9184f877b3d76e889d6e710&width=1920&quality=80','Reuters','General','Reuters','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.816941"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.925327"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.701813"}]',-0.158938,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CRM", "relevance_score": "0.971556", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.134099"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.693380", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.221934"}]','{"url": "https://www.reuters.com/business/world-at-work/salesforce-cuts-less-than-1000-jobs-business-insider-reports-2026-02-10/", "title": "Salesforce cuts fewer than 1,000 jobs, Business Insider reports", "source": "Reuters", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.816941"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.925327"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.701813"}], "authors": ["Reuters"], "summary": "Salesforce reportedly cut fewer than 1,000 roles at the beginning of February 2026, impacting areas like marketing, product management