	 (2721,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-09 19:59:51','20260209T195951','Brandywine Realty Trust plans to sell up to another $300M of its office portfolio','https://www.bizjournals.com/philadelphia/news/2026/02/09/brandywine-realty-trust-asset-sales-300-million.html','Brandywine Realty Trust plans to sell an additional $300 million in office assets, according to CEO Jerry Sweeney. The firm has already divested $1 billion from recent sales, and its Philadelphia portfolio currently boasts a 97% lease rate. This move signifies a continued strategy to optimize its real estate holdings.','https://media.bizj.us/view/img/13136543/brandywine-jerry-sweeney*900xx8192-4619-0-312.jpg','The Business Journals','General','The Business Journals','[{"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.943054"}]',0.137435,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "BDN", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.135798"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.637249", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.108887"}]','{"url": "https://www.bizjournals.com/philadelphia/news/2026/02/09/brandywine-realty-trust-asset-sales-300-million.html", "title": "Brandywine Realty Trust plans to sell up to another $300M of its office portfolio", "source": "The Business Journals", "topics": [{"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.943054"}], "authors": ["Paul Schwedelson"], "summary": "Brandywine Realty Trust plans to sell an additional $300 million in office assets, according to CEO Jerry Sweeney. The firm has already divested $1 billion from recent sales, and its Philadelphia portfolio currently boasts a 97% lease rate. This move signifies a continued strategy to optimize its real estate holdings.", "banner_image": "https://media.bizj.us/view/img/13136543/brandywine-jerry-sweeney*900xx8192-4619-0-312.jpg", "source_domain": "The Business Journals", "time_published": "20260209T195951", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "BDN", "releva