	 (2722,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-09 19:45:02','20260209T194502','The man who fixed Walmart''s grocer is Kroger''s new CEO','https://fortune.com/2026/02/09/kroger-ceo-greg-foran-walmarts-groceries/','Kroger has appointed Greg Foran, former CEO of Walmart U.S. and Air New Zealand, as its new chief executive. Foran is known for revitalizing Walmart''s grocery business with his hands-on style and focus on customer experience. His appointment comes at a critical time for Kroger, which has faced leadership changes, inflation challenges, and a blocked merger with Albertsons, and is expected to bring much-needed leadership to the supermarket conglomerate.','https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/GettyImages-2188993999.jpg?format=webp&w=1440&q=100','Fortune','General','Fortune','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.929447"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.839755"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.740043"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.619600"}]',0.270682,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.425107"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.908174", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.326193"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.601639", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.137778"}]','{"url": "https://fortune.com/2026/02/09/kroger-ceo-greg-foran-walmarts-groceries/", "title": "The man who fixed Walmart''s grocer is Kroger''s new CEO", "source": "Fortune", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.929447"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.839755"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.740043"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.619600"}], "authors": ["Phil Wahba"], "summary": "Kroger has appointed Greg Foran, former CEO of Walmart 