	 (2725,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-09 19:17:35','20260209T191735','What''s driving Procter & Gamble''s monster start to 2026 — and how it can continue','https://www.cnbc.com/2026/02/09/whats-driving-pgs-monster-start-to-2026-and-how-it-can-continue.html','Procter & Gamble has seen a strong start to 2026, with shares up 10% following a challenging 2025. This surge is attributed to a broader rotation of investors from high-growth tech stocks, concerned about AI''s impact and capital expenditures, into defensive consumer staples like P&G. The company''s performance is further bolstered by improving fundamentals, including strength in emerging markets, a weaker U.S. dollar, and lower oil prices, all contributing to better margins and sales.','https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108194035-1756947879330-gettyimages-94908931-pdir0322Hi_j0136JPG.jpeg?v=1756947897&w=600&h=300&vtcrop=y','CNBC','General','CNBC','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.933427"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.812406"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.749264"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.645626"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.617237"}]',-0.280889,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.421430"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.617223", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.402925"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.604088", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.417641"}, {"ticker": "META", "relevance_score": "0.644671", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.440523"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.640969", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.449980"}]','{"url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/02/09/whats-driving-pgs-monster-start-to-2026-and-how-it-can-continue.html