	 (2728,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-09 18:29:26','20260209T182926','What CIOs need to know about community-first AI infrastructure','https://www.techtarget.com/searchcio/feature/What-CIOs-need-to-know-about-community-first-AI-infrastructure','As the demand for AI drives the construction of numerous data centers, communities are raising concerns about their impact on local resources. In response, infrastructure providers like Microsoft and Applied Digital are adopting a "community-first" AI infrastructure approach. This strategy focuses on minimizing negative effects and maximizing benefits through collaboration with local leaders, investing in sustainable practices, and creating jobs and tax base enhancements.','https://www.techtarget.com/rms/onlineimages/storage_g1223952490_searchsitetablet_520X173.jpg','TechTarget','General','TechTarget','[{"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.828321"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.913095"}]',0.143825,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TTGT", "relevance_score": "0.309606", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.022629"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.749122", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.320636"}, {"ticker": "DELL", "relevance_score": "0.646323", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.145038"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.564477", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.128085"}, {"ticker": "ORCL", "relevance_score": "0.566664", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.157835"}]','{"url": "https://www.techtarget.com/searchcio/feature/What-CIOs-need-to-know-about-community-first-AI-infrastructure", "title": "What CIOs need to know about community-first AI infrastructure", "source": "TechTarget", "topics": [{"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.828321"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.913095"}], "author