	 (2729,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-09 17:59:09','20260209T175909','MercadoLibre stock pops back over $2,000 as MELI eyes Feb. 24 results','https://ts2.tech/en/mercadolibre-stock-pops-back-over-2000-as-meli-eyes-feb-24-results/','MercadoLibre (MELI) stock recovered to over $2,000, climbing 1.8% ahead of its provisional quarterly results on February 24. Investors are closely watching the Latin American e-commerce and payments giant for updates on commerce volumes, payment trends, and margins, especially gross merchandise volume (GMV). The company''s performance often reflects shifts in consumer appetite and logistics efficiency in the region.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/mercadolibre-stock-pops-back-over-2000-as-meli-eyes-feb-24-results-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.913754"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.801382"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.749381"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.646336"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.634819"}]',0.179644,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "MELI", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.329064"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.601599", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.006507"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/mercadolibre-stock-pops-back-over-2000-as-meli-eyes-feb-24-results/", "title": "MercadoLibre stock pops back over $2,000 as MELI eyes Feb. 24 results", "source": "TechStock²", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.913754"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.801382"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.749381"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.646336"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.634819"}], "authors": ["Khadija Saeed"], "summary": "MercadoLibre (MELI) stock recovered to over $