	 (2732,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-09 17:41:48','20260209T174148','From Integration to Intelligence: What Salesforce’s 2026 Connectivity Benchmark Really Signals','https://salesforcedevops.net/index.php/2026/02/09/agentic-enterprise-infrastructure-semantic-context/','Salesforce''s 2026 MuleSoft Connectivity Benchmark Report highlights a rapid proliferation of AI agents in enterprises, with 83% of organizations using them in most or all teams and a projected 67% growth by 2027. However, this boom has led to "agent sprawl" where over half of agents operate in disconnected silos and only 54% of enterprises have a centralized governance framework, exemplified by Alcon''s creation of 900 ungoverned agents. Salesforce''s MuleSoft Agent Fabric aims to address this by focusing on discovery, governance, and orchestration, but the report stresses that the next critical frontier is semantic context, ensuring agents not only connect but also share a common understanding of data.',NULL,'SalesforceDevops.net','General','SalesforceDevops.net','[{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.905004"}]',0.090992,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "CRM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.217794"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.645482", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.037862"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.619930", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.012979"}]','{"url": "https://salesforcedevops.net/index.php/2026/02/09/agentic-enterprise-infrastructure-semantic-context/", "title": "From Integration to Intelligence: What Salesforce’s 2026 Connectivity Benchmark Really Signals", "source": "SalesforceDevops.net", "topics": [{"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.905004"}], "authors": ["Vernon Keenan"], "summary": "Salesforce''s 2026 MuleSoft Connectivity Benchmark Report highlights a rapid proliferation of AI agents in enter