	 (2734,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-09 16:59:05','20260209T165905','STMicroelectronics'' Golden Cross Meets Amazon Backstop - And The Chart Lights Up','https://finviz.com/news/304658/stmicroelectronics-golden-cross-meets-amazon-backstop-and-the-chart-lights-up','STMicroelectronics NV (STM) has achieved a Golden Cross technical signal, indicating a potential new uptrend, supported by a significant deal with Amazon.com Inc (AMZN). Amazon''s equity-linked deal, including warrants, establishes a financial backstop for STM at $28.38 per share, giving the technical signal strong fundamental support. Analysts project 11.5% revenue growth for STM in 2026, with resistance levels at $33.47 and potential for further upside.','https://editorial-assets.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/09105638/Screenshot-2026-02-09-at-9.26.15-PM.png','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.929181"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.815152"}]',0.399102,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "STM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.491673"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.860054", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.318989"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/304658/stmicroelectronics-golden-cross-meets-amazon-backstop-and-the-chart-lights-up", "title": "STMicroelectronics'' Golden Cross Meets Amazon Backstop - And The Chart Lights Up", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.929181"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.815152"}], "authors": ["Surbhi Jain"], "summary": "STMicroelectronics NV (STM) has achieved a Golden Cross technical signal, indicating a potential new uptrend, supported by a significant deal with Amazon.com Inc (AMZN). Amazon''s equity-linked deal, including warrants, establishes a financial backstop for STM at $28.38 per share, giving the technical signal s