	 (2744,'alpha_vantage','BBWI','BBWI','2026-02-09 18:58:47','20260209T185847','Deadline Alert: Bath & Body Works, Inc. (BBWI) Shareholders','https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/02/09/3234838/0/en/Deadline-Alert-Bath-Body-Works-Inc-BBWI-Shareholders-Who-Lost-Money-Urged-To-Contact-Glancy-Prongay-Wolke-Rotter-LLP-About-Securities-Fraud-Lawsuit.html','Glancy Prongay Wolke & Rotter LLP is reminding investors of the March 16, 2026, deadline to file a lead plaintiff motion in a class action lawsuit against Bath & Body Works (BBWI). The lawsuit alleges that the company made misleading statements to investors regarding its "adjacencies, collaborations and promotions" strategy, which failed to grow its customer base and deliver expected net sales. This follows significant drops in stock price after the company reported disappointing financial results and cut its full-year guidance in August and November 2025.','https://ml.globenewswire.com/media/ZDBhZTFmZjktMTNiMi00ZmQ2LWE4YjAtNTYyZDYzZDNiODMyLTEwMjg4NjQtMjAyNi0wMi0wOS1lbg==/tiny/Glancy-Prongay-Wolke-Rotter-LL.png','GlobeNewswire','General','GlobeNewswire','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.945326"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.829202"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.824889"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.727217"}]',-0.717094,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "BBWI", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.749997"}]','{"url": "https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/02/09/3234838/0/en/Deadline-Alert-Bath-Body-Works-Inc-BBWI-Shareholders-Who-Lost-Money-Urged-To-Contact-Glancy-Prongay-Wolke-Rotter-LLP-About-Securities-Fraud-Lawsuit.html", "title": "Deadline Alert: Bath & Body Works, Inc. (BBWI) Shareholders", "source": "GlobeNewswire", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.945326"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.829202"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevan