	 (2765,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-10 04:29:33','20260210T042933','|‘Bunker’ and ‘Booster’ stocks in the U.S. – Which would perform better in a downturn vs. upturn?','https://seekingalpha.com/news/4340374-bunker-and-booster-stocks-in-the-us-which-would-perform-better-in-a-downturn-vs-upturn','|BofA Securities has categorized U.S. stocks into "bunkers" and "boosters" to indicate their performance during different economic cycles. "Boosters" are expected to thrive in an economic upturn, while "bunkers" are anticipated to perform well during a downturn. This analysis aims to guide investors on how different stock types might react to changes in economic conditions.','|https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1041490254/image_1041490254.jpg?io=getty-c-w750','Seeking Alpha','General','Seeking Alpha','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.938078"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.823476"}]',0.021191,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "PBUS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.049683"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.701811", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.041256"}, {"ticker": "AEP", "relevance_score": "0.746059", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.013191"}, {"ticker": "WEC", "relevance_score": "0.705525", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.014298"}, {"ticker": "ATO", "relevance_score": "0.705190", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.031049"}]','{"url": "https://seekingalpha.com/news/4340374-bunker-and-booster-stocks-in-the-us-which-would-perform-better-in-a-downturn-vs-upturn", "title": "|‘Bunker’ and ‘Booster’ stocks in the U.S. – Which would perform better in a downturn vs. upturn?", "source": "Seeking Alpha", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.938078"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_sco