	 (2766,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-10 02:37:38','20260210T023738','Costco Shares Surge 16% to $1,000 Amid Earnings Anticipation','https://intellectia.ai/news/stock/costco-shares-surge-16-to-1000-amid-earnings-anticipation','Costco''s shares have surged 16% in early 2026, reaching $1,000, as the company anticipates its upcoming earnings release on March 5th. Despite strong recent sales growth and positive analyst outlooks, the stock''s high P/E ratio of 54 raises valuation concerns among experts who advise caution for investors. Bernstein and Baird analysts have recently raised their price targets for Costco, expecting continued strong performance.','https://intellectia.ai/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd5bp8bijhhba2.cloudfront.net%2Fimage%2Fcover_image%2F20260210100413_ee5fa1be350e0634c0be159106a3666b.jpeg&w=256&q=75','Intellectia AI','General','Intellectia AI','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.926521"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.843804"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.721626"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.637894"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.617643"}]',0.281125,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.292085"}]','{"url": "https://intellectia.ai/news/stock/costco-shares-surge-16-to-1000-amid-earnings-anticipation", "title": "Costco Shares Surge 16% to $1,000 Amid Earnings Anticipation", "source": "Intellectia AI", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.926521"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.843804"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.721626"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.637894"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.617643"}], "authors": ["Emily J. Thompson"], "summary": "Costco''s shares have surged 16% in early 2026, reaching $1,000, as the company anticipates its upcom