	 (2773,'alpha_vantage','COST','COST','2026-02-09 18:49:49','20260209T184949','Costco shoppers are ignoring a whole section – and a few extra steps could save hundreds','https://www.the-sun.com/money/15914694/costco-bakery-items-warehouse-deals-food/','Costco shoppers are reportedly overlooking the in-store bakery, a section that offers significant savings on various items. Social media content creators and users have highlighted deals on baked goods like mini beignets, giant chocolate chip cookie bar cakes, peanut butter cookies, pumpkin pies, and croissants, attributing the low prices to Costco''s capped markups and limited marketing expenses. By exploring this section, customers could save hundreds of dollars.','https://www.the-sun.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/02/newspress-collage-bi3jp8om7-1770661820529.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&1770643833','www.the-sun.com','General','www.the-sun.com','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.914969"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.701619"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.612387"}]',0.438339,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.447408"}]','{"url": "https://www.the-sun.com/money/15914694/costco-bakery-items-warehouse-deals-food/", "title": "Costco shoppers are ignoring a whole section – and a few extra steps could save hundreds", "source": "www.the-sun.com", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.914969"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.701619"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.612387"}], "authors": ["James Evenden"], "summary": "Costco shoppers are reportedly overlooking the in-store bakery, a section that offers significant savings on various items. Social media content creators and users have highlighted deals on baked goods like mini beignets, giant chocolate chip cookie bar cakes, peanut butter cookies, pumpkin pies, and croissants, a