	 (2796,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-10 09:50:00','20260210T095000','Jim Cramer on Amazon.com (AMZN): “You Need a Certain Level of Faith if You’re Planning to Own This One”','https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/jim-cramer-on-amazon-com-amzn-you-need-a-certain-level-of-faith-if-youre-planning-to-own-this-one-1692621/','Jim Cramer discussed Amazon.com (AMZN) after the company''s recent earnings, highlighting its surprisingly high $200 billion CapEx forecast for the year, significantly exceeding analyst expectations. He noted that this massive investment, aimed at AI infrastructure, retail operations, and satellites, overshadowed positive quarterly results like strong AWS growth. Cramer acknowledges the stock''s recent sell-off due to the CapEx and weaker operating income guidance but expresses faith in CEO Andy Jassy''s ability to execute these investments for future returns, although he admits it requires a "leap of faith" for investors.','https://imonkey-blog.imgix.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/20014104/56055173_ml.jpg?auto=format&fit=clip&expires=1802217600&width=480&height=320','Insider Monkey','General','Insider Monkey','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.917018"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.815361"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.814594"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.743875"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.632549"}]',-0.054506,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.951938", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.292612"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.646192", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.062516"}, {"ticker": "GOOG", "relevance_score": "0.641478", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.083940"}]','{"url": "https://www.insidermonkey.com/blog/jim-cramer-on-amazon-com-amzn-you-need-a-certain-level-of-faith-if-youre-planning-to-own-t