	 (2803,'alpha_vantage','AMZN','AMZN','2026-02-09 22:58:09','20260209T225809','STMicroelectronics stock price target raised to $32 from $29 at Mizuho','https://www.investing.com/news/analyst-ratings/stmicroelectronics-stock-price-target-raised-to-32-from-29-at-mizuho-93CH-4495256','Mizuho has increased its price target for STMicroelectronics (NYSE:STM) to $32 from $29, while maintaining a Neutral rating. This adjustment follows a significant commercial agreement between STMicroelectronics and Amazon Web Services (AWS) for AI data center deployments, which Mizuho expects to generate "multi-billion" incremental revenue by 2030. Despite the positive outlook from this partnership, the Neutral rating was kept due to near-term analog headwinds, though various growth drivers were acknowledged.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/World_News_8_800x533_L_1420026210.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.942734"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.909285"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.834654"}]',0.260638,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "STM", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.342187"}, {"ticker": "AMZN", "relevance_score": "0.639707", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.227606"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/analyst-ratings/stmicroelectronics-stock-price-target-raised-to-32-from-29-at-mizuho-93CH-4495256", "title": "STMicroelectronics stock price target raised to $32 from $29 at Mizuho", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.942734"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.909285"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.834654"}], "authors": ["Investing.com"], "summary": "Mizuho has increased its price target for STMicroelectronics (NYSE:STM) to $32 from $29, while maintaining a Neutral rating. T