	 (2864,'alpha_vantage','CPNG','CPNG','2026-02-10 03:30:00','20260210T033000','Coupang, Inc. Notice of February 17, 2026 Application Deadline for Class Action Lawsuits - Contact Lewis Kahn, Esq. at Kahn Swick & Foti, LLC, Before Application Deadline','https://www.accessnewswire.com/newsroom/en/business-and-professional-services/coupang-inc.-notice-of-february-17-2026-application-deadline-for-1135442','Kahn Swick & Foti, LLC (KSF) has issued a notice to investors of Coupang, Inc. regarding class action securities lawsuits. The lawsuit alleges that Coupang and certain executives failed to disclose material information regarding inadequate cybersecurity protocols and a data breach between May 7, 2025, and December 16, 2025. Investors who suffered losses during this period have until February 17, 2026, to request appointment as lead plaintiff.','https://app.accessnewswire.com/imagelibrary/9c36f2e2-94da-48cf-b662-85dc677c2bfa/1135442/image.png','ACCESS Newswire','General','ACCESS Newswire','[{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.929204"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.602645"}]',-0.83117,'Bearish','[{"ticker": "CPNG", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.807827"}]','{"url": "https://www.accessnewswire.com/newsroom/en/business-and-professional-services/coupang-inc.-notice-of-february-17-2026-application-deadline-for-1135442", "title": "Coupang, Inc. Notice of February 17, 2026 Application Deadline for Class Action Lawsuits - Contact Lewis Kahn, Esq. at Kahn Swick & Foti, LLC, Before Application Deadline", "source": "ACCESS Newswire", "topics": [{"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.929204"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.602645"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Kahn Swick & Foti, LLC (KSF) has issued a notice to investors of Coupang, Inc. regarding class action securities lawsuits. The lawsuit alleges that Coupang and certain executives failed to disclose material informati