	 (2871,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-10 13:52:24','20260210T135224','CVS annual profit guidance misses Wall Street estimates','https://www.bostonglobe.com/2026/02/10/metro/cvs-earnings-2026-profit-guidance/','CVS Health Corp. has missed Wall Street''s profit projections for 2026, forecasting adjusted earnings of $7 to $7.20 a share, which is below the average analyst estimate. The company also lowered its cash flow from operations estimate to at least $9 billion, down from $10 billion. This cautious outlook comes amidst industry tumult and increased scrutiny from lawmakers regarding healthcare costs, particularly impacting its Medicare Advantage business.','https://bostonglobe-prod.cdn.arcpublishing.com/resizer/v2/GPL62N7THFBQZED2FG3QLLNQ54.jpg?auth=35f3188fabee55689039f67146decd9963eeef8407eaa194aa50ca95e77235cb&width=1440','The Boston Globe','General','The Boston Globe','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.926936"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.833302"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.728254"}]',-0.281807,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.411419"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.744097", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.261323"}, {"ticker": "ELV", "relevance_score": "0.644264", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.226766"}]','{"url": "https://www.bostonglobe.com/2026/02/10/metro/cvs-earnings-2026-profit-guidance/", "title": "CVS annual profit guidance misses Wall Street estimates", "source": "The Boston Globe", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.926936"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.833302"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.728254"}], "authors": [], "summary": "CVS Health Corp. has missed Wall Street''s profit projections for 2026, forecasting adjusted earn