	 (2873,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-10 12:45:52','20260210T124552','CVS Health Reports Q4 Beat but Maintains Full-Year Outlook','https://intellectia.ai/news/stock/cvs-health-reports-q4-beat-but-maintains-fullyear-outlook','CVS Health reported a strong Q4 2025 performance, with revenue growing 8% year-over-year to $105.7 billion and adjusted EPS exceeding forecasts, despite a decline in gross margin. The company saw significant growth in its Health Care Benefits and Pharmacy & Consumer Wellness segments. While profitability faced challenges, diluted EPS rose due to a tax benefit, and analysts maintain a positive outlook for CVS stock.','https://intellectia.ai/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd5bp8bijhhba2.cloudfront.net%2Fimage%2Fcover_image%2F20260210201129_0a71a160c50cf6aae0885cbed22d5c19.png&w=256&q=75','Intellectia AI','General','Intellectia AI','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.910146"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.833164"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.724121"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.638122"}]',0.119674,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.105459"}, {"ticker": "UNH", "relevance_score": "0.640752", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.101946"}, {"ticker": "HUM", "relevance_score": "0.602920", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.125922"}]','{"url": "https://intellectia.ai/news/stock/cvs-health-reports-q4-beat-but-maintains-fullyear-outlook", "title": "CVS Health Reports Q4 Beat but Maintains Full-Year Outlook", "source": "Intellectia AI", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.910146"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.833164"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.724121"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.638122"}], "authors": ["Emily J. Thompson"], "summary