	 (2874,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-10 12:31:52','20260210T123152','CVS Health Corp (NYSE:CVS) Beats Q4 Estimates but Shares Dip on Cautious Outlook','https://www.chartmill.com/news/CVS/Chartmill-41572-CVS-Health-Corp-NYSECVS-Beats-Q4-Estimates-but-Shares-Dip-on-Cautious-Outlook','CVS Health Corp (NYSE:CVS) surpassed Wall Street''s expectations for its fourth-quarter financial results, reporting stronger-than-anticipated revenue and adjusted EPS. Despite this earnings beat, the company''s shares traded lower in pre-market activity, reflecting cautious investor sentiment, possibly due to broader concerns in the health insurance industry and CVS''s decision to maintain, rather than raise, its 2026 full-year guidance. CEO Karen Lynch emphasized the company''s ongoing transformation efforts in lowering drug prices and improving healthcare experiences.','https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_17_c249efcc18.webp','Chartmill','General','Chartmill','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932395"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.802818"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.714367"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.622065"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.641174"}]',0.012678,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.331181", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.029154"}]','{"url": "https://www.chartmill.com/news/CVS/Chartmill-41572-CVS-Health-Corp-NYSECVS-Beats-Q4-Estimates-but-Shares-Dip-on-Cautious-Outlook", "title": "CVS Health Corp (NYSE:CVS) Beats Q4 Estimates but Shares Dip on Cautious Outlook", "source": "Chartmill", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932395"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.802818"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.714367"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.622065"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.641174"}], "authors"