	 (2875,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-10 11:48:23','20260210T114823','CVS HEALTH Corp SEC 10-K Report','https://www.tradingview.com/news/tradingview:de2311c9aed79:0-cvs-health-corp-sec-10-k-report/','CVS Health Corp has released its 2025 Form 10-K report, revealing a total revenue of $402,067 million, up 7.8% from 2024, despite a significant decrease in operating and net income due to impairment and litigation charges. The report details strategic initiatives including expanding its health solutions model, optimizing its retail business, and investing in value-based care through acquisitions. The company also outlined considerable challenges and risks related to market conditions, operational vulnerabilities, and regulatory changes, alongside strategies to mitigate these issues.',NULL,'TradingView','General','TradingView','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.901315"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.802934"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.721179"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.629586"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.640941"}]',-0.251693,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.291493"}]','{"url": "https://www.tradingview.com/news/tradingview:de2311c9aed79:0-cvs-health-corp-sec-10-k-report/", "title": "CVS HEALTH Corp SEC 10-K Report", "source": "TradingView", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.901315"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.802934"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.721179"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.629586"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.640941"}], "authors": [], "summary": "CVS Health Corp has released its 2025 Form 10-K report, revealing a total revenue of $402,067 million, up 7.8% from 2024, despite a significant decrease in operating and net income due to impairment and litigation charges. The report details strategic initiatives including expanding its health solutions model, optimizing its retail business, and investing in value-based care through acquisitions. The company also outlined considerable challenges and risks related to market conditions, operational vulnerabilities, and regulatory changes, alongside strategies to mitigate these issues.", "banner_image": null, "source_domain": "TradingView", "time_published": "20260210T114823", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.291493"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "overall_sentiment_score": -0.251693}','2026-02-10 17:19:15',NULL),
	 (2876,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-10 11:46:44','20260210T114644','Spotify, CVS, AppLovin, TSMC, BP, ON Semi, Credo, Upwork, and More Market Movers','https://www.barrons.com/articles/stock-movers-fcd46b27?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqfseN4ZvrvNykg5np5R_wn0wxB6Oz0fWwTDU_EviBt82KIdvTqIGILl&gaa_ts=698b2722&gaa_sig=rhEbVLurDzhbWElYUk_JcSezynOiYe4bJJgvZsHOzjq7N3lTb821vUhzJ2Uu5jykBu2-_9uT0prajc0f3hFICA%3D%3D','Stock futures showed modest gains on Tuesday, continuing the tech-led rally that has characterized the past two trading sessions. This article highlights several companies, including Spotify, CVS, AppLovin, TSMC, BP, ON Semi, Credo, and Upwork, as key market movers. The market''s upward trend appears to be sustained by a tech sector resurgence.','https://images.barrons.com/im-29276252?width=700&height=466','Barron''s','General','Barron''s','[{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.905458"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.737563"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.613503"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0.647809"}]',0.024344,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "ON", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.019099"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.032515"}]','{"url": "https://www.barrons.com/articles/stock-movers-fcd46b27?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqfseN4ZvrvNykg5np5R_wn0wxB6Oz0fWwTDU_EviBt82KIdvTqIGILl&gaa_ts=698b2722&gaa_sig=rhEbVLurDzhbWElYUk_JcSezynOiYe4bJJgvZsHOzjq7N3lTb821vUhzJ2Uu5jykBu2-_9uT0prajc0f3hFICA%3D%3D", "title": "Spotify, CVS, AppLovin, TSMC, BP, ON Semi, Credo, Upwork, and More Market Movers", "source": "Barron''s", "topics": [{"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.905458"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.737563"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.613503"}, {"topic": "energy_transportation", "relevance_score": "0