	 (2877,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-10 11:39:34','20260210T113934','CVS Health Corp earnings beat by $0.09, revenue topped estimates','https://www.investing.com/news/earnings/cvs-health-corp-earnings-beat-by-009-revenue-topped-estimates-4496029','CVS Health Corp (NYSE: CVS) reported strong fourth-quarter results, surpassing analyst estimates with an EPS of $1.09 against a projected $1.00 and revenue of $105.7 billion, exceeding the consensus of $103.63 billion. The company also provided a positive outlook for FY 2026, forecasting an EPS range of $7.00-$7.20. Despite recent stock fluctuations, CVS is rated for "good performance" by InvestingPro.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/World_News_10_800x533_L_1420026292.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.944084"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.727368"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.604718"}]',0.43309,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.412174"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/earnings/cvs-health-corp-earnings-beat-by-009-revenue-topped-estimates-4496029", "title": "CVS Health Corp earnings beat by $0.09, revenue topped estimates", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.944084"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.727368"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.604718"}], "authors": ["Investing.com"], "summary": "CVS Health Corp (NYSE: CVS) reported strong fourth-quarter results, surpassing analyst estimates with an EPS of $1.09 against a projected $1.00 and revenue of $105.7 billion, exceeding the consensus of $103.63 billion. The company also provided a positive outlook for FY 2026, forecasting an EPS range of $7.00-$7.20. Despite recent stock fluctuations, CVS is rated for \\"good performance\\" by InvestingPro.", "banner_image": "https:/