	 (2878,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-10 10:48:00','20260210T104800','Republican-led US House panel issues subpoenas to eight health insurers, Axios reports','https://www.reuters.com/world/republican-led-us-house-panel-issues-subpoenas-eight-health-insurers-axios-2026-02-10/','A Republican-led US House panel has issued subpoenas to eight Affordable Care Act health insurers as part of an expanding investigation into potential fraud concerning the use of premium subsidies, Axios reported. The subpoenas, issued by House Judiciary Chair Jim Jordan, demand documents related to subsidized ACA enrollees and discussions on subsidy-related fraud, with a deadline of February 23. This action follows previous requests in December triggered by federal auditors detecting subsidized coverage for non-existent individuals and other fraud risks.','https://www.reuters.com/resizer/v2/XZENXDLOFBLTXHDW6WPIXXDY4M.jpg?auth=80c5f909156d5479703a272129be17206ecb62a82a621b646fb1bc841e94bc40&width=1080&quality=80','Reuters','General','Reuters','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.913898"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.840523"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.609255"}]',-0.211327,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.226701"}, {"ticker": "ELV", "relevance_score": "0.913557", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.207922"}, {"ticker": "CNC", "relevance_score": "0.933102", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.248054"}]','{"url": "https://www.reuters.com/world/republican-led-us-house-panel-issues-subpoenas-eight-health-insurers-axios-2026-02-10/", "title": "Republican-led US House panel issues subpoenas to eight health insurers, Axios reports", "source": "Reuters", "topics": [{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.913898"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "re