	 (2883,'alpha_vantage','CVS','CVS','2026-02-10 07:10:42','20260210T071042','Online Doctor Consultation Market Set for Explosive Growth','https://www.openpr.com/news/4383905/online-doctor-consultation-market-set-for-explosive-growth','The Global Online Doctor Consultation Market is projected to experience explosive growth, reaching US$ 47.29 billion by 2033 from US$ 12.05 billion in 2024, driven by increased demand for convenient healthcare, digital health adoption, and technological advancements. North America currently holds the largest market share, while the Asia Pacific region is expected to show the fastest growth. Key players like Teladoc Health, PlushCare, and American Well are innovating with AI-enhanced platforms, wearable integrations, and expanded virtual care services to capture market opportunities despite challenges related to data privacy and the digital divide.','https://cdn.open-pr.com/L/2/L210239598_g.jpg','openPR.com','General','openPR.com','[{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.932316"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.832505"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.725151"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.613407"}]',0.332641,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "TDOC", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.494287"}, {"ticker": "CVS", "relevance_score": "0.642347", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.299613"}, {"ticker": "HUM", "relevance_score": "0.550845", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.219290"}]','{"url": "https://www.openpr.com/news/4383905/online-doctor-consultation-market-set-for-explosive-growth", "title": "Online Doctor Consultation Market Set for Explosive Growth", "source": "openPR.com", "topics": [{"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.932316"}, {"topic": "technology", "relevance_score": "0.832505"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisit