	 (2899,'alpha_vantage','DG','DG','2026-02-09 20:33:38','20260209T203338','Dollar Tree’s Wild Plot Twist: Is DLTR Still the Ultimate Cheap-Thrill Store or Is the Magic Over?','https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/ueberblick/dollar-tree-s-wild-plot-twist-is-dltr-still-the-ultimate-cheap-thrill/68567627','Dollar Tree, once known for its strict one-dollar policy, is now experiencing a "plot twist" with rising prices and mixed consumer reactions on social media. While the store is still popular for DIY inspiration, crafts, and party supplies, its value proposition for everyday essentials like snacks and household items is now debated. Investors are closely watching DLTR''s performance as the company navigates this shift away from its original pricing model.',NULL,'AD HOC NEWS','General','AD HOC NEWS','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.919297"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.613177"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.649122"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.700464"}]',0.083908,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "DLTR", "relevance_score": "0.995064", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.097847"}, {"ticker": "DG", "relevance_score": "0.742744", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.139071"}]','{"url": "https://www.ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/ueberblick/dollar-tree-s-wild-plot-twist-is-dltr-still-the-ultimate-cheap-thrill/68567627", "title": "Dollar Tree’s Wild Plot Twist: Is DLTR Still the Ultimate Cheap-Thrill Store or Is the Magic Over?", "source": "AD HOC NEWS", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.919297"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.613177"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.649122"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.700464"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Dollar Tree, once known for its strict one-dollar policy, is now experiencing a \\"plot twist\\" with rising prices a