	 (2901,'alpha_vantage','DLTR','DLTR','2026-02-10 15:57:15','20260210T155715','Dollar Tree to open new Lehigh Valley store this week at former CVS location','https://www.wfmz.com/news/area/lehighvalley/dollar-tree-to-open-new-lehigh-valley-store-this-week-at-former-cvs-location/article_8e08f6db-8523-4a38-bdf0-96a276804c9c.html','Dollar Tree is set to open a new store this week in Easton, Pennsylvania, at the former CVS location on 620 Old Philadelphia Road. This expansion adds to the discount variety store chain''s presence in the Lehigh Valley, bringing its total to over 380 Pennsylvania locations. The company recently reported a 9.4% increase in net sales for Q3 2025, driven by its multi-price strategy, and continues to focus on offering extreme value merchandise.','https://bloximages.newyork1.vip.townnews.com/wfmz.com/content/tncms/assets/v3/editorial/f/05/f05014e4-0c93-4dfa-9d2a-73b55c0dd00e/6985285abbf59.image.jpg?resize=967%2C500','WFMZ.com','General','WFMZ.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.822190"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}]',0.382881,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "DLTR", "relevance_score": "0.903779", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.403538"}]','{"url": "https://www.wfmz.com/news/area/lehighvalley/dollar-tree-to-open-new-lehigh-valley-store-this-week-at-former-cvs-location/article_8e08f6db-8523-4a38-bdf0-96a276804c9c.html", "title": "Dollar Tree to open new Lehigh Valley store this week at former CVS location", "source": "WFMZ.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.822190"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}], "authors": ["Ryan Kneller"], "summary": "Dollar Tree is set to open a new store this week in Easton, Pennsylvania, at the former CVS location on 620 Old Philadelphia Road. This expansion adds to the discount variety store chain''s presence in the Lehigh Valley, bringing its total to over 380 Pennsylvania locations. The company