	 (2913,'alpha_vantage','EL','EL','2026-02-10 05:58:48','20260210T055848','Edgewell Personal Care P/E Premium And 1.1% Margin Reinforce Bearish Earnings Narratives','https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/household/nyse-epc/edgewell-personal-care/news/edgewell-personal-care-pe-premium-and-11-margin-reinforce-be','Edgewell Personal Care (EPC) has opened fiscal 2026 with mixed Q1 results, showing volatile EPS and compressed profit margins of 1.1%. The company''s P/E ratio of 36.4x is higher than industry and peer averages, further complicated by a significant one-off loss of US$108.8 million in the last 12 months. While bulls point to a wide gap between the current share price and a DCF fair value of US$46.68, bears emphasize concerns about sustained pressure on profitability, slow revenue growth, and potential overvaluation given the quality of earnings.','https://images.simplywall.st/company/5a7e55ce-23e3-4abf-abf8-2fd829781572/chart/earnings-and-revenue-history','Simply Wall Street','General','Simply Wall Street','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.844651"}]',-0.217289,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "EPC", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.404088"}, {"ticker": "EL", "relevance_score": "0.603957", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.124762"}, {"ticker": "KVUE", "relevance_score": "0.621820", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.111498"}]','{"url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/household/nyse-epc/edgewell-personal-care/news/edgewell-personal-care-pe-premium-and-11-margin-reinforce-be", "title": "Edgewell Personal Care P/E Premium And 1.1% Margin Reinforce Bearish Earnings Narratives", "source": "Simply Wall Street", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.844651"}], "authors": ["Simply Wall St"], "s