	 (2915,'alpha_vantage','GAP','GAP','2026-02-09 17:29:47','20260209T172947','Gap and Sushi Club Host Super Bowl Weekend Dinner in San Francisco','https://houseofheat.co/gap/gap-sushi-club-super-bowl-dinner-san-francisco','Gap and Sushi Club co-hosted an exclusive Super Bowl weekend dinner in San Francisco, marking Sushi Club''s Bay Area debut and their first collaboration. The event featured a seven-course omakase by Nobu Matsuhisa and a performance by Sienna Spiro, coinciding with the launch of a limited-edition Gap x Sushi Club apparel collection. This gathering brought together figures from entertainment, sports, and fashion, celebrating the fusion of these industries.','https://cdn.sanity.io/images/pu5wtzfc/production/b2d3139776e5a998e0330afb50a479bf3608dd64-1920x1080.png/gap-sushi-club-super-bowl-dinner-san-francisco-r.png.png?w=320&h=180&auto=format','House of Heat°','General','House of Heat°','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.922617"}]',0.010299,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "GAP", "relevance_score": "0.333767", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.029968"}]','{"url": "https://houseofheat.co/gap/gap-sushi-club-super-bowl-dinner-san-francisco", "title": "Gap and Sushi Club Host Super Bowl Weekend Dinner in San Francisco", "source": "House of Heat°", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.922617"}], "authors": ["Ali Albaqshi"], "summary": "Gap and Sushi Club co-hosted an exclusive Super Bowl weekend dinner in San Francisco, marking Sushi Club''s Bay Area debut and their first collaboration. The event featured a seven-course omakase by Nobu Matsuhisa and a performance by Sienna Spiro, coinciding with the launch of a limited-edition Gap x Sushi Club apparel collection. This gathering brought together figures from entertainment, sports, and fashion, celebrating the fusion of these industries.", "banner_image": "https://cdn.sanity.io/images/pu5wtzfc/production/b2d3139776e5a998e0330afb50a479bf3608dd64