	 (2917,'alpha_vantage','HD','HD','2026-02-10 14:34:41','20260210T143441','Earnings call transcript: Masco Q4 2025 beats EPS, stock surges 7.7%','https://www.investing.com/news/transcripts/earnings-call-transcript-masco-q4-2025-beats-eps-stock-surges-77-93CH-4496897','Masco Corporation (MAS) reported Q4 2025 earnings per share of $0.82, exceeding analysts'' expectations by 3.8%, despite revenue falling short by 1.65%. The stock responded positively, surging 7.69% in premarket trading. The company provided a 2026 outlook of flat to low single-digit sales growth, with anticipated operating margin expansion to 17%, and announced an increased dividend and a new $2 billion share repurchase program.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/world_news_2_69x52._800x533_L_1419494365.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.921551"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.811775"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.647971"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "relevance_score": "0.612790"}, {"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.610128"}]',0.218499,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "MAS", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.396960"}, {"ticker": "HD", "relevance_score": "0.687227", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.211578"}, {"ticker": "LOW", "relevance_score": "0.547222", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.036959"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/transcripts/earnings-call-transcript-masco-q4-2025-beats-eps-stock-surges-77-93CH-4496897", "title": "Earnings call transcript: Masco Q4 2025 beats EPS, stock surges 7.7%", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.921551"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.811775"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.647971"}, {"topic": "manufacturing", "rel