	 (2921,'alpha_vantage','HD','HD','2026-02-10 11:28:08','20260210T112808','LiveWire (NYSE: LVWR) narrows 2025 losses, adds $75M loan and guides 2026','https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/LVWR/8-k-live-wire-group-inc-reports-material-event-0754593a24e8.html','LiveWire Group, Inc. reported its 2025 financial results, showing narrower losses and improved cash flow, despite remaining unprofitable. The company secured a $75 million related-party convertible term loan and issued $2.2 million in shares to boost liquidity. LiveWire also provided 2026 guidance, projecting an operating loss of $70-$80 million, and announced continued development of the S4 Honcho, targeting production in Spring 2026.',NULL,'Stock Titan','General','Stock Titan','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.943654"}]',0.087399,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "LVWR", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.121887"}, {"ticker": "HD", "relevance_score": "0.592232", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.015307"}]','{"url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/LVWR/8-k-live-wire-group-inc-reports-material-event-0754593a24e8.html", "title": "LiveWire (NYSE: LVWR) narrows 2025 losses, adds $75M loan and guides 2026", "source": "Stock Titan", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.943654"}], "authors": [], "summary": "LiveWire Group, Inc. reported its 2025 financial results, showing narrower losses and improved cash flow, despite remaining unprofitable. The company secured a $75 million related-party convertible term loan and issued $2.2 million in shares to boost liquidity. LiveWire also provided 2026 guidance, projecting an operating loss of $70-$80 million, and announced continued development of the S4 Honcho, targeting production in Spring 2026.", "banner_image": null, "source_domain": "Stock Titan", "time_published": "20260210T112808", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "LVWR", "relevance_score": "1.00000