	 (2924,'alpha_vantage','HD','HD','2026-02-10 02:02:34','20260210T020234','House Overwhelmingly Passes Bipartisan Housing Bill To Tackle Affordability Crisis, Push Localities To Build More Homes','https://www.benzinga.com/news/politics/26/02/50499858/house-overwhelmingly-passes-bipartisan-housing-bill-to-tackle-affordability-crisis-push-localities-to-build-more-homes','The House of Representatives overwhelmingly passed the Housing for the 21st Century Act with a 390-9 vote, aiming to alleviate the nation''s housing affordability crisis. The bipartisan bill encourages states and cities to construct more homes and reduce building hurdles. While the legislation moves to the Senate for further shaping, key housing stocks showed minimal movement following its passage.','https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/02/09/US-Capitol-Lights-North-Side-Illuminated.jpeg?quality=85&auto=webp&width=850','Benzinga','General','Benzinga','[{"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.915790"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.824043"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.626639"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.610770"}]',0.030492,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "HD", "relevance_score": "0.982353", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.118663"}, {"ticker": "LOW", "relevance_score": "0.693760", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.148394"}]','{"url": "https://www.benzinga.com/news/politics/26/02/50499858/house-overwhelmingly-passes-bipartisan-housing-bill-to-tackle-affordability-crisis-push-localities-to-build-more-homes", "title": "House Overwhelmingly Passes Bipartisan Housing Bill To Tackle Affordability Crisis, Push Localities To Build More Homes", "source": "Benzinga", "topics": [{"topic": "real_estate", "relevance_score": "0.915790"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.824043"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.626639"}, {"topic": "r