	 (2932,'alpha_vantage','KMB','KMB','2026-02-09 23:58:29','20260209T235829','Kenvue (KVUE) stock price holds near $18 after hours as Feb. 17 results, deal timeline come into focus','https://ts2.tech/en/kenvue-kvue-stock-price-holds-near-18-after-hours-as-feb-17-results-deal-timeline-come-into-focus/','Kenvue (KVUE) stock saw a slight increase after hours, holding near $18 as investors anticipate its Q4 and full-year 2025 earnings report on Feb. 17. The company will forgo its usual conference call due to an ongoing acquisition by Kimberly-Clark, which investors approved on January 29th and is expected to close in the second half of 2026. Despite positive market trends, Kenvue''s stock remained stable, with analysts focusing on the deal''s progression amidst concerns about litigation and potential financial performance issues.','https://ts2.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/kenvue-kvue-stock-price-holds-near-18-after-hours-as-feb-17-results-deal-timeline-come-into-focus-featured.jpg','TechStock²','General','TechStock²','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.908841"}, {"topic": "mergers_and_acquisitions", "relevance_score": "0.800164"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.733895"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.640958"}]',0.081415,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KVUE", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.095914"}, {"ticker": "KMB", "relevance_score": "0.622642", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.112616"}, {"ticker": "JNJ", "relevance_score": "0.574608", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.039346"}, {"ticker": "PG", "relevance_score": "0.594548", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.037516"}]','{"url": "https://ts2.tech/en/kenvue-kvue-stock-price-holds-near-18-after-hours-as-feb-17-results-deal-timeline-come-into-focus/", "title": "Kenvue (KVUE) stock price holds near $18 after hours as F