	 (2937,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-10 13:56:31','20260210T135631','Coca-Cola demand rises in fourth quarter despite higher prices but outlook sinks shares','https://www.wral.com/news/ap/788cb-coca-cola-demand-rises-in-fourth-quarter-despite-higher-prices-but-outlook-sinks-shares/','Coca-Cola experienced stronger demand in the fourth quarter, with global unit case volumes growing 1%, primarily in the U.S., Japan, and Brazil, despite price increases. While revenue increased 2% to $11.8 billion, it fell short of Wall Street''s expectations, and the company''s 2026 organic revenue growth outlook of 4% to 5% was also below analyst forecasts, causing shares to drop. The company noted a consumer divergence, with higher-income buyers gravitating towards premium brands and mini cans being introduced to make products more affordable for others.','https://images.wral.com/dcc7cdf0-5cd6-5229-92d6-69ef18f3f4d5?w=1200&h=675&f=jpg','WRAL','General','WRAL','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.942548"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.800055"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.745725"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.626435"}]',-0.119277,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.986363", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.113961"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.554813", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.062125"}]','{"url": "https://www.wral.com/news/ap/788cb-coca-cola-demand-rises-in-fourth-quarter-despite-higher-prices-but-outlook-sinks-shares/", "title": "Coca-Cola demand rises in fourth quarter despite higher prices but outlook sinks shares", "source": "WRAL", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.942548"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.800055"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.745725"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.626435"}], "authors": ["DEE-AN