	 (2939,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-10 12:37:34','20260210T123734','Incyte (NASDAQ:INCY) Surprises With Q4 CY2025 Sales','http://markets.chroniclejournal.com/chroniclejournal/article/stockstory-2026-2-10-incyte-nasdaqincy-surprises-with-q4-cy2025-sales','Incyte Corporation (NASDAQ: INCY) reported Q4 CY2025 revenue of $1.51 billion, significantly exceeding Wall Street''s estimates by 11.4% and representing a 27.8% year-on-year growth. Despite the strong revenue performance, the company''s non-GAAP profit of $1.80 per share missed analyst consensus estimates by 6.1%. Shares traded down 3.8% immediately after the report, indicating that investors were hoping for even stronger results, particularly concerning profitability.','https://news-assets.stockstory.org/cover-images/_1400x700_crop_center-center_none/incyte-corporation-cover-image-1ae5896fbc27_2024-12-17-093248_rhtv.jpeg','The Chronicle-Journal','General','The Chronicle-Journal','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.908628"}, {"topic": "life_sciences", "relevance_score": "0.823637"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.607392"}]',0.120173,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "INCY", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.191713"}, {"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.524836", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.136761"}, {"ticker": "MNST", "relevance_score": "0.533877", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.131539"}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "relevance_score": "0.543976", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.148935"}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "relevance_score": "0.512490", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.144217"}]','{"url": "http://markets.chroniclejournal.com/chroniclejournal/article/stockstory-2026-2-10-incyte-nasdaqincy-surprises-with-q4-cy2025-sales", "title": "Incyte (NASDAQ:INCY) Surprises With Q4 CY2025 Sales", "s