	 (2940,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-10 12:28:11','20260210T122811','Coca-Cola Revenue Rises on Higher Volume, Prices','https://www.wsj.com/business/retail/coca-cola-revenue-rises-on-higher-volume-prices-3f88d004?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqfPfYNqb08o8iEeQGC3bwToYNYDQ24Vir2-ShNed5XWnjCTfArjr9zm&gaa_ts=698b2e28&gaa_sig=esDXIBiW3VxK-rqkMoE8RUTdvjsqUk8ZzgmOhhXdw7-oqchdqZZARQHMHPXIKd7I6PdAKCgiZw-om0kG-G2EnQ%3D%3D','Coca-Cola announced higher fourth-quarter revenue, driven by increased prices and sales volume. Despite this, the company''s quarterly revenue fell short of Wall Street estimates, causing its stock to drop in premarket trading. Coca-Cola also forecast organic revenue growth of 4% to 5% through 2026.','https://images.wsj.net/im-44150676?width=700&height=466','The Wall Street Journal','General','The Wall Street Journal','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.904888"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.814382"}]',-0.212553,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.221914"}]','{"url": "https://www.wsj.com/business/retail/coca-cola-revenue-rises-on-higher-volume-prices-3f88d004?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqfPfYNqb08o8iEeQGC3bwToYNYDQ24Vir2-ShNed5XWnjCTfArjr9zm&gaa_ts=698b2e28&gaa_sig=esDXIBiW3VxK-rqkMoE8RUTdvjsqUk8ZzgmOhhXdw7-oqchdqZZARQHMHPXIKd7I6PdAKCgiZw-om0kG-G2EnQ%3D%3D", "title": "Coca-Cola Revenue Rises on Higher Volume, Prices", "source": "The Wall Street Journal", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.904888"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.814382"}], "authors": ["Nicholas G. Miller"], "summary": "Coca-Cola announced higher fourth-quarter revenue, driven by increased prices and sales volume. Despite this, the company''s quarterly revenue fell short of Wall Street estimates, causing its stock to drop in premarket trading. Coca-Cola also forecast organic revenue growth of 4% to 5% through 2026.",