	 (2942,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-10 12:01:00','20260210T120100','Coca-Cola misses revenue expectations on weak N. America demand','https://www.reuters.com/business/coca-cola-misses-fourth-quarter-revenue-expectations-2026-02-10/','Coca-Cola missed Wall Street''s fourth-quarter revenue expectations and projected modest growth for 2026, primarily due to softened demand for its sodas in North America and Asia. The company''s shares fell approximately 3% in premarket trading. This comes as Coca-Cola has increased beverage prices to counter rising input costs, while rival PepsiCo recently announced price cuts on snacks.','https://www.reuters.com/resizer/v2/ANDLGUTHIJINDDX5HAWVSYLL4I.jpg?auth=4da6bdd65eda8013281f785b595a48ee5126ef515bd31b757183bc4a8145191e&width=1920&quality=80','Reuters','General','Reuters','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.947018"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.842301"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.733866"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.747297"}]',-0.306552,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.433431"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.721985", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.233760"}]','{"url": "https://www.reuters.com/business/coca-cola-misses-fourth-quarter-revenue-expectations-2026-02-10/", "title": "Coca-Cola misses revenue expectations on weak N. America demand", "source": "Reuters", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.947018"}, {"topic": "economy_monetary", "relevance_score": "0.842301"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.733866"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.747297"}], "authors": ["Reuters", "Juveria Tabassum", "Angela Christy"], "summary": "Coca-Cola missed Wall Street''s fourth-quarter revenue expectations and projected modest growth for 2026, primaril