	 (2944,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-10 11:57:37','20260210T115737','Coca-Cola Reports Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Results','https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260210415728/en/Coca-Cola-Reports-Fourth-Quarter-and-Full-Year-2025-Results','The Coca-Cola Company announced its fourth-quarter and full-year 2025 financial results, with full-year net revenues growing 2% and organic revenues growing 5%. The company achieved a 23% increase in full-year EPS to $3.04 and provided a 2026 financial outlook projecting organic revenue growth of 4% to 5%. CEO James Quincey highlighted resilience and momentum, emphasizing a continued focus on strategic execution for long-term success.','https://mms.businesswire.com/media/20260210415728/en/2715838/4/Coca-Cola_Q4_2025_Earnings_Release_Full_Release_2.10.26.jpg','Business Wire','General','Business Wire','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.945829"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.715707"}]',0.41761,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.389333"}]','{"url": "https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260210415728/en/Coca-Cola-Reports-Fourth-Quarter-and-Full-Year-2025-Results", "title": "Coca-Cola Reports Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Results", "source": "Business Wire", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.945829"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.715707"}], "authors": [], "summary": "The Coca-Cola Company announced its fourth-quarter and full-year 2025 financial results, with full-year net revenues growing 2% and organic revenues growing 5%. The company achieved a 23% increase in full-year EPS to $3.04 and provided a 2026 financial outlook projecting organic revenue growth of 4% to 5%. CEO James Quincey highlighted resilience and momentum, emphasizing a continued focus on strategic execution for long-term success.", "banner_image": "https://mms.businesswire.com/med