	 (2949,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-10 07:10:00','20260210T071000','Coca-Cola falls after organic sales guidance disappoints; Pepsico also lower (KO:NYSE)','https://seekingalpha.com/news/4549402-coca-cola-falls-after-organic-sales-guidance-disappoints-pepsico-also-lower','The Coca-Cola Company (KO) saw its stock decline after its fourth-quarter earnings report, where revenue increased by 2.2% year-over-year but missed consensus estimates. The company''s organic revenue growth was attributed to gains in Latin America and EMEA, with volume growth primarily in Brazil, the U.S., and Japan. Coca-Cola provided guidance for future organic sales growth of 4–5% and EPS growth of 7–8%, which appeared to disappoint investors.','https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247373180/image_2247373180.jpg?io=getty-c-w630','Seeking Alpha','General','Seeking Alpha','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.917127"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.710354"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.616069"}]',-0.309363,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.404412"}, {"ticker": "PEP", "relevance_score": "0.746091", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.413990"}, {"ticker": "KDP", "relevance_score": "0.648705", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.109229"}]','{"url": "https://seekingalpha.com/news/4549402-coca-cola-falls-after-organic-sales-guidance-disappoints-pepsico-also-lower", "title": "Coca-Cola falls after organic sales guidance disappoints; Pepsico also lower (KO:NYSE)", "source": "Seeking Alpha", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.917127"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.710354"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.616069"}], "authors": ["Clark Schultz"], "summary": "The Coca-Cola Company (KO) saw its stoc