	 (2960,'alpha_vantage','KO','KO','2026-02-09 20:02:52','20260209T200252','Coca-Cola under fire as customers allege serious product issue: ''Surprises to discover''','https://www.yahoo.com/news/articles/coca-cola-under-fire-customers-200000064.html','Coca-Cola is facing potential legal action from an Italian nonprofit, Codacons, due to customer complaints about incomplete holiday-themed Advent calendars. Consumers reported missing items from calendars advertised to contain "24 surprises," leading to concerns about waste, misleading advertising, and the company''s environmental impact. Codacons has requested remedies from Coca-Cola, including refunds or replacements, and plans to escalate the issue with the Antitrust Authority and a class-action lawsuit if their demands are not met.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/pcdFXNav39Nr8QompMPUJw--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGhsYW5kZXJ0O3c9MTI0MjtoPTY5OTtjZj13ZWJwCg--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/the_cool_down_737/0c010541a8e15248735e4c91b94e91a9','Yahoo','General','Yahoo','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.828103"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.643795"}]',-0.329772,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "KO", "relevance_score": "0.988791", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.325502"}]','{"url": "https://www.yahoo.com/news/articles/coca-cola-under-fire-customers-200000064.html", "title": "Coca-Cola under fire as customers allege serious product issue: ''Surprises to discover''", "source": "Yahoo", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.828103"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.643795"}], "authors": ["Audrey Brewer"], "summary": "Coca-Cola is facing potential legal action from an Italian nonprofit, Codacons, due to customer complaints about incomplete holiday-themed Advent calendars. Consumers reported missing items from calendars advertised to contain \\"24 surprises,\\" leading to concerns about waste, misleading advertising, and the comp