	 (2973,'alpha_vantage','KR','KR','2026-02-09 18:24:14','20260209T182414','Six things we know about new Kroger CEO Greg Foran','https://www.cincinnati.com/story/money/2026/02/09/who-is-new-kroger-ceo-greg-foran/88591548007/','Kroger has appointed Greg Foran, former head of Walmart’s U.S. stores, as its new CEO, marking the first time the company has hired an outside leader and one born outside the U.S. Originally from New Zealand, Foran previously led Air New Zealand and spent three decades at Woolworths before joining Walmart, where he was credited with revitalizing U.S. sales. Industry observers recognize him for his focus on stores and customers, and he will now compete directly with his former employer.','https://www.gannett-cdn.com/authoring/authoring-images/2026/02/09/PCIN/88582992007-20151112-t-120000-z-1802165658-gf-20000055663-rtrmadp-3-usawalmart.JPG?crop=2559,1920,x0,y576?width=320&height=240','Cincinnati Enquirer','General','Cincinnati Enquirer','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.910218"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.609234"}]',0.241896,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "KR", "relevance_score": "0.972435", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.319925"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.856264", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.111738"}]','{"url": "https://www.cincinnati.com/story/money/2026/02/09/who-is-new-kroger-ceo-greg-foran/88591548007/", "title": "Six things we know about new Kroger CEO Greg Foran", "source": "Cincinnati Enquirer", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.910218"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.609234"}], "authors": ["Alexander Coolidge"], "summary": "Kroger has appointed Greg Foran, former head of Walmart’s U.S. stores, as its new CEO, marking the first time the company has hired an outside leader and one born outside the U.S. Originally from New Zealand, Foran previously led Air New Zea