	 (2992,'alpha_vantage','NKE','NKE','2026-02-10 12:31:31','20260210T123131','Target appoints Lisa Roath as COO, Rick Gomez to step down as CCO','https://www.investing.com/news/sec-filings/target-appoints-lisa-roath-as-coo-rick-gomez-to-step-down-as-cco-93CH-4496261','Target Corporation has announced that Lisa Roath will take on the role of Executive Vice President and Chief Operating Officer starting February 15, bringing extensive experience from her previous positions within the company. Concurrently, Rick Gomez, the current Executive Vice President and Chief Commercial Officer, will be stepping down from his role on the same date, transitioning to an advisory position before his departure in April. These leadership changes are part of broader executive and board adjustments at Target, which also include a new CEO appointment and board members, amid increased competition and a focus on long-term growth.','https://i-invdn-com.investing.com/news/news_pile_69x52._800x533_L_1419494209.jpg','Investing.com','General','Investing.com','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.826618"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.712366"}]',0.177673,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.228830"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.613140", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.196747"}, {"ticker": "NKE", "relevance_score": "0.555902", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.104702"}]','{"url": "https://www.investing.com/news/sec-filings/target-appoints-lisa-roath-as-coo-rick-gomez-to-step-down-as-cco-93CH-4496261", "title": "Target appoints Lisa Roath as COO, Rick Gomez to step down as CCO", "source": "Investing.com", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.826618"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.712366"}], "authors": ["Investing.com"], "summary": "Target