	 (2998,'alpha_vantage','PDD','PDD','2026-02-10 13:58:18','20260210T135818','Here''s What Citi Thinks About PDD Holdings Inc. (PDD)','https://finviz.com/news/305298/heres-what-citi-thinks-about-pdd-holdings-inc-pdd','Citi has adjusted its price target for PDD Holdings Inc. (PDD) to $142 from $170, maintaining a Neutral rating, due to slowing domestic retail sales and increased expenses expected in 2026. The firm also previously noted a "smaller-than-feared" fine from the Shanghai tax authority and issued a "downside 30-day catalyst watch" due to a deepening investigation by Chinese regulators. PDD Holdings operates Pinduoduo and Temu, and Citi suggests a formal announcement of the investigation could lead to further share downside.','https://d2gr5kl7dt2z3t.cloudfront.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/20164709/PDD-insidermonkey-1695242826339.jpg','Finviz','General','Finviz','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.911142"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.810337"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.649965"}]',-0.267846,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "PDD", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.263566"}]','{"url": "https://finviz.com/news/305298/heres-what-citi-thinks-about-pdd-holdings-inc-pdd", "title": "Here''s What Citi Thinks About PDD Holdings Inc. (PDD)", "source": "Finviz", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.911142"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.810337"}, {"topic": "economy_fiscal", "relevance_score": "0.649965"}], "authors": ["Noor Ul Ain Rehman"], "summary": "Citi has adjusted its price target for PDD Holdings Inc. (PDD) to $142 from $170, maintaining a Neutral rating, due to slowing domestic retail sales and increased expenses expected in 2026. The firm also previously noted a \\"smaller-than-feared\\" fine from the Shanghai tax authority and issued a \\"downside 30-day catalyst watch\\" due to a deep