	 (3046,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-10 16:26:54','20260210T162654','Walmart''s Next-Gen Stores Highlight Its Long-Term Retail Vision','https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/COST/pressreleases/134935/walmarts-next-gen-stores-highlight-its-long-term-retail-vision/','Walmart''s new Supercenter in Jacksonville, FL, showcases its long-term retail strategy, blending digital convenience with an enhanced in-store experience. The company plans to build or convert over 150 stores, emphasizing physical locations for pickup and delivery, and improving customer experience through open layouts and expanded assortments. This omnichannel approach reinforces the importance of Walmart''s physical footprint within its broader retail and logistics strategy.','https://staticx-tuner.zacks.com/images/articles/main/26/123.jpg','The Globe and Mail','General','The Globe and Mail','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.912065"}]',0.053488,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.984012", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.388180"}, {"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "0.620617", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.274811"}, {"ticker": "COST", "relevance_score": "0.587399", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.148736"}]','{"url": "https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/COST/pressreleases/134935/walmarts-next-gen-stores-highlight-its-long-term-retail-vision/", "title": "Walmart''s Next-Gen Stores Highlight Its Long-Term Retail Vision", "source": "The Globe and Mail", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.912065"}], "authors": ["Zacks Investment Research"], "summary": "Walmart''s new Supercenter in Jacksonville, FL, showcases its long-term retail strategy, blending digital convenience with an enhanced in-store experience. The company plans to build or convert over 150 stores, emphasizing physical loc