	 (3059,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-10 13:02:54','20260210T130254','Target CEO reshapes his leadership team in first big move since taking over this month','https://www.mprnews.org/story/2026/02/10/target-ceo-reshapes-leadership-team-first-big-move-since-taking-over','Target''s new CEO has initiated a significant restructuring of his leadership team, marking his first major action since assuming the top role this month. This move aims to reshape the company''s executive structure. The Minneapolis-based retailer announced these changes on Tuesday.','https://img.apmcdn.org/4963aee22d7ab98e5b7606a04d94d8033a1376d5/uncropped/5bfc87-20251027-target-corporation-1-600.jpg','MPR News','General','MPR News','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.844189"}]',0.12658,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.103791"}]','{"url": "https://www.mprnews.org/story/2026/02/10/target-ceo-reshapes-leadership-team-first-big-move-since-taking-over", "title": "Target CEO reshapes his leadership team in first big move since taking over this month", "source": "MPR News", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.844189"}], "authors": ["The Associated Press"], "summary": "Target''s new CEO has initiated a significant restructuring of his leadership team, marking his first major action since assuming the top role this month. This move aims to reshape the company''s executive structure. The Minneapolis-based retailer announced these changes on Tuesday.", "banner_image": "https://img.apmcdn.org/4963aee22d7ab98e5b7606a04d94d8033a1376d5/uncropped/5bfc87-20251027-target-corporation-1-600.jpg", "source_domain": "MPR News", "time_published": "20260210T130254", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.103791"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Neutr