	 (3065,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-10 12:02:52','20260210T120252','Target Announces Executive Leadership Changes to Accelerate Growth, Confirms Q4 Financial Guidance','https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/target-announces-executive-leadership-changes-to-accelerate-growth-confirms-q4-financial-guidance-302683451.html','Target Corporation has announced executive leadership changes to accelerate growth and strengthen merchandising and guest experience, effective February 15, 2026. Michael Fiddelke, the new CEO, appointed Cara Sylvester as Chief Merchandising Officer and Lisa Roath as Chief Operating Officer. The company also confirmed its Q4 2025 financial guidance is in line with prior expectations.','https://www.prnewswire.com/content/dam/prnewswire/homepage/prn_cision_logo_desktop.png','PR Newswire','General','PR Newswire','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.942608"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}]',0.422503,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.406794"}]','{"url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/target-announces-executive-leadership-changes-to-accelerate-growth-confirms-q4-financial-guidance-302683451.html", "title": "Target Announces Executive Leadership Changes to Accelerate Growth, Confirms Q4 Financial Guidance", "source": "PR Newswire", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.942608"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Target Corporation has announced executive leadership changes to accelerate growth and strengthen merchandising and guest experience, effective February 15, 2026. Michael Fiddelke, the new CEO, appointed Cara Sylvester as Chief Merchandising Officer and Lisa Roath as Chief Operating Officer. The company also confirmed its Q4 2025 financial guidance is in line with prior expectations.", "banner_image": "https://www.prnewswire