	 (3068,'alpha_vantage','TGT','TGT','2026-02-10 04:09:55','20260210T040955','Target job cuts signal renewed focus on physical stores','https://www.retail-insight-network.com/news/target-job-cuts-signal-renewed-focus-on-physical-stores/','Target has announced plans to cut approximately 500 corporate, regional, and supply chain roles to reallocate resources towards frontline staffing and store operations. This strategic shift aims to strengthen the performance of physical stores by investing in more scheduled hours for shop-floor staff and enhanced training. The move comes amid pressure on margins and increasing customer expectations, signaling a pivot towards a more store-centric operating model to improve customer service and sales conversion.','https://www.retail-insight-network.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/18/2026/02/Target-430x241.jpg','Retail Insight Network','General','Retail Insight Network','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.601836"}]',-0.102425,'Neutral','[{"ticker": "TGT", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.127846"}, {"ticker": "WMT", "relevance_score": "0.619783", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.144220"}]','{"url": "https://www.retail-insight-network.com/news/target-job-cuts-signal-renewed-focus-on-physical-stores/", "title": "Target job cuts signal renewed focus on physical stores", "source": "Retail Insight Network", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.601836"}], "authors": ["Mohamed Dabo"], "summary": "Target has announced plans to cut approximately 500 corporate, regional, and supply chain roles to reallocate resources towards frontline staffing and store operations. This strategic shift aims to strengthen the performance of physical stores by investing in more scheduled hours for shop-floor sta