	 (3097,'alpha_vantage','TSCO','TSCO','2026-02-10 00:28:56','20260210T002856','A Look At Tractor Supply (TSCO) Valuation After 2025 Results And 2026 Growth Guidance','https://www.sahmcapital.com/news/content/a-look-at-tractor-supply-tsco-valuation-after-2025-results-and-2026-growth-guidance-2026-02-05','Tractor Supply (TSCO) is under investor scrutiny after releasing its 2025 results and providing 2026 growth guidance, which has driven recent stock price increases. While a narrative fair value suggests the company is 4% undervalued at $57.59, a discounted cash flow (DCF) model indicates a lower value of $34.08, highlighting a discrepancy in valuation perspectives. Investors are advised to consider various factors like transaction growth, strategic initiatives, and potential challenges like softer comparable store sales.','https://images.simplywall.st/company/14cd1f16-7021-46c1-8947-54374597c95f/chart/dcf','Sahm','General','Sahm','[{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932661"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.809117"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.711501"}]',0.27856,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "TSCO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.252987"}]','{"url": "https://www.sahmcapital.com/news/content/a-look-at-tractor-supply-tsco-valuation-after-2025-results-and-2026-growth-guidance-2026-02-05", "title": "A Look At Tractor Supply (TSCO) Valuation After 2025 Results And 2026 Growth Guidance", "source": "Sahm", "topics": [{"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.932661"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.809117"}, {"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.711501"}], "authors": ["Simply Wall St"], "summary": "Tractor Supply (TSCO) is under investor scrutiny after releasing its 2025 results and providing 2026 growth guidance, which has driven recent stock price increases. While a narrative fair value suggests the compa