	 (3102,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-10 02:00:05','20260210T020005','Victoria''s Secret CEO says Gen Z didn''t grow up with 2000s body image baggage','https://fortune.com/2026/02/09/victorias-secret-ceo-body-image-fashion-show/','Victoria''s Secret CEO Hillary Super believes Gen Z''s body positivity, rather than the "heroin chic" era, is key to the brand''s revived fashion show. Super suggests that younger shoppers embrace the glamour without the body image trauma experienced by previous generations, seeing the Angels as fun rather than solely aspirational. This shift in attitude is central to Victoria''s Secret''s comeback strategy, which includes a more inclusive runway featuring pregnant models, older Angels, curve models, and athletes.','https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/GettyImages-2241361605-e1770405092313.jpg?format=webp&w=1440&q=100','Fortune','General','Fortune','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.934874"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.623636"}]',0.230727,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "VSCO", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.346114"}, {"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "0.629064", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Neutral", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.118399"}]','{"url": "https://fortune.com/2026/02/09/victorias-secret-ceo-body-image-fashion-show/", "title": "Victoria''s Secret CEO says Gen Z didn''t grow up with 2000s body image baggage", "source": "Fortune", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.934874"}, {"topic": "economy_macro", "relevance_score": "0.623636"}], "authors": ["Emma Hinchliffe"], "summary": "Victoria''s Secret CEO Hillary Super believes Gen Z''s body positivity, rather than the \\"heroin chic\\" era, is key to the brand''s revived fashion show. Super suggests that younger shoppers embrace the glamour without the body image trauma experienced by previous generations, seeing 