	 (3103,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-10 01:45:03','20260210T014503','Las Vegas Woman Charged With Grand Theft at Irvine Ulta Store','https://mynewsla.com/crime/2026/02/09/las-vegas-woman-charged-with-grand-theft-at-irvine-ulta-store/','A Las Vegas woman, Jasele Alicia Villanueva, has been charged with felony grand theft for allegedly stealing over $2,000 in merchandise from an Ulta beauty store in Irvine. Police also suspect her of being responsible for more than $60,000 in thefts from Ulta stores across Nevada and Arizona, where active extradition warrants exist for similar cases. Villanueva was arrested in Corona and has pleaded not guilty to the Irvine charge.',NULL,'MyNewsLA.com','General','MyNewsLA.com','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.928486"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.639339"}]',-0.320074,'Somewhat-Bearish','[{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "0.939744", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bearish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "-0.337714"}]','{"url": "https://mynewsla.com/crime/2026/02/09/las-vegas-woman-charged-with-grand-theft-at-irvine-ulta-store/", "title": "Las Vegas Woman Charged With Grand Theft at Irvine Ulta Store", "source": "MyNewsLA.com", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.928486"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.639339"}], "authors": ["Contributing Editor"], "summary": "A Las Vegas woman, Jasele Alicia Villanueva, has been charged with felony grand theft for allegedly stealing over $2,000 in merchandise from an Ulta beauty store in Irvine. Police also suspect her of being responsible for more than $60,000 in thefts from Ulta stores across Nevada and Arizona, where active extradition warrants exist for similar cases. Villanueva was arrested in Corona and has pleaded not guilty to the Irvine charge.", "banner_image": null, "source_domain": "MyNewsLA.com", "time_published": "20260210T014503", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "0.939744