	 (3108,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-09 18:28:48','20260209T182848','Made by Mitchell gets key US deal with Ulta Beauty','https://us.fashionnetwork.com/news/Made-by-mitchell-gets-key-us-deal-with-ulta-beauty,1805908.html','UK-based beauty brand Made by Mitchell has secured a significant retail partnership with Ulta Beauty, marking its major debut in the US market across over 1,350 stores. This expansion follows the brand''s success on TikTok Shop, where it achieved over $1 million in sales within a year, and builds on its existing international presence in retailers like Boots and Priceline. The move signifies a growing confidence from major US retailers in online-born challenger brands and bolsters Made by Mitchell''s position as a global player.','https://media.fashionnetwork.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=contain,width=1000,height=1000,format=auto/m/d253/cf32/954a/e934/8f90/3ab4/4181/3d30/1c58/05b9/05b9.jpeg','FashionNetwork USA','General','FashionNetwork USA','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}]',0.482193,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.492690"}]','{"url": "https://us.fashionnetwork.com/news/Made-by-mitchell-gets-key-us-deal-with-ulta-beauty,1805908.html", "title": "Made by Mitchell gets key US deal with Ulta Beauty", "source": "FashionNetwork USA", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}], "authors": ["Nigel TAYLOR"], "summary": "UK-based beauty brand Made by Mitchell has secured a significant retail partnership with Ulta Beauty, marking its major debut in the US market across over 1,350 stores. This expansion follows the brand''s success on TikTok Shop, where it achieved over $1 million in sales within a year, and builds on its existing international presence in retailers like Boots and Priceline. The move signifies a growing confidence from major US retailers in online-born challenger brands and bolsters Made by Mitchell''s position as a global player.", "banner_image": "https://media.fashionnetwork.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=contain,width=1000,height=1000,format=auto/m/d253/cf32/954a/e934/8f90/3ab4/4181/3d30/1c58/05b9/05b9.jpeg", "source_domain": "FashionNetwork USA", "time_published": "20260209T182848", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.492690"}], "category_within_source": "General", "overall_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "overall_sentiment_score": 0.482193}','2026-02-10 17:22:09',NULL),
	 (3109,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-09 17:58:41','20260209T175841','Luna Bronze Makes U.S. Retail Debut Through Launch at Ulta Beauty','https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/luna-bronze-makes-us-retail-debut-through-launch-at-ulta-beauty-302682793.html','Luna Bronze, an Australian sunless tanning brand focused on skin health, has launched its products at Ulta Beauty stores nationwide and on Ulta.com. This partnership marks Luna Bronze''s significant entry into the U.S. retail market, offering a curated selection of its bestselling skin-first self-tanning solutions. The collaboration aims to make healthier alternatives to UV exposure more accessible to a wider audience, aligning with Ulta Beauty''s commitment to self-care and global beauty trends.',NULL,'PR Newswire','General','PR Newswire','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.908841"}]',0.422303,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.442451"}]','{"url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/luna-bronze-makes-us-retail-debut-through-launch-at-ulta-beauty-302682793.html", "title": "Luna Bronze Makes U.S. Retail Debut Through Launch at Ulta Beauty", "source": "PR Newswire", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.908841"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Luna Bronze, an Australian sunless tanning brand focused on skin health, has launched its products at Ulta Beauty stores nationwide and on Ulta.com. This partnership marks Luna Bronze''s significant entry into the U.S. retail market, offering a curated selection of its bestselling skin-first self-tanning solutions. The collaboration aims to make healthier alternatives to UV exposure more accessible to a wider audience, aligning with Ulta Beauty''s commitment to self-care and global beauty trends.", "banner_image": null, "source_domain": "PR Newswire", "time_published": "20260209T175841", "ticker_sentiment": [{"ticker": "ULTA", "