	 (3110,'alpha_vantage','ULTA','ULTA','2026-02-09 17:35:32','20260209T173532','Luna Bronze Makes U.S. Retail Debut Through Launch at Ulta Beauty','https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/luna-bronze-makes-u-retail-173300992.html','Australian sunless tanning brand Luna Bronze has announced its first major U.S. retail partnership with Ulta Beauty, marking a significant step in its global expansion. Founded by Rhiannon Hall and Maddy Balderson, the brand is known for its skin-first approach to self-tanning, offering safer alternatives to UV exposure. Ulta Beauty will feature 15 of Luna Bronze''s bestselling products, reflecting a growing consumer interest in sun care and self-tan for beauty and wellness.','https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/1bWIEWlXOem2qYMyuFcRnw--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjt3PTQyMDtoPTYyOQ--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/prnewswire.com/451b411c41f13da366ce0a98ff0c2477','Yahoo Finance Singapore','General','Yahoo Finance Singapore','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}]',0.721703,'Bullish','[{"ticker": "ULTA", "relevance_score": "1.000000", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.714776"}]','{"url": "https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/luna-bronze-makes-u-retail-173300992.html", "title": "Luna Bronze Makes U.S. Retail Debut Through Launch at Ulta Beauty", "source": "Yahoo Finance Singapore", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "1.000000"}], "authors": [], "summary": "Australian sunless tanning brand Luna Bronze has announced its first major U.S. retail partnership with Ulta Beauty, marking a significant step in its global expansion. Founded by Rhiannon Hall and Maddy Balderson, the brand is known for its skin-first approach to self-tanning, offering safer alternatives to UV exposure. Ulta Beauty will feature 15 of Luna Bronze''s bestselling products, reflecting a growing consumer interest in sun care and self-tan for beauty and wellness.", "banner_image": "https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/1bWIE