	 (3111,'alpha_vantage','URBN','URBN','2026-02-09 23:29:30','20260209T232930','Did Strong Comp Sales and Buybacks Just Shift Urban Outfitters'' (URBN) Investment Narrative?','https://www.sahmcapital.com/news/content/did-strong-comp-sales-and-buybacks-just-shift-urban-outfitters-urbn-investment-narrative-2026-02-08','Urban Outfitters (URBN) reported strong comparable store sales growth of 4.6% over the past two years, with share repurchases contributing significantly to a 41.8% annual EPS growth. This performance bolsters the investment narrative, suggesting genuine demand and potential re-rating despite modest analyst growth expectations. The article highlights the importance of sustained in-store productivity and capital allocation, while also acknowledging execution risk and fashion cyclicality.','https://images.simplywall.st/company/4c1d2674-955d-41cc-b4c3-63cec8cd1bbe/chart/quote-price','Sahm','General','Sahm','[{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.943214"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.809602"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.739256"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.620253"}]',0.333608,'Somewhat-Bullish','[{"ticker": "URBN", "relevance_score": "0.987671", "ticker_sentiment_label": "Somewhat-Bullish", "ticker_sentiment_score": "0.344079"}]','{"url": "https://www.sahmcapital.com/news/content/did-strong-comp-sales-and-buybacks-just-shift-urban-outfitters-urbn-investment-narrative-2026-02-08", "title": "Did Strong Comp Sales and Buybacks Just Shift Urban Outfitters'' (URBN) Investment Narrative?", "source": "Sahm", "topics": [{"topic": "retail_wholesale", "relevance_score": "0.943214"}, {"topic": "earnings", "relevance_score": "0.809602"}, {"topic": "finance", "relevance_score": "0.739256"}, {"topic": "financial_markets", "relevance_score": "0.620253"}], "authors": ["Simply Wall St"], "summary": "Urban Outfitters (URBN) reported strong comparable store sales growth of 4.6% over the past two years, with